अंगारीय a. [अंगारेभ्यः एतानि; अंगार-छ]<BR>To be used for preparing coal; ˚याणि<BR>काष्ठानि P. V. 1. 12. Sk.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0020-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

