अंगीकृ|अङ्गीकृ
अंगीकृ {c8c} U. [connected with अंग,<BR>or अंग-च्वि; अनंगं अस्वोपकरणं स्वकीयं<BR>अंगं क्रियते]<BR>1 To accept, to<BR>betake oneself to, to take to; लवंगी<BR>कुरंगीदृगंगीकरोतु Jagannātha;<BR>दक्षिणामाशामंगीकृत्य गंतव्यं K. 121 in the<BR>southern direction, towards the<BR>south; अंगीकृत्य अयशः 160; यदि<BR>मृत्युमंगीकरोमि ibid.; एवमंगीकारयितुं मया<BR>भणितं Mk. 8 to make her consent.<BR>--2 To<BR>promise to do, to agree or consent to,<BR>undertake; किंत्वंगीकृतमुत्सृजन्<BR>कृपणवत् श्लाघ्यो जनो लज्जते Mu. 2. 18.<BR>--3<BR>To own, acknowledge, confess,<BR>admit, grant.<BR>--4 To subdue, to make<BR>one's own.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0021-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अंगीकारः|अङ्गीकार|अंगीकार|अङ्गीकारः
अंगीकारः --कृतिः --करणं<BR>1 Acceptance.<BR>--2 Agreement, promise,<BR>undertaking &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0021-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

