अंगुष्ठः [अंगौ पाणौ प्राधान्येन तिष्ठति;<BR>अंगु-स्था P. VIII. 3. 97]<BR>1 The thumb;<BR>great toe.<BR>--2 A thumb's breadth,<BR>usually regarded as equal to अंगुल.<BR>[cf. Zend angusta, Pers. angust.]<BR>--Comp.<BR>--मात्र a. [परिमाणार्थे मात्रच्] of<BR>the length or size of a thumb; ˚त्रं पुरुषं<BR>निश्चकर्ष बलाद्यमः Mb.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0021-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

