अजगवं|अजगव
अजगवं [अजगो विष्णुः शरत्वेन अस्त्यस्य<BR>अजग-व P. V. 2. 110] Śiva's bow,<BR>Pināka.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0024-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अजगावः|अजगाव|अजगावं
अजगावः [अजगं विष्णुं अवति अव्-अण्]<BR>1 Śiva's bow.<BR>--2 The southern<BR>portion of the path of the sun, moon<BR>and planets.<BR>--3 N. of a snake-priest.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0024-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अजटा
अजटा [नास्ति जटा शिफा यस्याः सा]<BR>N. of a plant भूम्यालकी or कपिकच्छू,<BR>See अज्झटा.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0024-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अजड
अजड a. Not stupid.<BR>--डा N. of<BR>the plants अजटा, कपिकच्छू (अजडयति<BR>स्पर्शमात्रात्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0024-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अजथ्या
अजथ्या [अजाय हिता अजथ्या;<BR>अजथ्यन् P. V. 1. 8]<BR>1 N. of the yellow<BR>jasmine यूथिका.<BR>--2 A flock of goats.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0024-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अजन|अजनं|अजनः
