अधिगंतृ|अधिगन्तृ
अधिगंतृ a. [गम्-तृच्] One who<BR>attains or acquires.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0048-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधिगव
अधिगव a. or adv. [गवि इत्यधिगवं<BR>अव्ययी-स.] Found in or derived from<BR>a cow; स्वादीयो यदधिगवं क्षीरं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0048-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधिगुण|अधिगुणः
अधिगुण a. [अधिका गुणा यस्य]<BR>1<BR>Possessing superior qualities, worthy,<BR>meritorious; याच्ञा मोघा वरमधिगुणे<BR>नाधमे लब्धकामा Me. 6.<BR>--2 [अधिगतो<BR>गुणो ज्या येन] well strung (as a bow);<BR>˚शरासनं जनाः Ki. 12. 14.<BR>--णः A<BR>superior or eminent merit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0048-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधिचर्
अधिचर् {c1c} P. To walk or move<BR>over or on something.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0048-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधिचरणं|अधिचरण
अधिचरणं Act of walking over<BR>something.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0048-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधिजननं|अधिजनन
अधिजननं Birth; मातुरग्रेऽधिजननं<BR>Ms. 2. 169.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0048-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधिजिह्वः|अधिजिह्व
अधिजिह्वः [अधिका जिह्वा यस्य] A<BR>serpent (who has a forked tongue).<BR>This arose from the attempt of the<BR>serpents to lick the nectar placed<BR>on a bed of Kuśa grass, the sharp<BR>points of which pricked the tongue<BR>and split it into two.<BR>--ह्वा<BR>--जिह्विका [अधिरूढा जिह्वा, स्वार्थे कन्]<BR>1 The<BR>uvula.<BR>--2 A sort of swelling of the<BR>tongue or epiglottis.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0048-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधिज्य
अधिज्य a. [अध्यारूढा ज्या यत्र,<BR>अधिगतं ज्यां वा] Having the bow-string<BR>stretched, well strung (as a bow).<BR>--Comp.<BR>--धन्वन्, --कार्मुक a. having the<BR>bow strung; त्वयि चाधिज्यकार्मुके<BR>Ś. 1. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0048-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधिज्यता
अधिज्यता The state of being<BR>strung; ˚तां नी to string; R. 11. 14.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0048-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अधित्यका
अधित्यका [अधि-त्यकन्<BR>P. V. 2. 34; पर्वतस्य आरूढस्थलमधित्यका Sk.]<BR>A table-land, highland; स्थाणुं<BR>तपस्यंतमधित्यकायां Ku. 3. 17; अधित्यकायामिव<BR>धातुमय्यां R. 2. 29.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0048-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

