अनुसृ
अनुसृ {c1c} P.<BR>1 To follow (in all<BR>senses); go after, attend, pursue; to<BR>practise, observe; betake oneself to;<BR>पूर्वोद्दिष्टामनुसर पुरीं Me. 30 go to;<BR>उदीचीं दिशं 57.<BR>--2 To go over or<BR>through. --Caus.<BR>1 To lead, forward;<BR>वायुरनुसारयतीव मां Rām.<BR>--2 To cause<BR>to pursue, follow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0084-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुसरः|अनुसर
अनुसरः A follower, companion,<BR>attendant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0084-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुसरणं|अनुसरण
अनुसरणं<BR>1 Following, pursuing,<BR>going after, seeking after;<BR>क्रंदनानुसरणं क्रियतां H. 3; कनकसूत्र˚ प्रवृत्तै<BR>राजपुरुषैः Pt. 1.<BR>--2 Conformity to,<BR>accordance with, consequence of (in<BR>instr. or abl.);<BR>इंदोस्त्वदनुसरणक्लिष्टकांतेः Me. 84.<BR>--3 Custom, usage, habit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0084-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुसारः|अनुसार
अनुसारः<BR>1 Going after, following<BR>(fig. also); pursuit;<BR>व्याधानुसारचकिता हरिणीव यासि Mk. 1. 17;<BR>शब्दानुसारेण अवलोक्य Ś. 7 looking in the<BR>direction of the sound;<BR>कपटानुसारकुशलः Mk. 9. 5 following up or<BR>tracing fraud.<BR>--2 Conformity to,<BR>accordance with, suitability,<BR>conformity to usage; किरणानुसारगलितेन<BR>K. 137, 194, 204; धर्मशास्त्रानुसारेण<BR>Y. 2. 1.<BR>--3 Custom, usage,<BR>established practice; अनुसारादधिका (वृद्धिः)<BR>Ms. 8. 152.<BR>--4 Received or<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0085-a" target="_blank">Page0085-a+ 56</a>]<BR>established authority, especially of codes of<BR>law.<BR>--5 Nature, natural condition<BR>of anything.<BR>--6 Currency,<BR>prevalence.<BR>--7 Consequence, result.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0084-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुसारतः
