अनुसारक
अनुसारक, --सारिन् a.<BR>1 Following,<BR>pursuing, going after, attendant<BR>on; तामभ्यगच्छद्रुदितानुसारी R. 14. 70;<BR>मृगानुसारिणं पिनाकिनं Ś. 1. 6.; परिमलः<BR>पवनानुसारी Dk. 91; कृपणानुसारि च<BR>धनं Pt. 1. 278 going after, falling<BR>to the lot of.<BR>--2 According or<BR>conformable to, following; यथाशास्त्र˚<BR>Ms. 7. 31.<BR>--3 Seeking, looking out<BR>for, investigating, scrutinizing;<BR>Ms. 7. 102.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0085-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुसारिन्
अनुसारक, --सारिन् a.<BR>1 Following,<BR>pursuing, going after, attendant<BR>on; तामभ्यगच्छद्रुदितानुसारी R. 14. 70;<BR>मृगानुसारिणं पिनाकिनं Ś. 1. 6.; परिमलः<BR>पवनानुसारी Dk. 91; कृपणानुसारि च<BR>धनं Pt. 1. 278 going after, falling<BR>to the lot of.<BR>--2 According or<BR>conformable to, following; यथाशास्त्र˚<BR>Ms. 7. 31.<BR>--3 Seeking, looking out<BR>for, investigating, scrutinizing;<BR>Ms. 7. 102.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0085-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुसारणा
अनुसारणा Going after, pursuit;<BR>तस्मात्पलायमानानां कुर्यान्नात्यनुसारणां Mb.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0085-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुसृतिः|अनुसृति
अनुसृतिः f.<BR>1 Going after,<BR>following; conforming to, accordance with.<BR>--2 [अनुसरति कुलांतरं] An unchaste<BR>woman, harlot (कुलटा).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0085-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

