अनुस्मृ
अनुस्मृ {c1c} P. To remember, think<BR>of, call to mind, recollect (with acc.<BR>or gen.); वरप्रार्थनामनुस्मृत्य Ś. 1; यदैव<BR>अनुस्मृतं देवेन Ś. 7; तस्मात्सर्वेषु कालेषु<BR>मामनुस्मर युध्य च Bg. 8. 7;<BR>व्यपगतमदरागस्यानुसस्मार लक्ष्मीं Ki. 4. 38. --Caus.<BR>To remind (painfully), cause to<BR>remember with regret; Ki. 5. 14.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0085-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुस्मरणं|अनुस्मरण
अनुस्मरणं<BR>1 Recollection,<BR>remembering.<BR>--2 Repeated recollection.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0085-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुस्मृतिः|अनुस्मृति
अनुस्मृतिः f.<BR>1 Cherished<BR>recollection; thinking of; अनुस्मृतेर्बादरिः<BR>Ś. B.<BR>--2 Thinking of one thing to the<BR>exclusion of others.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0085-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुस्यूत
अनुस्यूत a. [सिव्-क्त-ऊठ्]<BR>1<BR>Woven together, regularly and<BR>uninterruptedly.<BR>--2 Sewn on, fastened<BR>to.<BR>--3 Closely attached or linked to.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0085-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुसमाहारः|अनुसमाहार
अनुसमाहारः Continuing,<BR>following.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0085-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुस्वानः|अनुस्वान
