अंतरीपः [अंतः मध्ये गता आपो यस्य<BR>बहु. अच्समासः अप ईत् P. VI. 3. 97]<BR>A portion of land stretching out into<BR>the sea, promontory; an island<BR>(being situated in, and surrounded on<BR>all sides by, water).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0094-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

