अभिमर्शः, --र्शनं, --मर्षः, --र्षणं<BR>1 Touch,<BR>contact; उष्णांशुकरभिमर्षात् Śi. 4. 16.<BR>--2 Assault, violence, attack,<BR>outraging, touching carnally, sexual<BR>intercourse; कृताभिमर्षामनुमन्यमानः<BR>Ś. 5. 20 carnally touched or<BR>embraced, seduced, outraged;<BR>पराभिमर्शो न तवास्ति Ku. 5. 43 (Malli. =<BR>परधर्षणं); Ms. 8. 352, Y. 2. 284.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0135-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिमर्षणं|अभिमर्षण
अभिमर्शः, --र्शनं, --मर्षः, --र्षणं<BR>1 Touch,<BR>contact; उष्णांशुकरभिमर्षात् Śi. 4. 16.<BR>--2 Assault, violence, attack,<BR>outraging, touching carnally, sexual<BR>intercourse; कृताभिमर्षामनुमन्यमानः<BR>Ś. 5. 20 carnally touched or<BR>embraced, seduced, outraged;<BR>पराभिमर्शो न तवास्ति Ku. 5. 43 (Malli. =<BR>परधर्षणं); Ms. 8. 352, Y. 2. 284.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0135-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिमर्शक
अभिमर्शक --र्षक, --मर्शिन् --र्षिन् a.<BR>1<BR>Touching, coming in contact with.<BR>--2 Outraging, assaulting;<BR>त्वत्कलत्राभिमर्षी वैरास्पदं धनमित्रः Dk. 63.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0135-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिमर्षक
अभिमर्शक --र्षक, --मर्शिन् --र्षिन् a.<BR>1<BR>Touching, coming in contact with.<BR>--2 Outraging, assaulting;<BR>त्वत्कलत्राभिमर्षी वैरास्पदं धनमित्रः Dk. 63.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0135-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिमर्शिन्
अभिमर्शक --र्षक, --मर्शिन् --र्षिन् a.<BR>1<BR>Touching, coming in contact with.<BR>--2 Outraging, assaulting;<BR>त्वत्कलत्राभिमर्षी वैरास्पदं धनमित्रः Dk. 63.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0135-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिमर्षिन्
अभिमर्शक --र्षक, --मर्शिन् --र्षिन् a.<BR>1<BR>Touching, coming in contact with.<BR>--2 Outraging, assaulting;<BR>त्वत्कलत्राभिमर्षी वैरास्पदं धनमित्रः Dk. 63.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0135-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिमृष्ट
अभिमृष्ट p. p.<BR>1 Touched, rubbed<BR>or stroked gently.<BR>--2 Brought close<BR>to, grazing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0135-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिमेथिक
अभिमेथिक a. Ved.<BR>--मेथिका<BR>1<BR>Use of words or language calculated<BR>to secure every thing (सर्वप्राप्तिसाधनो<BR>वाग्भेदः).<BR>--2 Abusive speech, obscene<BR>expression; an imprecation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0135-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिम्लात
अभिम्लात --न a. Ved. Altogether<BR>faded or withered, decayed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0135-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिम्लान
अभिम्लात --न a. Ved. Altogether<BR>faded or withered, decayed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0135-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभियज्ञः
अभियज्ञः A sacrificial act.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--गाथा a sacrificial verse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0135-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिया
अभिया {c2c} P.<BR>1 To go up to,<BR>approach, go or repair to; अभिययौ स<BR>हिमाचलमुच्छ्रितं Ki. 5. 1; R. 9. 27.<BR>--2<BR>To come or draw near (without an<BR>object); come (as time).<BR>--3 To march<BR>against, attack, assail, encounter;<BR>कुबेरादभियास्यमानात् R. 5. 30; Dk. 30.<BR>--4 To give or resign oneself to,<BR>devote, attach or betake oneself to.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0136-a" target="_blank">Page0136-a+ 57</a>]<BR>--5 To partake or share in, get,<BR>obtain. --Caus. To send away.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0135-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिया
अभिया m. f. Going to,<BR>approaching, assailing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0136-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभियातृ
अभियातृ, --यातिन् a. Approaching,<BR>assailing, encountering; assailant;<BR>रामभियायिनां तेषां R. 12. 43.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0136-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभियातिन्
अभियातृ, --यातिन् a. Approaching,<BR>assailing, encountering; assailant;<BR>रामभियायिनां तेषां R. 12. 43.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0136-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभियातिः|अभियाति
अभियातिः, --यायिन् --तृ m.<BR>--(यी, --ता)<BR>Approaching with hostile<BR>intentions, an assailant, enemy, a foe.<BR>--तिः f. Assailing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0136-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभियायिन्
अभियातिः, --यायिन् --तृ m.<BR>--(यी, --ता)<BR>Approaching with hostile<BR>intentions, an assailant, enemy, a foe.<BR>--तिः f. Assailing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0136-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभियातृ
अभियातिः, --यायिन् --तृ m.<BR>--(यी, --ता)<BR>Approaching with hostile<BR>intentions, an assailant, enemy, a foe.<BR>--तिः f. Assailing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0136-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभियानं|अभियान
अभियानं<BR>1 Approaching.<BR>--2<BR>Marching against, attack, assault;<BR>रणाभियानेन Dk. 10 marching out for<BR>battle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0136-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभियाच्
अभियाच् {c1c} A. To beg, request,<BR>ask for, solicit (= याच् q. v).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0136-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभियाचनं|अभियाचन
अभियाचनं, --याञ्चा Asking for,<BR>request, an entreaty, solicitation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0136-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभियाञ्चा
अभियाचनं, --याञ्चा Asking for,<BR>request, an entreaty, solicitation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0136-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभियुज्
अभियुज् {c7c} A.<BR>1 To apply oneself<BR>to, exert oneself, make oneself<BR>ready for, prepare, set about, strive<BR>or endeavour (used in passive also<BR>in this sense); तद्यदि न सहसे ततः<BR>स्वयमभियुज्यस्व । एते<BR>स्वकर्मण्यभियुज्यामहे । Mu. 3; Dk. 55; K. 300;<BR>व्यसनमभियुंजानस्य Mu. 4 trying<BR>to find out a weak point.<BR>--2 To<BR>attack, assail; भवंतमभियोक्तुमुद्युंक्ते<BR>Dk. 3; वृषलमभियोक्तुमुद्यतः Mu. 1; क<BR>इदानीमभियोक्ष्यते U. 3.<BR>--3 To accuse,<BR>charge; complain or inform against,<BR>prosecute, claim or demand (as in<BR>a law-suit); न तत्र विद्यते<BR>किंचिद्यत्परैरभियुज्यते Ms. 8. 183;<BR>विभावितैकदेशेन देयं यदभियुज्यते V. 4. 17<BR>claimed, asked, or demanded; Y. 2. 9,<BR>28, 100.<BR>--4 To wish or long for,<BR>desire, ask for, request.<BR>--5 To say,<BR>speak, tell; नाभियोक्तुमनृतं त्वमिष्यसे<BR>Ki. 13. 58, 14. 7.<BR>--6 To appoint to,<BR>entrust with (with loc.).<BR>--7 To use<BR>with (instr.).<BR>--8 To be working or<BR>operative.<BR>--9 To put to; harness;<BR>harness repeatedly.<BR>--10 To hurt.<BR>--Caus. To join or unite to, attach<BR>oneself to; परकलत्रेषु सुहृत्त्वेनाभियोज्य<BR>Dk. 163.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0136-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभियुक्त|अभियुक्तः
अभियुक्त p. p.<BR>1 (a) Engaged or<BR>occupied or absorbed in, applying<BR>oneself to, intent on;<BR>स्वस्वकर्मण्यधिकतरमभियुक्तः परिजनः Mu. 1. (b)<BR>Diligent, persevering, resolute,<BR>zealous, intent, assiduous, zealously<BR>engaged, attentive, careful; इदं विश्वं<BR>पाल्यं विधिवदभियुक्तेन मनसा U. 3. 30;<BR>Mu. 1. 13; Dk. 55; अश्वावेक्षणेऽ<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0136-b" target="_blank">Page0136-b+ 57</a>]<BR>नभियुक्ते Mu. 3; भवतु भूंयोभियुक्तः<BR>स्वरव्यक्तिमुपलप्स्ये Mu. 1; Bg. 9. 22;<BR>Kām. 5. 77.<BR>--2 Well-versed or proficient<BR>in; शास्त्रार्थेष्वभियुक्तानां पुरुषाणां<BR>Kumārila.<BR>--3 (Hence) Learned, of<BR>acknowledged position; a<BR>competent judge, an expert, connoisseur, a<BR>learned person (m. also in this<BR>sense); न हि शक्यते दैवमन्यथा<BR>कर्तुमभियुक्तेनापि K. 62; अन्येऽभियुक्ता अपि<BR>नैवेदमन्यथा मन्यंते Ve. 2;<BR>सूक्तमिदमभियुक्तैः प्रकृतिर्दुस्त्यजेति ibid.<BR>--4 Attacked,<BR>assailed; अभियुक्तं त्वयैनं ते<BR>गंतारस्त्वामतः परे Śi. 2. 101; Mu. 3. 25.<BR>--5<BR>Accused, charged, indicted; Mk. 9. 9;<BR>prosecuted; a defendant; अभियुक्तोऽ<BR>भियोगस्य यदि कुर्यादपह्नवं Nārada.<BR>--6<BR>Appointed.<BR>--7 Said, spoken.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0136-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभियुग्वन्
अभियुग्व(ज्व)न् m. One who hurts<BR>or attacks; an enemy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0136-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभियुज्वन्
अभियुग्व(ज्व)न् m. One who hurts<BR>or attacks; an enemy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0136-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभियुज्
अभियुज् f. (क्-ग्)<BR>1 Attacking &c.<BR>--2 An enemy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0136-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभियोक्तव्य
अभियोक्तव्य, --योज्य pot. p. To be<BR>rebuked or blamed; to be accused;<BR>Ms. 8. 50; assailable, indictable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0136-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभियोज्य
अभियोक्तव्य, --योज्य pot. p. To be<BR>rebuked or blamed; to be accused;<BR>Ms. 8. 50; assailable, indictable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0136-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभियोक्तृ
अभियोक्तृ a. Assailing, attacking,<BR>accusing. --m. (क्ता)<BR>1 An enemy,<BR>assailant, invader; त्वय्युत्कृष्टबलेऽ<BR>भियोक्तरि नृपे Mu. 4. 15; H. 3. 93.<BR>--2 (In law) A complainant,<BR>plaintiff, accuser, prosecutor; Ms. 8. 52,<BR>58; Y. 2. 95.<BR>--3 A pretender,<BR>claimant; a stronger party.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0136-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभियोगः|अभियोग
अभियोगः<BR>1 Application or<BR>devotion (to some thing); connection;<BR>गुरुचर्यातपस्तंत्रमंत्रयोगाभियोगजां<BR>Māl. 9. 51; Ch. P. 11.<BR>--2 Close application,<BR>perseverance, zealous intentness,<BR>energetic effort, exertion; ˚भाज्<BR>persevering, resolute Ki. 3. 40; संतः स्वयं<BR>परहितेषु कृताभियोगाः Bh. 2. 73;<BR>Māl. 1. 34; मत्प्रियाभियोगेन Māl. 1; तदभियोगं<BR>प्रति निरुद्योगः Mu. 1; स्वयमभियोगदुःखैः<BR>ibid.; Dk. 41, K. 345; Śi. 7. 63.<BR>--3<BR>(a) Application or devotion to learn<BR>something; कस्यां कलायामभियोगो<BR>भवत्योः M. 5 to what art have you<BR>applied or devoted yourselves;<BR>K. 109. (b) Learning, scholarship;<BR>अनभियोगश्च शब्दादेरशिष्टानां<BR>अभियोगश्चेतरेषां Śabarasvāmin.<BR>--4 (a) Attack,<BR>assault; invasion (of a town or<BR>country); क्षुभितं वनगोचराभियोगात्<BR>Ki. 13. 10, 2. 46; Ku. 7. 50;<BR>Ve. 4; Māl. 8, Mu. 2, 1. 7, Mv. 6. 38.<BR>(b) Battle, war, conflict.<BR>--5 (In law)<BR>A charge, accusation, plaint,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0136-c" target="_blank">Page0136-c+ 57</a>]<BR>indictment; अभियोगमनिस्तीर्य नैनं<BR>प्रत्यभियोजयेत् Y. 2. 9.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0136-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभियोगिन्
अभियोगिन् a.<BR>1 Devoted to,<BR>intent on, absorbed in (in comp.).<BR>--2 Attacking, assaulting.<BR>--3<BR>Accusing; मिथ्याभियोगी Y. 2. 11. --m.<BR>A plaintiff, complainant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0136-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभियोजनं|अभियोजन
अभियोजनं Ved. Harnessing (one<BR>horse) on to another, re-fastening<BR>to make firm or tight (Sāy. युक्ते<BR>पुनर्योजनं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0136-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिरक्ष्
अभिरक्ष् {c1c} P.<BR>1 To protect,<BR>preserve, keep, guard, help;<BR>भीष्ममेवाभिरक्षंतु Bg. 1. 10, 11.<BR>--2 To rule over,<BR>govern (as earth &c.); command.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0136-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिरक्षा
अभिरक्षा, --रक्षणं Universal or<BR>complete protection; protection in every<BR>quarter; प्रशांतबाधं दिशतोऽभिरक्षया<BR>Ki. 1. 18.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0136-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिरक्षणं|अभिरक्षण
अभिरक्षा, --रक्षणं Universal or<BR>complete protection; protection in every<BR>quarter; प्रशांतबाधं दिशतोऽभिरक्षया<BR>Ki. 1. 18.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0136-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिरक्षितृ
अभिरक्षितृ a. Protecting, guarding.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0136-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिरंज्|अभिरञ्ज्
अभिरंज् Pass.^1<BR>1 To be coloured<BR>or tinted.<BR>--2 To be flushed or<BR>greatly delighted, exult. --Caus. To<BR>tinge, colour, tint.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by Dr. Dhaval Patel on 20260624. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-orig/issues/692.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0136-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिरक्त
अभिरक्त p. p. Devoted, intent,<BR>attached.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0136-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिरंजनं
अभिरंजनं Colouring.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0136-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिरम्
अभिरम् {c1c} A. (rarely P.)<BR>1 To<BR>be pleased or delighted (with loc.);<BR>दृष्टिरिहाभिरमते हृदयं च Mk. 4, 5. 15;<BR>न गंधहरिणो दमनककेदारिकायामभिरमति<BR>Vb. 3; Ratn. 2, Y. 1. 252.<BR>--2 To please<BR>or gratify oneself, take pleasure or<BR>delight in (with loc.); विद्यासु<BR>विद्वानिव सोभिरेमे Bk. 1. 9. --Caus. To<BR>gratify, please; मत्सपत्नीरभिरमयिष्यसि<BR>Dk. 90, 92, 163.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0136-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिरत
अभिरत p. p.<BR>1 Glad, delighted,<BR>satisfied, Śi. 10. 55, 89.<BR>--2<BR>Engaged in, devoted or attached to;<BR>performing, practising; Bg. 18. 45.<BR>--3<BR>Attentive to.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0136-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिरतिः|अभिरति
अभिरतिः f.<BR>1 Pleasure, delight,<BR>satisfaction; attachment or devotion<BR>to; न मृगयाभिरतिर्न दुरोदरं (तमपाहरत्)<BR>R. 9. 7; Ki. 6. 44.<BR>--2 Practice,<BR>occupation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0136-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिरमणं|अभिरमण
अभिरमणं Delighting in.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0136-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिराम|अभिरामः
अभिराम a.<BR>1 Pleasing, delightful,<BR>sweet, agreeable; मनोभिरामाः (केकाः)<BR>R. 1. 39; 2. 72; 6. 47; Ki. 6. 30.<BR>--2 Beautiful, lovely, graceful,<BR>charming;<BR>स्यादस्थांनोपगतयमुनासंगमेवाभिरामा Me. 51; कुमारा माराभिरामाः<BR>Dk. 10; ˚त्वं प्रमदवनस्य V. 2; राम<BR>इत्यभिरामेण वपुषा तस्य चोदितः<BR>R. 10. 67, 13. 32; K. 145; Mv. 5. 47-8.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0137-a" target="_blank">Page0137-a+ 56</a>]<BR>Ś. 3. 26<BR>--मः An epithet of Śiva.<BR>--मं ind.<BR>1 Gracefully, beautifully;<BR>ग्रीवाभंगभिरामं दत्तदृष्टिः Ś. 1. 7.<BR>--2<BR>Referring to Rāma.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0136-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिराज्
अभिराज् a. Reigning<BR>everywhere, supreme.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0137-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिराध्
अभिराध् Caus. To propitiate;<BR>Śi. 7. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0137-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिराद्ध
अभिराद्ध a. Propitiated, pleased<BR>Śi. 1. 71.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0137-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिराष्ट्र
अभिराष्ट्र a. Ved. Who has<BR>gained dominion or supremacy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0137-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिरुच्
अभिरुच् {c1c} A.<BR>1 To shine, look<BR>finely; धर्मोऽभिरोचते यस्माद्धर्मराजस्ततः<BR>स्मृतः Mārk. P.<BR>--2 To like, desire;<BR>यदभिरोचते or अभिरुचितं भवते V. 2<BR>--Caus. To be inclined to, have a<BR>taste or liking for, long, desire or<BR>wish for.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0137-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिरुचिः|अभिरुचि
अभिरुचिः f.<BR>1 Desire, taste,<BR>liking, relish, delight, pleasure; यशसि<BR>चाभिरुचिः Bh. 2. 63;<BR>परस्पराभिरुचिनिष्पन्नो विवाहः K. 367.<BR>--2 Desire of<BR>fame, ambition; splendour.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0137-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिरुचित|अभिरुचितः
अभिरुचित p. p. Liked, beloved.<BR>--तः A lover; Śi. 10. 68.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0137-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिरुचिर
अभिरुचिर a. Very pleasant or<BR>agreeable, beautiful, splendid.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0137-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिरुत
अभिरुत a. Sounded, vocal; cooed<BR>(as the voices of birds &c.).<BR>--तं A<BR>sound, cry, noise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0137-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिरूप|अभिरूपः
अभिरूप a. [अभिगतो रूपं]<BR>1<BR>Corresponding with, conformable or<BR>suitable to, congruous; अभिरूपमस्या<BR>वयसो वल्कलं Ś. 1. v. l.<BR>--2 Pleasing,<BR>delightful, handsome, charming,<BR>beautiful, well-formed;<BR>अभिरूपेणापि स्वदारसंतुष्टेन K. 51;<BR>उत्कृष्टायाभिरूपाय वराय सदृशाय च (कन्यां दद्यात्)<BR>Ms. 9. 88.<BR>--3 Dear to, beloved or liked by,<BR>favourite; यो यः प्रदेशः सख्या मेऽभिरूपः<BR>Ś. 6.<BR>--4 Learned, wise, enlightened;<BR>अभिरूपभूयिष्ठा परिषदियं Ś. 1; K. 78;<BR>Ms. 3. 144.<BR>--पः<BR>1 The moon.<BR>--2<BR>Śiva.<BR>--3 Viṣṇu.<BR>--4 Cupid,<BR>--Comp.<BR>--पतिः ‘having an agreeable<BR>husband,’ N. of a fast or rite<BR>performed to secure a good husband<BR>in the next world; Mk. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0137-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिरूपक
अभिरूपक = अभिरूप q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0137-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिरोरुद
अभिरोरुद a. Ved. Causing tears<BR>(of joy or earnest desire).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0137-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिलक्षित
अभिलक्षित a. Marked with<BR>signs, bearing marks.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0137-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिलक्ष्य
अभिलक्ष्य a. To be marked or noted.<BR>--क्ष्यं ind. Towards a mark or aim.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0137-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिलंघ्|अभिलङ्घ्
अभिलंघ् {c1c} {c10c} P.<BR>1 To jump<BR>across or over; Ms. 4. 54;<BR>Y. 1. 137.<BR>--2 To attack, rush upon or<BR>over, fly at; तत्रभवत्या वदनमभिलंघति<BR>मधुकरः Ś. 6.<BR>--3 To violate,<BR>transgress; to offend, injure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0137-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिलंघनं|अभिलङ्घन|अभिलंघन
अभिलंघनं Jumping across or over,<BR>flying at.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0137-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिलप्
अभिलप् {c1c} P. To talk to or ad<BR>dress; अभिलपतश्च द्वारनिहितलोचनौ<BR>Mk. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0137-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिलापः|अभिलाप
अभिलापः<BR>1 Expression, word,<BR>speech; Ki. 10. 61.<BR>--2 Declaration,<BR>mention, specification; न च<BR>स्मार्तमतद्धर्माभिलापात् Br. Sūt.<BR>--3 Declaration<BR>of the object of a vow or religious<BR>obligation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0137-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिलष्
अभिलष् {c1c} {c4c} P. To desire or<BR>wish for, long for, covet, crave or<BR>yearn after; तेन दत्तमभिलेषुरंगनाः<BR>R. 19. 12; मानुषानभिलष्यंती Bk. 4. 22.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0137-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिलषणं|अभिलषण
अभिलषणं Desiring, longing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0137-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिलषित
अभिलषित p. p. Desired, wished,<BR>longed for.<BR>--तं Desire, wish, will,<BR>pleasure; यथाभिलषितं अनुष्ठीयतां Pt. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0137-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिलाषः|अभिलाष
अभिलाषः (˚सः sometimes) A<BR>desire, wish, longing for, craving<BR>after; affection, longing of a lover,<BR>love, (usually with loc. of the<BR>object of desire); अतोऽभिलाषे प्रथमं<BR>तथाविधे मनो बबंध R. 3. 4; भव हृदय<BR>साभिलाषं Ś. 1. 28; Me. 110 साभिलाषं<BR>निर्वर्ण्य Ś. 3 casting a coveting or<BR>wistful look; न खलु सत्यमेव शकुंतलायां म<BR>माभिलाषः Ś. 2, Pt. 5. 67; sometimes<BR>with प्रति and acc., or in comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0137-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिलाषक
अभिलाषक, --लाषि(सि)न्, --लाषुक<BR>a. Wishing or desiring for (with<BR>acc., loc. or in comp.); desirous,<BR>covetous, greedy of;<BR>यदार्यमस्यामभिलाषि मे मनः Ś. 1. 22;<BR>जलाभिलाषी जलमाददानां R. 2. 6; 3. 36;<BR>Me. 78; जयमत्रभवान्नूनमरातिष्वभिलाषुकः<BR>Ki. 11. 18; Śi. 15. 59.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0137-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिलाषिन्
अभिलाषक, --लाषि(सि)न्, --लाषुक<BR>a. Wishing or desiring for (with<BR>acc., loc. or in comp.); desirous,<BR>covetous, greedy of;<BR>यदार्यमस्यामभिलाषि मे मनः Ś. 1. 22;<BR>जलाभिलाषी जलमाददानां R. 2. 6; 3. 36;<BR>Me. 78; जयमत्रभवान्नूनमरातिष्वभिलाषुकः<BR>Ki. 11. 18; Śi. 15. 59.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0137-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिलासिन्
अभिलाषक, --लाषि(सि)न्, --लाषुक<BR>a. Wishing or desiring for (with<BR>acc., loc. or in comp.); desirous,<BR>covetous, greedy of;<BR>यदार्यमस्यामभिलाषि मे मनः Ś. 1. 22;<BR>जलाभिलाषी जलमाददानां R. 2. 6; 3. 36;<BR>Me. 78; जयमत्रभवान्नूनमरातिष्वभिलाषुकः<BR>Ki. 11. 18; Śi. 15. 59.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0137-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिलाषुक|अभिलाषुकः
अभिलाषक, --लाषि(सि)न्, --लाषुक<BR>a. Wishing or desiring for (with<BR>acc., loc. or in comp.); desirous,<BR>covetous, greedy of;<BR>यदार्यमस्यामभिलाषि मे मनः Ś. 1. 22;<BR>जलाभिलाषी जलमाददानां R. 2. 6; 3. 36;<BR>Me. 78; जयमत्रभवान्नूनमरातिष्वभिलाषुकः<BR>Ki. 11. 18; Śi. 15. 59.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0137-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिलावः|अभिलाव
अभिलावः [लू-घञ् P. III. 3. 28]<BR>Cutting, reaping, mowing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0137-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिलिखित
अभिलिखित a. Written,<BR>inscribed.<BR>--तं, अभिलेखनं<BR>1 Writing,<BR>inscribing.<BR>--2 A writing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0137-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिली
अभिली {c4c} A. To enter into, lurk<BR>or lie hid into; कपिलाशवस्य<BR>क्रोडमभ्यलीयत Dk. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0137-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिलीन
अभिलीन a.<BR>1 Adhering or<BR>clinging to, attached to; R. 3. 8.<BR>--2<BR>Embracing, shrouding; Me. 36.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0137-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिलुलित
अभिलुलित a.<BR>1 Agitated,<BR>disturbed.<BR>--2 Playful, unsteady.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0137-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिलूता
अभिलूता A sort of spider.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0137-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिवद्
अभिवद् {c1c} U.<BR>1 To speak to,<BR>address; परस्त्रियं योऽभिवदेत्तीर्थेऽरण्ये<BR>वनेपि वा Ms. 8. 356; Y. 2. 301.<BR>--2<BR>To speak of or with reference to,<BR>tell, declare, mention; यत्कर्म क्रियमाणं<BR>ऋगभिवदति Ait. Br.<BR>--3 To express,<BR>utter, signify; यद्वाचाऽनभ्युदितं येन<BR>वागभ्युद्यते तदेव ब्रह्म त्वं विद्धि नेदं यदिद<BR>मुपासते Ken.<BR>--4 To name, call.<BR>--5 To<BR>salute, greet; see caus. --Caus.<BR>1 To<BR>greet or salute respectfully, oft. with<BR>the mention of the person saluted<BR>and the person who salutes; तात<BR>प्राचेतसांतेवासी लवोऽभिवादयते U. 6;<BR>भगवन्नभिवादये V. 5; see अभिवाद also.<BR>--2 To<BR>cause to salute (with acc. or instr.<BR>of agent of action); अभिवादयते देवं<BR>भक्तं भक्तेन वा.<BR>--3 To utter, pronounce.<BR>--4 To play on an instrument.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0137-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिवदनं|अभिवदन
अभिवदनं<BR>1 Addressing &c.<BR>--2<BR>Salutation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0137-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिवादः|अभिवाद
अभिवादः, --वादनं<BR>1 Reverential<BR>salutation, respectful obeisance,<BR>salutation of a superior or elder by an<BR>inferior or junior, or of a teacher<BR>by his disciple. It consists in (1)<BR>rising from one's seat (प्रत्युत्त्थान),<BR>(2) seizing the feet (पादोपसंग्रह), and<BR>(3) repeating the form of<BR>salutation (अभिवाद) which includes the<BR>name or title of the person<BR>addressed, followed by the<BR>mention of the person's own name.<BR>For the different ways of<BR>performing obeisance and the merit arising<BR>therefrom see Ms. 2. 120-126.<BR>--2 Abuse, insulting or scurrilous<BR>speech (for अतिवाद).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0137-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिवादनं|अभिवादन
अभिवादः, --वादनं<BR>1 Reverential<BR>salutation, respectful obeisance,<BR>salutation of a superior or elder by an<BR>inferior or junior, or of a teacher<BR>by his disciple. It consists in (1)<BR>rising from one's seat (प्रत्युत्त्थान),<BR>(2) seizing the feet (पादोपसंग्रह), and<BR>(3) repeating the form of<BR>salutation (अभिवाद) which includes the<BR>name or title of the person<BR>addressed, followed by the<BR>mention of the person's own name.<BR>For the different ways of<BR>performing obeisance and the merit arising<BR>therefrom see Ms. 2. 120-126.<BR>--2 Abuse, insulting or scurrilous<BR>speech (for अतिवाद).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0137-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिवादक|अभिवादकः
अभिवादक a. (दिका f.)<BR>1 Saluting;<BR>saluter.<BR>--2 Polite, respectful,<BR>humble.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0137-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिवादयितृ
अभिवादयितृ m. A respectful saluter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0137-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिवादिन्
अभिवादिन् a.<BR>1 Saluting<BR>respectfully.<BR>--2 Describing, referring to;<BR>तदभिवादिनी एषा ऋग्भवति Nir.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0137-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिवाद्य|अभिवाद्यः
अभिवाद्य--, वादनीय pot. p. To be<BR>respectfully saluted.<BR>--द्यः N. of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0137-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिवादनीय
अभिवाद्य--, वादनीय pot. p. To be<BR>respectfully saluted.<BR>--द्यः N. of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0137-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिवंद्|अभिवन्द्
अभिवंद् {c1c} A. To salute<BR>respectfully.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0137-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिवंदनं|अभिवन्दन
अभिवंदनं Respectful salutation;<BR>पाद˚ holding the feet (of another)<BR>as an humble obeisance; see<BR>अभिवादनं above.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0137-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिवयस्
अभिवयस् a.<BR>1 Very fresh or<BR>young.<BR>--2 Possessed of food.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0137-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिवासः|अभिवास
