अभिवासनं|अभिवासन
अभिवासः, --सनं Covering,<BR>clothing with.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0138-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिवासस्
अभिवासस् ind. Over the covering<BR>or cloth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0138-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिवह
अभिवह a. Conveying towards<BR>or near, driving near.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0138-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिवहनं|अभिवहन
अभिवहनं Carrying towards.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0138-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिवाह्य
अभिवाह्य pot. p. To be carried<BR>near.<BR>--ह्यं<BR>1 Conveyance,<BR>transmission, carrying; Ms. 1. 94.<BR>--2<BR>Presentation, offering.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0138-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिवान्या
अभिवान्या, अभिवान्यवत्सा Ved. A<BR>cow suckling an adopted calf.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0138-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिवान्यवत्सा
अभिवान्या, अभिवान्यवत्सा Ved. A<BR>cow suckling an adopted calf.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0138-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिविख्यात
अभिविख्यात a. Universally<BR>known, renowned, famous; called,<BR>known as.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0138-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिविधिः|अभिविधि
अभिविधिः [अभितो विधिर्व्याप्तिः]<BR>1<BR>Complete comprehension or<BR>inclusion; one of the senses of the<BR>particle आ; आङ् मर्यादाभिविध्योः<BR>P. II. 1. 13, the limit inceptive as opposed to<BR>the limit conclusive and translated<BR>by ‘from,’ ‘commencing with’,<BR>‘including’; as in<BR>आबालं-आबालेभ्यः हरिभक्तिः (मर्यादा and अभिविधि are thus<BR>distinguished तेन विना मर्यादा,<BR>तत्सहितोऽभिविधिः).<BR>--2 Complete pervasion,<BR>filling up or occupying completely;<BR>अभिविधौ भाव इनुण् P. III. 3. 44; also<BR>V. 4. 53 and Sk. thereon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0138-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिविनी
अभिविनी {c1c} U. To teach,<BR>instruct (= विनी q. v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0138-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिविनीत
अभिविनीत p. p.<BR>1 Well behaved,<BR>well principled.<BR>--2 Taught,<BR>instructed; कस्यां कलायां अभिविनीते भवत्यौ<BR>M. 5 v. l. for अभियोगः.<BR>--3 Pious,<BR>pure, devout.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0138-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिविमान
अभिविमान a. Of unlimited<BR>dimensions, an epithet of the<BR>Supreme Being.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0138-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिविश्रुत
अभिविश्रुत a. Widely<BR>celebrated, renowned.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0138-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिवीक्ष्
अभिवीक्ष् {c1c} A.<BR>1 To look at, view,<BR>behold, see, perceive, observe;<BR>न चैनं भुवि शक्नोति कश्चिदप्यभिवीक्षितुं<BR>Ms. 7. 6.<BR>--2 To aim at.<BR>--3 To prove,<BR>test, examine.<BR>--4 To be<BR>affected towards, incline or lean to.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0138-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिवीक्षणं
अभिवीक्षणं Perceiving, beholding.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0138-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिवीर
अभिवीर a. [अभिवृतो वीरैः]<BR>Surrounded by heroes.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0138-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिवृत्
अभिवृत् {c1c} A.<BR>1 To go up to,<BR>go towards, go or come near,<BR>approach; used with or without any<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0138-b" target="_blank">Page0138-b+ 57</a>]<BR>acc.; इत एवाभिवर्तंते (in dramas) are<BR>coming hitherward or in this<BR>direction; श्रावस्तीमभ्यवर्तिषि Dk. 116;<BR>तमर्च्यमारादभिर्वतमानं R. 2. 10; यतो<BR>यतः षट्चरणोभिवर्तते Ś. 1. 23 turns.<BR>--2 To attack, assail, rush upon or<BR>towards, turn towards (inimically<BR>or to attack); वदनं मे मधुकरोऽ<BR>भिवर्तते Ś. 1; अयमेकचरोऽभिवर्तते मां<BR>Ki. 13. 3.<BR>--3 To face, encounter, stand<BR>opposite to.<BR>--4 To stretch or extend<BR>towards; द्रीर्घारण्यानि दक्षिणां<BR>दिशमभिवर्तंते U. 2.<BR>--5 (a) To turn up,<BR>arise, begin. (b) To appear,<BR>commence, break (as day).<BR>--6<BR>To be, exist, chance to be.<BR>--7 To procure for one (dat.). --Caus.<BR>1 To carry over, transport.<BR>--2 To<BR>overcome, to be master of.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0138-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिवर्तिन्|अभिवर्त्तिन्
अभिवर्तिन् a. Going towards,<BR>approaching, attacking &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0138-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिवर्तनं
अभिवर्तनं Going towards,<BR>approaching, attacking &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0138-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिवृध्
अभिवृध् {c1c} A.<BR>1 To grow,<BR>increase, be augmented; हविषा<BR>कृष्णवर्त्मेव भूय एवाभिवर्धते Ms. 2. 94.<BR>--2<BR>To thrive, prosper (of men also);<BR>दातारो नोऽभिवर्धंतां वेदाः संततिरेव च<BR>Ms. 3. 259; 7. 27; Y. 1. 245.<BR>--Caus.<BR>1 To increase, augment,<BR>add to; कोशं, धर्मं, प्रीतिं &c.<BR>--2 To<BR>stretch, extend, lengthen.<BR>--3 To<BR>bring up, rear.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0138-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिवृद्धिः|अभिवृद्धि
अभिवृद्धिः f. Increase, growth,<BR>addition; success, prosperity; राष्ट्र˚,<BR>लाभ˚, धन˚ &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0138-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिवृष्
अभिवृष् {c1c} P. To rain upon,<BR>pour, sprinkle, water, bedew, cover<BR>with (a shower of any thing), pour<BR>or shower down upon;<BR>प्रस्नवेनाभिवर्षंती (भुवं) R. 1. 84; 10. 48, 15. 58,<BR>99; Ki. 2. 31; बाणैर्मामभिवर्षति<BR>V. 4. --Caus. To sprinkle or cover<BR>with, shower upon,<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0138-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिवृष्ट
अभिवृष्ट p. p. Sprinkled; rained<BR>upon, showered; स्थली नवांभः<BR>पृषताभिवृष्टा R. 7. 69; 15. 99; V. 4. 6;<BR>also used actively; V. 4. 34.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0138-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिवर्षणं|अभिवर्षण
अभिवर्षणं Raining upon, watering,<BR>bedewing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0138-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिवर्षिन्
अभिवर्षिन् a. Raining upon,<BR>bedewing &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0138-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिवेगः|अभिवेग
अभिवेगः Ved. Consideration,<BR>thought, determination.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0138-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिव्यंज्|अभिव्यञ्ज्
अभिव्यंज् {c7c} P. (˚अंज्) or Caus.<BR>To manifest, make clear, reveal,<BR>disclose, exhibit, display.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0138-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिव्यक्त
अभिव्यक्त p. p.<BR>1 Manifested,<BR>revealed, declared.<BR>--2 Distinct, plain,<BR>clear, R. 6. 12, 16. 23, Mu. 1, V. 3.<BR>--क्तं ind. Clearly, distinctly, plainly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0138-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिव्यक्तिः|अभिव्यक्ति
अभिव्यक्तिः f.<BR>1 Manifestation (of<BR>a cause as an effect); distinction,<BR>exposition, declaration, revelation,<BR>display, exhibition;<BR>सर्वांगसौष्ठवाभिव्यक्तये M. 1; दूतीसंप्रेषणैर्नार्या<BR>भावाभिव्यक्तिरिष्यते S. D. 6.<BR>--2 Association,<BR>concomitance; P. VIII. 1. 15 (Sk.<BR>= साहचर्यं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0138-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिव्यंजक|अभिव्यञ्जक
अभिव्यंजक a. Displaying,<BR>showing, indicating; गुणाभिव्यंजकौ<BR>शब्दार्थौ S. D. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0138-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिव्यंजनं|अभिव्यञ्जन
अभिव्यंजनं Manifesting, revealing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0138-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिव्यादानं|अभिव्यादान
अभिव्यादानं<BR>1 Suppressed sound.<BR>--2 Repetition of the same sound.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0138-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिव्याधिन्
अभिव्याधिन् a. Striking,<BR>injuring greatly, hurting much.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0138-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिव्याप्
अभिव्याप् {c5c} P.<BR>1 To extend to,<BR>include, comprehend; अधिकारोऽयं<BR>यूनस्तिः इत्यभिव्याप्य Sk.<BR>--2 To pervade,<BR>surround.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0138-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिव्यापक
अभिव्यापक--, व्यापिन् a.<BR>1 Including,<BR>comprehending, pervading.<BR>--2 (In<BR>gram.) One of the three kinds of<BR>आधार q. v.; ˚कः आधारः<BR>P. II. 3. 36 Sk.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0138-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिव्यापिन्
अभिव्यापक--, व्यापिन् a.<BR>1 Including,<BR>comprehending, pervading.<BR>--2 (In<BR>gram.) One of the three kinds of<BR>आधार q. v.; ˚कः आधारः<BR>P. II. 3. 36 Sk.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0138-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिव्याप्तिः|अभिव्याप्ति
अभिव्याप्तिः f. Inclusion,<BR>comprehension, universal pervasion,<BR>co-extension.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0138-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिव्याप्य
अभिव्याप्य pot. p. To be included.<BR>--प्यं Validity of a rule.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0138-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिव्याहृ
