अभिव्याहारः|अभिव्याहार
अभिव्याहरणं, --व्याहारः<BR>1 Uttering,<BR>pronunciation, speaking.<BR>--2 An<BR>articulate significant word, a name,<BR>appellation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0138-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिव्याहारिन्
अभिव्याहारिन् a. Pronouncing,<BR>telling, speaking.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0138-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिव्लंगः|अभिव्लङ्ग|अभिव्लङ्गः
अभिव्लंगः Ved. Going towards<BR>or against, assault.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0138-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिशंस्
अभिशंस् {c1c} P.<BR>1 To blame,<BR>accuse, charge, calumniate, defame,<BR>traduce; महापापोपपापाभ्यां योऽ<BR>भिशंसेन्मृषा परं Y. 3. 286.<BR>--2 To praise, extol.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0138-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिशंसक
