अवस्कंदित|अवस्कन्दित
अवस्कंदित p. p.<BR>1 Attacked.<BR>--2<BR>Gone down, descended.<BR>--3 Refuted.<BR>--4 Bathed, bathing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0191-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवस्कंदिन्|अवस्कन्दिन्
अवस्कंदिन् a.<BR>1 Attaking,<BR>assaulting; outraging; गौतमदारावरकंदिनं<BR>Mv. 1.<BR>--2 Covering.<BR>--3 Leaping upon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0191-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवस्कॄ
अवस्कॄ {c6c} U. To scratch, butt<BR>against; रोधांसि धीरमवचस्करिरे महोक्षाः<BR>Śi. 5. 63.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0191-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवस्करः|अवस्कर
अवस्करः [अवकीर्यते इत्यवस्करः, कॄ-अप्<BR>सुट् P. VI. 1. 148]<BR>1 Ordure,<BR>excrement.<BR>--2 The privities (गुह्यदेश).<BR>--3<BR>Dirt, sweepings (in general);<BR>गृहद्वाराशुचिस्थानरथ्यावस्करशोधनं Nārada.<BR>--4 A place for fæces, dung-hill.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--मंदिरं a privy, water-closet.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0191-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवस्करक|अवस्करकः
अवस्करक a. [अवस्करे भवः, वुन्<BR>P. IV. 3. 28] Existing in the ordure.<BR>--कः<BR>1 An insect.<BR>--2 A sweeper,<BR>scavenger.<BR>--3 A brush, broom.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0191-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवस्कव|अवस्कवः
अवस्कव a. Noxious, injurious.<BR>--वः A kind of worm.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0191-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवस्तात्
अवस्तात् ind. [अवरस्मिन्<BR>अवरस्मात् अवरमित्यर्थे अस्ताति अव् आदेशः<BR>P. V. 3. 41]<BR>1 Below, from below,<BR>downwards, hitherwards; ˚प्रपदन a.<BR>attained from below (as heaven &c).<BR>--2 (Used as a preposition) Under.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0191-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवस्तु
अवस्तु n. [कुत्सितार्थे नञ्]<BR>1 A<BR>worthless thing or matter;<BR>अवस्तुनिर्बंधपरे कथं नु ते Ku. 5. 66 intent on a<BR>bad object.<BR>--2 Unreality (of matter),<BR>insubstantiality;<BR>वस्तुन्यवस्त्वारोपोऽज्ञानं attribution of unreality;<BR>--ता,<BR>--त्वं unreality.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0191-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवस्तॄ
अवस्तॄ {c9c} P. To cover, spread,<BR>overspread, overcast;<BR>प्रकंपयन्गामवतस्तरे दिशः Ki. 14. 29 pervaded,<BR>filled; उरसि रसादवतस्तरे स्तनाभ्यां Śi. 7. 47.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0191-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवस्तरणं|अवस्तरण
अवस्तरणं Spreading out.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0191-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवस्तारः|अवस्तार
अवस्तारः [अव-स्तॄ कर्मणि घञ्<BR>P. III. 3. 120]<BR>1 A curtain.<BR>--2 A<BR>covering; a screen or wall of cloth around<BR>a tent.<BR>--3 A mat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0191-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवस्त्र
अवस्त्र a. Without clothes, naked.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0191-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवस्था
अवस्था {c1c} A.<BR>1 To remain, stay,<BR>abide; तेन सह सुखमवतिष्ठंते K. 108;<BR>oft. with an adj. or adv.; विलोकयंती<BR>तावदवतस्थे 205; पादौ विष्टभ्य; क्षणं<BR>भद्रावतिष्ठस्व Bk. 8. 11 stay, wait;<BR>अनीत्वा पंकतां धूलिमुदकं नावतिष्ठते<BR>Śi. 2. 34.<BR>--2 To abide by, conform to,<BR>obey; न शासनेऽवास्थित यो गुरूणां<BR>Bk. 3. 14.<BR>--3 To live; क्षणमप्यवतिष्ठते<BR>श्वसन् यदि जंतुर्ननु लाभवानसौ R. 8. 87.<BR>--4 To stand (still), make a halt,<BR>stop; Bg. 1. 30, 14. 23; R. 2. 31,<BR>Ku. 3. 42, Śi. 9. 83.<BR>--5 To stand,<BR>exist, chance to be.<BR>--6 To fall to,<BR>devolve on.<BR>--7 To enter; reach,<BR>attain to.<BR>--8 To stand apart, go off,<BR>withdraw.<BR>--9 To descend; go to.<BR>--10 To place (Ved.) --Caus. (स्थापयति<BR>ते)<BR>1 To cause to stand or stop,<BR>station, keep, place;<BR>पश्चादवस्थापितवाहिनीकः R. 13. 66;<BR>स्कंधावारमवस्थाप्य Dk. 174 having encamped;<BR>भिक्षापात्रं नागदंतकेऽवस्थाप्य H. 1, 3.<BR>--2<BR>To fix, settle; शक्योऽवस्थापयितुं<BR>Mu. 1.<BR>--3 To establish, found;<BR>द्वैराज्यमवस्थापयितुकामोस्मि M. 5.<BR>--4 To<BR>compose, collect, steady, fix (as heart<BR>&c.); न शक्नोमि हृदयमवस्थापयितुं U. 4.<BR>--5 To comfort, console.<BR>--6 To<BR>separate, divide.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0191-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवस्थः|अवस्थ
अवस्थः The membrum virile.<BR>--स्था<BR>[अव-स्था-अङ्]<BR>1 State, condition,<BR>situation; स्वामिनो महत्यवस्था वर्तते<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0192-a" target="_blank">Page0192-a+ 57</a>]<BR>Pt. 1 a critical state; तदनु<BR>कथयेर्माधवीयामवस्थां Māl. 9. 26; तुल्यावस्थः<BR>स्वसुः कृतः R. 12. 80; तां तामवस्थां<BR>प्रतिपद्यमानं 13. 5; ईदृशीमवस्थांप्रपन्नोस्मि Ś. 5;<BR>Ku. 2. 6; सर्व˚ Me. 108; oft. in comp.;<BR>तदवस्थः Pt. 5. reduced to that state;<BR>एतद्˚, बालावस्थः अधिपतिः V. 5;<BR>अंत्यावस्था Pt. 4; so कामयमानावस्थो<BR>राजा Ś. 3; स्फुलिंगावस्थया वह्निः<BR>7. 15; अंतर्मदावस्थो द्विपेंद्रः R. 2. 7 rutting<BR>state.<BR>--2 Position, circumstance.<BR>--3<BR>Period, stage (of life &c.); यौवन˚;<BR>वयोवस्थां तस्याः शृणुत Māl. 9. 29.<BR>--4 Form, appearance.<BR>--5 Degree,<BR>proportion.<BR>--6 Stability, fixity, as<BR>in अनवस्थ q. v.<BR>--7 Appearance in a<BR>court of law; कृतावस्थो धनैषिणा<BR>Ms. 8. 60.<BR>--8 The female organ of<BR>generation.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--अंतरं another or<BR>altered state; ˚रं आरोपिता Ś. 3, 5.<BR>--चतुष्टयं the four periods or states of<BR>human life; i. e. बाल्यं (childhood);<BR>कौमारं (youth); यौवनं (manhood); and<BR>वार्धकं (old age).<BR>--त्रयं the three<BR>states; i. e. जागृति (waking), स्वप्न<BR>(dreaming), and सुषुप्ति (sound<BR>sleep).<BR>--दशकं the ten states of<BR>lovers; दृङ् मनः संगसंकल्पौ जागरः<BR>कृशताऽरतिः । ह्रीत्यागोन्मादमूर्छांता इत्यनंगदशा<BR>दश ॥ D. R.<BR>--द्वयं the two states of<BR>life i. e. सुखं and दुःखं (happiness and<BR>misery).<BR>--षट्कं the six states of an<BR>action mentioned by Yāska;<BR>जायतेऽस्ति वर्धते विपरिणमतेऽपक्षीयते नश्यति Nir.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0191-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवस्थानं|अवस्थान
अवस्थानं<BR>1 Standing, remaining,<BR>residing, abiding, dwelling;<BR>पूर्वकृतावस्थानेन राजलोकेन K. 92; किमिह<BR>निवृत्त्यावस्थानं Pt. 1; चतुर्मंडलावस्थानेन<BR>ibid.<BR>--2 Situation, station, position;<BR>मधुर˚ दर्शनीयः Ś. 6.<BR>--3 Residence,<BR>abode, place; घनावस्थानैः K. 127.<BR>--4<BR>Period of staying.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0192-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवस्थापनं|अवस्थापन
अवस्थापनं<BR>1 Fixing, settling.<BR>--2<BR>Residence, abode.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0192-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवस्थायिन्
अवस्थायिन् a. Staying, residing,<BR>dwelling; पश्चादवस्थायि बलं Ak.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0192-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवस्थित|अवस्थितः
अवस्थित p. p.<BR>1 Remained, stayed;<BR>कथमियंतं कालमवस्थिता मया विना भवती<BR>V. 4; remaining, standing firm or<BR>fixed; staying, abiding, lasting &c.;<BR>R. 6. 19; एवमवस्थिते K. 158 under these<BR>circumstances.<BR>--2 Firm of purpose,<BR>steady; see अनवस्थित.<BR>--3 Engaged in<BR>prosecuting; following; abiding by;<BR>Ms. 8. 42, Bg. 4. 23.<BR>--4 Resting with,<BR>dependent on; मयि सृष्टिर्हि लोकानां<BR>रक्षा युष्मास्ववस्थिता Ku. 2. 28; K.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0192-b" target="_blank">Page0192-b+ 55</a>]<BR>344.<BR>--5 Settled, a matter of course;<BR>पितुरस्याः समीपनयनमवस्थितमेव Ś. 5.<BR>--6<BR>Resolved; युद्धाय Pt. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0192-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवस्थितिः|अवस्थिति
अवस्थितिः f.<BR>1 Abiding, dwelling.<BR>--2 Residence, abode; अत्र<BR>कृतावस्थितिना धर्मेण K. 44.<BR>--3 Following,<BR>practising.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0192-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

