अवस्यु
अवस्यु a. [अवः रक्षणं तदिच्छति क्यच्<BR>उन्] Ved. Desiring favour, help or<BR>protection.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0192-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवस्वत्|अवस्वन्त्
अवस्वत् a. [अवो रक्षणमस्त्यस्य मतुप्<BR>मस्य वः] Defended, protected.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0192-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

