अवस्वन्य
अवस्वन्य a. Ved. Roaring, boisterous.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0192-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवह|अवहः
अवह a.<BR>1 Not carrying.<BR>--2<BR>Having no stream.<BR>--हः A kind of wind.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0192-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवहन्
अवहन् {c2c} P.<BR>1 To strike, beat<BR>off, hit, kill.<BR>--2 To destroy, remove;<BR>दुरितं, क्षुधां, द्विषः &c.<BR>--3 To thresh<BR>(as rice); अवहत्य तंडुलान् Dk. 132.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0192-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

