अहिंसान
अहिंसान a. Ved. Not hurting,<BR>harmless.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0219-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अहिंस्र|अहिंस्रः
अहिंस्र a. Harmless, innocent;<BR>Ms. 4. 246.<BR>--स्रः, --स्रा N. of a plant<BR>(कुलिक).<BR>--स्रं Harmless behaviour,<BR>innocence; Ms. 1. 29.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0219-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

