आतिरैक्यं|आतिरैक्य
आतिरे(रै)क्यं [अतिरेक-ष्यञ्]<BR>Superfluity, excess, abundance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0233-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आतिवाहिक
आतिवाहिक^1 a. [अतिवाहे नियुक्तः ठक्]<BR>Employed to convey to the other<BR>world; आतिवाहिकास्तल्लिगात् Br. Sūt.<BR>--कं An epithet of the Sūkṣma<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0233-b" target="_blank">Page0233-b+ 57</a>]<BR>Śarīra (in Sān. phil.) from its<BR>surpassing the wind in swiftness.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20170209. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/CORRECTIONS/issues/336. note: per quotation and AP and others.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0233-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आतिशय्यं|आतिशय्य
आतिशय्यं [अतिशय-स्वार्थे-ष्यञ्]<BR>Excess, abundance, large quantity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0233-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आतिष्ठं|आतिष्ठ
आतिष्ठं [अतिष्ठस्य भावः अण्] Being<BR>a universal ruler (अतिष्ठ).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0233-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

