आतर्पणं|आतर्पण
आतर्पणं<BR>1 Satisfaction,<BR>gratification.<BR>--2 Pleasing, satisfying.<BR>--3<BR>White-washing the wall, floor or<BR>seat (on festive occasions) (<BR>मंगलालेपनं).<BR>--4 The pigment used for the<BR>above purpose.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0233-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आतृप्यः|आतृप्य|आतृप्यं
