आतॄ
आतॄ {c1c} P.<BR>1 To pass through or<BR>over.<BR>--2 To cross over.<BR>--3 To<BR>overcome.<BR>--4 To enlarge, increase.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0233-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

