आनुगत्यं|आनुगत्य
आनुगत्यं [अनुगत-ष्यञ्]<BR>Acquaintance, familiarity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0242-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आनुगतिक
आनुगतिक a. (की f.) Relating<BR>to a follower.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0242-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

