आनुगुण्यं [अनुगुणस्य भावः कर्म वा<BR>ष्यञ्] Favourableness, suitableness,<BR>congruity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0242-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आनुग्रामिक
