आनुपूर्वं, --र्व्यं --र्वी [अनुपूर्वस्य भावः<BR>ष्यञ् ततो वा ङीषि यलोपः]<BR>1 Order,<BR>succession, series; Ms. 2. 41.<BR>--2 (In<BR>law) The regular order of the<BR>castes; षडानुपूर्व्या विप्रस्य क्षत्रस्य<BR>चतुरोऽवरान् Ms. 3. 23.<BR>--3 (In logic)<BR>Conclusion regularly or syllogistically<BR>drawn.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0242-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

