आनुमानिक|आनुमानिकः
आनुमानिक a. (की f.) [<BR>अनुमानादागतः ठक्]<BR>1 Relating to a<BR>conclusion.<BR>--2 Derived from an<BR>inference, subject to inference,<BR>inferential.<BR>--3 Inferred.<BR>--कं The<BR>Pradhāna of the Sāṃkhyas;<BR>आनुमानिकमप्येकेषामिति चेन्न Br. Sūt.; ˚त्वं the<BR>state of being inferable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0242-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आनुयात्रिकः|आनुयात्रिक
