आनुरक्तिः|आनुरक्ति
आनुरक्तिः f. Passion, affection.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0242-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आनुलेपिक
आनुलेपिक a. [अनुलेपिकायाः स्त्रिया<BR>धर्म्यम्] Forming the duty of an<BR>अनुलेपिका.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0242-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आनुलोमिक
आनुलोमिक a. (की f.) [<BR>अनुलोमंवर्तते अनुलोम ठक्]<BR>1 Regular, orderly,<BR>in due course.<BR>--2 Favourable,<BR>suitable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0242-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आनुलोम्य
आनुलोम्य a. ‘In the direction of<BR>the hair,’ produced in natural or<BR>direct order.<BR>--म्यं [अनुलोमस्य भावः<BR>कर्म वा ब्राह्म˚ ष्यञ्]<BR>1 Natural or direct<BR>order, proper arrangement;<BR>आनुलोम्येन संभूता जात्या ज्ञेयास्त एव ते<BR>Ms. 10. 5, 13.<BR>--2 Regular series or<BR>succession.<BR>--3 Favourableness, fit<BR>disposition.<BR>--4 Bringing to one's<BR>right place.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0242-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आनुविधित्सा
आनुविधित्सा Ingratitude.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0242-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आनुवेश्यः|आनुवेश्य
आनुवेश्यः [अनुवेशं वसति] A<BR>neighbour who lives next to the<BR>next-door neighbour;<BR>प्रातिवेश्यानुवेश्यौ च कल्याणे विंशतिद्विजे<BR>Ms. 8. 392; (on which Kull. says;<BR>निरंतरगुहवासी प्रातिवेश्यः,<BR>तदनंतरगृहवास्यानुवेश्यः). The word is also found to be<BR>written as अनुवेश्य.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0242-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आनुशासनिक
आनुशासनिक a. (की f.) [<BR>अनुशासनाय हितं ठक्] Relating to or<BR>treating of instruction.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0242-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आनुशूक
आनुशूक a. (की f.) Being with or<BR>within the awns (as rice).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0242-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आनुश्रविक|आनुश्रविकः
आनुश्र(श्रा)विक a. (की f.) [<BR>गुरुपाठादनुश्रूयते अनुश्रवो वेदस्तत्र विहितः ठक्]<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0242-c" target="_blank">Page0242-c+ 56</a>]<BR>According to hearing, resting on<BR>tradition.<BR>--कः Means of obtaining<BR>Heaven, absolution &c. Sk.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0242-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आनुश्राविक
आनुश्र(श्रा)विक a. (की f.) [<BR>गुरुपाठादनुश्रूयते अनुश्रवो वेदस्तत्र विहितः ठक्]<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0242-c" target="_blank">Page0242-c+ 56</a>]<BR>According to hearing, resting on<BR>tradition.<BR>--कः Means of obtaining<BR>Heaven, absolution &c. Sk.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0242-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आनुषक्
आनुषक् ind. Ved. In<BR>continuous order, uninterruptedly, one<BR>after the other.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0242-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आनुषंगिक|आनुषङ्गिक
आनुषंगिक a. (की f.) [<BR>अनुषंगात् आगतः ठक् स्त्रियां ङीप्]<BR>1 Connected<BR>with, concomitant.<BR>--2 Implied,<BR>inherent.<BR>--3 Necessarily following,<BR>inevitable, necessary.<BR>--4 Of<BR>secondary importance, secondary; असुभिः<BR>स्थास्नु यशश्चिचीषतः ननु लक्ष्मीः<BR>फलमानुषंगिकं Ki. 2. 19;<BR>अन्यतरस्यानुषंगिकत्वेऽन्वाचयः Sk.; see अन्वाचय.<BR>--5<BR>Attached to, fond of, frequenting;<BR>तत्र˚ Pt. 1.<BR>--6 Like, analogous.<BR>--7<BR>Relative, proportionate.<BR>--8 (In<BR>gram.) Elliptical, including words<BR>not included in the sentence.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0242-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आनुषज्
आनुषज् ind. In order,<BR>successively.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0242-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आनुषूक
आनुषूक a. Promoting, urging,<BR>driving forward.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0242-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आनुष्टुभ
आनुष्टुभ a. (भी f.) [अनुष्टुप्<BR>छंदोऽस्य उत्सा˚ अञ्]<BR>1 Consisting of<BR>Anuṣṭubhs.<BR>--2 Relating to Anuṣṭubh,<BR>formed like the metre.<BR>--भं The<BR>Anuṣṭubh metre.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0242-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

