आंदोल्
आंदोल् {c10c} P. [--दोलयति, दोलित]<BR>1<BR>To swing, rock or move to and<BR>fro.<BR>--2 To shake, tremble (fig. also);<BR>Māl. 4; मंदमारुतांदोलिता लतेव<BR>Dk. 17, 21.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0243-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आंदोलः|आन्दोल|आन्दोलः
