आन्न
आन्न a. (न्नी f.) [अन्नं लब्धा अन्न-ण<BR>P. IV. 4. 85]<BR>1 Fed, having food.<BR>--2 Relating to, derived from food.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0243-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आन्यभाव्यं|आन्यभाव्य
आन्यभाव्यं Another form.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0243-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आन्वयिक|आन्वयिकः
