उपपार्श्वः|उपपार्श्व|उपपार्श्वं
उपपार्श्वः --र्श्वं<BR>1 A shoulder.<BR>--2<BR>A flank, side.<BR>--3 The opposite side.<BR>--4 The lesser ribs.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0325-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपपार्श्वं|उपपार्श्व|उपपार्श्वः
उपपार्श्वः --र्श्वं<BR>1 A shoulder.<BR>--2<BR>A flank, side.<BR>--3 The opposite side.<BR>--4 The lesser ribs.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0325-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपपीड्
उपपीड् {c10c} P.<BR>1 (a) To press<BR>down or against, hurt, injure, pain;<BR>स्तनोपपीडं परिरब्धुकामा Ki. 3. 54,<BR>8. 16; Śi. 10. 47; पार्श्वोपपीडं,<BR>पार्श्वयोरुपपीडं, पार्श्वाभ्यामुपपीडं Sk. (b) To<BR>oppress, devastate, lay waste;<BR>क्षुत्तृष्णोपपीडित troubled; Ms. 8. 67,<BR>7. 195; Kām. 8. 72.<BR>--2 To eclipse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0325-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपपीडनं|उपपीडन
उपपीडनं<BR>1 Pressing down,<BR>devastating, laying waste.<BR>--2<BR>Inflicting pain, injuring; व्याधिभिश्चोपपीडनं<BR>Ms. 6. 62, 12. 80.<BR>--3 Pain, agony.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0325-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपपुरं|उपपुर
उपपुरं A suburb.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0325-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपपौरिक
उपपौरिक a. (की f.) Belonging to<BR>a suburb, suburban.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0325-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपपुराणं|उपपुराण
उपपुराणं A secondary or minor<BR>Purāṇa (for an enumeration of<BR>their names, see under अष्टादशन्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0325-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपपुष्पिका
उपपुष्पिका Yawning, gaping.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0325-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपप्रदर्शनं|उपप्रदर्शन
उपप्रदर्शनं Pointing out,<BR>indication.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0325-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपप्रदानं|उपप्रदान
उपप्रदानं<BR>1 Delivering over,<BR>entrusting.<BR>--2 A bribe, present;<BR>उपप्रदानैर्मार्जारो हितकृत्प्रार्थ्यते जनैः<BR>Pt. 1. 95.<BR>--3 A tribute.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0325-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपप्रलोभनं|उपप्रलोभन
उपप्रलोभनं<BR>1 Seducing,<BR>alluring.<BR>--2 A bribe, an inducement,<BR>allurement; उच्चावचान्युपप्रलोभनानि<BR>Dk. 48.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0325-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपप्राणः|उपप्राण
उपप्राणः A secondary life-wind<BR>(belonging to the body).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0325-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपप्रेक्ष्
उपप्रेक्ष् = उपेक्ष् q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0325-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपप्रेक्षणं|उपप्रेक्षण
उपप्रेक्षणं Overlooking,<BR>disregarding.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0325-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपप्रैषः|उपप्रैष
उपप्रैषः Invitation, summons.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0325-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपप्लु
उपप्लु {c1c} A.<BR>1 To float, swim;<BR>यदुपप्लवते तल्लघु Sk.<BR>--2 To overwhelm,<BR>cover with; उपप्लुतमघौघेन Rām.<BR>--3 To<BR>assault violently, assail; to trouble,<BR>oppress, distress; पौलस्त्योपप्लुता हरिं<BR>R. 10. 5, 14. 64; Ms. 4. 118.<BR>--4 To<BR>jump or spring upon.<BR>--5 To depart<BR>from. --Caus. To water.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0325-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपप्लवः|उपप्लव
उपप्लवः<BR>1 Misfortune, evil,<BR>calamity, distress, adversity; अथ<BR>मदनवधूरुपप्लवांतं… परिपालयांबभूव Ku. 4. 46;<BR>जीवन्पुनः शश्वदुपप्लवेभ्यः प्रजाः पासि<BR>R. 2. 48; K. 32, 54.<BR>--2 (a) An<BR>unlucky accident, injury, trouble;<BR>कच्चिन्न वाय्वादिरुपप्लवो वः R. 5. 6; Me. 17.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0326-a" target="_blank">Page0326-a+ 54</a>]<BR>(b) An obstacle, impediment;<BR>Ki. 11. 20.<BR>--3 Oppression, harassing,<BR>troubling; उपप्लवाय लोकानां<BR>धूमकेतुरिवोत्थितः Ku. 2. 32.<BR>--4 Danger, fear; see<BR>उपप्लविन् below.<BR>--5 Agitation,<BR>perturbation; इंद्रिय˚ K. 146.<BR>--6 A<BR>portent or natural phenomenon<BR>foreboding evil.<BR>--7 Particularly,<BR>an eclipse of the sun or moon;<BR>चंद्रमिवोपप्लवान्मुक्तं V. 1. 11.<BR>--8 N. of<BR>Rāhu, the ascending node;<BR>केतूपप्लवभौममंदगतयः षष्ठे तृतीये शुभाः<BR>--9<BR>Anarchy.<BR>--10 N. of Śiva.<BR>--11 Doubt,<BR>scepticism (with Buddhists).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0325-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपप्लविन्
उपप्लविन् a.<BR>1 One who has<BR>suffered a calamity, distressed,<BR>troubled; K. 208.<BR>--2 Suffering<BR>oppression; नृपा इवोपप्लविनः परेभ्यः<BR>R. 13. 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0326-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपप्लुत
उपप्लुत p. p.<BR>1 Violently<BR>attacked, beset, distressed, pained &c.<BR>--2 Harassed (by Rāhu), eclipsed.<BR>--3 Marked by prodigies.<BR>--4<BR>Moistened, watered; ˚अक्ष, --नयन weeping.<BR>--ता Morbid sensibility of the<BR>uterus.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0326-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपबंधः|उपबन्ध|उपबंध|उपबन्धः
उपबंधः<BR>1 Connection.<BR>--2 An<BR>affix.<BR>--3 A particular mode of sexual<BR>enjoyment; Ch. P. 44.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0326-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपबर्हः|उपबर्ह
उपबर्हः, --र्हणं<BR>1 A pillow.<BR>--2<BR>Pressing down, oppressing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0326-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपबर्हणं|उपबर्हण
उपबर्हः, --र्हणं<BR>1 A pillow.<BR>--2<BR>Pressing down, oppressing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0326-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपबृंहणं|उपबृंहण
