उपबृंहित
उपबृंहित a. Increased, magnified;<BR>K. 27, 136; Dk. 42.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0326-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

