उपबहु
उपबहु a. A few, a tolerable<BR>number.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0326-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपबाहुः|उपबाहु
उपबाहुः The lower arm.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0326-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपब्दः|उपब्द
उपब्दः, --ब्दिः Sound produced<BR>at the sprinkling of Soma; noise,<BR>sound in general.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0326-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपब्दिः|उपब्दि
उपब्दः, --ब्दिः Sound produced<BR>at the sprinkling of Soma; noise,<BR>sound in general.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0326-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपभंगः|उपभङ्ग|उपभंग|उपभङ्गः
उपभंगः<BR>1 Fleeing away, retreat.<BR>--2 A division (of a verse).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0326-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपभाषा
उपभाषा A secondary dialect.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0326-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपभुज्
उपभुज् {c7c} U.<BR>1 To enjoy, taste<BR>(in all senses); तपसामुपभुंजानाः फलानि<BR>Ku. 6. 10; नोपभुज्यते is not enjoyed,<BR>Pt. 2. 142; Ms. 12. 8.<BR>--2 To<BR>eat, drink; पयः R. 2. 65, 1. 67;<BR>Bk. 8. 40; अर्धोपभुक्तेन Ku. 3. 37;<BR>Y. 3. 325.<BR>--3 To possess;<BR>स्त्रीरत्नमुपभुंक्ष्व Hariv.<BR>--4 To use, make use<BR>of, receive.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0326-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपभुक्तिः|उपभुक्ति
उपभुक्तिः f. Enjoyment, use.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0326-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपभोक्तृ
उपभोक्तृ a. Enjoying, an enjoyer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0326-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपभोगः|उपभोग
उपभोगः<BR>1 (a) Enjoyment, eating,<BR>tasting; न जातु कामः कामानामुपभोगेन<BR>शाम्यति Ms. 2. 94, 8. 285;<BR>Y. 2. 171. काम˚ Bg. 16. 11; प्रियोपभोग<BR>R. 12. 22. (b) Use, application;<BR>चरणोपभोगसुलभः Ś. 4. 4.<BR>--2<BR>Enjoyment (of a woman), cohabitation;<BR>R. 14. 24.<BR>--3 Usufruct.<BR>--4 Pleasure,<BR>satisfaction.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0326-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपभोगिन्
उपभोगिन् a. Enjoying, using.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0326-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपभोग्य
उपभोग्य, --भोक्तव्य, --भोज्य pot. p.<BR>To be enjoyed, used or eaten;<BR>Ku. 1. 20; किंचित्कालोपभोग्यानि यौवनानि<BR>धनानि च Pt. 2. 114; अस्माकमुपभोग्यो<BR>भविष्यति Pt. 1 will become our prey.<BR>--ग्यं<BR>1 Any object of enjoyment.<BR>--2 Food.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0326-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपभोक्तव्य
उपभोग्य, --भोक्तव्य, --भोज्य pot. p.<BR>To be enjoyed, used or eaten;<BR>Ku. 1. 20; किंचित्कालोपभोग्यानि यौवनानि<BR>धनानि च Pt. 2. 114; अस्माकमुपभोग्यो<BR>भविष्यति Pt. 1 will become our prey.<BR>--ग्यं<BR>1 Any object of enjoyment.<BR>--2 Food.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0326-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपभोज्य
उपभोग्य, --भोक्तव्य, --भोज्य pot. p.<BR>To be enjoyed, used or eaten;<BR>Ku. 1. 20; किंचित्कालोपभोग्यानि यौवनानि<BR>धनानि च Pt. 2. 114; अस्माकमुपभोग्यो<BR>भविष्यति Pt. 1 will become our prey.<BR>--ग्यं<BR>1 Any object of enjoyment.<BR>--2 Food.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0326-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपभोगिन्
उपभोगिन् a. Eating, enjoying.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0326-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपभूषणं|उपभूषण
उपभूषणं A minor or inferior<BR>ornament.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0326-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपभृत्
उपभृत् f. [उप-भृ-आधारे क्विप्] A<BR>round cup used in sacrifices, made<BR>of the wood of the banian tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0326-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपम
उपम a. Ved.<BR>1 Highest,<BR>uppermost.<BR>--2 Most excellent, best,<BR>eminent, first.<BR>--3 Nearest.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0326-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपमंत्र्|उपमन्त्र्
उपमंत्र् {c10c} A.<BR>1 To invoke, call,<BR>invite.<BR>--2 To address, call to;<BR>स्त्री पुंसोपमंत्रिता.<BR>--3 To persuade,<BR>conciliate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0326-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपमंत्रणं|उपमन्त्रण|उपमंत्रण
उपमंत्रणं<BR>1 The act of addressing,<BR>inviting, calling.<BR>--2 Persuading,<BR>coaxing (उपच्छंदनं); P. I. 3. 47.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0326-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपमंत्रिन्|उपमन्त्रिन्
उपमंत्रिन् a. Inviting, persuading.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0326-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपमंथनी|उपमन्थनी
उपमंथनी A staff for stirring<BR>(fire).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0326-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपमंथितृ|उपमन्थितृ
उपमंथितृ a. Ved. Stirring.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0326-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपमन्यु
उपमन्यु a. Ved.<BR>1<BR>Understanding, intelligent.<BR>--2 Zealous,<BR>striving after.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0326-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपमा
उपमा {c2c} P., {c3c} {c4c} A.<BR>1 To<BR>compare, liken; तेनोपमीयेत तमालनीलं<BR>Śi. 3. 8; स्तनौ मांसग्रंथी<BR>कनककलशावित्युपमितौ Bh. 3. 20.<BR>--2 To give, grant<BR>(Ved.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0326-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपमा
उपमा<BR>1 Resemblance, similarity,<BR>equality; स्फुटोपमं भूतिसितेन शंभुना<BR>Śi. 1. 4, 17. 69; Ki. 6. 23;<BR>इहोपमा सतां Pt. 2. 7 the same is the<BR>case with the good.<BR>--2 (In Rhet.)<BR>Comparison of two objects<BR>different from each other, simile,<BR>comparison; साधर्म्यमुपमा भेदे K. P. 10;<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0326-c" target="_blank">Page0326-c+ 57</a>]<BR>or सादृश्यं सुंदरं<BR>वाक्यार्थोपस्कारकमुपमालंकृतिः R. G.; or उपमा यत्र<BR>सादृश्यलक्ष्मीरुल्लसति द्वयोः । हंसीव कृष्ण ते कीर्तिः<BR>स्वर्गंगामवगाहते ॥ Chandr. 5. 3; Kāv. 2. 14;<BR>उपमा कालिदासस्य Subhāṣ. (Daṇḍin<BR>mentions 32 varieties of उपमा; see<BR>Kāv. 2. 15-50; as to words<BR>expressive of उपमा see 2. 57-65);<BR>see K. P. 10 ad loc. also.<BR>--3<BR>The standard of comparison (<BR>उपमान); यथा वातो निवातस्थो नेंगते<BR>सोपमा स्मृता Bg. 6. 19; see ˚द्रव्य<BR>below; mostly at the end of comp.,<BR>‘like,’ ‘resembling’; बुबुधे न बुधोपमः<BR>R. 1. 47; so स्वर्गोपम, अमरोपम, अनुपम<BR>&c.<BR>--4 A likeness (as a picture,<BR>portrait &c).<BR>--Comp.<BR>--द्रव्यं any<BR>object used for a comparison;<BR>सर्वोपमाद्रव्यसमुच्चयेन Ku. 1. 49.<BR>--रूपकं a<BR>figure in Rhetoric being a mixture<BR>of simile and metaphor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0326-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपमातृ
उपमातृ m. An image-maker, a<BR>portrait-painter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0326-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपमानं|उपमान
उपमानं<BR>1 Comparison, resemblance;<BR>जातास्तदूर्वोरूपमानवाह्याः Ku. 1. 36.<BR>--2<BR>The standard of comparison, that<BR>with which anything is compared<BR>(opp. उपमेय); one of the four requisites<BR>of an उपमा; उपमानमभूद्विलासिनां<BR>Ku. 4. 5; उपमानस्यापि सखे प्रत्युपमानं वपुस्तस्याः<BR>V. 2. 3; Śi. 20. 49.<BR>--3 (In Nyāya<BR>phil.) Analogy, recognition of<BR>likeness, considered as one of the<BR>four kinds of pramāṇas or means<BR>of arriving at correct knowledge.<BR>It is defined as प्रसिद्धसाधर्म्यात्<BR>साध्यसाधनं; or उपमितिकरणमुपमानं तच्च<BR>सादृश्यज्ञानात्मकं Tarka K.<BR>--4 A<BR>particle of comparison.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--उपमेयभावः relation between the<BR>subject of comparison and the<BR>standard of comparison.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0326-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपमित
उपमित p. p. Compared, likened,<BR>similar &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0326-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपमितिः|उपमिति
उपमितिः f.<BR>1 Resemblance,<BR>comparison, similarity;<BR>पल्लवोपमितिसाम्यसपक्षं S. D.; तदाननस्योपमितौ<BR>दरिद्रता N. 1. 24.<BR>--2 (In<BR>Nyāya phil.) Analogy, inference,<BR>deduction, knowledge of things<BR>derived from analogy, a conclusion<BR>deduced by means of an उपमान;<BR>प्रत्यक्षमप्यनुमितिस्तथोपमितिशब्दजे<BR>Bhāṣā P. 52.<BR>--3 A figure of speech = उपमा<BR>q. v.<BR>--4 A likeness, picture.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0326-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपमेय
उपमेय pot. p. Fit to be likened<BR>or compared, comparable with;<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0327-a" target="_blank">Page0327-a+ 55</a>]<BR>(with instr. or in comp.);<BR>भूयिष्ठमासीदुपमेयकांतिः गुहेन R. 6. 4; 18. 34,<BR>37; अंतःपुरं चैककुलोपमेयं Ku. 7. 2;<BR>Ch. P. 29 v. l.<BR>--यं The subject of<BR>comparison, that which is<BR>compared (opp. उपमान); उपमानोपमेयत्वं<BR>यदेकस्यैव वस्तुनः Chandr. 5. 7, 9.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--उपमा a figure of speech<BR>in which the उपमान and उपमेय are<BR>compared to each other with a view<BR>to imply that the like of them does<BR>not exist; reciprocal comparison;<BR>विपर्यास उपमेयोपमानयोः K. P. 10; e. g.<BR>कमलेव मतिर्मतिरिव कमला तनुरिव विभा<BR>विभेब तनुः । &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0326-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपमातिः|उपमाति
उपमातिः f.<BR>1 Comparison.<BR>--2<BR>Killing.<BR>--3 Approaching with a<BR>prayer, addressing.<BR>--तिः m.<BR>Granting wealth (Sāy.),<BR>approaching in a friendly way; affable, an<BR>epithet of Agni (B. and R.).<BR>--Comp.<BR>--वनि a. destroyer of an<BR>enemy (Sāy.); one who receives<BR>addresses in a friendly way (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0327-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपमीमांसा
उपमीमांसा Ved. Deliberation,<BR>investigation, consideration.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0327-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपमातृ
उपमातृ f. [उपमिता मात्रा उप गौणे वा]<BR>1 ‘A second mother,’ wet nurse.<BR>--2 A near female relative; मातृष्वसा<BR>मातुलानी पितृव्यस्त्री पितृष्वसा । श्वश्रूः पूर्वजपत्नी<BR>च मातृतुल्याः प्रकीर्तिताः Śabdak.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0327-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपमाद|उपमादः
उपमाद a. Giving delight.<BR>--दः<BR>Enjoyment, delight.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0327-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपमारणं|उपमारण
उपमारणं Ved. Submerging(in<BR>water).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0327-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपमास्य
उपमास्य a. Occurring every<BR>month, monthly (Ved.).<BR>--स्यं The<BR>Śrāddha ceremony to be performed<BR>every month.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0327-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपमित्
उपमित् a. Ved.<BR>1 Dug up,<BR>excavated.<BR>--2 Placing near. --f. A<BR>prop, stay, pillar (स्थूणा).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0327-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपमृद्
उपमृद् {c9c} U.<BR>1 To crush, bruise,<BR>dash to pieces, destroy, kill;<BR>यामिकाननुपमृद्य N. 5. 110.<BR>--2 To rub<BR>down.<BR>--3 To pass through.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0327-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपमर्दः|उपमर्द|उपमर्द्द
उपमर्दः<BR>1 Friction, rubbing or<BR>pressing down, crushing under<BR>one's weight; अन्यासु तावदुपमर्दसहासु<BR>भृंग लोलं विनोदय मनः सुमनोलतासु S. D.<BR>(where उ˚ also means rough<BR>handling or enjoyment).<BR>--2<BR>Destruction, injury, killing.<BR>--3 Reproach,<BR>abuse, insult, harsh or insulting<BR>treatment; Mk. 1.<BR>--4 Unhusking.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0327-b" target="_blank">Page0327-b+ 55</a>]<BR>--5 Refutation of a charge.<BR>--6<BR>Stirring, shaking.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0327-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपमर्दक|उपमर्दकः|उपमर्द्दक
उपमर्दक a. Crushing, destroying.<BR>--कः Refutation of a charge.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0327-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपयज्
उपयज् m. (cf. P. III. 2. 73)<BR>N. of eleven additional formulas at<BR>a sacrifice; एकादशोपयजः<BR>यद्यजंतमुपयजति तस्मादुपयजो नाम Śat. Br.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0327-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपयष्टृ
उपयष्टृ m. The priest who utters<BR>the above formulas.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0327-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपयाजः|उपयाज
उपयाजः Additional formulas at<BR>a sacrifice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0327-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपयंत्रं|उपयन्त्र|उपयंत्र
उपयंत्रं A minor surgical<BR>instrument, a secondary application of<BR>any kind.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0327-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपयम्
उपयम् {c1c} U.<BR>1 To marry, take a<BR>wife (A. in this sense); भवान्<BR>मिथःसमयादिमामुपायंस्त Ś. 5; आत्मानुरूपां<BR>विधिनोपयेमे Ku. 1. 18; R. 14. 87;<BR>Śi. 15. 27; Ms. 3. 11; Bk. 4. 20,<BR>28; 7. 101.<BR>--2 (a) To seize, hold;<BR>उपयच्छ शूर्पं Av.; उपायंस्त महास्त्राणि<BR>Bk. 15. 21; शस्त्राण्युपायंसत जित्वराणि<BR>1. 16. (b) To take, receive, accept;<BR>कोपात्काश्चित्प्रियैः प्रत्तमुपायंसत नासवं<BR>Bk. 8. 33.<BR>--3 To show, indicate (सूच्);<BR>मोपयध्वं भयं Bk. 7. 101.<BR>--4 To lie<BR>under, support, prop up (Ved.).<BR>--5 To go to (a woman); Ms. 11. 173.<BR>--6 To curb, restrain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0327-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपयंतृ|उपयन्तृ
उपयंतृ m. A husband;<BR>अथोपयंतारमलं समाधिना Ku. 5. 45; R. 7. 1;<BR>Śi. 10. 45.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0327-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपयमः|उपयम
उपयमः<BR>1 Marriage, marrying;<BR>कन्या त्वजातोपयमा सलज्जा नवयौवना<BR>S. D.<BR>--2 Restraint.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0327-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपयमनं|उपयमन
उपयमनं<BR>1 Marrying, taking a<BR>wife; P. I. 2. 16.<BR>--2 Restraining,<BR>curbing.<BR>--3 Placing down the fire.<BR>--4 Support.<BR>--नी<BR>1 Any support of<BR>stone for holding fire-wood;<BR>उपयमनीरुपकल्पयंति Śat. Br.<BR>--2 A<BR>sacrificial ladle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0327-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपयामः|उपयाम
उपयामः<BR>1 A kind of vessel in a<BR>sacrifice.<BR>--2 The formulas uttered<BR>in taking out the Soma juice by<BR>means of a ladle.<BR>--3 Marriage (see<BR>उपयम).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0327-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपया
उपया {c2c} P.<BR>1 To approach, go<BR>towards, reach; सुरनिम्नगामुपयतीः<BR>सरितः Ki. 6. 16, 26; so पुरं, गतिं, नयनं,<BR>पदवीं; दुर्मंत्रिणं कमुपयांति न नीतिदोषाः<BR>H. 3. 117.<BR>--2 To attain to a<BR>particular state, meet with &c.; तनुतां,<BR>मृत्युं, रुजं, पाकं, प्रसादं &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0327-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपयात
उपयात p. p. Come, arrived.<BR>Arrival, return.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0327-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपयानं|उपयान
उपयानं Approaching, coming<BR>near; हरोपयाने त्वरिता बभूव Ku. 7. 22.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0327-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपयायिन्
उपयायिन् a. Coming towards.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0327-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपयाच्
उपयाच् {c1c} A. To wish or ask<BR>for, solicit; त्वया पुरस्तादुपयाचितो यः<BR>R. 13. 53; अक्षमालामुपयाचितुं<BR>K. 151.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0327-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपयाचक|उपयाचकः
उपयाचक a. One who asks or<BR>solicits, suitor, beggar.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0327-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपयाचनं|उपयाचन
उपयाचनं Soliciting, begging,<BR>approaching with a request or prayer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0327-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपयाचित|उपयाचितं
उपयाचित p. p. Begged, requested.<BR>--तं<BR>1 A request or prayer in<BR>general.<BR>--2 A present promised to a<BR>deity for the fulfilment of a desired<BR>object and generally to propitiate<BR>her, (the present may be an animal<BR>or even a human being); निक्षेपी<BR>म्रियते तुभ्यं प्रदास्याम्युपयाचितं Pt. 1. 14;<BR>2. 46; अद्य मया भगवत्याः करालायाः<BR>प्रागुपयाचितं स्त्रीरत्नमुपहर्तव्यं Māl. 5;<BR>दीयते यत्तु देवेभ्यो मनोराज्यस्य सिद्धये ।<BR>उपयाचितकं दिव्यं दोहदं तद्विदुर्बुधाः ॥.<BR>--3 A<BR>request or prayer to a deity for the<BR>accomplishment of a desired object;<BR>K. 330.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0327-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपयाचितकं|उपयाचितक
उपयाचितकं = उपयाचित above;<BR>सिद्धायतनानि कृतविविधदेवतोपयाचितकानि<BR>K. 64.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0327-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपयुज्
उपयुज् {c7c} A.<BR>1 To use, employ,<BR>apply; षाड्गुण्यमुपयुंजीत Śi. 2. 93;<BR>षडुपायुंक्त समीक्ष्य तत्फलं R. 8. 21;<BR>M. 5. 12; अनुपयुज्यमान useless, good<BR>for nothing Ś. 7; U. 4.<BR>--2 To<BR>enjoy, taste; पय उपयुज्य Me. 13<BR>v. l.; फलान्युपायुंक्त स दंडनीतेः<BR>R. 18. 46; Bk. 8. 39.<BR>--3 To devote or<BR>attach oneself to; न मृगैरुपयुज्यते is<BR>not loved Pt. 2. 22; न वै प्राज्ञा<BR>गतश्रीकं भर्तारमुपयुंजते Subhāṣ.<BR>--4 To<BR>yoke or harness (as horses to a<BR>carriage).<BR>--5 To appropriate,<BR>consume, eat; Ms. 8. 40. --pass.<BR>1 To be<BR>used or applied.<BR>--2 To be fit or<BR>proper; तस्येयमुपयुज्यते Bhāg.<BR>--3 To<BR>be of use, be taken into account;<BR>Pt. 1. 328.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0327-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपयुक्त|उपयुक्तः
उपयुक्त p. p.<BR>1 Attached &c.<BR>--2<BR>Suited, appropriate, fit, right, proper.<BR>--3 Worthy, serviceable, useful.<BR>--4<BR>Eaten, consumed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0327-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपयोगः|उपयोग
उपयोगः<BR>1 Employment, use,<BR>application, service; उपयोगं गम् or व्रज<BR>to be used or employed, serve; व्रजंति<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0328-a" target="_blank">Page0328-a+ 55</a>]<BR>…अनंगलेखक्रिययोपयोगं Ku. 1. 7.<BR>--2<BR>Administration of medicine, or<BR>preparation of them.<BR>--3 Fitness,<BR>suitableness, propriety.<BR>--4 Contact,<BR>proximity.<BR>--5 Any act contributing to<BR>the fulfilment of a desired object.<BR>--6 Good conduct, observing<BR>established customs.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0327-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपयोगिन्
उपयोगिन् a<BR>1 Employing, using.<BR>--2 Conducive or contributing to,<BR>serviceable, useful.<BR>--3 Appropriate,<BR>fit, proper.<BR>--4 Favourable,<BR>propitious.<BR>--5 Touching.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0328-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपयोगिता
उपयोगिता or ˚त्वं<BR>1 Usefulness,<BR>utility.<BR>--2 Fitness, propriety.<BR>--3<BR>Occasion, need.<BR>--4 Favour.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0328-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपयोजनं|उपयोजन
उपयोजनं<BR>1 Harnessing a horse.<BR>--2 A team.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0328-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपर|उपरः
उपर a. Ved.<BR>1 Being below,<BR>under.<BR>--2 Posterior, later.<BR>--3 Nearer.<BR>--रः<BR>1 The lower stone on which<BR>the Soma plant is laid that it may<BR>be ground by means of other stones<BR>(ग्रावन्).<BR>--2 The lower part of the<BR>sacrificial post.<BR>--3 A cloud.<BR>--4 A<BR>region, direction.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0328-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपरताति
उपरताति^1 ind. In the proximity,<BR>near to.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20170209. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/CORRECTIONS/issues/336. note: ap90 gives after PWG, where uparatāti is interpreted as loc. (and only loc.!) from uparatāt, but when we mark it as indecl. we should write down the exact indeclinable form uparatāti. So it was an error of Apte 1890..<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0328-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपरंज्
उपरंज् {c4c} U. or in pass. To be<BR>red; to be eclipsed; उपरज्यते<BR>भगवान् चंद्रः Mu. 1. --Caus.<BR>1 To<BR>colour, tint, dye.<BR>--2 To affect,<BR>grieve, distress.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0328-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपरक्त|उपरक्तः
उपरक्त p. p.<BR>1 Afflicted,<BR>overtaken by calamity, distressed.<BR>--2<BR>Eclipsed; K. 314.<BR>--3 Tinged,<BR>coloured; Śi. 2. 18<BR>--क्तः<BR>1 The sun<BR>or moon in eclipse.<BR>--2 Rāhu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0328-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपरागः|उपराग
उपरागः<BR>1 An eclipse of the sun<BR>or moon; उपरागांते शशिनः समुपगता<BR>रोहिणी योगं Ś. 7. 22; Śi. 20. 45.<BR>--2 Hence, Rāhu or the ascending<BR>node.<BR>--3 Redness, red colour,<BR>colour; कोपोपरागजनितां Ratn. 3. 14;<BR>Mk. 4; कलहकोप˚ Māl. 3.<BR>--4 A<BR>calamity, affliction, injury;<BR>blighting influence; मृणालिनी हैममिवोपरागं<BR>R. 16. 7.<BR>--5 Misbehaviour, ill<BR>conduct.<BR>--6 Reproach, blame, abuse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0328-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपरक्षः|उपरक्ष
उपरक्षः A body-guard.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0328-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपरक्षणं|उपरक्षण
उपरक्षणं A guard, an out-post.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0328-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपरत्नं|उपरत्न
उपरत्नं [उपमितं रत्नेन उप गौणे वा]<BR>A secondary or inferior gem;<BR>उपरत्नानि काचश्च कर्पूरोश्मा तथैव च ।<BR>मुक्ताशुक्तिस्तथा शंख इत्यादीनि बहून्यपि ॥ गुणा यथैव<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0328-b" target="_blank">Page0328-b+ 56</a>]<BR>रत्नानामुपरत्नेषु ते तथा । किंतु<BR>किंचित्ततोहीना विशेषोऽयमुदाहृतः ॥.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0328-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपरम्
उपरम् {c1c} P. (Sometimes A. also).<BR>1 To cease, end, terminate;<BR>संगतावुपरराम च लज्जा Ki. 9. 44, 13. 69;<BR>इत्युक्त्वोपरराम; युद्धमुपारमत् ceased &c.<BR>--2 To cease or desist from, stop<BR>(oft. with pres. part.);<BR>व्यापादयन्नोपरराम Pt. 1; or with abl.; Bg. 2. 35;<BR>Bk. 8. 54; 9. 51; or with inf.;<BR>Ki. 4. 17; or by itself; Bk. 8. 55.<BR>--3<BR>To be quiet or calm; यत्रोपरमते चित्तं<BR>Bg. 6. 20.<BR>--4 To a wait, wait for.<BR>--5<BR>To make quiet (= Caus.) --Caus.<BR>To cause to cease, stop, make quiet<BR>or still.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0328-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपरत|उपरतः
उपरत p. p.<BR>1 Stopped, ceased;<BR>रजस्युपरते Ms. 5. 66.<BR>--2 Dead; अद्य<BR>दशमो मासस्तातस्योपरतस्य Mu. 4.<BR>--3<BR>Withdrawn or retired from;<BR>रणात, कलहात् &c.<BR>--4 One who is<BR>disgusted with the world and has<BR>retired from it.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--अरि a. having<BR>no foe.<BR>--कर्मन् a. ceasing from<BR>works, not relying on worldly acts.<BR>--विषयाभिलाष a. one who has<BR>renounced all desire for worldly<BR>things.<BR>--स्पृह a. void of desire,<BR>indifferent to worldly attachments or<BR>possessions.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0328-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपरतिः|उपरति
उपरतिः f.<BR>1 Ceasing, stopping.<BR>--2 Death.<BR>--3 Abstaining from<BR>sexual enjoyment.<BR>--4 Indifference.<BR>--5 Abstaining from prescribed<BR>acts; the conviction that<BR>ceremonial acts are futile and ceasing to<BR>rely on them.<BR>--6 Intellect.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0328-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपरमः|उपरम
उपर(रा)मः<BR>1 Ceasing, stopping.<BR>--2 Abstaining from, giving up.<BR>--3 Death.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0328-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपरामः|उपराम
उपर(रा)मः<BR>1 Ceasing, stopping.<BR>--2 Abstaining from, giving up.<BR>--3 Death.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0328-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपरमणं|उपरमण
उपरमणं<BR>1 Abstaining from sexual<BR>pleasures.<BR>--2 Refraining from<BR>ceremonial acts.<BR>--3 Ceasing, stopping.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0328-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपरवः|उपरव
उपरवः A sort of hole used in<BR>the extraction of Soma juice (<BR>सोमाभिषवांगो गर्ताकारो देशभेदः) (name of<BR>certain holes which increase the sound<BR>of the stones when Soma juice is<BR>being extracted).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0328-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपरसः|उपरस
उपरसः<BR>1 A secondary mineral.<BR>--2 A secondary passion or feeling.<BR>--3 A subordinate flavour.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0328-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपराजः|उपराज
उपराजः A viceroy, one inferior<BR>to the ruling authority.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0328-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपरि
उपरि ind.<BR>1 As a separable<BR>preposition (usually with gen., rarely<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0328-c" target="_blank">Page0328-c+ 56</a>]<BR>with acc. or loc.) it means (a) Above,<BR>over, upon, on, towards; (opp. अधः)<BR>(with gen.); गतमुपरि घनानां Ś. 7. 7;<BR>अवाङ्मुखस्योपरि वृष्टिः पपात R. 2. 60;<BR>अर्कस्योपरि Ś. 2. 8; प्रासादानां Māl. 7. 5;<BR>U. 5. 2; Śi. 16. 9; 12. 37; so ˚स्थापनं,<BR>˚स्थित &c.; with loc. उपर्येव स<BR>लंकायां Rām.; or acc. यंत्राण्युपरि यंत्राणि<BR>ibid.; oft. at the end of comp.; रथ˚,<BR>तरुवर,˚तद्˚. (b) At the end of, at<BR>the head of; सर्वानंदानामुपरि वर्तमाना<BR>K. 158. (c) Beyond, in addition to;<BR>पणस्योपरि संस्थाप्य व्ययं Y. 2. 253;<BR>भुक्तस्योपरि Suśr. (d) In connection<BR>with, with regard to, towards, upon;<BR>परस्परस्योपरि पर्यचीयत R. 3. 24;<BR>Śānti. 3. 23; तस्योपरि क्रुद्धः, ममोपरि<BR>दुष्टबुद्धिः &c.; तवोपरि प्रायोपवेशनं करिष्यामि<BR>on your account. (e) After;<BR>मुहूर्तादुपरि उपाध्यायश्चेदागच्छेत्<BR>P. III. 3. 9 Sk. उपरि joined to उपरि (with<BR>acc. or gen. or by itself) means<BR>(a) Just above; लोकानुपर्युपर्यास्ते<BR>माधवः Vop. (b) higher and higher,<BR>far high, high above; उपर्युपरि<BR>सर्वेषामादित्य इव तेजसा Mb.<BR>--2 (As<BR>a separable adverb) It means (a)<BR>high above, upon, towards the<BR>upper side of (opp. अधः);<BR>उपर्युपरि पश्यंतः सर्व एव दरिद्रति H. 2. 2;<BR>so उपरिया; ˚स्थापन, ˚स्थित &c.; oft. in<BR>comp. स्वमुद्रोपरिचिह्नितं Y. 1. 319. (b)<BR>Besides, in addition, further, more;<BR>शतान्युपरि चैवाष्टौ तथा भूयश्च सप्ततिः<BR>Mb. (c) Afterwards; यदा पूर्वं<BR>नासीदुपरि च तथा नैव भविता Śānti. 2. 7;<BR>सर्पिः पीत्वोपरि पयः पिबेत् Suśr.;<BR>उपर्युपरि more and more, repeatedly,<BR>continuously. [cf. Zend upairi,<BR>upara; Gr. huper; L. super; Old<BR>Germ. obar; Germ. uber; Eng.<BR>over; Hind. upar].<BR>--Comp.<BR>--आसनं sitting on high.<BR>--गत a. gone<BR>up, ascended.<BR>--चर a. moving<BR>above (as a bird).<BR>--चित a. piled<BR>over or above.<BR>--ज a. produced<BR>above, elevated, high.<BR>--तन, स्थ a.<BR>upper, higher.<BR>--प्रुत a. Ved. coming<BR>from above.<BR>--बुध्न a. Ved. raised<BR>above the ground.<BR>--भागः the<BR>upper portion or side.<BR>--भावः<BR>being above or higher.<BR>--भूमिः f.<BR>the ground above<BR>--मर्त्यं ind.<BR>Ved. above men.<BR>--शयनं a place<BR>of rest.<BR>--श्रेणिक a. being in the<BR>upper line or series.<BR>--सद a. lying<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0329-a" target="_blank">Page0329-a+ 56</a>]<BR>or sitting above. (--m.) a class<BR>of gods.<BR>--सद्यं sitting above.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0328-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपरिष्टात्
उपरिष्टात् ind. [cf. P. V. 3. 31]<BR>1 As an adverb it means (a) Over,<BR>above, from above, on high;<BR>परहितकरणे नोपरिष्टान्न चाधः Bh. 3. 131;<BR>Y. 1. 106. (b) Further or later on,<BR>afterwards; कल्याणावतंसा हि कल्याण<BR>संपदुपरिष्टाद्भवति Māl. 6; इदमुपरिष्टात्<BR>व्याख्यातं in the sequel. (c) Behind<BR>(opp. पुरस्तात्).<BR>--2 (As a<BR>preposition) it means (a) Over, upon<BR>(with gen., rarely acc.); Śi. 11. 3. (b)<BR>Down upon. (c) Behind (with gen.).<BR>--Comp.<BR>--ज्योतिष्मती N. of a<BR>Vedic metre consisting of 43 or 44<BR>syllables.<BR>--ज्योतिः f. a verse of<BR>the Triṣṭubh metre, the last line<BR>of which consists of eight syllables.<BR>--बृहती N. of a Vedic metre<BR>having four Pādas, the first of which<BR>contains 12 syllables, each of the<BR>three others having only eight.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0329-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपरीतकः|उपरीतक
उपरीतकः A particular mode<BR>or posture of sexual enjoyment;<BR>(also called विपरीतक); ऊरावेकपदं<BR>कृत्वा द्वितीयं स्कंधसंस्थितं । नारीं कामयते कामी<BR>बंधः स्यादुपरीतकः ॥. Śabdak.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0329-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपरुध्
उपरुध् {c7c} U.<BR>1 To obstruct,<BR>hinder, interrupt, stop;<BR>उत्पक्ष्मणोर्नयनयोरुपरुद्धवृत्तिं Ś. 4. 14;<BR>Ve. 3. 8; उपरुध्यते तपोनुष्ठानं Ś. 4;<BR>V. 5; पण्यमुपरुंधतां Y. 2. 250; to<BR>detain; अन्याय्यमुपरोद्धुं V. 5.<BR>--2 (a)<BR>To disturb, trouble;<BR>पौरास्तपोवनमुपरुंधंति Ś. 1. (b) To press, trouble<BR>with a request; R. 5. 22.<BR>--3 To<BR>overcome, subdue; R. 4. 83.<BR>--4 To<BR>besiege (an enemy, town &c.);<BR>उपरुध्यारिमासीत Ms. 7. 195;<BR>Kām. 13. 67; उपरुद्धं कुसुमपुरं Mu. 2.<BR>--5<BR>To lock up, pen, confine; व्रजोपरोधं<BR>गाः स्थापयति Sk.<BR>--6 To conceal,<BR>hide; R. 7. 39.<BR>--7 To cast off,<BR>repudiate, reject; ज्येष्ठपुत्रमुपारुधत् Rām.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0329-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपरुद्ध|उपरुद्धः
उपरुद्ध p. p.<BR>1 Obstructed,<BR>impeded, stopped, confined, captive;<BR>वृत्तं हि राज्ञामुपरुद्धवृत्तं R. 18. 18.<BR>--2<BR>Covered, spread, concealed.<BR>--3<BR>Protected, favoured.<BR>--4 Besieged,<BR>locked up.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0329-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपरोधः|उपरोध
उपरोधः<BR>1 Obstruction, impediment,<BR>obstacle; शरत्प्रमृष्टांबुधरोपरोधः<BR>R. 6. 44; Śi. 20. 74; सकौतुक˚ विनयं U. 4.<BR>--2 Disturbance, trouble, molestation;<BR>तपोवननिवासिनामुपरोधो मा भूत् Ś. 1, 5, 6;<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0329-b" target="_blank">Page0329-b+ 56</a>]<BR>अनुग्रहः खल्वेष नोपरोधः V. 3; उपरोधः<BR>सह्यतां ibid.; detention; किं<BR>राजर्षेरुपरोधेन Ś. 3.<BR>--3 Opposition, refusal,<BR>check, restraint.<BR>--4 Covering,<BR>surrounding, blocking up.<BR>--5 Binding,<BR>tying, seizing.<BR>--6 Protection, favour.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--कारिन् a. impeding,<BR>obstructing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0329-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपरोधक|उपरोधकं
उपरोधक a.<BR>1 Obstructing.<BR>--2<BR>Covering, surrounding.<BR>--3<BR>Favouring.<BR>--कं An inner room, a private<BR>apartment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0329-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपरोधनं|उपरोधन
उपरोधनं Obstruction, impediment<BR>&c.; see उपरोध.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0329-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपरोधिन्
उपरोधिन् a. Obstructing,<BR>impeding; R. 18. 18.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0329-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपरूपकं|उपरूपक
उपरूपकं [उपगतं रूपकं दृश्यकाब्यं<BR>सादृश्येन] A drama of an inferior<BR>class, of which 18 kinds are<BR>enumerated; नाटिका त्रोटकं गोष्ठी सट्टकं<BR>नाट्यरासकं । प्रस्थानोल्लाप्यकाव्यानि प्रेंखणं रासकं तथा ॥<BR>संलापकं श्रीगदितं शिल्पकं च विलासिका ।<BR>दुर्भल्लिका प्रकरणी हल्लीशो भाणिकेति च ॥<BR>S. D. 276.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0329-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपलः|उपल
उपलः<BR>1 A stone, rock;<BR>उपलशकलेमतद्भदक गोमयानां Mu. 3. 15; कांते<BR>कथं घटितवानुपलेन चेतः Ś. Til. 3;<BR>Me. 19; Ś. 1. 14.<BR>--2 A precious<BR>stone, jewel.<BR>--3 Sand (Ved.).<BR>--4 A<BR>cloud.<BR>--ला<BR>1 Refined sugar.<BR>--2 The upper and smaller<BR>millstone which rests on the Dṛṣad.<BR>[cf. L. opalus].<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0329-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपलकः|उपलक
उपलकः A stone.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0329-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपलक्ष्
उपलक्ष् {c10c} P.<BR>1 To look at,<BR>observe, behold, mark; आसन्नवर्तिजन<BR>उपलक्षयति K. 197; सम्यगुपलक्षितं<BR>भवत्या Ś. 1.<BR>--2 To regard or consider;<BR>लोकप्रवादः सत्योयं पंडितैरुपलक्षितः Rām<BR>--3 To mark, put a sign upon;<BR>Y. 1. 30; 2. 151; Kām. 7. 47.<BR>--4 To<BR>denote, designate, describe.<BR>--5 To<BR>imply in addition; नक्षत्रशब्देन<BR>ज्योतिःशास्त्रमुपलक्ष्यते Kull. on<BR>Ms. 3. 162.<BR>--6 To mind, have in view;<BR>Kām. 16. 40.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0329-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपलक्षक
उपलक्षक a.<BR>1 Observing;<BR>marking; परचित्त˚.<BR>--2 Designating,<BR>indicating (as a word).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0329-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपलक्षणं|उपलक्षण
उपलक्षणं<BR>1 Looking at, beholding,<BR>observing, marking, ascertainment;<BR>वेलोपलक्षणार्थं Ś. 4.<BR>--2 A mark,<BR>characteristic or distinctive feature:<BR>उपलब्धमुपलक्षणं V. 4, 4. 33; उपलक्षणे<BR>तृतीया Sk.<BR>--3 Designation;<BR>प्राद्युपलक्षणं Sk.<BR>--4 Implying something<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0329-c" target="_blank">Page0329-c+ 57</a>]<BR>that has not been actually<BR>expressed, implication of something in<BR>addition or any similar object<BR>where only one is mentioned;<BR>synecdoche of a part for the whole,<BR>of an individual for the species, or<BR>of a quality for that in which the<BR>quality exists (स्वप्रतिपादकत्वे सति<BR>स्वेतरप्रतिपादकत्वं); मंत्रग्रहणं<BR>ब्राह्मणस्याप्युपलक्षणं P. II. 4. 80 Sk.; so अस्ति<BR>नास्तेरुपलक्षणं &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0329-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपलक्षित
उपलक्षित p. p.<BR>1 Observed,<BR>marked, comprehended, implied,<BR>metaphorically expressed &c.<BR>--2<BR>Understood, comprehended.<BR>--3<BR>Characterized.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0329-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपलक्ष्य|उपलक्ष्यः
उपलक्ष्य pot. p.<BR>1 Inferable.<BR>--2 To<BR>be described, designated &c.<BR>--क्ष्यः<BR>1 A prop, stay, support.<BR>--2 An<BR>asylum, shelter.<BR>--3 An inference.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0329-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपलधिप्रियः|उपलधिप्रिय
उपलधिप्रियः [बालधिः प्रियोऽस्य<BR>पृषो˚] A kind of antelope (चमर).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0329-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपलभ्
उपलभ् {c1c} A.<BR>1 To know,<BR>understand, see, perceive (directly);<BR>Pt. 1. 76; अन्या प्रतिक्रिया नोपलभ्यते<BR>K. 152.<BR>--2 To ascertain, find out,<BR>learn, know; ब्रूहि यदुपलब्धं U. 1;<BR>तत्त्वत एनामुपलप्स्ये Ś. 1; Mv. 7. 30;<BR>R. 12. 60; Bk. 3. 27; K. 159;<BR>M. 4, 3. 6, 4. 6.<BR>--3 To get, obtain, acquire,<BR>enjoy, experience (happiness &c.);<BR>उपलब्धसुखः Ku. 4. 42 experiencing;<BR>कथमुपलभे निद्रां V. 2. 10 enjoy;<BR>इदानीं स्मृतिरुपलब्धा Mu. 2 now I<BR>recollect; Ms. 11. 17; R. 8. 82,<BR>10. 2, 18. 21.<BR>--4 To conceive,<BR>become pregnant. --Caus.<BR>1 To cause<BR>to get.<BR>--2 To produce, bring about.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0329-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपलब्ध
उपलब्ध p. p.<BR>1 Gained, obtained.<BR>--2 Conceived.<BR>--3 Perceived,<BR>understood, known, guessed.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--अर्थ a. having the meaning<BR>understood. (--र्था f.) a tale, a true or<BR>probable story.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0329-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपलब्धिः|उपलब्धि
उपलब्धिः f.<BR>1 Getting, obtaining,<BR>acquisition; वृथा हि मे<BR>स्यात्स्वपदोपलब्धिः R. 5. 56, 8. 17.<BR>--2 Observation,<BR>perception, knowledge (ज्ञान);<BR>नाभाव उपलब्धेः cf. Nyāya S. 2. 28,<BR>30.<BR>--3 Understanding, mind (मति).<BR>--4 A conjecture, guess.<BR>--5<BR>Perceptibility, appearance (recognized as a<BR>kind of proof by the Mīmāṃsakas);<BR>see अनुपलब्धि.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0329-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपलब्धृ
उपलब्धृ a.<BR>1 Gaining, acquiring.<BR>--2 Knowing, perceiving. --m. Soul,<BR>self.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0329-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपलंभः|उपलम्भ|उपलंभ|उपलम्भः
उपलंभः [लभ्-घञ्-मुम् च]<BR>1<BR>Acquisition; भस्मादंगुलीयापलंभात्स्मृतिरुपलब्धा<BR>Ś. 7.<BR>--2 Direct perception or<BR>recognition, comprehension otherwise<BR>than from memory (same as<BR>अनुभव q. v.); प्राक्तनोपलंभ Māl. 5; ज्ञातौ<BR>सुतस्पर्शसुखोपलंभात् R. 14. 2.<BR>--3<BR>Ascertaining, knowing;<BR>अविघ्नक्रियोपलंभाय Ś. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0330-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपलंभक|उपलम्भक
उपलंभक a. Causing to observe,<BR>reminding.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0330-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपलंभनं|उपलम्भन
उपलंभनं Apprehension &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0330-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपलभ्य
उपलभ्य pot. p.<BR>1 Obtainable.<BR>--2<BR>Respectable, commendable,<BR>praiseworthy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0330-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपलिप्सा
उपलिप्सा A desire to obtain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0330-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपलल्
उपलल् {c10c} P. To fondle, coax,<BR>flatter; नतांगीमुपलालयन् Dk. 29;<BR>Ś. 7; M. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0330-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपलालनं|उपलालन
उपलालनं Fondling.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0330-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपलालिका
उपलालिका Thirst.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0330-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपलिंगं|उपलिङ्ग|उपलिंग|उपलिङ्गं
उपलिंगं A portent, natural<BR>phenomenon, considered as boding evil.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0330-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपलिप्
उपलिप् {c6c} P.<BR>1 To anoint, smear,<BR>besmear.<BR>--2 To defile, pollute;<BR>तथात्मा नोपलिप्यते Bg. 13. 32.<BR>--3 To stick<BR>or adhere to; यो वक्त्रमुपलिंपति Vāgb.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0330-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपलेपः|उपलेप
उपलेपः<BR>1 Anointing, smearing.<BR>--2<BR>Cleaning, white-washing.<BR>--3<BR>Obstruction, being concealed,<BR>becoming deadened or dull (said of<BR>senses).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0330-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपलेपनं|उपलेपन
उपलेपनं<BR>1 Smearing, anointing,<BR>plastering.<BR>--2 An ointment,<BR>unguent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0330-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपलेपिन्
उपलेपिन्<BR>1 Serving as an ointment.<BR>--2 Anointing, smearing.<BR>--3<BR>Obstructing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0330-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपवक्तृ
उपवक्तृ m.<BR>1 A priest at a<BR>sacrifice.<BR>--2 One who animates (by his<BR>words).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0330-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपवटः|उपवट
उपवटः The tree Buchanania<BR>Latifolia (प्रियासाल).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0330-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपवद्
उपवद् {c1c} A.<BR>1 To talk over,<BR>conciliate.<BR>--2 To flatter, cajole, coax;<BR>भृत्यानुपवदते Sk.; दातारं Bk. 8. 28.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0330-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपवादः|उपवाद
उपवादः Censure, blame (Ved.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0330-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपवादिन्
उपवादिन् a. Censuring, blaming.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0330-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपवनं|उपवन
उपवनं [उपमितं वनेन] A garden,<BR>grove, a planted forest;<BR>पांडुच्छायोपवनवृतयः केतकैः सूचिभिन्नैः Me. 23;<BR>R. 8. 73, 13. 79; ˚लता a garden<BR>creeper.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0330-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपवर्ण्
उपवर्ण् {c10c} P. To describe in<BR>detail; उपवर्णयेदानीं कुसुमपुरवृत्तांतं<BR>Mu. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0330-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपवर्णः|उपवर्ण
उपवर्णः Minute or detailed<BR>description.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0330-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपवर्णनं|उपवर्णन
उपवर्णनं Minute description,<BR>delineation in detail; अतिशयोपवर्णनं<BR>व्याख्यानं Suśr.; Y. 1. 320.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0330-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपवर्षः|उपवर्ष
उपवर्षः N. of a son of Śaṅkara<BR>Svāmi, author of several writings<BR>on the Mīmāṃsā philosophy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0330-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपवल्गित
उपवल्गित a. Swollen or<BR>dimmed with tears (as eyes).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0330-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपवल्लिका
उपवल्लिका N. of a plant (<BR>अमृतश्रवा).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0330-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपवल्हः|उपवल्ह
उपवल्हः Ved. Emulation,<BR>rivalry.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0330-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपवस्
उपवस् {c1c} P.<BR>1 To dwell in or at,<BR>inhabit (with acc.); वैकुंठं उपवसति Sk.<BR>--2 To be in a state of abstinence,<BR>abstain from food, fast; उपवसेद्दिनं<BR>Ms. 2. 220, 5. 20; Y. 3. 292, 64;<BR>(fig. also); उपोषिताभ्यामिव नेत्राभ्यां<BR>पिबंती Dk. 4.<BR>--3 To go to (a master).<BR>--4 To enter upon, learn, take to,<BR>begin. --Caus. To cause to fast.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0330-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपवसथः|उपवसथ
उपवसथः [उप-वस्-आधारे अथ]<BR>1 A<BR>village.<BR>--2 The day preceding a<BR>Soma sacrifice; or a day of<BR>preparation for this sacrifice; a fast-day.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0330-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपवसथीय
उपवसथीय, उपवसथ्य a. Selected for<BR>an उपवसथ (as a day).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0330-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपवसथ्य
उपवसथीय, उपवसथ्य a. Selected for<BR>an उपवसथ (as a day).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0330-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपवस्तं|उपवस्त
उपवस्तं A fast.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0330-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपवस्तिः|उपवस्ति
उपवस्तिः f. Support of life (as<BR>food, sleep &c.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0330-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपवस्तृ
उपवस्तृ a. One who fasts.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0330-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपवासः|उपवास
उपवासः<BR>1 A fast; सोपवासस्त्र्यहं वसेत्<BR>Y. 1. 175, 3. 190; Ms. 11. 196<BR>(a fast is a religious act and<BR>consists in abstaining from every kind<BR>of sensual gratification).<BR>--2<BR>Kindling a sacred fire.<BR>--3 A fire-altar.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0330-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपवासक
उपवासक a. Fasting, observing a<BR>fast.<BR>--कं A fast.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0330-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपवासिन्
उपवासिन् a. Fasting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0330-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपवह्
उपवह् {c1c} P.<BR>1 To bear or lead<BR>near, lead towards.<BR>--2 To bring<BR>about, commence.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0330-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपोढ|उपोढः
उपोढ p. p.<BR>1 Collected,<BR>accumulated, increased, stored up;<BR>उपोढतपसां Ś. 5. 7; ˚बलस्य ते M. 5. 1;<BR>V. 2. 7; so ˚मदः, ˚हर्षः &c.<BR>--2 Brought<BR>near, proximate, near; Ki. 17. 54,<BR>13. 23.<BR>--3 Arrayed for battle (as an<BR>army).<BR>--4 Begun, commenced;<BR>उपोढशब्दा न रथांगनेमयः Ś. 7. 10<BR>causing sound.<BR>--5 Married.<BR>--6 A<BR>battle-array.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0330-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपवहं|उपवह
उपवहं Ved. Anything placed on<BR>the neck of an ox under the yoke,<BR>to raise it to the right level for a<BR>yoke-fellow of greater height; M. W.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0330-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपवहनं
उपवहनं (In music) Preliminary<BR>singing, humming a tune before<BR>beginning to sing it aloud; M. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0330-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपवाहनं|उपवाहन
उपवाहनं Carrying to, bringing<BR>near.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0330-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपवाहिन्
उपवाहिन् a. Flowing towards.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0330-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपवाह्यः|उपवाह्य
उपवाह्यः, --ह्या<BR>1 A king's riding<BR>elephant (male or female);<BR>चंद्रगुप्तोपवाह्यां गजवशां Mu. 2.<BR>--2 A royal<BR>vehicle (in general).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0330-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपवाह्या
उपवाह्यः, --ह्या<BR>1 A king's riding<BR>elephant (male or female);<BR>चंद्रगुप्तोपवाह्यां गजवशां Mu. 2.<BR>--2 A royal<BR>vehicle (in general).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0330-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपवा
उपवा Ved. Blowing at.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0330-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपवाकः|उपवाक
उपवाकः<BR>1 Addressing, speaking<BR>to, conversing.<BR>--2 Praising.<BR>--3<BR>Indra-grain (इंद्रयव.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0330-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपवाजनं|उपवाजन
उपवाजनं A fan.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0330-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपवासनं|उपवासन
उपवासनं A dress, garment<BR>(Ved.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0330-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपविद्
उपविद् a.<BR>1 Gaining, obtaining.<BR>--2 Knowing. --f.<BR>1 Acquisition.<BR>--2 Investigating, inquiring into,<BR>knowledge.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0330-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपविद्या
उपविद्या Profane science, inferior<BR>kind of knowledge.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0330-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपवेदः|उपवेद
उपवेदः ‘Inferior knowledge’, a<BR>class of writings subordinate to the<BR>Vedas. There are four such<BR>Upavedas, one being attached to each of<BR>the four Vedas:--thus आयुर्वेद or<BR>Medicine to ऋग्वेद; (according to<BR>some authorities such as Suśruta<BR>it is a part of the Atharvaveda);<BR>धनुर्वेद or military science to यजुर्वेद;<BR>गांधर्ववेद or Music to सामवेद, and<BR>स्थापत्य-शस्त्रं-वेद or Mechanics to अथर्ववेद.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0330-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपविश्
उपविश् {c6c} P.<BR>1 To sit down,<BR>take a seat.<BR>--2 To sit near to, wait<BR>upon.<BR>--3 To pitch a camp, encamp.<BR>--4 To go down, set (as the sun).<BR>--5 To enter upon, practise; as<BR>प्रायं उपविशति; so अनशनोपविष्ट.<BR>--6<BR>To abstain from food, fast;<BR>सोप्युक्त्वैवमुपाविशत् Bk. 7. 75.<BR>--7 To<BR>seize, take possession of. --Caus. To<BR>cause to sit down, place or set<BR>down.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0330-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपवेशः|उपवेश
उपवेशः --शनं<BR>1 Sitting, sitting<BR>down; as in प्रायोपवेशन.<BR>--2 Directing<BR>one's mind to, being attached to.<BR>--3 Voiding by stool.<BR>--4 Placing<BR>down.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0330-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपवेशनं|उपवेशन
उपवेशः --शनं<BR>1 Sitting, sitting<BR>down; as in प्रायोपवेशन.<BR>--2 Directing<BR>one's mind to, being attached to.<BR>--3 Voiding by stool.<BR>--4 Placing<BR>down.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0330-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपवेशिन्
उपवेशिन् a.<BR>1 Sitting.<BR>--2<BR>Devoting oneself to.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0331-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपवेष्टृ
उपवेष्टृ a. One who sits, sitting<BR>down.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0331-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपविषः|उपविष|उपविषं
उपविषः --षं<BR>1 An artificial poison.<BR>--2 A narcotic, any poisonous drug;<BR>अर्कक्षीरं स्नुहीक्षीरं तथैव कलिहारिका । धत्तूरः<BR>करवीरश्च पंच चोपविषाः स्मृताः ॥<BR>--षा N.<BR>of a plant (अतिविषा).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0331-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपविषं|उपविष|उपविषः
उपविषः --षं<BR>1 An artificial poison.<BR>--2 A narcotic, any poisonous drug;<BR>अर्कक्षीरं स्नुहीक्षीरं तथैव कलिहारिका । धत्तूरः<BR>करवीरश्च पंच चोपविषाः स्मृताः ॥<BR>--षा N.<BR>of a plant (अतिविषा).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0331-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपवीणयति
उपवीणयति Den. P. To play on<BR>the Vīṇā or lute (before a deity<BR>&c.); उपवीणयितुं ययौ<BR>रवेरुदयावृत्तिपथेन नारदः R. 8. 33; N. 6. 65;<BR>Ki. 10. 38; K. 131.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0331-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपवीतं|उपवीत
उपवीतं [उप-वे-क्त]<BR>1 Investiture<BR>with the sacred thread.<BR>--2 The<BR>sacred thread worn by the first<BR>three classes of the Hindus;<BR>पित्र्यमंशमुपवीतलक्षणं मातृकं च धन्रूर्जितं<BR>दधत् R. 11. 64; मुक्तायज्ञोपवीतानि<BR>Ku. 6. 6; Śi. 1. 7; Ki. 12. 23;<BR>Ms. 2. 44, 64, 4. 36, 66.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0331-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपवीतिन्
उपवीतिन् a. Wearing the sacred<BR>thread.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0331-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपवीरं|उपवीर
उपवीरं A kind of demon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0331-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपवृंह
उपवृंह, --हणं &c. See उपबृंह् &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0331-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपवृंहणं|उपवृंहण
उपवृंह, --हणं &c. See उपबृंह् &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0331-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपवृत्
उपवृत् {c1c} A.<BR>1 To go towards,<BR>approach.<BR>--2 To return.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0331-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपवर्तः|उपवर्त
उपवर्तः A particular high number.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0331-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपवर्तनं|उपवर्तन|उपवर्त्तन|उपवर्त्तनं
उपवर्तनं<BR>1 A place for exercise.<BR>--2 A place whether inhabited or<BR>not.<BR>--3 A district or Pargana.<BR>--4<BR>A kingdom (राज्य).<BR>--5 A bog,<BR>marshy place.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0331-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपवृत्तिः|उपवृत्ति
उपवृत्तिः f. Motion towards,<BR>approaching.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0331-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपवेद|उपवेदः
उपवेद See under उपविद्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0331-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपवेषः|उपवेष
उपवेषः Ved. A stick (of green<BR>wood) used for stirring the<BR>sacrificial fire; स उपवेषमादत्ते Śat. Br.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0331-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपवैणवं|उपवैणव
उपवैणवं The three periods of<BR>the day; i. e. morning, midday,<BR>and evening (त्रिसंध्यं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0331-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपव्याख्यानं|उपव्याख्यान
उपव्याख्यानं A supplementary<BR>explanation or interpretation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0331-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपव्याघ्रः|उपव्याघ्र
उपव्याघ्रः A small hunting<BR>leopard.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0331-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपशम्
उपशम् {c4c} P.<BR>1 To become calm<BR>or quiet, be assuaged; उपशाम्यतु<BR>ते बुद्धिः Bk. 20. 5.<BR>--2 To cease, stop;<BR>अग्निः, शब्दः, कोपः &c.; cease to<BR>speak; K. 110. --Caus.<BR>1 To calm,<BR>tranquillize.<BR>--2 To appease, pacify,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0331-b" target="_blank">Page0331-b+ 55</a>]<BR>assuage, mitigate.<BR>--3 To extinguish,<BR>kill.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0331-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपशमः|उपशम
उपशमः<BR>1 Becoming quiet,<BR>assuagement, pacification; कुतोऽस्या<BR>उपशमः Ve. 3; मन्युर्दुःसह एष<BR>यात्युपशमं नो सांत्ववादैः स्फुटं Amaru. 5;<BR>cessation, stopping, extinction.<BR>--2<BR>Relaxation, intermission.<BR>--3<BR>Tranquility, calmness, patience;<BR>ज्ञानस्योपशमः Bh. 2. 82.<BR>--4 Control or<BR>restraint of the senses.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0331-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपशमक
उपशमक a. Appeasing, pacifying,<BR>affording repose, making patient.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0331-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपशमनं|उपशमन
उपशमनं<BR>1 Quieting, calming,<BR>appeasing.<BR>--2 Mitigation,<BR>assuagement.<BR>--3 Extinction, cessation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0331-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपशांत|उपशान्त
उपशांत p. p.<BR>1 Calmed,<BR>appeased, pacified.<BR>--2 Calm, tranquil.<BR>--3<BR>Lessened, diminished.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0331-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपशांतिः|उपशान्ति|उपशांति|उपशान्तिः
उपशांतिः f.<BR>1 Cessation, allaying,<BR>quieting, alleviation;<BR>आर्तभयोपशांतये R. 8. 31; Amaru. 65.<BR>--2<BR>Appeasing, assuaging, pacification,<BR>satisfaction (of desires); Pt. 1. 147.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0331-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपशांतिन्|उपशान्तिन्
उपशांतिन् a.<BR>1 Appeased, pacified.<BR>--2 Calm, tranquil. --m. A tame<BR>elephant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0331-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपशय|उपशयः
उपशय See under उपशी.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0331-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपशल्यं|उपशल्य|उपशल्यः
उपशल्यं An open place in the<BR>vicinity of a town or village,<BR>suburb; अथोपशल्ये रिपुमग्नशल्यः<BR>R. 16. 37, 15. 60; Śi. 5. 8, K. 50.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0331-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपशाखा
उपशाखा A secondary branch.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0331-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपशांत्वनं|उपशान्त्वन
उपशांत्वनं Appeasing(see<BR>उपसांत्वन).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0331-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपशालं|उपशाल
उपशालं A place near a house,<BR>a court before a house.<BR>--लं ind.<BR>Near a house.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0331-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपशास्त्रं|उपशास्त्र
उपशास्त्रं A minor science or<BR>treatise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0331-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपशिक्षा
उपशिक्षा --क्षणं Learning,<BR>training.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0331-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपशिक्षणं|उपशिक्षण
उपशिक्षा --क्षणं Learning,<BR>training.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0331-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपशिंघनं|उपशिङ्घन
उपशिंघ(ह)नं<BR>1 Smelling.<BR>--2<BR>Anything given to smell at.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0331-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपशिंहनं|उपशिंहन
उपशिंघ(ह)नं<BR>1 Smelling.<BR>--2<BR>Anything given to smell at.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0331-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपशिष्यः|उपशिष्य
उपशिष्यः The pupil of a<BR>pupil; शिष्योपशिष्यैरुपगीयमानमवेहि<BR>तन्मंडनमिश्रधाम Udb.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0331-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपशी
उपशी {c2c} A.<BR>1 To lie near.<BR>--2<BR>To cohabit.<BR>--3 To do good to,<BR>agree with; यन्ममोपशेते Caraka.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0331-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपशय|उपशयः
उपशय a.<BR>1 Lying by the side of.<BR>--2 Productive of happiness or rest.<BR>--यः<BR>1 Lying by the side of.<BR>--2 A<BR>lair, ambush; Śi. 2. 80.<BR>--3<BR>Diagnosis by the effect of certain articles of<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0331-c" target="_blank">Page0331-c+ 52</a>]<BR>food, or medicine (one of the five<BR>elements of निदान).<BR>--4 Allaying<BR>disease by diet, regimen &c.<BR>--या<BR>A prepared piece of clay.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0331-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपशायः|उपशाय
उपशायः Sleeping in turn,<BR>rotation for sleeping with (another<BR>who keeps watch at night).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0331-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपशायिन्
उपशायिन् a.<BR>1 Lying near to.<BR>--2 Sleeping, going to bed.<BR>--3<BR>Allaying, calming.<BR>--4 Composing or<BR>narcotic (in medicine); ˚ता, -त्वं<BR>tranquilling; calming, secondary<BR>means of cure (as diet &c.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0331-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपशुभ्
उपशुभ् Caus. P. To adorn,<BR>ornament, decorate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0331-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपशोभनं|उपशोभन
उपशोभनं, --शोभा Adorning,<BR>ornamenting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0331-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपशोभा
उपशोभनं, --शोभा Adorning,<BR>ornamenting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0331-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपशोषणं|उपशोषण
उपशोषणं Drying up,<BR>withering.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0331-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपश्री
उपश्री f. Covering, anything<BR>thrown above or upon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0331-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपश्रु
उपश्रु {c5c} P.<BR>1 To hear, listen;<BR>वचः, गिरः &c.<BR>--2 To promise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0331-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपश्रुत्
उपश्रुत् m. A sacrifice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0331-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपश्रुत|उपश्रुतं
उपश्रुत a.<BR>1 Heard.<BR>--2<BR>Promised, agreed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0331-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपश्रुतिः|उपश्रुति
उपश्रुतिः f.<BR>1 Hearing, listening.<BR>--2 Range of hearing.<BR>--3 A<BR>supernatural voice heard at night, and<BR>personified as a nocturnal deity<BR>revealing the future; नक्तं निर्गत्य<BR>यत्किंचिच्छुभाशुभकरं वचः । श्रूयते तद्विदुर्धीरा<BR>देवप्रश्नमुपश्रुतिं ॥ Hārāvalī; परिजनोऽपि<BR>चास्याः सततमुपश्रुत्यै निर्जगाम K. 65.<BR>--4 Aspect of the stars,<BR>fortune-telling.<BR>--5 Promise, assent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0331-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपश्रोतृ
उपश्रोतृ a. Listening, hearing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0331-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपश्लिष्
उपश्लिष् {c4c} P.<BR>1 To embrace.<BR>--2<BR>To draw near, approach. --Caus.<BR>To bring near, place at hand;<BR>उपश्लेषय रथं V. 1; शरं V. 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0331-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपश्लिष्ट
उपश्लिष्ट p. p. Placed near,<BR>contiguous, adjoining.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0331-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपश्लेषः|उपश्लेष
उपश्लेषः, --षणं<BR>1 Juxta-position,<BR>contact.<BR>--2 An embrace.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0331-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपश्लेषणं|उपश्लेषण
उपश्लेषः, --षणं<BR>1 Juxta-position,<BR>contact.<BR>--2 An embrace.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0331-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपश्लोकयति
उपश्लोकयति Den. P. To<BR>extolor praise in verses; समुत्तेजनसमर्थैः<BR>श्लोकैरुपश्लोकयितव्यः Mu. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0331-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपश्वस|उपश्वसः
उपश्वस a. Ved. Sounding,<BR>roaring.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0331-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपष्टुत्
उपष्टुत् ind. Ved. (Ready) At<BR>one's call.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0331-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपसंयमः|उपसंयम
उपसंयमः<BR>1 Curbing,<BR>restraining, binding.<BR>--2 The end of the<BR>world, universal destruction.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0332-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपसंयमनं|उपसंयमन
उपसंयमनं Binding.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0332-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपसंयोगः|उपसंयोग
उपसंयोगः A secondary<BR>connection, modification;<BR>नामाख्यातयोः कर्मोपसंयोगद्योतकाः Nir.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0332-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपसंरोहः|उपसंरोह
उपसंरोहः Growing together or<BR>over, cicatrizing; शल्यमार्गानुपसंरोहः<BR>Suśr.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0332-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपसंवादः|उपसंवाद
उपसंवादः An agreement, a<BR>contract.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0332-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपसंव्यानं|उपसंव्यान
उपसंव्यानं An undergarment;<BR>अंतरं बहिर्योगोपसंव्यानयोः P. I. 1. 36.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0332-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपसंस्कृ
उपसंस्कृ {c8c} U.<BR>1 To prepare (as<BR>a meal).<BR>--2 To ornament.<BR>--3 To<BR>consecrate, purify; K. 40.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0332-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपसंस्करणं
उपसंस्करणं Preparing, purifying.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0332-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपसंहृ
उपसंहृ {c1c} P.<BR>1 To draw or bring<BR>together, collect.<BR>--2 To sum or<BR>wind up, conclude; इदानीमुपसंहरति;<BR>प्रकृतमुपसंहरति Kull. on Ms. 1. 57.<BR>--3 To contract; as कूर्मोंऽगानि.<BR>--4 To<BR>withdraw, take away, withhold:<BR>छेत्तुः पार्श्वगतां छायां नोपसंहरते द्रुमः<BR>H. 1. 59.<BR>--5 To check, stop, curb.<BR>--6 To absorb, destroy, annihilate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0332-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपसंहरणं|उपसंहरण
उपसंहरणं<BR>1 Withdrawing, taking<BR>away or back.<BR>--2 Refusing,<BR>withholding.<BR>--3 Excluding.<BR>--4<BR>Attacking, invading.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0332-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपसंहारः|उपसंहार
उपसंहारः<BR>1 Drawing in or<BR>together, contracting.<BR>--2 Drawing<BR>away, withdrawing, excluding,<BR>withholding.<BR>--3 A collection,<BR>assemblage.<BR>--4 Summing up,<BR>winding up, conclusion (opp. उपक्रम).<BR>--5<BR>A preparation (of a speech &c).<BR>--6 A compendium, rèsumè.<BR>--7<BR>Brevity, conciseness.<BR>--8 Perfection.<BR>--9 Destruction, death, end.<BR>--10<BR>Attacking, invading.<BR>--11 (In logic)<BR>Refutation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0332-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपसंहारिन्
उपसंहारिन् a.<BR>1 Comprehending.<BR>--2<BR>Exclusive. --m. A hetu (हेतु) which<BR>is not exclusive; see अनुपसंहारिन्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0332-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपसंहृतिः|उपसंहृति
उपसंहृतिः f.<BR>1 Comprehension.<BR>--2 Seizing, taking.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0332-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपसंक्रांत
उपसंक्रांत a. Handed down.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0332-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपसंक्षेपः|उपसङ्क्षेप
उपसंक्षेपः An abstract,<BR>summary, résumè.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0332-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपसंख्यानं|उपसङ्ख्यान
उपसंख्यानं<BR>1 Addition.<BR>--2<BR>Supplementary addition, further or<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0332-b" target="_blank">Page0332-b+ 55</a>]<BR>additional enumeration (a term<BR>technically applied to the Vārtikas<BR>of Kātyāyana which are intended<BR>to supply omissions in Pāṇini's<BR>Sūtras and generally to<BR>supplement them); e. g.<BR>जुगुप्साविरामप्रमादार्थानामुपसंख्यानं; cf. इष्टि.<BR>--3 (In gram.)<BR>A substitute in form or sense.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0332-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपसंग्रह्|उपसङ्ग्रह्
उपसंग्रह् {c9c} P.<BR>1 To take upon<BR>oneself, experience, feel, suffer.<BR>--2<BR>To receive, accept.<BR>--3 To seize,<BR>catch hold of; पाणिभ्यां तूपसंगृह्य<BR>Ms. 3. 224.<BR>--4 To take into custody or<BR>possession.<BR>--5 To win over,<BR>conciliate, make favourable;<BR>पिंडदानादिनोपसंगृह्य Dk. 58.<BR>--6 To clasp,<BR>embrace.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0332-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपसंग्रहः|उपसङ्ग्रह
उपसंग्रहः, --हणं<BR>1 Keeping pleased,<BR>supporting, maintaining;<BR>तीक्ष्णरसदायिनामुपसंग्रहार्थं Mu. 2.<BR>--2<BR>Respectful salutation (as by touching the<BR>feet of the person saluted); स्फुरति<BR>रभसात्पाणिः पादोपसंग्रहणाय च<BR>Mv. 2. 30.<BR>--3 Accepting, adopting;<BR>Br. Sūt. I. 4. 11.<BR>--4 Polite address,<BR>obeisance.<BR>--5 Collecting, joining.<BR>--6 Taking, accepting (as a wife);<BR>दारोपसंग्रहः Y. 1. 56.<BR>--7 (An external)<BR>appendage, any necessary article<BR>either for use or decoration (उपकरण).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0332-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपसंग्रहणं|उपसङ्ग्रहण
उपसंग्रहः, --हणं<BR>1 Keeping pleased,<BR>supporting, maintaining;<BR>तीक्ष्णरसदायिनामुपसंग्रहार्थं Mu. 2.<BR>--2<BR>Respectful salutation (as by touching the<BR>feet of the person saluted); स्फुरति<BR>रभसात्पाणिः पादोपसंग्रहणाय च<BR>Mv. 2. 30.<BR>--3 Accepting, adopting;<BR>Br. Sūt. I. 4. 11.<BR>--4 Polite address,<BR>obeisance.<BR>--5 Collecting, joining.<BR>--6 Taking, accepting (as a wife);<BR>दारोपसंग्रहः Y. 1. 56.<BR>--7 (An external)<BR>appendage, any necessary article<BR>either for use or decoration (उपकरण).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0332-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपसंग्राह्य
उपसंग्राह्य a. To be respectfully<BR>saluted, respectable, venerable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0332-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपसद्
उपसद् {c1c} P., {c6c} P.<BR>1 To sit<BR>near to, go near, approach;<BR>उपसेदुर्दशग्रीवं Bk. 9. 92, 3. 12, 6. 135.<BR>--2 To sit at the feet of;<BR>उपाध्यायमुपासदं Ks. 108. 21.<BR>--3 To wait<BR>upon, serve; (तं)<BR>आकल्पसाधनैस्तैस्तैरुपसेदुः प्रसाधकाः R. 17. 22;<BR>Śi. 13. 24.<BR>--4 To march against.<BR>--5<BR>To try to get or obtain.<BR>--6 To sink<BR>down. --Caus.<BR>1 To place near.<BR>--2 To lead towards.<BR>--3 To get,<BR>find.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0332-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपसत्तिः|उपसत्ति
उपसत्तिः f.<BR>1 Connection,<BR>union.<BR>--2 Service, worship,<BR>attendance upon.<BR>--3 Gift, donation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0332-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपसद्
उपसद् a. Serving, waiting upon<BR>--f.<BR>1 Siege, assault, attack.<BR>--2<BR>Laying up, accumulating.<BR>--3 Service,<BR>worship.<BR>--4 N. of a ceremony,<BR>forming part of the ज्योतिष्टोम<BR>ceremony, and lasting for several days.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--व्रनिन् a. observing the<BR>rules of the Upasad, i. e. drinking<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0332-c" target="_blank">Page0332-c+ 54</a>]<BR>milk in certain quantities, sleeping<BR>on the bare earth, keeping silence &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0332-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपसद|उपसदः
उपसद a. Going near to, serving.<BR>--दः<BR>1 Approach.<BR>--2 A gift,<BR>donation.<BR>--3 The उपसद् sacrifice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0332-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपसदनं|उपसदन
उपसदनं<BR>1 Going near to<BR>approaching.<BR>--2 Sitting at the feet of<BR>a teacher, becoming a pupil;<BR>तत्रोपसदनं चक्रे द्रोणस्येष्वस्त्रकर्मणि Mb.<BR>--3<BR>Neighbourhood.<BR>--4 Service.<BR>--5<BR>Partaking of.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0332-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपसदी
उपसदी Ved.<BR>1 A body of<BR>attendants (collectively).<BR>--2<BR>Continuity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0332-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपसन्न|उपसन्नः
उपसन्न p. p.<BR>1 Approached; near,<BR>approximate.<BR>--2 Worshipped,<BR>served.<BR>--3 Serving, waiting upon.<BR>--4<BR>Easily obtainable; got, obtained.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0332-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपसंतानः|उपसन्तान|उपसंतान
