उपसंधा|उपसन्धा
उपसंधा {c3c} U.<BR>1 To put<BR>together, add, increase.<BR>--2 To join,<BR>connect; त्रिवर्गेणोपसंधत्ते<BR>Kām. 1. 13.<BR>--3 To aim at, direct towards.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0332-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपसंहित
उपसंहित p. p.<BR>1 Connected with,<BR>furnished or endowed with;<BR>श्रुतवृत्तोपसंहितः Mb.<BR>--2 Accompanied or<BR>surrounded by; regarding,<BR>referring to.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0332-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपसंधानं
उपसंधानं Adding, joining.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0332-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपसंन्यासः|उपसन्न्यास
उपसंन्यासः Laying down,<BR>giving up, resignation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0332-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपसमाधा
उपसमाधा {c3c} U.<BR>1 To put on (as<BR>fuel on fire).<BR>--2 To arrange.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0332-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपसमाधानं|उपसमाधान
उपसमाधानं Gathering together,<BR>heaping; उपसमाधानं राशीकरणं Sk.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0332-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपसमाहार्य
उपसमाहार्य a. To be brought<BR>together, or arranged.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0332-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपसंपद्|उपसम्पद्
उपसंपद् {c4c} A.<BR>1 To come to,<BR>arrive at; तं देशमुपसंपेदे Mb.<BR>--2 To get,<BR>obtain. --Caus.<BR>1 To bring or lead<BR>near.<BR>--2 To give, grant.<BR>--3 To<BR>receive into the order of priests,<BR>ordain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0332-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपसंपत्तिः|उपसम्पत्ति|उपसंपत्ति
उपसंपत्तिः f.<BR>1 Approaching,<BR>arriving at.<BR>--2 Entering into any<BR>condition.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0332-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपसंपन्न|उपसम्पन्न|उपसम्पन्नः
उपसंपन्न p. p.<BR>1 Gained,<BR>obtained.<BR>--2 Arrived at.<BR>--3<BR>Furnished with, possessing; कुसुमैरुपसंपन्ना<BR>नदी Rām.<BR>--4 Familiar with.<BR>--5<BR>Enough, sufficient.<BR>--6 Killed at a<BR>sacrifice (as an animal),<BR>immolated; Ms. 5. 81.<BR>--7 Dead,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0333-a" target="_blank">Page0333-a+ 54</a>]<BR>deceased.<BR>--8 Cooked, dressed (as food).<BR>--न्नं Condiment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0332-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपसंभाषः
उपसंभाषः --षा<BR>1 Conversation;<BR>Ki. 3. 3.<BR>--2 Friendly persuasion;<BR>उपसंभाषा उपसांत्वनं P. I. 3. 47 Sk.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0333-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपसंभाषा|उपसम्भाषा
