उपसीरः|उपसीर
उपसीरः A plough.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0333-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपसुंदः|उपसुन्द|उपसुन्दः
उपसुंदः N. of an Asura, son of<BR>Nikumbha and younger brother<BR>of Sunda.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0333-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपसूर्यकं|उपसूर्यक|उपसूर्यकः|उपसूर्य्यक|उपसूर्य्यकं
