ऐदंयुगीन
ऐदंयुगीन a. Fit for this yoke.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0359-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऐनसं|ऐनस
ऐनसं Sin.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0359-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऐंदव|ऐन्दव|ऐन्दवं|ऐन्दवः
ऐंदव a. (वी f.) [इंदु-अण्] Lunar;<BR>Māl. 8. 1; U. 1. 34.<BR>--वः A lunar<BR>month.<BR>--वी The plant सोमराजी.<BR>--वं<BR>1 The asterism Mṛgaśiras.<BR>--2<BR>The Vrata called चांद्रायण q. v.;<BR>Ms. 11. 126.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0359-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऐंद्र|ऐन्द्र|ऐन्द्रं|ऐन्द्रः
ऐंद्र a. (द्री f.) [इंद्र-अण्]<BR>Belonging or sacred to Indra; R. 2. 50;<BR>6. 27.<BR>--द्रः<BR>1 N. of Arjuna and of<BR>Vāli (who are regarded as sons of<BR>इंद्र).<BR>--2 N. of a Saṃvatsara.<BR>--3<BR>The part of a sacrifice offered to<BR>Indra.<BR>--द्री<BR>1 N. of a Ṛk<BR>addressed to Indra; इत्यादिका काचिदैंद्री<BR>समाम्नाता J. N. V.<BR>--2 The east, eastern<BR>direction (presided over by Indra);<BR>अयमैंद्रीमुखं पश्य रक्तश्चुंबति चंद्रमाः<BR>Chandr. 5. 58; Ki. 9. 18.<BR>--3 The<BR>eighteenth lunar mansion.<BR>--4 The<BR>eighth day in the second half<BR>of the months of मार्गशीर्ष and<BR>पौष.<BR>--5 Indra's energy<BR>(personified as his wife Śacī).<BR>--6<BR>Misfortune, misery.<BR>--7 A kind of<BR>cucumber.<BR>--8 An epithet of Durgā.<BR>--9 Small cardamom.<BR>--द्रं<BR>1 The<BR>eighteenth lunar mansion (ज्येष्ठा).<BR>--2<BR>Wild ginger.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0359-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऐंद्रजालिक|ऐन्द्रजालिक|ऐन्द्रजालिकः
ऐंद्रजालिक a. (की f.) [इंद्रजालेन चरति<BR>ठक्]<BR>1 Deceptive, magical, illusive.<BR>--2 Familiar with magic.<BR>--कः A<BR>juggler; Śi. 15. 25.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0359-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऐंद्रतुरीयः|ऐन्द्रतुरीय|ऐन्द्रतुरीयः
