औचित्यं|औचित्य
औचित्यं, औचिती [उचित-ष्यञ् यलोपे<BR>ङीष्]<BR>1 Aptness, fitness, propriety,<BR>suitableness.<BR>--2 Congruity or<BR>fitness, as one of the several<BR>circumstances which determine the exact<BR>meaning of a word in a sentence<BR>(such as संयोग, वियोग &c.);<BR>सामर्थ्यमौचिती देशः कालो व्यक्तिः स्वरादयः S. D. 2;<BR>in the example पातु वो दयितामुखं there<BR>is औचिती or fitness in taking मुख to<BR>mean सांमुख्यं (meeting) instead of<BR>आननं.<BR>--3 Habituation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0361-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

