औदुंबर a. (री f.) [उदंबर-अञ्]<BR>Made of, or coming from, the<BR>Udumbara tree<BR>--रः<BR>1 N. of a region<BR>abounding in Udumbara trees.<BR>--2<BR>A form of Yama, the god of death.<BR>--री A branch of the Udumbara<BR>tree.<BR>--रं<BR>1 The wood of the<BR>Udumbara tree.<BR>--2 The Udumbara<BR>fruit.<BR>--3 A kind of leprosy.<BR>--4<BR>Copper.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0362-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

