कचुः|कचु
कचुः f. An esculent root; see<BR>कच्वी.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0367-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कचेलं|कचेल
कचेलं A string or cover<BR>containing and keeping together the leaves<BR>of a manuscript.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0367-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कच्चटं|कच्चट
कच्चटं An aquatic plant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0367-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कच्चर|कच्चरं
कच्चर a.<BR>1 Bad, dirty.<BR>--2<BR>Wicked, vile, debased.<BR>--रं Buttermilk<BR>diluted with water.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0367-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कच्चित्
कच्चित् ind. A particle of (1)<BR>interrogation (often translateable by<BR>‘I hope’); कच्चित् अहमिव<BR>विस्मृतवानसि त्वं Ś. 6; कच्चिन्मृगीणामनघा प्रसूतिः<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0368-a" target="_blank">Page0368-a+ 56</a>]<BR>R. 5. 7; also 5, 6, 8, 9 (b) joy;<BR>(c) auspiciousness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0367-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कच्छः|कच्छ|कच्छं
कच्छः --छं<BR>1 Bank, margin,<BR>skirt, bordering region (whether<BR>near water or not);<BR>यमुनाकच्छमवतीर्णः Pt. 1; गंधमादनकच्छोऽध्यासितः<BR>V. 5; Śi. 3. 80; Māl. 9. 16.<BR>--2 A<BR>marsh, morass, fen.<BR>--3 The hem of<BR>the lower garment tucked into the<BR>waistband; see कक्षा.<BR>--4 A part of<BR>a boat.<BR>--5 A particular part of a<BR>tortoise (in कच्छप).<BR>--6 A tree, the<BR>timber of which is used for making<BR>furniture (तुन्न).<BR>--च्छा<BR>1 A cricket.<BR>--2 The plant Lycopodium<BR>Imbricatum (वाराही).<BR>--Comp.<BR>--अंतः the<BR>border of a lake or stream; marshy<BR>place; Ki. 7. 39, 12. 54.<BR>--देशः N.<BR>of a place in the South.<BR>--पः<BR>(पी f.) {1} a turtle, tortoise; केशव<BR>धृतकच्छपरूप जय जगदीश हरे Gīt. 1;<BR>Ms. 1. 44, 12. 42 (thus explained<BR>by Durga; कच्छं आत्मनो मुखसंपुटं पाति,<BR>स हि किंचित् दृष्ट्वा शरीर एव मुखसंपुटं<BR>प्रवेशयति). {2} a tumour on the palate.<BR>{3} an apparatus used in the<BR>distillation of spirituous liquor. {4}<BR>an attitude in wrestling. {5}<BR>the tree Cedrela Toona. {6} one of<BR>the nine treasures of Kubera.<BR>--(पी) {1} a female tortoise. {2} a<BR>cutaneous disease, wart or blotch.<BR>{3} a kind of lute; also the lute<BR>of Sarasvatī.<BR>--भूः f. marshy ground,<BR>morass.<BR>--रुहा a kind of grass (दूर्वा).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0368-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कच्छं|कच्छ|कच्छः
कच्छः --छं<BR>1 Bank, margin,<BR>skirt, bordering region (whether<BR>near water or not);<BR>यमुनाकच्छमवतीर्णः Pt. 1; गंधमादनकच्छोऽध्यासितः<BR>V. 5; Śi. 3. 80; Māl. 9. 16.<BR>--2 A<BR>marsh, morass, fen.<BR>--3 The hem of<BR>the lower garment tucked into the<BR>waistband; see कक्षा.<BR>--4 A part of<BR>a boat.<BR>--5 A particular part of a<BR>tortoise (in कच्छप).<BR>--6 A tree, the<BR>timber of which is used for making<BR>furniture (तुन्न).<BR>--च्छा<BR>1 A cricket.<BR>--2 The plant Lycopodium<BR>Imbricatum (वाराही).<BR>--Comp.<BR>--अंतः the<BR>border of a lake or stream; marshy<BR>place; Ki. 7. 39, 12. 54.<BR>--देशः N.<BR>of a place in the South.<BR>--पः<BR>(पी f.) {1} a turtle, tortoise; केशव<BR>धृतकच्छपरूप जय जगदीश हरे Gīt. 1;<BR>Ms. 1. 44, 12. 42 (thus explained<BR>by Durga; कच्छं आत्मनो मुखसंपुटं पाति,<BR>स हि किंचित् दृष्ट्वा शरीर एव मुखसंपुटं<BR>प्रवेशयति). {2} a tumour on the palate.<BR>{3} an apparatus used in the<BR>distillation of spirituous liquor. {4}<BR>an attitude in wrestling. {5}<BR>the tree Cedrela Toona. {6} one of<BR>the nine treasures of Kubera.<BR>--(पी) {1} a female tortoise. {2} a<BR>cutaneous disease, wart or blotch.<BR>{3} a kind of lute; also the lute<BR>of Sarasvatī.<BR>--भूः f. marshy ground,<BR>morass.<BR>--रुहा a kind of grass (दूर्वा).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0368-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कच्छटिका
कच्छ(च्छा)टिका, कच्छाटी The<BR>end or hem of a lower garment<BR>which, after being carried round the<BR>body, is gathered up behind and<BR>tucked into the waist band.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0368-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कच्छाटिका
कच्छ(च्छा)टिका, कच्छाटी The<BR>end or hem of a lower garment<BR>which, after being carried round the<BR>body, is gathered up behind and<BR>tucked into the waist band.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0368-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कच्छाटी
कच्छ(च्छा)टिका, कच्छाटी The<BR>end or hem of a lower garment<BR>which, after being carried round the<BR>body, is gathered up behind and<BR>tucked into the waist band.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0368-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कच्छपिका
कच्छपिका<BR>1 Pimple, blotch.<BR>--2<BR>A wart accompanying gonorrhœa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0368-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कच्छोटिका
कच्छोटिका = कच्छटिका q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0368-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कच्छुः|कच्छु
कच्छुः --कच्छू f. Itch, scab.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--घ्नी the plant (पटोल);<BR>another plant (हपुषाभेद).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0368-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कच्छू
कच्छुः --कच्छू f. Itch, scab.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--घ्नी the plant (पटोल);<BR>another plant (हपुषाभेद).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0368-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कच्छुमती
कच्छुमती The plant Carpopogon<BR>Pruriens शूकशिंबी (said to cause<BR>itching on being applied to the<BR>skin).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0368-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कच्छुर|कच्छुरः
कच्छुर a. [कच्छु र थस्वश्च<BR>P. V. 2. 107 Vārt.]<BR>1 Scabby, itchy.<BR>--2<BR>Unchaste, libidinous.<BR>--3 Poor,<BR>wretched.<BR>--रा N. of several plants;<BR>शटी, शूकींशबी.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0368-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कच्छोरं|कच्छोर
कच्छोरं A kind of Curcuma (शटी).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0368-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कच्वी
कच्वी A plant with an esculent<BR>root (Arum Colocasia) cultivated<BR>for food.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0368-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कज्
कज् {c1c} P. (कजति)<BR>1 To be happy.<BR>--2 To be confused with joy, pride,<BR>or sorrow.<BR>--3 To grow (in the last<BR>sense a Sautra root.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0368-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कज|कजं
कज See under क.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0368-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कज्जलं|कज्जल|कज्जलः
कज्जलं [कुत्सितं जलमस्मात्प्रभवति, कोः<BR>कदादेशः]<BR>1 Lamp-black or soot,<BR>considered as a collyrium and applied<BR>to the eyelashes or eyelids<BR>medicinally, or sometimes as an<BR>ornament; यथा यथा चेयं चपला दीप्यते तथा<BR>तथा दीवशिखेव कज्जलमलिनमेव कर्म<BR>केवलमुद्वमति K. 105; अद्यापि तां<BR>विधृतकज्जललोलनेत्रां Ch. P. 15; ˚कालिमा<BR>Amaru. 88.<BR>--2 Sulphuret of lead or<BR>antimony (used as a collyrium.)<BR>--3<BR>Ink.<BR>--ली<BR>1 Sulphuret of mercury,<BR>Æthiop's mineral.<BR>--2 Ink.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--ध्वजः a lamp.<BR>--रोचकः --कं the<BR>wooden stand on which a lamp is<BR>placed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0368-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कज्जलित
कज्जलित a. Covered with<BR>lampblack or with a collyrium<BR>prepared from it.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0368-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कज्ज्वलं|कज्ज्वल
कज्ज्वलं Lamp-black (especially<BR>considered as an application to<BR>the eyes).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0368-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कंच्|कञ्च्
कंच् {c1c} A.<BR>1 To bind.<BR>--2 To<BR>shine.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0368-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कंचारः|कञ्चार|कंचार|कञ्चारः
कंचारः<BR>1 The sun.<BR>--2 The Arka<BR>plant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0368-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कंचिका|कञ्चिका
कंचिका<BR>1 A small boil.<BR>--2 The<BR>branch of a bamboo.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0368-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कंचुकः|कञ्चुक|कंचुक|कञ्चुकः
कंचुकः<BR>1 An armour, mail.<BR>--2<BR>The skin of a snake, slough; भोगिनः<BR>कंचुकाविष्टाः Pt. 1. 65.<BR>--3 A dress,<BR>garb, cloth (in general); धर्म˚<BR>प्रवेशिनः Ś. 5; कपटधर्म˚ Dk. 29.<BR>--4 A<BR>dress fitting close to the upper<BR>part of the body, robe;<BR>अंतःकंचुकिकंचुकस्य विशति त्रासादयं वामनः<BR>Ratn. 2. 3; सुभाषितरसास्वादजातरोमांचकंचुकं<BR>Pt. 2. 64.<BR>--5 A bodice, jacket;<BR>क्वचिदिवेंद्रगजाजिनकंचुकाः Śi. 6. 51, 12. 20;<BR>Amaru. 81; (Phrase:<BR>--निंदति कंचुककारं<BR>प्रायः शुष्कस्तनी नारी; cf. “a bad<BR>workman quarrels with his tools”).<BR>--6<BR>A kind of drawers or short breeches.<BR>--7 A strap of leather.<BR>--8 Husk.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0368-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कंचुकालुः|कञ्चुकालु|कंचुकालु|कञ्चुकालुः
कंचुकालुः A snake.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0368-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कंचुकित|कञ्चुकित
कंचुकित a.<BR>1 Furnished with<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0368-c" target="_blank">Page0368-c+ 55</a>]<BR>armour, mailed.<BR>--2 Having a garment;<BR>कथा˚ Bh. 3. 130.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0368-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कंचुकिन्|कञ्चुकिन्
कंचुकिन् a. Furnished with<BR>armour or mail. --m.<BR>1 An attendant<BR>on the women's apartments, a<BR>chamberlain; (an important character<BR>in dramas); अंतःपुरचरो वृद्धो विप्रो<BR>गुणगणान्वितः । सर्वकार्यार्थकुशलः कंचकीत्यभिधीयते ॥<BR>(he must be a Brāhmaṇa, very old,<BR>&c.; cf. V. 3. 1 and Ś. 5. 3).<BR>--2 A<BR>libidinous man, debauchee.<BR>--3 A<BR>serpent.<BR>--4 A door keeper.<BR>--5 Barley.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0368-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कंचुलिका|कञ्चुलिका
कंचुलिका, कंचुली A bodice; त्वं<BR>मुग्धाक्षि विनैव कंचुलिकया धत्से<BR>मनोहारिणीं लक्ष्मीं Amaru. 23.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0368-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कंचुली
कंचुलिका, कंचुली A bodice; त्वं<BR>मुग्धाक्षि विनैव कंचुलिकया धत्से<BR>मनोहारिणीं लक्ष्मीं Amaru. 23.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0368-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कंचूलं|कञ्चूल
कंचूलं An article of female dress,<BR>i. e. a bodice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0368-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कंजः|कञ्ज|कंज|कञ्जं|कञ्जः
कंजः<BR>1 The hair.<BR>--2 N. of<BR>Brahmā.<BR>--जं<BR>1 A lotus.<BR>--2<BR>Ambrosia, nectar.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--जंः N. of<BR>Brahmā.<BR>--नाभः N. of Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0368-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कंजकः|कञ्जक|कंजक|कञ्जकः
