कंजरः|कञ्जर|कंजर|कञ्जरः
कंजरः, कंजारः<BR>1 The sun.<BR>--2 An<BR>elephant.<BR>--3 The belly.<BR>--4 An<BR>epithet of Brahmā.<BR>--5 A peacock.<BR>--6 A<BR>hermit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0368-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

