कटिन्
कटिन् a.<BR>1 Matted, screened.<BR>--2<BR>Having handsome loins &c. --m.<BR>An elephant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0369-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कटकट|कटकटः
कटकट a. Excellent, best.<BR>--टः<BR>N. of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0369-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कटकटा
कटकटा An onomatopoetic word<BR>supposed to represent the noise of<BR>rubbing together.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0369-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कटकटापयति
कटकटापयति Den. P. To rub<BR>together, make a creaking or<BR>grating sound.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0369-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कटंकटः|कटङ्कट|कटंकट|कटङ्कटः
कटंकटः<BR>1 Fire.<BR>--2 Gold.<BR>--3 N.<BR>of Gaṇeśa; Y. 1. 285.<BR>--4 N. of<BR>Śiva.<BR>--5 The चित्रक tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0369-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कटंकटेरी|कटङ्कटेरी
