कटनं|कटन
कटनं The roof (or thatch) of a<BR>house.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0369-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कटंबः|कटम्ब|कटम्बः
कटंबः<BR>1 A kind of musical<BR>instrument.<BR>--2 An arrow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0369-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

