कठिन|कठिनं|कठिनः
कठिन a.<BR>1 Hard, stiff;<BR>कठिनविषमामेकवेणीं सारयंतीं Me. 92;<BR>Amaru. 72; Mu. 2. 20; so ˚स्तनौ.<BR>--2<BR>Hardhearted, cruel, ruthless; न विदीर्ये<BR>कठिनाः खलु स्त्रियः Ku. 4. 5; Pt. 1. 64;<BR>Amaru. 6; so ˚हृदय.<BR>--3 Inexorable’<BR>inflexible.<BR>--4 Sharp, violent, intense<BR>(as pain &c.); नितांतकठिनां रुजं मम न<BR>वेद सा मानसीं V. 2. 11.<BR>--5 Giving pain.<BR>--नः A thicket.<BR>--ना<BR>1 A sweetmeat<BR>made with refined sugar.<BR>--2 An<BR>earthen vessel for cooking; (n. also<BR>in this sense).<BR>--नी Chalk.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--पृष्ठः,-कः a tortoise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0370-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

