कठोर|कठोरः
कठोर a.<BR>1 Hard(fig. also),<BR>solid, stiff; कठोरास्थिग्रांथि<BR>Māl. 5. 34.<BR>--2 Cruel, hard-hearted, ruthless;<BR>अयि कठोर यशः किल ते प्रियं<BR>U. 3. 27; so ˚हृदय, ˚चित्त.<BR>--3 Sharp,<BR>piercing; ˚अंकुश Śānti. 1. 22.<BR>--4<BR>Full, developed, complete,<BR>fullgrown, of mature age; कठोरगर्भां<BR>जानकीं विमुच्य U. 1, 1. 49, 6. 25;<BR>Māl. 6. 19; so कठोरताराधिपलांछनच्छविः<BR>Śi. 1. 20; so अ˚ new, young;<BR>Māl. 1. 2.<BR>--5 (Fig.) Matured,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0370-c" target="_blank">Page0370-c+ 53</a>]<BR>refined: कलाकलापालोचनकठारेमातिभिः<BR>K. 7; ˚रीभूतः दिवसः U. 2 it<BR>is noon-time.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--गर्भ a.<BR>far advanced in pregnancy;<BR>U. 1. 49.<BR>--गिरिमाहात्म्यं a portion of<BR>the Brahmāṇḍa Purāṇa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0370-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

