कनिक्रद
कनिक्रद a. Ved. Neighing,<BR>crying very much.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0375-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कनिष्ठ|कनिष्ठः
कनिष्ठ a. (Snperl. of अल्प or<BR>युवन्)<BR>1 The smallest, least.<BR>--2 The<BR>youngest.<BR>--3 Lower.<BR>--4 Having the<BR>feet downwards.<BR>--ष्ठः N. of Śiva.<BR>--ष्ठा<BR>1 The little finger.<BR>--2 A kind<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0375-c" target="_blank">Page0375-c+ 54</a>]<BR>of heroine.<BR>--3 The wife of a<BR>younger brother.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--पदं --मूलं the<BR>least or first root.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0375-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कनिष्ठक|कनिष्ठकं
कनिष्ठक a. The smallest.<BR>--ष्ठिका<BR>The little finger;<BR>कनिष्ठिकाधिष्ठितकालिदासा Subhāṣ.<BR>--कं A kind of<BR>grass.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0375-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कनी
कनी A daughter or girl.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0375-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कनीन
कनीन a. Ved. Young.<BR>--नी<BR>1 The<BR>little finger.<BR>--2 The pupil of the eye.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0375-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कनीनकः|कनीनक
कनीनकः<BR>1 A boy, youth.<BR>--2 The<BR>pupil of the eye.<BR>--का<BR>1 A maiden,<BR>girl.<BR>--2 The pupil of the eye.<BR>--निका<BR>1 The little finger.<BR>--2 The<BR>pupil of the eye.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0375-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कनीयस्
कनीयस् a. (सी f.)(Compar.<BR>of अल्प or युवन्)<BR>1 Smaller, less.<BR>--2<BR>Younger; कनीयान् भ्राता, कनीयसी<BR>भगिनी &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0375-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

