कनीचिः|कनीचि
कनीचिः f.<BR>1 A cart.<BR>--2 A<BR>creeping plant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0375-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

