कनेरा
कनेरा<BR>1 A harlot.<BR>--2 A female<BR>elephant; (cf. कणेरा).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0375-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कंत|कन्त
