कंदः|कन्द|कंद|कंदं|कन्दं|कन्दः
कंदः --दं<BR>1 A bulbous root.<BR>--2 A<BR>bulb; Bh. 3. 69; (fig. also);<BR>ज्ञानकंद.<BR>--3 Garlic.<BR>--4 A knot, swelling.<BR>--5 An affection of the male or<BR>female organ.<BR>--दः<BR>1 A cloud.<BR>--2<BR>Camphor.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--मूलं a radish.<BR>--संज्ञं prolapsus uteri.<BR>--सारं the<BR>garden of Indra.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0375-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

