कंदर्पः|कन्दर्प|कंदर्प|कन्दर्पः
कंदर्पः<BR>1 N. of Cupid, the god<BR>of love; प्रजनश्चास्मि कंदर्पः Bg. 10. 28;<BR>कंदर्प इव रूपेण Mb.<BR>--2 Love. (कंदर्प<BR>is thus derived:<BR>--कं दर्पयामीति<BR>मदाज्जातमात्रो जगाद च । तेन कंदर्पनामानं तं<BR>चकार चतुर्मुखः ॥)<BR>--Comp.<BR>--कूपः<BR>pudenda muliebre.<BR>--ज्वरः fever of<BR>love, passion, vehement desire.<BR>--दहनः, --मथनः N. of Śiva.<BR>--मुषलः, --मुसलः<BR>the male organ of generation.<BR>--शृंखलः {1} membrum virile. {2} a<BR>particular mode of sexual enjoyment or<BR>coitus (रतिबंध).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0376-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कंदलः|कन्दल|कंदल|कंदलं|कन्दलं|कन्दलः
कंदलः --लं<BR>1 A new shoot or<BR>sprout; U. 3. 40.<BR>--2 Reproach,<BR>censure.<BR>--3 The cheek, or the cheek<BR>and temple.<BR>--4 A portent.<BR>--5 Sweet<BR>sound.<BR>--6 The plantain tree;<BR>कंदलदलोल्लासाः पयोबिंदवः Amaru. 48.<BR>--7<BR>Collection; U. 3. 11.<BR>--लः<BR>1 Gold.<BR>--2 War, battle.<BR>--3 (Hence) War<BR>of words, controversy.<BR>--लं A<BR>Kandala flower; विदलकंदलकंपनलालितः<BR>Śi. 6. 30; R. 13. 29.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0376-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

