कर्करी
कर्करी A water-jar with small<BR>holes at the bottom, as in a sieve.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0381-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्कश|कर्कशः
कर्कश a. [कर्क-श]<BR>1 Hard, rough<BR>(opp. कोमल or मृदु);<BR>सुरद्विपास्फालनकर्कशां गुलौ R. 3. 55, 12. 41,<BR>13. 73; ऐरावतास्फालनकर्कशेन हस्तेन पस्पर्श<BR>तदंगभिंद्रः Ku. 3. 22, 1. 36;<BR>Śi. 15. 10, 16. 18, 63.<BR>--2 Harsh, cruel,<BR>merciless (words, conduct &c.).<BR>--3 Violent, strong, excessive; तस्य<BR>कर्कशविहारसंभवं R. 9. 68.<BR>--4 Hardy,<BR>strong, muscular, robust.<BR>--5 Strict,<BR>imperative, peremptory; Mv. 2. 11.<BR>--6 Desperate.<BR>--7 Ill-conducted,<BR>unchaste, unfaithful (as a woman).<BR>--8 Incomprehensible, difficult to<BR>comprehend; तर्के वा भृशकर्कशे मम<BR>समं लीलायते भारती P. R.<BR>--शः A<BR>sword.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0381-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्कशिका
कर्कशिका, कर्कशी Wild jujube.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0381-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्कशी
कर्कशिका, कर्कशी Wild jujube.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0381-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्कारुकः|कर्कारुक
कर्कारुकः A gourd; Mk. 1. 51.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0381-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

