कर्द्
कर्द् {c1c} P. (कर्दति, कर्दित)<BR>1 To rumble<BR>(as the bowels).<BR>--2 To caw (as a<BR>crow).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0383-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

