कार्पास|कार्पासं|कार्पासः
कार्पास a. (सी f.) [कर्पास्याः<BR>अवयवः अण्] Made of cotton.<BR>--सः<BR>--सं<BR>1 Anything made of cotton;<BR>Ms. 8. 326; 12. 64.<BR>--2 Paper.<BR>--सी<BR>The cotton plant.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--अस्थि n.<BR>the seed of the cotton plant.<BR>--नासिका a spindle.<BR>--सौत्रिक a. made of<BR>cotton thread; Y. 2. 179.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0398-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

