किलाटः|किलाट
किलाटः Coagulated milk.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0404-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किलाटिन्
किलाटिन् m. A bamboo.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0404-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किलास|किलासं
किलास a. Ved. Leprous.<BR>--सं<BR>1<BR>A white leprous spot.<BR>--2 A blotch,<BR>scab.<BR>--3 A kind of leprosy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0404-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किलिंजं|किलिञ्ज|किलिंज|किलिञ्जः
किलिंजं<BR>1 A mat.<BR>--2 A thin<BR>plank of green wood, board; also<BR>किलिंचं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0404-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

