किशलयं|किशलय|किशलयः
किशलयः, --यं A sprout, a young<BR>shoot; see किसलय.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0404-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किशोरः|किशोर
किशोरः [Uṇ. 1. 65]<BR>1 A colt, cub,<BR>the young of any animal;<BR>केसरिकिशोरः &c.<BR>--2 A youth, lad, a boy below<BR>fifteen, a minor in law (अप्राप्तव्यवहार).<BR>--3 The sun.<BR>--री A maiden, a young<BR>woman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0404-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किष्किंधः|किष्किन्ध|किष्किंध|किष्किन्धः
किष्किंधः, --ध्यः<BR>1 N. of a<BR>country.<BR>--2 N. of a mountain situated<BR>in that country.<BR>--धा, --ध्या N. of a<BR>city, the capital of Kiṣkindha.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0404-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किष्किंध्यः|किष्किन्ध्य|किष्किंध्य|किष्किन्ध्यः
