किष्कु|किष्कुः
किष्कु a. Vile, contemptible, bad.<BR>--ष्कुः m. or f.<BR>1 The fore-arm.<BR>--2 A<BR>cubit, span.<BR>--3 An instrument for<BR>measuring lengths.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0404-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किसलः|किसल|किसलं
किसलः, --लं, किसलयः, --यं A sprout,<BR>a young and tender shoot or foliage;<BR>अधरः किसलयरागः Ś. 1. 21;<BR>किसलयमलूनं कररुहैः 2. 10; किसलयैः सलयैरिव<BR>पाणिभिः R. 9. 35.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0404-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किसलं|किसल|किसलः
किसलः, --लं, किसलयः, --यं A sprout,<BR>a young and tender shoot or foliage;<BR>अधरः किसलयरागः Ś. 1. 21;<BR>किसलयमलूनं कररुहैः 2. 10; किसलयैः सलयैरिव<BR>पाणिभिः R. 9. 35.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0404-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

किसलयः|किसलय|किसलयं
