कुजः|कुज
कुजः<BR>1 A tree; Pt. 3. 93.<BR>--2 The<BR>planet Mars.<BR>--3 N. of a demon killed<BR>by Kṛṣṇa (also called नरक q. v.).<BR>--जा<BR>N. of Sītā; also of Durgā.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0406-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

