कुंजः|कुञ्ज|कुंज|कुंजं|कुञ्जः
कुंजः, --जं<BR>1 A place overgrown<BR>with plants or creepers, a bower, an<BR>arbour; चल सखि कुंजं सतिमिरपुंजं<BR>शीलय नीलनिचोलं Gīt. 5; वंजुललताकुंजे<BR>12; Me. 19; R. 9. 64.<BR>--2 The lower<BR>jaw.<BR>--3 A cave.<BR>--4 A tooth.<BR>--5 The<BR>tusk of an elephant.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--कुटीरः<BR>a bower, a place overgrown with<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0407-a" target="_blank">Page0407-a+ 55</a>]<BR>plants and creepers;<BR>गुंजत्कुंजकुटीरकौशिकघटा U. 2. 29; Māl. 5. 19;<BR>कोकिलकूजितकुंजकुटीरे Gīt. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0406-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुंजं|कुञ्ज|कुंज|कुंजः|कुञ्जः
कुंजः, --जं<BR>1 A place overgrown<BR>with plants or creepers, a bower, an<BR>arbour; चल सखि कुंजं सतिमिरपुंजं<BR>शीलय नीलनिचोलं Gīt. 5; वंजुललताकुंजे<BR>12; Me. 19; R. 9. 64.<BR>--2 The lower<BR>jaw.<BR>--3 A cave.<BR>--4 A tooth.<BR>--5 The<BR>tusk of an elephant.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--कुटीरः<BR>a bower, a place overgrown with<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0407-a" target="_blank">Page0407-a+ 55</a>]<BR>plants and creepers;<BR>गुंजत्कुंजकुटीरकौशिकघटा U. 2. 29; Māl. 5. 19;<BR>कोकिलकूजितकुंजकुटीरे Gīt. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0406-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुंजरः|कुञ्जर|कुंजर|कुञ्जरः
कुंजरः [कुंजो हस्तिहनुः सोऽस्यास्ति,<BR>कुंज-र, P. V. 2. 107 Vārt.]<BR>1 An<BR>elephant.<BR>--2 Any thing<BR>pre-eminent or excellent of its class (at<BR>the end of comp. only). Amara<BR>gives the following words used<BR>similarly:<BR>--स्युरुत्तरपदे<BR>व्याघ्रपुंगवर्षभकुंजराः । सिंहशार्दूलनागाद्याः पुंसि<BR>श्रेष्ठार्थवाचकाः ॥.<BR>--3 The Aśvattha tree.<BR>--4 The lunar asterism called हस्त.<BR>--5 Hair.<BR>--रा, --री A female elephant.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--अनीकं the division of an<BR>army consisting of elephant-corps.<BR>--अशनः the Aśvattha tree.<BR>--अरातिः {1} a lion. {2} Śarabha (a<BR>fabulous animal with 8 feet).<BR>--ग्रहः an<BR>elephant-catcher.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0407-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुंजलं|कुञ्जल|कुञ्जलं
