कुट्
कुट् {vI.v} {c6c} P. (कुटति, कुटित)<BR>1 To<BR>be crooked or curved.<BR>--2 To curve or<BR>bend.<BR>--3 To act dishonestly, cheat,<BR>deceive. {vII.v} {c4c} P. (कुट्यति)<BR>1 To break to<BR>pieces, break asunder, divide, split;<BR>Pt. 2.<BR>--2 To speak indistinctly.<BR>--3 To be<BR>warm, burn.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0407-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

