कुटित|कुटितं
कुटिक --त a. Bent, crooked.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0407-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुटः|कुट|कुटं
कुटः, --टं [कुट्-कं] A<BR>waterpot, a jar, pitcher.<BR>--टः<BR>1 A fort,<BR>strong-hold.<BR>--2 A hammer.<BR>--3 A<BR>tree.<BR>--4 A house.<BR>--5 A mountain.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--जः {1} N. of a tree;<BR>Māl. 9. 15; Me. 4; R. 19. 37; Rs. 3. 13;<BR>Bh. 1. 35. {2} N. of Agastya. {3}<BR>N. of Droṇa.<BR>--हारिका a female<BR>servant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0407-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुटं|कुट|कुटः
कुटः, --टं [कुट्-कं] A<BR>waterpot, a jar, pitcher.<BR>--टः<BR>1 A fort,<BR>strong-hold.<BR>--2 A hammer.<BR>--3 A<BR>tree.<BR>--4 A house.<BR>--5 A mountain.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--जः {1} N. of a tree;<BR>Māl. 9. 15; Me. 4; R. 19. 37; Rs. 3. 13;<BR>Bh. 1. 35. {2} N. of Agastya. {3}<BR>N. of Droṇa.<BR>--हारिका a female<BR>servant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0407-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

