कुटंगकः<BR>1 An arbour formed by<BR>creeping plants overrunning a tree.<BR>--2 A small house, hut or cottage.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0407-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुटपः|कुटप
