कुटुनी
कुटुनी A bawd, procuress; see<BR>कुट्टनी.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0407-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुटुंबं|कुटुम्ब|कुटुंब|कुटुम्बः
कुटुंबं, कुटुंबकं<BR>1 A household, a<BR>family; उदारचरितानां तु वसुधैव<BR>कुटुंबकं H. 1. 70; Y. 2. 45;<BR>Ms. 11. 12, 22; 8. 166.<BR>--2 The duties and<BR>cares of a family; तदुपहितकुटुंबः<BR>R. 7. 71.<BR>--बः, --बं<BR>1 A kinsman, a<BR>relation by descent or marriage.<BR>--2<BR>Offspring, progeny.<BR>--3 A name.<BR>--4<BR>Race.<BR>--5 A group, collection;<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0407-c" target="_blank">Page0407-c+ 55</a>]<BR>Vikr. 1. 92.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--कलहः, --हं internal or<BR>domestic quarrels.<BR>--भरः the burden<BR>of the family; भर्त्रा तदर्पितकुटुंबभरेण<BR>सार्धम् Ś. 4. 19; ˚चिंतया Pt. 5. 4.<BR>--व्यापृत a. (a father) who is<BR>provident and attentive to the good of the<BR>family.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0407-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुटुंबकं|कुटुम्बक|कुटुंबक
कुटुंबं, कुटुंबकं<BR>1 A household, a<BR>family; उदारचरितानां तु वसुधैव<BR>कुटुंबकं H. 1. 70; Y. 2. 45;<BR>Ms. 11. 12, 22; 8. 166.<BR>--2 The duties and<BR>cares of a family; तदुपहितकुटुंबः<BR>R. 7. 71.<BR>--बः, --बं<BR>1 A kinsman, a<BR>relation by descent or marriage.<BR>--2<BR>Offspring, progeny.<BR>--3 A name.<BR>--4<BR>Race.<BR>--5 A group, collection;<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0407-c" target="_blank">Page0407-c+ 55</a>]<BR>Vikr. 1. 92.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--कलहः, --हं internal or<BR>domestic quarrels.<BR>--भरः the burden<BR>of the family; भर्त्रा तदर्पितकुटुंबभरेण<BR>सार्धम् Ś. 4. 19; ˚चिंतया Pt. 5. 4.<BR>--व्यापृत a. (a father) who is<BR>provident and attentive to the good of the<BR>family.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0407-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुटुंबिकः|कुटुम्बिक|कुटुंबिक|कुटुम्बिकः
कुटुंबिकः, कुटुंबिन् m.<BR>1 A<BR>householder, married man, a<BR>paterfamilias, one who has a family to support<BR>or take care of; प्रायेण गृहिणीनेत्राः<BR>कन्यार्थेषु कुटुंबिनः Ku. 6. 85; V. 3. 1;<BR>Ms. 3. 80; Y. 2. 45.<BR>--2 (fig.) One<BR>who takes care of anything.<BR>--3 A<BR>peasant.<BR>--4 A member of a family;<BR>Śānti. 4. 9.<BR>--नी<BR>1 The wife of a<BR>householder, a house wife (in charge<BR>of the house); भवतु<BR>कुटुंबिनीमाहूय पृच्छामि Mu. 1; प्रभवंत्योऽपि हि<BR>भर्तृषु कारणकोपाः कुटुंबिन्यः M. 1. 17;<BR>R. 8. 86; Amaru. 48.<BR>--2 A large<BR>household or family.<BR>--3 A woman<BR>in general.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0407-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुटुंबिन्|कुटुम्बिन्
कुटुंबिकः, कुटुंबिन् m.<BR>1 A<BR>householder, married man, a<BR>paterfamilias, one who has a family to support<BR>or take care of; प्रायेण गृहिणीनेत्राः<BR>कन्यार्थेषु कुटुंबिनः Ku. 6. 85; V. 3. 1;<BR>Ms. 3. 80; Y. 2. 45.<BR>--2 (fig.) One<BR>who takes care of anything.<BR>--3 A<BR>peasant.<BR>--4 A member of a family;<BR>Śānti. 4. 9.<BR>--नी<BR>1 The wife of a<BR>householder, a house wife (in charge<BR>of the house); भवतु<BR>कुटुंबिनीमाहूय पृच्छामि Mu. 1; प्रभवंत्योऽपि हि<BR>भर्तृषु कारणकोपाः कुटुंबिन्यः M. 1. 17;<BR>R. 8. 86; Amaru. 48.<BR>--2 A large<BR>household or family.<BR>--3 A woman<BR>in general.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0407-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुट्ट्
कुट्ट् {c10c} U. (कुट्टयति, कुट्टित)<BR>1 To<BR>cut, divide.<BR>--2 To grind, pound.<BR>--3<BR>To blame, censure.<BR>--4 To multiply.<BR>--5 To burn.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0407-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुट्ट|कुट्टः
कुट्ट a. (At the end of comp.)<BR>Dividing, cutting; grinding.<BR>--ट्टः (in<BR>Math.) A multiplier.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0407-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुट्टकः|कुट्टक
कुट्टकः<BR>1 A grinder.<BR>--2 A kingfisher.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0407-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुट्टनं|कुट्टन
कुट्टनं<BR>1 Cutting.<BR>--2 Pounding.<BR>--3<BR>A busing, censuring.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0407-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुट्टनी
कुट्ट(ट्टि)नी A bawd, procuress, a<BR>go-between.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0407-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुट्टिनी
कुट्ट(ट्टि)नी A bawd, procuress, a<BR>go-between.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0407-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुट्टाक
कुट्टाक a. (की f.) Who or what<BR>divides or cuts;<BR>सारंगसंगरविधाविभकुंभकूटकुट्टाकपाणिकुलिशस्य हरेः प्रमादः<BR>Māl. 5. 32.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0407-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुट्टित
कुट्टित a.<BR>1 Cut.<BR>--2 Pounded &c.<BR>--ता Unskilful opening of a vein.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0407-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुट्टमितं|कुट्टमित
कुट्टमितं The affected repulse of a<BR>lover's endearments or caresses (one<BR>of the 28 graces or blandishments of<BR>the heroine). The S. D. thus defines<BR>it:--केशस्तनाधरादीनां ग्रहे हर्षेपि संभ्रमात् ।<BR>प्राहुः कुट्टमितं नाम शिरःकरविधूननम् 142.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0407-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुट्टारः|कुट्टार|कुट्टारं
कुट्टारः A mountain.<BR>--रं<BR>1 Sexual<BR>intercourse.<BR>--2 A woollen blanket.<BR>--3 Exclusion or oneness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0407-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुट्टिम|कुट्टिमः
कुट्टिम a. Paved with small stones,<BR>decorated with mosaic.<BR>--मः, --मं<BR>1 An<BR>inlaid or paved floor, ground paved<BR>with small stones, pavement;<BR>कांतेंदुकांतोपलकुट्टिमेषु Śi. 3. 44; R. 11. 9.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0408-a" target="_blank">Page0408-a+ 52</a>]<BR>--2 Ground prepared for the site of<BR>a mansion.<BR>--3 A jewel-mine.<BR>--4 The<BR>pomegranate.<BR>--5 A hut, cottage, small<BR>house.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0407-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुट्टिमित
कुट्टिमित = कुट्टमित q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0408-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुट्टिहारिका
कुट्टिहारिका A maidservant,<BR>slave; cf. कुटहारिका.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0408-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुट्टीरः|कुट्टीर
कुट्टीरः A small mountain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0408-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुट्टीरकं|कुट्टीरक
कुट्टीरकं A small house, hut.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0408-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुट्मल
कुट्मल = कुड्मल q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0408-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुठः|कुठ
कुठः A tree; cf. कुट.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0408-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुठर|कुठरः
