कुद्दारः, --लः, --लकः<BR>1 A spade,<BR>hoe.<BR>--2 The Kāñcana tree.<BR>--लकं<BR>A copper pitcher.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0409-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

