कुवलं<BR>1 The water-lily.<BR>--2 A<BR>pearl.<BR>--3 Water.<BR>--4 The belly of<BR>a serpent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0413-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुवलयं|कुवलय
कुवलयं<BR>1 The blue water-lily<BR>कुवलयदलस्निग्धैरंगैर्ददौ नयनोत्सवं<BR>U. 3. 22.<BR>--2 A water-lily in general.<BR>--3 The earth (--m. also).<BR>--Comp.<BR>--आनंद N. of a work on rhetoric<BR>by अप्ययादीक्षित.<BR>--ईशः a king.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0413-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुवलयिन्
