कुवेणी
कुवेणी<BR>1 A basket to hold fish<BR>(when caught), fish-basket.<BR>--2<BR>A badly arranged tress of hair.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0413-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुवेलं|कुवेल
