कोथ|कोथः
कोथ a. [कुथ्-घञ्]<BR>1 Afflicted<BR>with pain.<BR>--2 Churned.<BR>--थः<BR>1<BR>Putrefaction, corruption.<BR>--2 A sore.<BR>--3<BR>Gangrene.<BR>--4 A disease of the eyes.<BR>--5 Churning.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0426-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

