कोयष्टिः|कोयष्टि
कोयष्टिः, कोयष्टिकः<BR>1 The lapwing;<BR>काश्मर्याः कृतमालमुद्गतदलं कोयष्टिकष्टीकते<BR>Māl. 9. 7; Ms. 5. 13; Y. 1. 173.<BR>--2<BR>A small white crane.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0426-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

