कोरः|कोर
कोरः [कुल् संस्त्याने अच् लस्य-रः Tv.]<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0426-b" target="_blank">Page0426-b+ 55</a>]<BR>1 A moveable joint (as the fingers,<BR>the knees &c).<BR>--2 A bud; cf. कोरक.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0426-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कोरकः|कोरक|कोरकं
कोरकः --कं [Uṇ. 5. 35]<BR>1 A bud,<BR>an unblown flower; संनद्धं यदपि स्थितं<BR>कुरबकं तत्कोरकावस्थया Ś. 6. 3.<BR>--2 (fig.)<BR>Any thing resembling a bud, i. e.<BR>partially opened but not fully<BR>developed; राधायाः स्ततकोरकोपरि<BR>चलन्नेत्रो हरिः पातु वः Gīt. 12.<BR>--3 The<BR>fibres of the stalk of a lotus.<BR>--4 A<BR>kind of perfume.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0426-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कोरकं|कोरक|कोरकः
कोरकः --कं [Uṇ. 5. 35]<BR>1 A bud,<BR>an unblown flower; संनद्धं यदपि स्थितं<BR>कुरबकं तत्कोरकावस्थया Ś. 6. 3.<BR>--2 (fig.)<BR>Any thing resembling a bud, i. e.<BR>partially opened but not fully<BR>developed; राधायाः स्ततकोरकोपरि<BR>चलन्नेत्रो हरिः पातु वः Gīt. 12.<BR>--3 The<BR>fibres of the stalk of a lotus.<BR>--4 A<BR>kind of perfume.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0426-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कोरित
