कोलः|कोल|कोलं
कोलः [कुल् संस्त्याने अच्]<BR>1 A hog,<BR>boar; Śi. 14. 43, 86.<BR>--2 A raft, boat.<BR>--3 The breast.<BR>--4 The haunch, hip,<BR>lap.<BR>--5 An embrace.<BR>--6 The planet<BR>Saturn.<BR>--7 An out-cast, one of a<BR>degraded tribe.<BR>--8 A barbarian.<BR>--लं<BR>1<BR>The weight of one Tola.<BR>--2 Black<BR>pepper.<BR>--3 A kind of berry.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--अंचः N. of the country of the<BR>Kaliṅgas.<BR>--पुच्छः a heron.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0426-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कोलकुणः|कोलकुण
