कोषिन्
कोशि(षि)न् m. The mango tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0426-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कोशलिकं|कोशलिक
कोशलिकं A bribe (= कौशलिक<BR>q. v. which is the more correct form).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0426-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कोशातकिन्
कोशातकिन् m.<BR>1 Trade,<BR>business.<BR>--2 A trader, merchant.<BR>--3<BR>Submarine fire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0426-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कोशातकी
कोशातकी N. of a tree (पटोली);<BR>Śi. 12. 37.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0426-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कोष्ठ|कोष्ठः
कोष्ठ a. [कुष्-थन् Uṇ. 2. 4] Own.<BR>--ष्ठः<BR>1 Any one of the viscera of the<BR>body, such as the heart, lungs &c.<BR>--2 The belly, abdomen.<BR>--3 An<BR>inner apartment.<BR>--4 A granary,<BR>store-room.<BR>--ष्ठं<BR>1 A surrounding<BR>wall.<BR>--2 The shell of anything.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--अगारं {1} a store-house,<BR>store room; पर्याप्तभरितकोष्ठागारं<BR>मांसशोणितैर्मे गृहं भविष्यति Ve. 3;<BR>Ms. 9. 280. {2} a treasury.<BR>--अगारिकः {1}<BR>an animal living in a shell.<BR>{2} the manager of a store-room.<BR>--अग्निः the digestive faculty, gastric<BR>juice.<BR>--पालः {1} a treasurer,<BR>storekeeper. {2} a guard, watch. {3} a<BR>constable (resembling the modern<BR>municipal officer).<BR>--शुद्धिः f.<BR>evacuation of the bowels.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0427-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कोष्ठकः|कोष्ठक
कोष्ठकः<BR>1 A granary.<BR>--2 A<BR>surrounding wall.<BR>--कं A brick trough<BR>for watering cattle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0427-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कोष्ठकीकृ
कोष्ठकीकृ {c8c} U. To surround, enclose.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0427-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कोष्ठ्य
कोष्ठ्य a. [कोष्ठ-य] Proceeding from<BR>the chest (as a sound).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0427-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कोष्ण|कोष्णं
कोष्ण a. [ईषदुष्ण; कोः कादेशः]<BR>Lukewarm, tepid; R. 1. 84.<BR>--ष्णं Warmth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0427-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कोसलः|कोसल
कोस(श)लः (pl.) N. of a<BR>country and its people;<BR>पितुरनंतरमुत्तरकोसलान् R. 9. 1; 3. 5; 6. 71;<BR>मगधकोसलकेकयशासिनां दुहितरः 9. 17.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0427-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

