खटिनी, खटी Chalk.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0441-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खट्ट्
खट्ट् {c10c} P. (खट्टयति) To cover,<BR>screen.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0441-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खट्टन|खट्टनः
खट्टन a. Dwarfish.<BR>--नः A dwarf.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0441-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खट्टा
खट्टा<BR>1 A bedstead.<BR>--2 A kind<BR>of grass.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0441-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खट्टाशः|खट्टाश
खट्टाशः --शी The civet-cat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0441-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खट्टाशी
खट्टाशः --शी The civet-cat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0441-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खट्टिः|खट्टि
खट्टिः m. f. A bier.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0441-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खट्टिकः|खट्टिक
खट्टिकः<BR>1 A butcher.<BR>--2 A hunter,<BR>fowler.<BR>--का<BR>1 A small bedstead, a<BR>cot.<BR>--2 A bier.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0441-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खट्टेरक|खट्टेरकः
खट्टेरक a. Dwarfish.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0441-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खट्वा
खट्वा [खट्-क्वुन्; cf. Uṇ. 1. 150]<BR>1 A bedstead, couch, cot.<BR>--2 A<BR>swing, hammock.<BR>--3 A kind of<BR>bandage.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--अंगः {1} a club<BR>or staff with a skull at the top<BR>considered as the weapon of Śiva and<BR>carried by ascetics and Yogins;<BR>Māl. 5. 4, 23. {2} N. of Dilīpa. ˚धर,<BR>भृत् an epithet of Śiva.<BR>--अंगिन्<BR>m. an epithet of Śiva.<BR>--आप्लुत,<BR>--आरूढ a. {1} lying on a bed. {2} low,<BR>vile {3} abandoned, wicked. {4}<BR>silly, stupid. {5} erring, going<BR>wrong or astray.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0441-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खट्वयति
खट्वयति Den. P. To use as a<BR>couch; Śi. 2. 77.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0441-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खट्वाका
खट्वाका, खट्विका A small bedstead.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0441-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खट्विका
खट्वाका, खट्विका A small bedstead.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0441-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खड्
खड् See खंड्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0441-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खडः|खड|खडं
खडः<BR>1 Breaking, dividing.<BR>--2<BR>Buttermilk boiled with acid<BR>vegetables and spices.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0441-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खडिका
खडिका, खडी Chalk.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0441-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खडी
खडिका, खडी Chalk.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0441-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खडुः|खडु
खडुः --डूः m. or f. A bier or bed<BR>on which the corpse is carried.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0441-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खडूः
खडुः --डूः m. or f. A bier or bed<BR>on which the corpse is carried.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0441-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खड्गः|खड्ग|खड्गं
खड्गः [खड्-भेदने गन् Uṇ. 1. 121]<BR>1 A sword; न हि खड्गो विजानाति<BR>कर्मकारं स्वकारणं Udb.; खड्गं परामृश्य &c.<BR>--2 The horn of a rhinoceros.<BR>--3 A<BR>rhinoceros; R. 9. 62;<BR>Ms. 3. 272, 5. 18.<BR>--ड्गं Iron.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--आघातः a sword-cut.<BR>--आधारः a<BR>sheath, scabbard.<BR>--आमिषं a<BR>buffalo's flesh.<BR>--आह्वः a rhinoceros.<BR>--कोशः a scabbard.<BR>--धरः a<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0442-a" target="_blank">Page0442-a+ 57</a>]<BR>swordsman.<BR>--धेनुः, --धेनुका {1} a small<BR>sword. {2} a female rhinoceros.<BR>--पत्रं the blade of a sword.<BR>--(त्रः)<BR>a tree in hell having swords for<BR>leaves; cf. असिपत्र.<BR>--पाणि a. sword<BR>in hand.<BR>--पात्रं a vessel made of<BR>buffalo's horns.<BR>--पिधानं, --पिधानकं<BR>a scabbard.<BR>--पुत्रिका a knife, small<BR>sword.<BR>--प्रहारः a sword-cut.<BR>--फलं a<BR>sword-blade.<BR>--बंधः a kind of<BR>artificial composition, the words being<BR>arranged in the form of a sword;<BR>see K. P. 9 ad loc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0441-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खड्गारीटः|खड्गारीट
खड्गारीटः<BR>1 A shield.<BR>--2 One<BR>who observes a particular religious<BR>penance peculiar to Buddhists by<BR>walking on swords; cf. असिधारा.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0442-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खड्गवत्|खड्गवन्त्
खड्गवत् a. Armed with a sword.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0442-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खड्गिकः|खड्गिक
खड्गिकः<BR>1 A swordsman.<BR>--2 A<BR>butcher.<BR>--3 The cream of buffalo's<BR>milk.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0442-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खड्गिन्
खड्गिन् a. (नी f.) Armed with a<BR>sword. --m.<BR>1 A rhinoceros.<BR>--2 An<BR>epithet of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0442-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खड्गीकं|खड्गीक
खड्गीकं A sickle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0442-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खणखणायते
खणखणायते Den. A. To tick,<BR>tinkle, crack, clank.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0442-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खंड्|खण्ड्
खंड् {c10c} P. (खंडयति, खंडित)<BR>1 To<BR>break, cut, tear, break to pieces,<BR>crush; Bk. 15. 54; सौहार्दं शकटेन<BR>खंडितं Mu. 5. 18; Śi. 7. 31, 20. 24,<BR>6. 16, 12. 3.<BR>--2 To defeat completely,<BR>destroy, dispel; रजनीचरनाथेन खंडिते<BR>तिमिरे निशि H. 2. 111.<BR>--3 To<BR>disappoint; frustrate, cross in love;<BR>स्त्रीभिः कस्य न खंडितं भुवि मनः<BR>Pt. 1. 146.<BR>--4 To disturb.<BR>--5 To cheat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0442-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खंड|खण्ड|खण्डं|खण्डः
खंड a. [खंड्-घञ्]<BR>1 Broken, divided,<BR>torn asunder; ˚देवकुलं Pt. 2 a temple<BR>in ruins.<BR>--2 Having chasms,<BR>gaps or breaks.<BR>--3 Defective,<BR>deficient.<BR>--डः, --डं<BR>1 A break, chasm,<BR>gap, fissure, fracture.<BR>--2 A piece,<BR>part, fragment, portion; दिवः<BR>कांतिमत्खंडमेकं Me. 30; काष्ठ˚, मांस˚ &c.<BR>--3<BR>A section of a work, chapter.<BR>--4 A<BR>multitude, an assemblage, group;<BR>तरुखंडस्य K. 23; Māl. 5. 23, 8. 10.<BR>--5 A term in an equation.<BR>--डः<BR>1<BR>Candied sugar.<BR>--2 A flaw in a jewel.<BR>--डं<BR>1 A kind of salt.<BR>--2 A sort of<BR>sugar-cane. (In comp. खंड means<BR>‘partial,’ ‘incomplete’).<BR>--Comp.<BR>--अभ्रं<BR>{1} scattered clouds. {2} the impression<BR>of the teeth in amorous sports.<BR>--आलिः {1} a measure of oil. {2} a<BR>pond or lake. {3} a woman whose<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0442-b" target="_blank">Page0442-b+ 57</a>]<BR>husband has been guilty of<BR>infidelity.<BR>--कथा a short tale.<BR>--कर्णः {1} a<BR>kind of bulbous plant. {2} sweet<BR>potato.<BR>--काव्यं a small poem, such<BR>as the मेघदूत; it is thus defined:<BR>खंडकाव्यं भवेत् काव्यस्यैकदेशानुसारि च<BR>S. D. 564.<BR>--जः a kind of sugar.<BR>--धारा scissors.<BR>--परशुः {1} an<BR>epithet of Śiva; महैश्वर्यं<BR>लीलाजनितजगतः खंडपरशोः G. L. 1; येनानेन जगत्सु<BR>खंडपरशुर्देवो हरः ख्याप्यते Mv. 2. 33.<BR>{2} an epithet of Paraśurāma, son<BR>of Jamadagni. {3} an epithet of<BR>Viṣṇu.<BR>--पर्शुः {1} N. of Śiva. {2} of<BR>Paraśurāma. {3} of Rāhu. {4} an<BR>elephant with a broken tusk.<BR>--पालः<BR>a confectioner.<BR>--प्रलयः {1} a partial<BR>destruction of the universe in which<BR>all the spheres beneath Svarga are<BR>dissolved in one common ruin. {2}<BR>a quarrel.<BR>--मंडल a. gibbous, not full<BR>or round.<BR>--(लं) the segment of a<BR>circle.<BR>--मोदकः a kind of sugar.<BR>--लवणं a kind of salt.<BR>--विकारः sugar.<BR>--शर्करा candied sugar.<BR>--शीला a<BR>loose woman, an unchaste wife.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0442-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खंडक|खण्डक|खण्डकः
खंडक a. [खंड्-ण्वुल्] Destroying,<BR>tearing, breaking to pieces, removing,<BR>&c.<BR>--कः, --कं A fragment, part or<BR>piece.<BR>--कः<BR>1 Candied sugar.<BR>--2 One<BR>who has no nails.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--आलु n.<BR>sweet potato.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0442-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खंडन|खण्डन|खण्डनं
खंडन a. [खंड्-ल्युट्]<BR>1 Breaking,<BR>cutting, dividing.<BR>--2 Destroying,<BR>annihilating; स्मरगरलखंडनं मम शिरसि<BR>मंडनं Gīt. 10; भवज्वरखंडन 12.<BR>--नं<BR>1<BR>Breaking or cutting.<BR>--2 Biting;<BR>injuring, hurting; अधरोष्ठखंडनं Pt. 1;<BR>घटय भुजबंधनं जनय रदखंडनं Gīt. 10;<BR>Ch. P. 12; दर्शनेन कृतखंडनव्यथाः<BR>R. 19. 21.<BR>--3 Disappointing,<BR>frustrating (as in love).<BR>--4 Interrupting;<BR>रसखंडनवर्जितं R. 9. 36.<BR>--5 Cheating,<BR>deceiving.<BR>--6 Refuting (in argument);<BR>N. 6. 113.<BR>--7 Rebellion, opposition.<BR>--8 Dismissal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0442-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खंडनीय|खण्डनीय
खंडनीय, खंडयितव्य pot. p.<BR>1 To be<BR>broken, frangible, brittle.<BR>--2<BR>Destructible.<BR>--3 Refutable &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0442-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खंडयितव्य
खंडनीय, खंडयितव्य pot. p.<BR>1 To be<BR>broken, frangible, brittle.<BR>--2<BR>Destructible.<BR>--3 Refutable &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0442-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खंडलः|खण्डल|खंडल|खंडलं|खण्डलः
खंडलः, --लं A piece.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0442-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खंडलं|खण्डल|खंडल|खंडलः|खण्डलः
खंडलः, --लं A piece.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0442-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खंडशस्|खण्डशस्
खंडशस् ind.<BR>1 To pieces, into<BR>fragments; ˚कृ to cut into pieces.<BR>--2 Bit by bit, piece by piece,<BR>piece-meal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0442-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खंडिकः|खण्डिक|खण्डिकः
खंडिकः [खंड्-अस्त्यर्थे ठन्]<BR>1 A<BR>sugar-boiler.<BR>--2 Pease.<BR>--3 The<BR>armpit.<BR>--का<BR>1 The food of pease.<BR>--2 A<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0442-c" target="_blank">Page0442-c+ 56</a>]<BR>kind of air or tune (in music).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0442-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खंडित|खण्डित|खण्डितं
खंडित p. p. [खंड्-क्त]<BR>1 Cut,<BR>broken in pieces.<BR>--2 Destroyed,<BR>annihilated, lost, decayed; खंडित च<BR>वसुनि Bh. 3. 33.<BR>--3 Refuted (in<BR>argument), controverted.<BR>--4 Rebelled.<BR>--5 Disappointed, betrayed,<BR>abandoned; खंडितयुवतिविलापं Gīt. 8.<BR>--ता A<BR>woman whose husband or lover<BR>has been guilty of infidelity, and who<BR>is therefore angry with him; one of the<BR>{8} principal Nāyikās in Sanskrit;<BR>R. 5. 67; Me. 39. She is thus described:<BR>--पार्श्वमेति प्रियो यस्या अन्यसंभोगचिह्रितः । सा<BR>खंडितेति कथिता धीरैरीर्ष्याकषायिता<BR>S. D. 114.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--विग्रह a. maimed,<BR>mutilated.<BR>--वृत्त a. immoral, dissolute,<BR>abandoned; Mk. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0442-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खंडिन्|खण्डिन्
खंडिन् a. [खंड-इनि]<BR>1 Consisting of<BR>parts, in pieces or parts.<BR>--2<BR>Divided.<BR>--नी The earth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0442-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खंडीकृ|खण्डीकृ
खंडीकृ {c8c} U. To divide, tear to<BR>pieces, cut up.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0442-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खंड्य|खण्ड्य
खंड्य a.<BR>1 To be broken or<BR>divided, fragile.<BR>--2 Destructible.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0442-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खद्
खद् {c1c} P. (खदति, खदित)<BR>1 To be<BR>steady, firm.<BR>--2 To strike, hurt,<BR>kill.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0442-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खदिरः|खदिर
खदिरः [खद्-किरच्]<BR>1 N. of a tree,<BR>Acacia Catechu; Y. 1. 302.<BR>--2 An<BR>epithet of Indra.<BR>--3 The moon.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--कुणः the fruit-time of<BR>the Khadira tree.<BR>--पत्रिका, --पत्री a<BR>sensitive plant.<BR>--सारः catechu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0442-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खदिकाः
खदिकाः (pl.) Fried or parched<BR>grain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0442-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खन्
