खल्लः|खल्ल
खल्लः<BR>1 A stone or vessel for<BR>grinding drugs, a mill.<BR>--2 A pit.<BR>--3<BR>Leather.<BR>--4 The Cātaka bird.<BR>--5 A<BR>leather water-bag.<BR>--6 A canal, trench.<BR>--ल्ली Shooting pain in the<BR>extremities.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0444-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

