खल्लि(ल्ली)ट a. Bald-headed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0444-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

