खाद्
खाद् {c1c} P. (खादति, खादित)<BR>1 To eat,<BR>devour, feed; to prey upon, bite;<BR>प्राक्पादयोः पतति खादति पृष्ठमांसं H. 1. 81;<BR>खादन्मांसं न दुष्यति Ms. 5. 32, 53;<BR>Bk. 6. 6; 9. 78, 14. 87, 101; 15. 35.<BR>--2<BR>To hurt.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0444-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खाद|खादः
खाद a. Eating, devouring.<BR>--दः<BR>1 Eating, chewing<BR>--2 Food.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0444-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खादक|खादकः
खादक a. (दिका f.) [खाद्-ण्वुल्]<BR>Eating, consuming.<BR>--कः<BR>1 A<BR>debtor.<BR>--2 An eater, consumer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0444-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खादतमोदता
खादतमोदता [खादत मोदध्वमिति सततं<BR>यत्राभिधीयते] Eating and being glad;<BR>cf. “Eat, drink and be merry”; so<BR>खादतवमता, खादताचमता; cf. P. II. 1. 72.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0444-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खादनः|खादन|खादनं
खादनः [खाद्-करणे-ल्युद्] A tooth.<BR>--नं<BR>1 Eating, chewing.<BR>--2 Food.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0444-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खादुक|खादुकः
खादुक a. (की f.) Mischievous,<BR>injurious, malicious.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0444-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खाद्य|खाद्यं
खाद्य a. Eatable,<BR>--द्यं Food,<BR>victuals.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0444-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खादिः|खादि
खादिः Ved. A brooch, bracelet,<BR>ring.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0444-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खादिर|खादिरः
खादिर a. (री f.) [खदिरस्येदं, अण्]<BR>Made, of or coming from, the Khadira<BR>tree; खादिरं युपं कुर्वति; Ms. 2. 45.<BR>--रः Catechu,<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0444-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खारः|खार
खारः, --रिः --री f. A measure<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0444-c" target="_blank">Page0444-c+ 55</a>]<BR>of grain equal to 16 dronas.<BR>--री A<BR>scar.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0444-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खारिः|खारि
