खारीक|खारीकं
खारि(री)क a. Equal to or sown<BR>with a khārī of grain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0444-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खारिंपच|खारिम्पच|खारिम्पचः
