खालत्यं|खालत्य
खालत्यं Morbid baldness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0444-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खालिक
खालिक a. Like a threshing<BR>floor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0444-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खिखिः|खिखि
खिखिः A fox.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0444-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

