खुडकः|खुडक
खुडकः The ankle-joint.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0445-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खुंड्|खुण्ड्
खुंड् {c1c} A. (खुंडते)<BR>1 To break in<BR>pieces.<BR>--2 To limp, be lame.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0445-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खुर्
खुर् {c6c} P. (खुरति) To scratch, cut,<BR>break in pieces.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0445-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खुंगाहः|खुङ्गाह|खुंगाह|खुङ्गाहः
खुंगाहः A tawny (or black)<BR>horse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0445-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खुरः|खुर
खुरः [खुर-क]<BR>1 A hoof;<BR>R. 1. 85, 2. 2; Ms. 4. 67.<BR>--2 A kind of<BR>perfume.<BR>--3 A razor.<BR>--4 The foot of<BR>a bedstead.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--आघातः, --क्षेपः<BR>a kick.<BR>--णस्, --णस a. flat nosed.<BR>--पदवी a horse's foot-marks.<BR>--प्रः<BR>an arrow with a semi-circular head;<BR>see क्षुरप्र.<BR>--न्यासः prints of hoof;<BR>R. 2. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0445-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खुरली
खुरली Military exercise or practice<BR>(as of arms, archery &c.);<BR>अस्त्रप्रयोगखुरलीकलहे गणानां Mv. 2. 34;<BR>दूरोत्पतनखुरलीकेलिजनितान् 5. 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0445-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खुराकः|खुराक
