खुराका
खुराकः, --का [खुर्-आकन्] An animal<BR>in general.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0445-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खुरालकः|खुरालक
खुरालकः A iron arrow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0445-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खुरालिकः|खुरालिक
खुरालिकः<BR>1 A razor-case.<BR>--2 An<BR>iron arrow.<BR>--3 A pillow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0445-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खुर्द्
खु(खू)र्द् {c1c} A. (खु-खूर्दते) To play.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0445-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खूर्द्
खु(खू)र्द् {c1c} A. (खु-खूर्दते) To play.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0445-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खुल्ल|खुल्लं
खुल्ल a. Small, little, mean, low;<BR>see क्षुद्रः<BR>--Comp.<BR>--तातः a father's<BR>younger brother.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0445-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खुल्लमः|खुल्लम
खुल्लमः A road.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0445-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खेचर|खेचरः
खेचर See खचर.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0445-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खेट्
खेट् {c10c} P. (खेटयति &c.) To eat,<BR>consume.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0445-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खेट|खेटं|खेटः
खेट a. [खे अटति, अट् अच्; खिट्-अच्<BR>वा] Having a weapon, armed.<BR>--टः<BR>1 A village, small town or hamlet.<BR>--2 Phlegm.<BR>--3 The club of<BR>Balarāma.<BR>--4 A horse.<BR>--टः, --टं<BR>1<BR>Hunting, chase.<BR>--2 A shield.<BR>--टं<BR>1<BR>Grass.<BR>--2 Hide, skin. (N. B. At the<BR>end of comp. खेट expresses<BR>‘defectiveness’ or ‘deterioration’, & may<BR>be rendered by ‘miserable’, ‘low’,<BR>‘vile’, ‘wretched’ &c.; नगरखेटं a<BR>miserable town.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0445-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खेट|खेटं|खेटः
खेऽट See under ख.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0445-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खेटकः|खेटक
खेटकः A small village, hamlet.<BR>--कः, --कं<BR>1 A shield.<BR>--2 The club of<BR>Balarāma.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0445-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खेटिन्
खेटिन् m.<BR>1 A lecher, libertine.<BR>--2<BR>A citizen.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0445-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खेटितानः|खेटितान
खेटितानः, --लः A minstrel, whose<BR>business it is to awaken the master<BR>of the house with music and<BR>singing; (वैतालिक.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0445-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खेटितालः|खेटिताल
खेटितानः, --लः A minstrel, whose<BR>business it is to awaken the master<BR>of the house with music and<BR>singing; (वैतालिक.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0445-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खेल्
खेल् {c1c} P. (खेलति, खोलित)<BR>1 To<BR>shake, move to and fro.<BR>--2 To<BR>tremble.<BR>--3 To play, sport.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0445-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खेल
खेल a.<BR>1 Sportive, amorous,<BR>playful; R. 4. 22. V. 4. 16, 43.<BR>--2<BR>Moving, shaking.<BR>--ला Sport, play,<BR>pastime.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--गति, --गमन a.<BR>having a sportive or stately gait.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0445-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खेलनं|खेलन
खेलनं<BR>1 Shaking.<BR>--2 Play,<BR>pastime.<BR>--3 A performance.<BR>--नी A<BR>piece or man at chess &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0445-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खेलिः|खेलि
खेलिः f.<BR>1 Sport, play.<BR>--2 An<BR>arrow.<BR>--3 An animal.<BR>--4 A bird.<BR>--5 The sun.<BR>--6 A song or hymn.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0445-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खेव्
खेव् {c1c} A. (खेवते) To serve, wait<BR>upon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0445-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खेसरः|खेसर
खेसरः A mule.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0445-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खैलिक
खैलिक a. Supplementary,<BR>additional.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0445-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खोंगाहः|खोङ्गाह|खोङ्गाहः
खोंगाहः A white and brown horse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0445-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खोट्
खोट्, --ड्, --र्, --ल् {c1c} P.<BR>1 To limp.<BR>--2<BR>To be lame.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0445-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खोड्
खोट्, --ड्, --र्, --ल् {c1c} P.<BR>1 To limp.<BR>--2<BR>To be lame.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0445-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खोर्
खोट्, --ड्, --र्, --ल् {c1c} P.<BR>1 To limp.<BR>--2<BR>To be lame.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0445-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खोल्
खोट्, --ड्, --र्, --ल् {c1c} P.<BR>1 To limp.<BR>--2<BR>To be lame.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0445-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खोटिः|खोटि
खोटिः f. A cunning or shrewd<BR>woman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0445-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खोड|खोडः
खोड a. Crippled, lame, limping.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0445-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

