गंजः|गञ्ज|गंज|गञ्जः
गंजः<BR>1 A mine.<BR>--2 A treasury.<BR>--3<BR>A cow-house.<BR>--4 A mart, a place<BR>where grain is stored for sale.<BR>--5<BR>Disrespect, contempt.<BR>--जा<BR>1 A<BR>hut, hovel.<BR>--2 A tavern.<BR>--3 A<BR>drinking vessel.<BR>--4 A mine,<BR>jewelmine.<BR>--जं<BR>1 A mine.<BR>--2 A treasury.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0447-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गंजन|गञ्जन
गंजन a.<BR>1 Contemning, putting<BR>to shame, surpassing, excelling;<BR>स्थलकमलगंजनं मम हृदयरंजनं (चरणद्वयं)<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0447-b" target="_blank">Page0447-b+ 54</a>]<BR>Gīt. 10; अलिकुलगंजनमंजनकं 12;<BR>नेत्रे खंजनगंजने S. D.<BR>--2 Defeating.<BR>conquering: कालियविषधरगंजन Gīt. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0447-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गंजिका|गञ्जिका
गंजिका A tavern, liquor shop.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0447-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गड्
गड् {c1c} P. (गडति, गडित)<BR>1 To distil,<BR>draw out.<BR>--2 To run (as a liquid).<BR>{c10c} P. (गडयति) To cover, hide.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0447-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गडः|गड
गडः [गड्-अच्]<BR>1 A screen.<BR>--2 A<BR>fence.<BR>--3 A ditch, moat.<BR>--4 An<BR>impediment.<BR>--5 A kind of gold-fish.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--उत्थं, --देशजं --लवणं rock<BR>or fossil salt, especially that found<BR>in the district called गड.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0447-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

