गडिः|गडि
गडिः [गड्-इन्]<BR>1 A young steer.<BR>--2<BR>A lazy ox; गुणानामेव दौरात्म्याद्धुरि धुर्यो<BR>नियुज्यते । असंजातकिणस्कंधःसुखं स्वपिति<BR>गौर्गडिः K. P. 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0447-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गडु|गडुः
गडु a. [गड्-उन्] Crooked, hump<BR>backed.<BR>--डुः<BR>1 A hump on the<BR>back.<BR>--2 A javelin.<BR>--3 A water-pot.<BR>--4 An earth-worm.<BR>--5 Any<BR>superfluous excrescence or addition, a<BR>useless object; see अंतर्गडु.<BR>--6 A goitre,<BR>excrescence on the neck.<BR>--7 A<BR>hump-backed person.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0447-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

