गडुकः<BR>1 A water-pot.<BR>--2 A<BR>finger-ring.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0447-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

