गडोलः|गडोल
गडोलः<BR>1 A mouthful.<BR>--2 Raw<BR>sugar.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0447-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गड्डरः|गड्डर
