गड्डरिका
गड्डरिका [गड्डरं मेषमनुधावति ठन्]<BR>1 A<BR>line of sheep.<BR>--2 A continuous line,<BR>stream, current; ˚प्रवाहः ‘a stream<BR>of sheep, used to signify ‘blindly<BR>following other people like a flock<BR>of sheep;’ cf. इति गड्डरिकाप्रवाहेनैषां<BR>भेदः K. P. 8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0447-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

