गुंडः|गुण्ड|गुण्डः
गुंडः [गुंड्-अच्]<BR>1 A kind of<BR>fragrant grass.<BR>--2 Pounding, grinding.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0462-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुंडकः|गुण्डक|गुंडक|गुण्डकः
गुंडकः<BR>1 Dust, powder.<BR>--2 An<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0462-b" target="_blank">Page0462-b+ 55</a>]<BR>oil-vessel.<BR>--3 A soft or low pleasing<BR>tone.<BR>--4 Dirty flour or meal<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0462-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुंडनं|गुण्डन
गुंडनं Concealing, covering, hiding.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0462-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुंडिकः|गुण्डिक|गुंडिक|गुण्डिकः
गुंडिकः Flour, meal, powder.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0462-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुंडित|गुण्डित|गुण्डितः
