गूः
गूः f.<BR>1 Dirt.<BR>--2 Ordure,<BR>excrement.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0464-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

