गूथः --थं Feces, ordure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0464-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गूथं|गूथ|गूथः
गूथः --थं Feces, ordure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0464-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गून|गूनः
गून a. Voided by stool (as ordure).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0464-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गूर्
गूर् = गुर् q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0464-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गूरणं|गूरण
गूरणं See गुरण.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0464-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गूर्त|गूर्त्त
गूर्त(र्ण) a. Ved. Agreeable,<BR>thankful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0464-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गूर्ण|गूर्ण्ण
गूर्त(र्ण) a. Ved. Agreeable,<BR>thankful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0464-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गूर्तिः|गूर्ति|गूर्त्ति
गूर्तिः f. Ved. Praise, approval.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0464-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गूर्द्
गूर्द्(गुर्द्) {vI.v} {c1c} A. (गू(गु)र्दते)<BR>1<BR>To play, sport.<BR>--2 To leap, jump.<BR>{vII.v} {c10c} P. (गूर्दयति)<BR>1 To play,<BR>sport<BR>--2 To dwell, inhabit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0464-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुर्द्
गूर्द्(गुर्द्) {vI.v} {c1c} A. (गू(गु)र्दते)<BR>1<BR>To play, sport.<BR>--2 To leap, jump.<BR>{vII.v} {c10c} P. (गूर्दयति)<BR>1 To play,<BR>sport<BR>--2 To dwell, inhabit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0464-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

