गोधिका
गोधिका A kind of lizard.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0469-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोधेरः|गोधेर
गोधेरः A protector, guardian.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0469-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोपः|गोप
