चंपूः
चंपूः f. A kind of elaborate and<BR>highly artificial composition in which<BR>the same subject is continued<BR>through alterations in prose and<BR>verse; गद्यपद्यमयं काव्यं<BR>चंपूरित्यभिधीयते S. D. 569; for instance भोजचंपू,<BR>नलचंपू, भारतचंपू &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0486-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चंब्|चम्ब्
चंब् {c1c} P. (चंबति) To go, move.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0486-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चम्रिष्
चम्रिष् a. Ved. Contained in the<BR>sacrificial vessel (as libations)<BR>(चमसस्थ); Rv. 1. 56. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0486-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

