चिरुः|चिरु
चिरुः The shoulder-joint.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0495-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिर्भटिः
चिर्भटिः A sort of cucumber.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0495-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिल्
चिल् {c6c} P. (चिलति) To put on<BR>clothes.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0495-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिलमीलिका
चिलमी(मि)लिका<BR>1 A kind<BR>of necklace.<BR>--2 A fire-fly.<BR>--3<BR>Lightning.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0495-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिलमिलिका
चिलमी(मि)लिका<BR>1 A kind<BR>of necklace.<BR>--2 A fire-fly.<BR>--3<BR>Lightning.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0495-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिल्ल्
चिल्ल् {c1c} P. (चिल्लति, चिल्लित)<BR>1 To<BR>become loose, be slack or flaccid.<BR>--2 To act wantonly, sport.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0495-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिल्ल|चिल्लः
चिल्ल a. [चिल्ल्-अच्] Blear-eyed.<BR>--ल्लः<BR>1 A bleared or sored eye.<BR>--2<BR>The (Bengal) kite; चिल्ला also in<BR>this sense; बंधनभ्रष्टो गृहकपोतश्चिल्लाया<BR>मुखे पतितः M. 4; cf. English<BR>“From the frying-pan into the fire”.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--आभः a petty thief, a<BR>pickpocket.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0495-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिल्लका
