झषः|झष|झषं
झषः<BR>1 A fish in general; झषाणां<BR>मकरश्चास्मि Bg. 10. 31; cf. words<BR>like झषकेतन below.<BR>--2 A large fish.<BR>--3 The sign Pisces of the zodiac.<BR>--4 Heat, warmth.<BR>--5 The sign<BR>Capricornus of the zodiac.<BR>--षं<BR>1 A<BR>forest, wood.<BR>--2 A desert, dreary<BR>forest.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--अंकः, --केतनः, --केतुः,<BR>--ध्वजः N. of the god of love;<BR>स्त्रीमुद्रां झषकेतनस्य Pt. 4. 34.<BR>--अशनः<BR>a porpoise.<BR>--उदरी an epithet of<BR>Satyavatī, mother of Vyāsa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0521-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

