टगर|टगरः
टगर a. Squint-eyed.<BR>--रः<BR>1 Borax.<BR>--2 Wanton play or sport.<BR>--3<BR>Confusion.<BR>--4 An object of sense.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0522-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

टंक्|टङ्क्
