टिप्पणी
टिप्पणी(नी) A gloss, a<BR>comment; sometimes used in the sense<BR>of ‘a gloss on a gloss’; as Kaiyaṭa's<BR>commentary on the Mahābhāṣya,<BR>or Nāgojībhaṭṭa's gloss on Kaiyaṭa's<BR>gloss.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0522-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

टिप्पनी
टिप्पणी(नी) A gloss, a<BR>comment; sometimes used in the sense<BR>of ‘a gloss on a gloss’; as Kaiyaṭa's<BR>commentary on the Mahābhāṣya,<BR>or Nāgojībhaṭṭa's gloss on Kaiyaṭa's<BR>gloss.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0522-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

टीक्
टीक् {c1c} A. (टीकते) To move, go,<BR>resort to; काश्मर्याः कृतमालमुद्गतदलं<BR>कोयष्टिकष्टीकते Māl. 9. 7. --WITH आ to<BR>go, move, go about; आटीकसेंऽग<BR>करिघोटीपदातिजुषि वाटीभुवि क्षितिभुजां<BR>Aśvad. 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0522-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

