ठः|ठ
ठः<BR>1 An imitative sound, as of a<BR>metallic jar rolling down steps;<BR>रामाभिषेके मदविह्वलायाः कक्षाच्च्युतो<BR>हेमघटस्तरुण्याः । सोपानमार्गे प्रकरोति शब्दं ठठं ठठं<BR>ठं ठठठं ठठं ठः Subhāṣ.<BR>--2 A loud<BR>noise.<BR>--3 The disc of the sun or<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0522-1b" target="_blank">Page0522-1b+ 6</a>]<BR>moon.<BR>--4 A circle, globe.<BR>--5 A<BR>cypher.<BR>--6 A place resorted to or held<BR>sacred by all.<BR>--7 An object of sense.<BR>--8 An idol, deity.<BR>--9 An epithet of<BR>Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0522-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ठक्कुरः|ठक्कुर
