डः|ड
डः<BR>1 A sound.<BR>--2 A kind of drum<BR>or tabor.<BR>--3 Submarine fire.<BR>--4 Fear.<BR>--5 An epithet of Śiva.<BR>--डा<BR>1 A<BR>kind of female imp (डाकिनी).<BR>--2 A<BR>basket carried by means of a sling.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0523-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

