तिथिः|तिथि
तिथिः m. or f. [अत्-इथिन् पृषो˚ वा<BR>ङीप् cf. Uṇ. 4. 2]<BR>1 A lunar day;<BR>तिथिरेव तावन्न शुद्ध्यति Mu. 5;<BR>Ku. 6. 93, 7. 1.<BR>--2 The number ‘15’.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--ईशः the regent of a<BR>lunar day.<BR>--क्षयः {1} the day of new<BR>moon. {2} the day on which a<BR>tithi begins and ends without one<BR>sunrise or between two sunrises.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0538-a" target="_blank">Page0538-a+ 55</a>]<BR>--पत्री an almanac.<BR>--पालनं<BR>observance of the rites prescribed<BR>for the several lunar days.<BR>--प्रणीः<BR>the moon.<BR>--वृद्धिः f. the day in which<BR>a tithi is completed under two<BR>suns (one which comprises two<BR>sunrises).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0537-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

