तुंडं [तुंड्-अच्]<BR>1 Mouth, face,<BR>beak, snout (of a hog);<BR>तुंडैराताम्रकुटिलैः (शुकाः) Kāv. 2. 9.<BR>--2 The<BR>trunk of an elephant.<BR>--3 The point<BR>of an instrument.<BR>--डः N. of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0541-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुंडकेरिका|तुण्डकेरिका
