तुंडिः|तुण्डि|तुंडि|तुण्डिः
तुंडिः [तुंड्-इन्]<BR>1 Face, mouth.<BR>--2<BR>A beak.<BR>--डिः f. The navel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0541-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुंडिक|तुण्डिक
