तुत्थ्
तुत्थ् {c10c} U. (तुत्थयति-ते)<BR>1 To<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0541-b" target="_blank">Page0541-b+ 57</a>]<BR>praise.<BR>--2 To cover, screen,<BR>Śi. 5. 11.<BR>--3 To spread.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0541-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुत्थः|तुत्थ|तुत्थं
तुत्थः [तुद्-थक्]<BR>1 Fire.<BR>--2 A<BR>stone.<BR>--त्थं Sulphate of copper,<BR>usually applied to the eyes as a sort<BR>of collyrium or medical ointment.<BR>--त्था<BR>1 Small cardamoms.<BR>--2 The<BR>indigo plant.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--अंजनं blue<BR>vitriol applied to the eyes as a<BR>medical ointment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0541-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुत्थकं|तुत्थक
तुत्थकं Blue vitriol.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0541-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुद्
तुद् {c6c} U. (तुदति-ते, तुन्न)<BR>1 To strike,<BR>wound, hit; तुतोद गदया चारिं<BR>Bk. 14 81; 15. 37: Śi. 20. 77.<BR>--2 To<BR>prick, goad.<BR>--3 To bruise, hurt.<BR>--4 To pain, vex, torment, afflict;<BR>सुतीक्ष्णधारापतनोग्रसायकैस्तुदंति चेतः<BR>प्रसभं प्रवासिनां Rs. 2. 4, 6. 28.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0541-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुद
तुद a. Striking, tormenting &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0541-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुन्न|तुन्नः
तुन्न p. p. [तुद्-क्त]<BR>1 Struck, hurt,<BR>wounded.<BR>--2 Tormented.<BR>--3 Cut,<BR>broken.<BR>--4 Pricked.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--वायः<BR>a tailor, Ms. 4. 214.<BR>--सेवनी the<BR>suture of a wound or of a skull.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0541-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

