तोदः|तोद
तोदः [तुद् भावे घञ्]<BR>1 Pain,<BR>anguish, torture.<BR>--2 The sun.<BR>--3<BR>Guiding, urging, driving (horses<BR>&c.).<BR>--4 Sharp pain.<BR>--5 Ved. A<BR>sacrificer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0541-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तोदनं|तोदन
तोदनं [तुद्-करणे घञ्]<BR>1 Pain,<BR>anguish.<BR>--2 A goad.<BR>--3 Face, mouth<BR>(तुंड).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0541-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुंदं|तुन्द|तुंद|तुन्दं|तुन्दः
तुंदं The belly, a corpulent or<BR>protuberant belly.<BR>--दः, --दी The navel.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--कूपिका, --कूपी the cavity of<BR>the navel.<BR>--परिमार्ज, --परिमृज्, --मृज<BR>a. lazy, sluggish.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0541-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुंदवत्|तुन्दवत्|तुन्दवन्त्
