तुभ् {c4c} {c9c} P. (तुभ्यति, तुभ्नाति) To<BR>hurt, injure, strike; Bk. 17. 79. 90.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0541-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुमुल|तुमुलं|तुमुलः
तुमुल a.<BR>1 Tumultuous, noisy;<BR>Māl. 9. 3; Bg. 1. 13, 19.<BR>--2 Fierce,<BR>raging; R. 3. 57.<BR>--3 Excited.<BR>--4<BR>Perplexed, confused; R. 5. 49.<BR>--लः<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0541-c" target="_blank">Page0541-c+ 55</a>]<BR>--लं<BR>1 An uproar, a tumult, clang.<BR>--2 A confused combat, melée.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0541-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुंब्|तुम्ब्
तुंब् {vI.v} {c1c} P. (तुंबति)<BR>1 To distress,<BR>trouble.<BR>--2 To kill, hurt. {vII.v} {c10c} U.<BR>(तुंबयति-ते) To hurt, trouble.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0541-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुंबः|तुम्ब|तुंब|तुम्बः
तुंबः [तुंब्-अच्] A kind of gourd.<BR>--बा<BR>1 A kind of long gourd.<BR>--2 A<BR>milch cow.<BR>--3 A milk-vessel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0541-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुंबरः|तुम्बर|तुंबर|तुम्बरः
तुंबरः N. of a Gandharva; see<BR>तुंबरु.<BR>--रं A kind of musical<BR>instrument.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0541-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुंबिः|तुम्बि|तुंबि|तुम्बिः
तुंबिः --बी f. A sort of gourd; न<BR>हि तुबीफलविकलो वीणादंडः प्रयाति<BR>महिमानं Bv. 1. 80.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0541-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुंबी
तुंबिः --बी f. A sort of gourd; न<BR>हि तुबीफलविकलो वीणादंडः प्रयाति<BR>महिमानं Bv. 1. 80.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0541-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुंबरुः|तुम्बरु|तुम्बरुः
तुंब(बु)रुः N. of a Gandharva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0541-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुंबुरुः|तुम्बुरु|तुंबुरु|तुम्बुरुः
तुंब(बु)रुः N. of a Gandharva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0541-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुम्र
तुम्र a. Ved.<BR>1 Destroying,<BR>defeating, killing.<BR>--2 Impelling.<BR>--3<BR>Energetic, strong.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0541-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुर्
तुर् {vI.v} {c6c} U. (तुरति-ते)<BR>1 To hurry,<BR>hasten.<BR>--2 To overcome.<BR>--3 To.<BR>injure. {vII.v} {c3c} P. (तुतोर्ति) To run.<BR>--तुर् a.<BR>1 Hastening.<BR>--2 Fighting.<BR>--f. Speed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0541-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुर|तुरः
तुर a. Ved.<BR>1 Advancing,<BR>promoting.<BR>--2 Speedy, quick, prompt.<BR>--3<BR>Strong, energetic.<BR>--4 Hurt,<BR>wounded.<BR>--5 Rich.<BR>--6 Abundant.<BR>--रः<BR>Speed, velocity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0541-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुरण
तुरण a. Ved. Quick, swift.<BR>--णं<BR>Haste, speed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0541-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुरण्यति
तुरण्यति Den. P.<BR>1 To be swift.<BR>--2 To make haste, accelerate,<BR>expedite.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0541-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुरी
तुरी Ved. Great strength.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0541-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुरकिन्
तुरकिन् a. Turkish.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0541-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुरक्वः|तुरक्व
तुरक्वः N. of a people, the Turks.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0541-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुरगः|तुरग
तुरगः [तुरेण गच्छति गम्-ड]<BR>1 A<BR>horse; तुरगखुरहतरतथा हि रेणुः<BR>Ś. 1. 31; R. 1. 42, 3. 51.<BR>--2 The mind,<BR>thought.<BR>--गी A mare.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--आरोहः a horseman.<BR>--उपचारकः a<BR>groom.<BR>--प्रियः --यं barley.<BR>--ब्रह्मचर्यं<BR>forced or compulsory celibacy<BR>leading a life of celibacy simply in<BR>consequence of the absence of female<BR>society.<BR>--मेधः a horse-sacrifice.<BR>--रक्षः a groom, an equery.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0541-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुरगिन्
तुरगिन् m. A horseman; तुरंगिन्<BR>also.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0541-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुरंगः|तुरङ्ग|तुरंग|तुरङ्गः
तुरंगः [तुरेण गच्छति, गम्-ख मुम् वा<BR>डिच्च]<BR>1 A horse; भानुः सकृद्युक्ततुरंग<BR>एव Ś. 5. 5; R. 3. 38, 13. 3.<BR>--2 A<BR>name for the number ‘seven’.<BR>--3 The heart, mind.<BR>--गी A<BR>mare.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--अरिः {1} a buffalo<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0542-a" target="_blank">Page0542-a+ 56</a>]<BR>{2} fragrant oleander.<BR>--आरूढः a<BR>horseman.<BR>--द्विषणी a she-buffalo.<BR>--प्रियः --यं barley.<BR>--मेधः a<BR>horsesacrifice; R. 13. 61.<BR>--यायिन्,<BR>--सादिन् m. a horseman.<BR>--वक्त्रः, --वदनः a<BR>Kinnara.<BR>--शाला, --स्थानं a<BR>horsestable.<BR>--स्कंधः a troop of horses.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0541-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुरंगकः|तुरङ्गक|तुरंगक|तुरङ्गकः
तुरंगकः A horse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0542-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुरंगमः|तुरङ्गम|तुरंगम|तुरङ्गमः
तुरंगमः A horse; R. 3. 63, 9. 72.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0542-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुरायणं|तुरायण|तुरायणः
तुरायणं<BR>1 Non-attachment to<BR>any object or pursuit (असंग).<BR>--2 A<BR>kind of sacrifice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0542-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुरासाह्
तुरासाह् m. (Nom. sing.<BR>तुराषाट्ड्) N. of Indra; Ku. 2. 1;<BR>R. 15. 40; also of Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0542-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुरी
तुरी [तुर्-इन् ङीप्]<BR>1 The fibrous<BR>stick used by weavers to clear and<BR>separate the threads of the woof.<BR>--2 A shuttle; तद्भटचातुरीतुरी<BR>N. 1. 12.<BR>--3 A painter's brush.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0542-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुरीय|तुरीयं|तुरीयः
तुरीय a.<BR>1 The fourth.<BR>--2<BR>Consisting of four parts.<BR>--3 Mighty.<BR>--यं<BR>1 A quarter, a fourth part,<BR>fourth.<BR>--2 (In Vedānta phil.) The<BR>fourth state of the soul in which<BR>it becomes one with Brahman or<BR>the Supreme Spirit.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--वर्णः<BR>a man of the fourth caste, a Śūdra.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0542-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुरीयक
तुरीयक a. A fourth (part).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0542-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुर्य|तुर्य्य|तुर्य्यः
तुर्य a. Fourth; N. 4. 123.<BR>--र्यं<BR>1<BR>A quarter, a fourth part.<BR>--2 (In<BR>Vedānta phil.) The fourth state of<BR>the soul in which it becomes one<BR>with Brahman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0542-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुरुष्काः
तुरुष्काः (m. pl.) N. of a people,<BR>the Turks.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0542-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुर्फरी
तुर्फरी, तुर्फरीतु a. Ved. Killing<BR>(हंतृ); Rv. 10. 106. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0542-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुर्फरीतु
तुर्फरी, तुर्फरीतु a. Ved. Killing<BR>(हंतृ); Rv. 10. 106. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0542-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुर्व्
तुर्व् {c1c} P. (तु-तू-र्वति) Ved.<BR>1 To<BR>injure, hurt, kill; वृत्रं यादिंद्र तूर्वसि<BR>Rv. 8. 99. 6.<BR>--2 To excel.<BR>--3 To<BR>overpower.<BR>--4 To save.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0542-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुर्वणि
तुर्वणि a. Ved.<BR>1 Acting or<BR>moving quickly.<BR>--2 Injuring or<BR>destroying enemies, victorious.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0542-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुल्
तुल् {c1c} P., {c10c} U. (तोलति-तोलयति-ते;<BR>also तुलयति-ते which some suppose to<BR>be a denominative from तुला)<BR>1 To<BR>weigh, measure.<BR>--2 To weigh in the<BR>mind, ponder, consider.<BR>--3 To raise,<BR>lift up; कैलासे तुलिते Mv. 5. 37;<BR>पौलस्त्यतुलितस्याद्रेरादधान इव थियं<BR>R. 4. 80, 12. 89; Śi. 15. 30.<BR>--4 To bear<BR>up, hold up, support; पृथिवीतले<BR>तुलितभूभृदुच्यसे Śi. 15. 30, 61.<BR>--5<BR>To compare, equal, liken (with<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0542-b" target="_blank">Page0542-b+ 57</a>]<BR>instr.); तृणमिव तुलयंति Pt. 5. 31;<BR>मुखं श्लेष्मागारं तदपि च शशांकेन<BR>तुलितं Bh. 3. 20; Śi. 8. 12.<BR>--6<BR>To match, be equal to (with acc.);<BR>प्रासादास्त्वां तुलयितुमलं यत्र तैस्तैर्विशेषैः<BR>Me. 64.<BR>--7 To make light of,<BR>contemn, despise; अंतःसारं घन<BR>तुलयितुं नानिलः शक्ष्यति त्वां Me. 20<BR>(where तु. also means ‘to bear up<BR>or carry away’); Śi. 15. 30.<BR>--8 To<BR>suspect, examine with distrust; कः<BR>श्रद्धास्यति भूतार्थं सर्वो मां तुलयिष्यति<BR>Mk. 3. 24, 5. 43 (where some<BR>editions read तूलयिष्यति for तुलयिष्यति).<BR>--9<BR>To try, put to test, reduce to a<BR>wretched state; हा अवस्थे तुलयसि<BR>Mk. 1 (तूलयसि v. l.).<BR>--10 To<BR>counterbalance, outweigh.<BR>--11 To have<BR>in the same degree, attain or<BR>reach to.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0542-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुलनं|तुलन
तुलनं [तुल्-ल्युट्]<BR>1 Weight.<BR>--2<BR>Lifting.<BR>--3 Comparing, likening,<BR>&c.<BR>--ना<BR>1 Comparison.<BR>--2<BR>Weighing.<BR>--3 Lifting, raising.<BR>--4 Rating,<BR>assessing, estimating.<BR>--5 Examining.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0542-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुला
तुला [तुल्-भिदा˚अङ्]<BR>1 A balance<BR>or the beam of a balance; तुलया धृ<BR>to hold in a balance, to weigh,<BR>consider equal; अश्वमेधसहस्राणि<BR>सत्यं च तुलया धृतं H. 4. 131. v. l.<BR>--2 A<BR>measure, weight.<BR>--3 Weighing.<BR>--4<BR>Resemblance, likeness, equality,<BR>similarity (with gen., instr. or in<BR>comp.); किं धूर्जटेरिव तुलामुपयाति<BR>संख्ये Ve. 3. 8; तुलां यदाराहेति<BR>दंतवाससा Ku. 5. 34; R. 8. 15; सद्यः<BR>परस्परतुलामधिरोहतां द्वे R. 5. 68, 19. 8,<BR>50.<BR>--5 Libra, the seventh sign of<BR>the zodiac; जयति तुलामधिरूढो<BR>भास्वानपि जलदपटलानि Pt. 1. 330.<BR>--6 A<BR>sloping beam or timber in the roof<BR>of a house.<BR>--7 A measure of gold or<BR>silver equal to 100 palas.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--कूटः a false weight.<BR>--कोटिः --टी f.<BR>{1} an ornament (an anklet or नूपुर)<BR>worn on the feet by women;<BR>लीलाचलत्स्त्री<BR>चरणारुणोत्पलस्खलत्तुलाकोटिनिनादकोमलः Śi. 12. 44. {2} a hundred<BR>millions (अर्बुद).<BR>--कोशः, --कोषः {1}<BR>ordeal by weighing. {2} a place where<BR>a balance is kept.<BR>--दानं the gift to<BR>a Brāhmaṇa of as much gold or<BR>silver as equals the weight of one's<BR>body.<BR>--धटः {1} the scale of a<BR>balance. {2} an oar.<BR>--धरः {1} a<BR>trader, merchant. {2} the sign<BR>Libra of the zodiac.<BR>--धारः a dealer<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0542-c" target="_blank">Page0542-c+ 56</a>]<BR>trader, or merchant. {2} the string<BR>of a balance. {3} the beam. {4} the<BR>sign Libra of the zodiac.<BR>--परीक्षा<BR>ordeal by the balance.<BR>--पुरुषः gold,<BR>jewels or other valuable things<BR>equal to a man's weight (given to<BR>a Brāhmaṇa as a gift); cf. तुलादान.<BR>--प्रग्रहः, --प्रग्राहः the string or beam<BR>of a balance.<BR>--मानं, --यष्टिः f. the beam<BR>of a balance; Pt. 1. 150.<BR>--बीजं<BR>the berry of the Guñjā plant<BR>--सूत्रं the string of a balance<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0542-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुलित
तुलित p. p.<BR>1 Weighed,<BR>counterpoised.<BR>--2 Compared, likened, equal<BR>led; Bh. 3. 36; see तुल्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0542-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुल्य|तुल्यः
तुल्य a. [तुलया संमितं यत्]<BR>1 Of the<BR>same kind or class, well-matched,<BR>similar, like, equal, resembling (with<BR>gen., instr., or in comp.); Ms. 4. 86;<BR>Y. 2. 77; R. 2. 35, 12. 80, 18. 38.<BR>--2<BR>Fit for.<BR>--3 Identical, same.<BR>--4<BR>Indifferent.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--दर्शन a.<BR>regarding with the same or indifferent<BR>eyes.<BR>--पानं drinking together,<BR>compotation.<BR>--भावना (in arith.)<BR>combination of like sets of magnitude.<BR>--योगिता (in Rhet.) a figure of<BR>speech, a combination of several<BR>objects having the same attribute, the<BR>objects being either all relevant or<BR>all irrelevant; नियतानां सकृद्धर्मः सा<BR>पुनस्तुल्ययोगिता K. P. 10; cf.<BR>Chandr. 5. 41.<BR>--रूप a. like, similar,<BR>analogous.<BR>--शुद्धि f. equal subtraction.<BR>--शोधनं reducing an equation by<BR>removing the like terms on both<BR>sides.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0542-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तोलः|तोल|तोलं
तोलः, --लं [तुल्-कर्मणि अच्]<BR>1 Weight<BR>or quantity measured by the balance.<BR>--2 A weight of gold or silver equal<BR>to 12 māshas or a tolā.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0542-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तोलं|तोल|तोलः
तोलः, --लं [तुल्-कर्मणि अच्]<BR>1 Weight<BR>or quantity measured by the balance.<BR>--2 A weight of gold or silver equal<BR>to 12 māshas or a tolā.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0542-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तोलनं|तोलन
तोलनं Raising, lifting,<BR>weighing &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0542-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तोल्य
तोल्य a. To be weighed.<BR>--ल्यं<BR>Weighing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0542-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुलसारिणी
तुलसारिणी A quiver.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0542-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुलसी
तुलसी [तुलां सादृश्यं स्यति, सो-क<BR>गौरा˚ ङीष् शकंध्वा. Tv.] The holy basil held<BR>in veneration by the Hindus,<BR>especially by the worshippers of Viṣṇu.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--पत्रं (lit.) a Tulasī leaf;<BR>(fig.) a very small gift.<BR>--विवाहः<BR>the marriage of an image of<BR>Bālakṛṣṇa with the holy basil,<BR>performed on the 12th day of the bright<BR>half of Kārtika.<BR>--वृंदावनः --नं a square<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0543-a" target="_blank">Page0543-a+ 55</a>]<BR>pedestal in which the sacred basil is<BR>planted.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0542-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुलिः|तुलि
तुलिः --ली f. = तुरी. (1) and (2) q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0543-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुली
तुलिः --ली f. = तुरी. (1) and (2) q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0543-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुवर|तुवरः
तुवर a.<BR>1 Astringent.<BR>--2<BR>Beardless; also तूवर.<BR>--रः, --रं An<BR>astringent taste.<BR>--री<BR>1 A fragrant earth.<BR>--2 Alum.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0543-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुवरिका
तुवरिका<BR>1 A kind of earth.<BR>--2<BR>Alum.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0543-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुवि|तुविः
तुवि a. Ved.<BR>1 Much, many;<BR>Rv. 3. 30. 3.<BR>--2 Strong, powerful.<BR>--विः<BR>f. A long gourd (तुंबी).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0543-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुविस्
तुविस् n. Ved.<BR>1 Growth.<BR>--2<BR>Strength.<BR>--3 Intellect.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0543-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुश्
तुश् Ved. {c1c} A. (तोशते)<BR>1 To<BR>strike, hurt, kill.<BR>--2 To be pressed<BR>out or extracted.<BR>--3 To trickle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0543-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुष्
तुष् {c4c} P. (तुष्यति, तुष्ट)<BR>1 To be<BR>pleased or satisfied, be contented or<BR>delighted with anything (usually<BR>with instr.); रत्नैर्महार्हैस्तुतुषुर्न देवाः<BR>Bh. 2. 80, Ms. 3. 207; Bg. 2. 55;<BR>Bk. 2. 13, 15. 8; R. 3. 62.<BR>--2 To<BR>become calm or quiet.<BR>--3 To satisfy,<BR>please (with acc.). --Caus. (<BR>तोषयति-ते) To please, gratify, satisfy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0543-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुष्ट|तुष्टः
तुष्ट p. p. [तुष् कर्तरि क्त]<BR>1 Pleased,<BR>satisfied, delighted, gratified,<BR>contented.<BR>--2 Contented with what<BR>one possesses and indifferent to<BR>everything else.<BR>--ष्टः N. of Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0543-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुष्टिः|तुष्टि
तुष्टिः f. [तुष्-भावे-क्तिन्]<BR>1<BR>Satisfaction, gratification, pleasure,<BR>contentment.<BR>--2 (In Sān. phil.)<BR>Acquiescence, indifference to<BR>everything except what is possessed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0543-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तोषः|तोष
तोषः [तुष्-भावे घञ्] Satisfaction,<BR>contentment, pleasure, delight.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0543-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तोषण
तोषण a. [तुष्-कर्तरि ल्यु] Satisfying,<BR>gratifying, pleasing.<BR>--णं [भावे ल्युट्]<BR>1 Satisfaction, gratification,<BR>contentment.<BR>--2 Anything that gives<BR>satisfaction, a gratification.<BR>--णी An<BR>epithet of Durgā.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0543-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तोषित
तोषित a. Pleased, satisfied &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0543-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तोषिन्
तोषिन् a. (At the end of comp.)<BR>1 Pleased with.<BR>--2 Gladdening,<BR>satisfying.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0543-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुषः|तुष
तुषः [तुष्-क] The husk or chaff<BR>of grain; अजानतार्थं तत्सर्वं (अध्ययनं)<BR>तुषाणां कंडनं यथा; Ms. 4. 78.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--अग्निः, --अनलः {1} fire of the chaff or<BR>husk of corn {2} a mode of capital<BR>punishment consisting in twisting<BR>straw round the limbs of a criminal<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0543-b" target="_blank">Page0543-b+ 53</a>]<BR>and then setting it on fire.<BR>--अंबु n.<BR>--उदकं, --उत्थं sour rice-gruel or<BR>barley gruel.<BR>--ग्रहः, --सारः fire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0543-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुषार|तुषारः
तुषार a. [तुष्-आरन् किच्च<BR>Uṇ. 3. 139] Cold, frigid, frosty or<BR>dewy; अपां हि तृप्ताय न वारिधारा<BR>स्वादुः सुगंधिः स्वदते तुषारा N. 3. 93;<BR>Śi. 9. 7.<BR>--रः<BR>1 Frost, cold;<BR>Ku. 5. 27.<BR>--2 Ice, snow; Ku. 1. 6;<BR>Rs. 4. 1.<BR>--3 Dew; R. 14. 84; Ś. 5. 19.<BR>--4<BR>Mist, thin rain, spray, especially<BR>of cold water; पृक्तस्तुषारैर्गिरिनिर्झराणां<BR>R. 2. 13; 9. 68; U. 5. 3.<BR>--5 A kind<BR>of camphor.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--अद्रिः, --गिरिः,<BR>--पर्वतः the Himālaya mountain;<BR>ते तुषाराद्रिवाताः Me. 107.<BR>--करः {1} the<BR>moon. {2} camphor.<BR>--कणः a<BR>dewdrop, an icicle, hoar-frost.<BR>--कालः<BR>winter.<BR>--किरणः, --रश्मिः the moon;<BR>Amaru. 49; Śi. 9. 27.<BR>--गौर a. {1}<BR>white as snow. {2} white with snow.<BR>--(रः) camphor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0543-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुषिताः
तुषिताः (m. pl.) A class of<BR>subordinate deities, said to be 12 or<BR>36 in number.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0543-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुष्ट|तुष्टः
तुष्ट, --तुष्टिः See under तुष्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0543-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुष्टिः|तुष्टि
तुष्ट, --तुष्टिः See under तुष्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0543-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुष्टुः|तुष्टु
तुष्टुः A jewel worn in the ears.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0543-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुष्यः|तुष्य
तुष्यः N. of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0543-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुस्
तुस् {c1c} P. (तोसति) To sound.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0543-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुस|तुसः
तुस = तुष q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0543-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुस्तं|तुस्त
तुस्तं<BR>1 Dust.<BR>--2 Husk.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0543-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुहिन|तुहिनं
तुहिन a. [तुह्-इनन् थस्वश्च<BR>Uṇ. 2. 52] Cold, frigid.<BR>--नं<BR>1 Snow,<BR>ice.<BR>--2 Dew or frost;<BR>तृणाग्रलग्नैस्तुहिनैः पतद्भिः Rs. 4. 7, 3. 15.<BR>--3<BR>Moonlight.<BR>--4 Camphor.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--अंशुः, --करः, --किरणः, --गुः, --द्युतिः,<BR>--रश्मिः {1} the moon; Śi. 9. 30. {2}<BR>camphor.<BR>--अचलः, --अद्रिः, --शैलः<BR>the Himālaya mountain; R. 8. 54.<BR>--कणः {1} a dew-drop; Amaru. 54.<BR>{2} a snow-flake.<BR>--शर्करा ice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0543-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तूड्
तूड् {c1c} P. (तूडति)<BR>1 To<BR>disrespect, contemn.<BR>--2 To split.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0543-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तूण्
तूण् {vI.v} {c10c} U. (तूणयति-ते) To<BR>contract. {vII.v} {c10c} A. (तूणयते) To<BR>fill, fill up.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0543-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तूणः|तूण
तूणः [तूण्-कर्मणि घज्] A quiver;<BR>मिलितशिलीमुखपाटलिपटलकृतस्मरतूणविलासे Gīt. 1; R. 7. 57.<BR>--णी<BR>1 An<BR>internal disease by which the anus<BR>and the bladder become painfully<BR>affected.<BR>--2 The indigo plant.<BR>--3<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0543-c" target="_blank">Page0543-c+ 54</a>]<BR>A quiver; R. 9. 56; U. 4. 20;<BR>Mv. 1. 18.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--धरः --धारः an archer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0543-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तूणिः|तूणि
तूणिः, तूणीरः --रं A quiver.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0543-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तूणीरः|तूणीर|तूणीरं
तूणिः, तूणीरः --रं A quiver.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0543-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तूणीरं|तूणीर|तूणीरः
तूणिः, तूणीरः --रं A quiver.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0543-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तूतुजान
तूतुजान a. Ved. Quick, eager(क्षिप्र)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0543-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तूतुम
तूतुम a. Quick, active;<BR>Rv. 10. 50. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0543-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तूदः|तूद
तूदः The cotton tree.<BR>--दी N. of<BR>a country.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0543-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तूपरः|तूपर
तूपरः Ved. A hornless beast,<BR>particularly a goat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0543-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तूबरः|तूबर
तूबरः<BR>1 A beardless man.<BR>--2 A<BR>bull without horns.<BR>--3 Astringent<BR>flavour.<BR>--4 A eunuch.<BR>--री A<BR>fragrant earth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0543-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तूय
तूय a. Ved. Quick.<BR>--यं Water.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0543-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तूर्
तूर् {c4c} A. (तूर्यते, तूर्ण)<BR>1 To go<BR>quickly, make haste.<BR>--2 To hurt,<BR>kill.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0543-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तूर|तूरं
तूर a.<BR>1 Hastening.<BR>--2 A courier.<BR>--रा Speed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0543-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तूरं|तूर
तूरं A kind of musical<BR>instrument.<BR>--री A thorn-apple.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0543-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तूर्ण|तूर्णं|तूर्ण्ण
तूर्ण, तूर्णि &c. See under त्वर्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0543-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तूर्णि|तूर्णिः
तूर्ण, तूर्णि &c. See under त्वर्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0543-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तूर्यः|तूर्य|तूर्यं|तूर्य्य|तूर्य्यं
तूर्यः, --र्यं [तूर्यते ताड्यते तूर्-यत्] A<BR>kind of musical instrument;<BR>Ms. 7. 225; Ku. 7. 10.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--ओघः a<BR>band of instruments.<BR>--खंडः a sort<BR>of tabor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0543-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तूर्यं|तूर्य|तूर्यः|तूर्य्य|तूर्य्यं
तूर्यः, --र्यं [तूर्यते ताड्यते तूर्-यत्] A<BR>kind of musical instrument;<BR>Ms. 7. 225; Ku. 7. 10.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--ओघः a<BR>band of instruments.<BR>--खंडः a sort<BR>of tabor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0543-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तूर्वयाण
तूर्वयाण, तूर्वि a. Quick, rapid.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0543-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तूर्वि
तूर्वयाण, तूर्वि a. Quick, rapid.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0543-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तूल्
तूल् {vI.v} {c10c} A. (तूलयते) To fill.<BR>{vII.v} {c1c} P. (तूलति)<BR>1 To ascertain<BR>the quantity or weight of.<BR>--2 To<BR>weigh, measure.<BR>--3 To drive out.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0543-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तूलः|तूल|तूलं
तूलः --लं [तूल्-अच्] Cotton.<BR>--लं<BR>1 The atmosphere, sky, air.<BR>--2 A tuft of grass.<BR>--3 The<BR>mulberry.<BR>--4 The panicle of a flower or<BR>plant.<BR>--5 The thorn-apple.<BR>--ला<BR>1<BR>The cotton tree.<BR>--2 The wick of a<BR>lamp.<BR>--ली<BR>1 Cotton.<BR>--2 The wick<BR>of a lamp.<BR>--3 A weaver's fibrous<BR>stick or brush.<BR>--4 A painter's<BR>brush.<BR>--5 The Indigo plant.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--कार्मुकं, --धनुस् n. a cotton-bow,<BR>i. e. a bow used for cleaning cotton.<BR>--नाली (लिः) f.,<BR>--नालिका a thick<BR>roll of cotton drawn out in spinning.<BR>--पिचुः cotton.<BR>--शर्करा a seed of<BR>the cotton plant.<BR>--सेचनं the act of<BR>spinning.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0543-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तूलं|तूल|तूलः
तूलः --लं [तूल्-अच्] Cotton.<BR>--लं<BR>1 The atmosphere, sky, air.<BR>--2 A tuft of grass.<BR>--3 The<BR>mulberry.<BR>--4 The panicle of a flower or<BR>plant.<BR>--5 The thorn-apple.<BR>--ला<BR>1<BR>The cotton tree.<BR>--2 The wick of a<BR>lamp.<BR>--ली<BR>1 Cotton.<BR>--2 The wick<BR>of a lamp.<BR>--3 A weaver's fibrous<BR>stick or brush.<BR>--4 A painter's<BR>brush.<BR>--5 The Indigo plant.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--कार्मुकं, --धनुस् n. a cotton-bow,<BR>i. e. a bow used for cleaning cotton.<BR>--नाली (लिः) f.,<BR>--नालिका a thick<BR>roll of cotton drawn out in spinning.<BR>--पिचुः cotton.<BR>--शर्करा a seed of<BR>the cotton plant.<BR>--सेचनं the act of<BR>spinning.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0543-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तूलकं|तूलक
तूलकं Cotton.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0543-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तूलिः|तूलि
तूलिः f. A painter's brush.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--फला the silk-cotton tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0543-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तूलिका
तूलिका<BR>1 A painter's brush; a<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0544-a" target="_blank">Page0544-a+ 54</a>]<BR>pencil; उन्मीलितं तूलिकयवे चित्रं<BR>Ku. 1. 32.<BR>--2 A wick of cotton either<BR>for a lamp or for applying<BR>unguents.<BR>--3 A mattress filled with<BR>cotton, a down or cotton-bed.<BR>--4 A<BR>boring instrument, probing-rod.<BR>--5 An ingot mould.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0543-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तूलिनी
तूलिनी = तूलिफला above.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0544-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तूवर|तूवरः
तूवर = तूबर q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0544-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तूवरक
तूवरक a. Unmanly, eunuch.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0544-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तूष्
तूष् {c1c} P.<BR>1 To be satisfied.<BR>--2 To<BR>satisfy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0544-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तूषः|तूष
तूषः Ved. The border of a<BR>garment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0544-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तूष्णीक|तूष्णीकः
तूष्णीक a. Silent, taciturn.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0544-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तूष्णीम्
तूष्णीम् ind. [तुष् बा˚ नीम् स्वरादि]<BR>In silence, silently, quickly,<BR>without speaking or noise; किं<BR>भवांस्तूष्णीमास्ते V. 2; न योत्स्य इति<BR>गोविंदमुक्त्वा तूष्णीं बभूव ह Bg. 2. 9.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--भावः silence, taciturnity.<BR>--शील<BR>a. silent, taciturn.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0544-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तूस्तं|तूस्त
तूस्तं [तुस् बा˚ तान् दीर्घश्च]<BR>1 Matted hair.<BR>--2 Dust.<BR>--3<BR>Sin.<BR>--4 An atom, any minute<BR>particle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0544-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तृंह्
तृंह् {c6c} P. (तृंहति) To kill, hurt;<BR>see तृह्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0544-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तृंहणं|तृंहण
तृंहणं Hurting, killing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0544-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तृंढ
तृंढ a. Hurt, injured, killed; see<BR>तृह्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0544-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तृक्ष्
तृक्ष् {c1c} P. (तृक्षति) To go, move.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0544-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तृक्षः|तृक्ष
तृक्षः N. of the sage Kaśyapa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0544-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तृखं|तृख
तृखं Nutmeg.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0544-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तृण्
तृण् {c8c} U. (तृणोति-तृणुते or तर्णोति<BR>तर्णुते) To eat, grass graze.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0544-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तृणं|तृण
तृणं [तृह्-नक् हलोपश्च Uṇ. 5. 8]<BR>1 Grass in general; किं जीर्णं तृणमत्ति<BR>मानमहतामग्रेसरः केसरी Bh. 2. 29.<BR>--2 A<BR>blade of grass, reed, straw.<BR>--3<BR>Anything made of straw (as a mat for<BR>sitting); often used as a symbol of<BR>worthlessness or uselessness;<BR>तृणमिवलघुलक्ष्मीनैव तान्संरुणाद्धि Bh. 2. 17; see तृणीकृ<BR>also.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--अग्निः {1} a fire of<BR>chaff or straw; Ms. 3. 168. {2} fire<BR>quickly extinguished. {3} burning<BR>a criminal by twisting straw round<BR>his body and then setting it on fire.<BR>--अंजनः a chameleon.<BR>--अटवी a<BR>forest abounding in grass.<BR>--अन्नं<BR>rice growing wild.<BR>--असृज् n.,<BR>--कुंकुमं, --गौरं a variety of perfume.<BR>--आवर्तः a whirlwind.<BR>--इंद्रः the<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0544-b" target="_blank">Page0544-b+ 56</a>]<BR>palmyra tree.<BR>--उल्का a torch of<BR>hay, a fire-brand made of straw.<BR>--ओकस् n. a hut of straw.<BR>--कांडः,<BR>--डं a heap of grass.<BR>--कुटी, --कुटीरकं a<BR>hut of straw.<BR>--कूटं a heap of straw.<BR>--केतुः {1} the palmyra tree. {2} a<BR>bamboo.<BR>--गोधा a kind of<BR>chameleon.<BR>--ग्राहिन् m. a sapphire.<BR>--चरः<BR>a kind of gem (गोमेद).<BR>--जलायुका,<BR>--जलूका a caterpillar.<BR>--जंभन् a.<BR>feeding on grass.<BR>--जातिः f. grass<BR>kind, the vegetable kingdom.<BR>--ज्योतिस् n. the plant called<BR>ज्योतिष्मती.<BR>--द्रुमः {1} the palm tree. {2} the<BR>cocoa-nut tree. {3} the betel-nut<BR>tree. {4} the Ketaka tree. {5} the<BR>date-tree.<BR>--धान्यं grain growing<BR>wild or without cultivation.<BR>--ध्वजः<BR>{1} the palmyra tree. {2} a bamboo.<BR>--पीडं hand-to-hand fighting.<BR>--पूली a mat, seat made of reeds.<BR>--प्राय<BR>a. worth a straw, worthless,<BR>insignificant.<BR>--बिंदुः N. of a sage;<BR>R. 8. 79.<BR>--मणिः a sort of gem (amber).<BR>--मत्कुणः a bail or surety<BR>(perhaps a wrong reading for<BR>ऋणमत्कुण).<BR>--राज् m. the vine palm.<BR>--राजः {1} the cocoa-nut tree. {2} the<BR>bamboo. {3} the sugarcane. {4}<BR>the palmyra tree.<BR>--वृक्षः {1} the<BR>fanpalm tree. {2} the date-tree. {3} the<BR>cocoa-nut tree. {4} the areca-nut<BR>tree.<BR>--शीतं a kind of fragrant grass.<BR>--शून्यं N. of two plants केतकां<BR>and मल्लिका.<BR>--सारा the plantain tree.<BR>--सिंहः an axe.<BR>--हर्म्यः a house of<BR>straw.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0544-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तृणकं|तृणक
तृणकं Grass, a worthless blade of<BR>grass.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0544-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तृणकीया
तृणकीया A grassy place.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0544-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तृणीकृ
तृणीकृ {c8c} U.<BR>1 To make light of,<BR>look down upon, treat with<BR>contempt; U. 6. 19.<BR>--2 (Hence) To<BR>eclipse, obscure; जगाद वक्त्रेण<BR>तृणीकृतेंदुः N. 3. 54.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0544-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तृण्या
तृण्या A heap of grass or straw.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0544-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तृतीय|तृतीयः
तृतीय a. The third.<BR>--यं A third<BR>part.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--प्रकृतिः m. or f. {1} a<BR>eunuch. {2} the neuter gender.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0544-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तृतीयक
तृतीयक a.<BR>1 Recurring every<BR>third day, tertian (as a fever).<BR>--2<BR>Occurring for the third time.<BR>--3 The<BR>third.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0544-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तृतीया
तृतीया<BR>1 The third day of a lunar<BR>fortnight.<BR>--2 (In gram.) The<BR>instrumental case or its terminations.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0544-c" target="_blank">Page0544-c+ 56</a>]<BR>--Comp.<BR>--कृत a. thrice ploughed<BR>(as a field).<BR>--तत्पुरुषः the<BR>instrumental Tatpuruṣa.<BR>--प्रकृतिः m., f.<BR>{1} a cunuch. {2} a hermaphrodite.<BR>{3} the neuter gender.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0544-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तृतीयिन्
तृतीयिन् a.<BR>1 Entitled to a third<BR>portion (of inheritance &c.).<BR>--2<BR>Occupying the third rank.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0544-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तृद्
तृद् {c1c} P., {c7c} U. (तर्दति, तृणत्ति, तृंत्ते,<BR>तृण्ण)<BR>1 To cleave, split, pierce.<BR>--2<BR>To kill, destroy, annihilate;<BR>Bk. 6. 38, 14. 13, 108; 15. 36, 44.<BR>--3 To<BR>set free.<BR>--4 To disregard.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0544-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तृप्
तृप् {vI.v} {c4c} {c5c} {c6c} P. (तृप्यति, तृप्नोति,<BR>तृपति, तृप्त)<BR>1 To become satisfied, be<BR>pleased or contented; अद्य तर्प्स्यंति<BR>मांसादाः Bk. 16. 29; प्राशीन्न चातृपत्<BR>क्रूरः 15. 29; (usually with instr.;<BR>but sometimes with gen. or loc.<BR>also); कोन तृप्यति वित्तेन H. 2. 174.<BR>तृप्तस्तत्पिशितने Bh. 2. 84; नाग्निरतृप्य,<BR>ति काष्टानां नापगानां महोदधिः ।<BR>नांतकसर्वभूतानां न पुंसां वामलोचना ॥<BR>Pt. 1. 137; तस्मिन्हि ततृपुर्देवास्तते यज्ञे Mb.<BR>--2 To please, gratify. --Caus. To<BR>gratify, please. --Desid. तितृप्सति, ति<BR>तपिंषति. {vII.v} {c1c} P., {c10c} U. (तर्पति,<BR>तर्पयति-ते)<BR>1 To light up, kindle.<BR>--2 (Atm.)<BR>To be satisfied.<BR>--3 To please, satisfy.<BR>--4 To gladden, refresh, reanimate,<BR>U. 3. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0544-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तर्पण|तर्पणं
तर्पण a. [तृप्-णिच् वा ल्युट्]<BR>Satisfying, pleasing, refreshing.<BR>--णं<BR>1 Pleasing, satisfying.<BR>--2<BR>Satisfaction, pleasure.<BR>--3 Satiety,<BR>fulness.<BR>--4 One of the five daily<BR>Yajñas (performed by men),<BR>presenting libations of water to the<BR>Manes of the deceased ancestors<BR>(पितृयज्ञ).<BR>--5 Fuel for the sacred<BR>fire.<BR>--6 Food.<BR>--7 Filling the eyes<BR>with oil &c.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--इच्छुः an<BR>epithet of Bhīṣma.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0544-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तर्पित
तर्पित a. Pleased, gratified.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0544-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तर्पिन्
तर्पिन् a.<BR>1 Gratifying.<BR>--2<BR>Offering libations to the Manes of<BR>deceased ancestors.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0544-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तृपत्
तृपत् Ā. Ved.<BR>1 The moon.<BR>--2 A<BR>parasol.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0544-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तृप्त|तृप्तः
तृप्त a. [तृप्-क्त] Satiated, satisfied,<BR>contented.<BR>--प्तं Satisfaction.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0544-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तृप्तिः|तृप्ति
तृप्तिः f. [तृप्-क्तिन्]<BR>1<BR>Satisfaction, contentment; R. 2. 39, 73;<BR>3. 3; Ms. 3. 271; Bg. 10. 18.<BR>--2<BR>Satiety, disgust.<BR>--3 Pleasure,<BR>gratification.<BR>--4 (Ved.) Water.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0544-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तृप्र|तृप्रः
तृप्र a.<BR>1 Restless, anxious.<BR>--2<BR>Pleased, satisfied.<BR>--3 Pleasing,<BR>satisfying.<BR>--प्रः A sacrificial cake<BR>(पुरोडाश).<BR>--प्रं<BR>1 Ghee or an<BR>oblation thereof.<BR>--2 Suffering, sorrow<BR>(दुःख).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0545-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तृपतः|तृपत
तृपतः The moon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0545-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तृपल|तृपलः
तृपल a.<BR>1 Pleased.<BR>--2<BR>Restless.<BR>--लः A stone.<BR>--ला A creeper.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0545-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तृपुः|तृपु
तृपुः Ved. A thief.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0545-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तृफूः
तृफूः f. The serpent race.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0545-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तृंप्|तृम्प्
तृंप् or तृंफ् = तृप् q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0545-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तृष्
तृष् {c4c} P. (तृष्यति, तृषित)<BR>1 To<BR>be thirsty; Bk. 7. 106, 14. 30;<BR>15. 51.<BR>--2 To wish, wish excessively,<BR>be cager or greedy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0545-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तर्षः|तर्ष
तर्षः [तृष्-भावे घञ्]<BR>1 Thirst.<BR>--2<BR>Desire, wish.<BR>--3 The ocean.<BR>--4<BR>A boat.<BR>--5 The sun.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0545-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तर्षणं|तर्षण
तर्षणं [तृष्-भावे ल्युट्]<BR>1 Thirst.<BR>--2<BR>Desire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0545-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तर्षित|तर्षितः
तर्षित, तर्षुल a.<BR>1 Thirsty.<BR>--2<BR>Wishing, desiring.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0545-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तर्षुल
तर्षित, तर्षुल a.<BR>1 Thirsty.<BR>--2<BR>Wishing, desiring.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0545-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तृष्
तृष् f. [तृष्-संप˚ क्विप्]<BR>1 (nom. sing.<BR>तृट्-ड्) {1} Thirst; तृषा शुष्यत्यास्ये<BR>पिबति सलिलं स्वादु सुरभि<BR>Bh. 3. 92; Rs. 1. 11.<BR>--2 Strong desire,<BR>eagerness.<BR>--3 Desire personified<BR>as the daughter of Kāma.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0545-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तृषा
तृषा See तृष्.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--आर्त a.<BR>suffering from thirst, thirsty.<BR>--भू f. the bladder.<BR>--हं water.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0545-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तृषित|तृषितः
तृषित p. p.<BR>1 Thirsty; Ghaṭ. 9;<BR>Rs. 1. 18.<BR>--2 Greedy, thirsting for,<BR>desirous of gain.<BR>--तं Thirst, desire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0545-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तृषु
तृषु a. Ved.<BR>1 Greedy, thirsting<BR>for.<BR>--2 Quick, speedy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0545-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तृष्णज्
तृष्णज् a. Covetous, greedy,<BR>thirsting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0545-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तृष्णा
तृष्णा [तृष् न किच्च]<BR>1 Thirst (lit.<BR>and fig.); तृष्णां छिनत्त्यात्मनः<BR>H. 1. 171; Rs. 1. 15.<BR>--2 Desire, strong<BR>desire, greed, avidity, desire of<BR>gain; तृष्णां छिंद्धि Bh. 2. 77, 3. 5;<BR>R. 8. 2.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--क्षयः cessation<BR>of desire, tranquillity of mind,<BR>contentment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0545-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तृष्णालु
तृष्णालु a. Very thirsty.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0545-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तृष्य
तृष्य a. To be wished or desired.<BR>--ष्यं Greediness, thirst.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0545-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तृष्ट
तृष्ट a. Ved.<BR>1 Harsh.<BR>--2<BR>Pungent.<BR>--3 Rugged.<BR>--4 Hoarse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0545-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तृह्
तृह् {c7c} P., {c10c} U., {c6c} P. (तृणेढि,<BR>तर्हयति-ते, तृहति, तृढ; desid. तितृक्षति, तितर्हिषति,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0545-b" target="_blank">Page0545-b+ 56</a>]<BR>तितृंहिषति) To injure, hurt, kill,<BR>strike; न तृणेह्मीति लोकोऽयं विंत्ते मां<BR>निष्पराक्रमं Bk. 6. 39; (तानि)<BR>तृणिढु रामः सह लक्ष्मणेन 1. 19.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0545-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तॄ
तॄ {c1c} P. (तरति, ततार, अतारीत्,<BR>तरिरी-ष्यति, तीर्ण)<BR>1 To cross over,<BR>cross; केनोडुपेन परलोकनदीं तरिष्ये<BR>Mk. 8. 23; स तीर्त्वा कपिशां R. 4. 38;<BR>Ms. 4. 77.<BR>--2 (a) To cross over,<BR>traverse (as a way); Ku. 7. 48;<BR>Me. 19. (b) To sail across,<BR>navigate (as a river).<BR>--3 To float, swim;<BR>शिला तरिष्यत्युदके न पर्णं Bk. 12. 77.<BR>--4 (a) To get over, surmount,<BR>overcome, overpower; धीरा हि<BR>तरंत्यापदं K. 175; कृच्छ्रं महत्तीर्ण.<BR>R. 14. 6; Pt. 4. 1; Bg. 18. 58;<BR>Ms. 11. 34. (b) To subdue, destroy,<BR>become master of.<BR>--5 To go to the<BR>end of, master completely;<BR>R. 3. 30.<BR>--6 To fulfil, accomplish,<BR>perform (as a promise); दैवात्तीर्णप्रतिज्ञः<BR>Mu. 4. 12.<BR>--7 To be saved or<BR>rescued, escape from; गावो<BR>वर्षभयात्तीर्णा वयं तीर्णा महाभयात् Hariv.<BR>--8 To<BR>acquire, gain.<BR>--9 To move forward<BR>rapidly.<BR>--10 To fill completely,<BR>pervade.<BR>--11 To live through (a<BR>definite period).<BR>--12 To deliver,<BR>liberate from.<BR>--13 To strive together,<BR>compete. --Pass. (तीर्यते) To be<BR>crossed &c. --Caus. (तारयति-ते)<BR>1<BR>To carry or lead over.<BR>--2 To cause<BR>to arrive at.<BR>--3 To save, rescue,<BR>deliver, liberate. --Desid. (तितीर्षति.<BR>तितरिषति, तितरीषति) To wish to cross<BR>&c.; दोर्भ्यां तितीर्षति तरंगवतीभुजंगं<BR>K. P. 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0545-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तर|तरः
तर a. [तॄ-भवे-अप्]<BR>1 Crossing.<BR>--2<BR>Surpassing, excelling.<BR>--3<BR>Conquering, overpowering; cf. दुस्तर.<BR>--रः<BR>1 Passing over, crossing, passage;<BR>Bk. 7. 55.<BR>--2 Freight; दीर्घाध्वनि<BR>यथादेशं यथाकालं तरो भवेत् Ms. 8. 406.<BR>--3 A road.<BR>--4 A ferry-boat.<BR>--5 Fire.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--पण्यं freight.<BR>--पण्यिकः<BR>one who receives the freight.<BR>--स्थानं a landing-place, wharf.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0545-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरणः|तरण|तरणं
तरणः [तॄ-ल्युट्]<BR>1 A boat, raft.<BR>--2 Svarga or heaven.<BR>--णं<BR>1<BR>Crossing over.<BR>--2 Conquering,<BR>overcoming.<BR>--3 An oar.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0545-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरणि|तरणिः
तरणि a. [तॄ-अनि] Ved.<BR>1 Passing<BR>through, pervading (as the sun).<BR>--2 Quick, energetic, unremitting.<BR>--3 Saving, carrying over, benevolent<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0545-c" target="_blank">Page0545-c+ 56</a>]<BR>--णिः<BR>1 The sun.<BR>--2 A ray of light<BR>--3<BR>The Arka plant.<BR>--4 Copper.<BR>--णिः,<BR>--णी f. A raft, boat.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--धन्यः<BR>an epithet of Śiva.<BR>--पेटकः an oval<BR>bowl of wood for baling a boat.<BR>--रत्नं a ruby.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0545-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरंडः|तरण्ड|तरंड|तरंडं|तरण्डः
तरंडः, --डा, --डी, --डं [तॄ-अंडच्] A boat.<BR>--डः, --डं<BR>1 A raft or float made of<BR>bamboos tied together and floated<BR>on jars or inverted hollow gourds.<BR>--2 The float of a fishing line.<BR>--3<BR>An oar.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--पादा a kind of boat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0545-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरंडा
तरंडः, --डा, --डी, --डं [तॄ-अंडच्] A boat.<BR>--डः, --डं<BR>1 A raft or float made of<BR>bamboos tied together and floated<BR>on jars or inverted hollow gourds.<BR>--2 The float of a fishing line.<BR>--3<BR>An oar.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--पादा a kind of boat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0545-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरंडी
तरंडः, --डा, --डी, --डं [तॄ-अंडच्] A boat.<BR>--डः, --डं<BR>1 A raft or float made of<BR>bamboos tied together and floated<BR>on jars or inverted hollow gourds.<BR>--2 The float of a fishing line.<BR>--3<BR>An oar.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--पादा a kind of boat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0545-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरंडं|तरण्ड|तरंड|तरंडः|तरण्डः
तरंडः, --डा, --डी, --डं [तॄ-अंडच्] A boat.<BR>--डः, --डं<BR>1 A raft or float made of<BR>bamboos tied together and floated<BR>on jars or inverted hollow gourds.<BR>--2 The float of a fishing line.<BR>--3<BR>An oar.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--पादा a kind of boat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0545-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरण्यति
तरण्यति Den. P. To cross over.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0545-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरद्
तरद् f. [तॄ-करणे अदि]<BR>1 A boat.<BR>--2 A kind of duck (कारंडव).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0545-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरंती
तरंती A boat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0545-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरिः|तरि
तरिः --रीः f. [तॄ करणे इ]<BR>1 A boat;<BR>जीर्णा तरिः सरिदतीव गभीरनीरा Udb.;<BR>Śi. 3. 76.<BR>--2 A box for clothes.<BR>--3<BR>The end or hem of a garment.<BR>--री<BR>1 A small wooden baling-vessel.<BR>--2<BR>A club.<BR>--3 Smoke.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--रथः<BR>an oar, a paddle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0545-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरीः
तरिः --रीः f. [तॄ करणे इ]<BR>1 A boat;<BR>जीर्णा तरिः सरिदतीव गभीरनीरा Udb.;<BR>Śi. 3. 76.<BR>--2 A box for clothes.<BR>--3<BR>The end or hem of a garment.<BR>--री<BR>1 A small wooden baling-vessel.<BR>--2<BR>A club.<BR>--3 Smoke.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--रथः<BR>an oar, a paddle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0545-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरिकः|तरिक
तरिकः [तराय तरणाय हितः बा˚ ठन्]<BR>1 A ferry-man.<BR>--2 A float, raft.<BR>--का<BR>1 A boat.<BR>--2 Cream.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0545-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरिकिन्
तरिकिन् m. A ferry-man.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0545-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरित्रं|तरित्र
तरित्रं, तरित्री, तरिणी A boat, ship.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0545-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरित्री
तरित्रं, तरित्री, तरिणी A boat, ship.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0545-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरिणी
तरित्रं, तरित्री, तरिणी A boat, ship.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0545-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरीषः|तरीष
तरीषः [तॄ-ईषन्]<BR>1 A boat, raft.<BR>--2 The ocean.<BR>--3 A fit or<BR>competent person.<BR>--4 Heaven.<BR>--5 Work,<BR>business, practice, profession.<BR>--6<BR>A fine shape or form.<BR>--7<BR>Decorating, ornamenting.<BR>--8 Dry cow-dung.<BR>--षी N of a daughter of Indra.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0545-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तारक|तारकं|तारकः
तारक a. (रिका f.) [तॄ-णिच् ण्वुल]<BR>1 Carrying over.<BR>--2 Protecting,<BR>preserving, rescuing.<BR>--3 Helping<BR>another through a difficulty.<BR>--कः<BR>1<BR>A pilot, helmsman.<BR>--2 A deliverer,<BR>saviour.<BR>--3 N. of Śiva.<BR>--कः, --कं A<BR>boat, raft.<BR>--कं<BR>1 The pupil of the<BR>eye.<BR>--2 The eye (also f.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0545-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तारण|तारणः
तारण a. [तारयत्यनेन तॄ-ल्युट्]<BR>1<BR>Enabling to cross.<BR>--2 Saving,<BR>delivering, liberating.<BR>--3 Helping one<BR>through a difficulty &c.<BR>--णः<BR>1 N.<BR>of Śiva; also of Viṣṇu.<BR>--2 A boat,<BR>raft.<BR>--णं<BR>1 Crossing.<BR>--2<BR>Conquering.<BR>--3 Carrying or conveying<BR>across.<BR>--4 Rescuing, delivering,<BR>liberating.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0545-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तारणिः|तारणि
तारणिः, --णी A float, raft.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0545-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तारणी
तारणिः, --णी A float, raft.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0545-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तारिकं|तारिक
तारिकं Fare, freight.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0545-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तारित
तारित p. p. Made to cross,<BR>conveyed across, saved, rescued.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0545-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तारिन्
तारिन् a. [तॄ-णिच्-णिनि] Enabling<BR>to cross, saving, delivering.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0546-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तार्य|तार्य्य
तार्य a. [तॄ कर्मणि ण्यत्]<BR>1 To be<BR>crossed, passable.<BR>--2 To be<BR>conquered or defeated.<BR>--र्यं Fare, freight,<BR>toll.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0546-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तितीर्षा
तितीर्षा<BR>1 Desire to cross over.<BR>--2<BR>Desire of final emancipation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0546-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तितीर्षु
तितीर्षु a.<BR>1 Desirous of crossing;<BR>R. 1. 3.<BR>--2 Wishing to attain.<BR>--3<BR>Desirous of final emancipation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0546-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तीर्ण|तीर्णः
तीर्ण p. p. [तॄ-क्त]<BR>1 Crossed, passed<BR>over.<BR>--2 Spread, expanded.<BR>--3<BR>Surpassed, excelled.<BR>--4 Gone down to<BR>bathe, bathed.<BR>--5 Defeated,<BR>conquered, overcome; see तॄ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0546-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तेज्
तेज् {c1c} P. (तेजति) To guard,<BR>defend, protect.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0546-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तेजः|तेज
तेजः, तेजनं See under तिज्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0546-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तेजनं|तेजन|तेजनः
तेजः, तेजनं See under तिज्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0546-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तेजलः|तेजल
तेजलः The francoline partridge.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0546-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तेजस्
तेजस् n. [तिज्-भावे करुणादौ असुन्]<BR>1 Sharpness.<BR>--2 The sharp edge (of<BR>a knife &c.).<BR>--3 The point or top<BR>of a flame.<BR>--4 Heat, glow, glare.<BR>--5<BR>Lustre, light, brilliance, splendour;<BR>R. 4. 1; Bg. 7. 9, 10. 30.<BR>--6 Heat<BR>or light considered as the third of<BR>the five elements of creation (the<BR>other four being पृथिवी, अप्, वायु, and<BR>आकाश).<BR>--7 The bright appearance of<BR>the human body, beauty; R. 3. 15.<BR>--8 Fire of energy; Ś. 2. 7,<BR>U. 6. 14.<BR>--9 Might, prowess, strength,<BR>courage, valour, martial or heroic<BR>lustre; तेजस्तेजसि शाम्यतु U. 5. 7;<BR>Ś. 7. 15.<BR>--10 One possessed of heroic<BR>lustre; तेजसां हि न वयः ससीक्ष्यते<BR>R. 11. 1; Pt. 1. 328, 3. 33.<BR>--11<BR>Spirit, energy.<BR>--12 Strength of<BR>character, not bearing insult or<BR>ill-treatment with impunity.<BR>--13 Majestic<BR>lustre, majesty, dignity, authority,<BR>consequence; तेजोविशेषानुमितां (<BR>राजलक्ष्मीं) दधानः R. 2. 7.<BR>--14 Semen,<BR>seed, semen virile; स्याद्रक्षणीयं यदि<BR>मे न तेजः R. 14. 65; 2. 75;<BR>दुष्यंतेनाहितं तेजो दधानां भूतये भुवः Ś. 4. 3.<BR>--15 The essential nature of any<BR>thing.<BR>--16 Essence, quint-essence.<BR>--17 Spiritual, moral, or magical<BR>power.<BR>--18 Fire.<BR>--19 Marrow.<BR>--20<BR>Bile.<BR>--21 The speed of a horse.<BR>--22<BR>Fresh butter.<BR>--23 Gold.<BR>--24<BR>Clearness of the eyes.<BR>--25 A shining or<BR>luminous body, light; Ku. 1. 51,<BR>Ś. 4. 2.<BR>--26 The heating and<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0546-b" target="_blank">Page0546-b+ 55</a>]<BR>strengthening faculty of the human frame<BR>seated in the bile (पित्त).<BR>--27 The<BR>brain.<BR>--28 Violence, fierceness.<BR>--29<BR>Impatience.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--कर a. {1}<BR>illuminating. {2} granting vital power<BR>or strength.<BR>--बीजं marrow.<BR>--भंगः<BR>{1} disgrace, destruction of dignity.<BR>{2} depression, discouragement.<BR>--मंडलं a halo of light.<BR>--मूर्तिः the sun.<BR>--रूपं {1} the Supreme Spirit,<BR>Brahman. {2} the nature of light.<BR>--वृत्तं<BR>{1} noble behaviour. {2} superior<BR>power or lustre.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0546-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तेजस्वत्|तेजस्वन्त्
तेजस्वत्, तेजोवत् a.<BR>1 Bright,<BR>brilliant, splendid.<BR>--2 Sharp, pungent.<BR>--3 Brave, heroic.<BR>--4 Energetic.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0546-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तेजोवत्|तेजोवन्त्
तेजस्वत्, तेजोवत् a.<BR>1 Bright,<BR>brilliant, splendid.<BR>--2 Sharp, pungent.<BR>--3 Brave, heroic.<BR>--4 Energetic.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0546-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तेजस्विन्
तेजस्विन् a. (नी f.)<BR>1 Brilliant,<BR>bright.<BR>--2 Powerful, heroic, strong;<BR>U. 6. 14; Ki. 16. 16.<BR>--3 Dignified,<BR>noble.<BR>--4 Famous, illustrious.<BR>--5<BR>Violent.<BR>--6 Haughty.<BR>--7 Lawful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0546-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तेजित|तेजितः
तेजित a.<BR>1 Sharpened, whetted.<BR>--2 Excited, stimulated, prompted.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0546-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तेजोमय
तेजोमय a.<BR>1 Glorious.<BR>--2 Bright,<BR>brilliant, luminous; Bg. 11. 47.<BR>--3<BR>Full of energy, spirited.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0546-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तेनः|तेन
तेनः A note introductory to a<BR>song.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0546-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तेप्
तेप् {c1c} A. (तेपते)<BR>1 To sprinkle.<BR>--2 To ooze, drop.<BR>--3 To shake,<BR>tremble.<BR>--4 To shine.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0546-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तेमः|तेम
तेमः [तिम्-घञ्] Becoming wet or<BR>moist, moisture.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0546-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तेमनं|तेमन
तेमनं<BR>1 Wetting, moistening.<BR>--2<BR>Moisture.<BR>--3 A sauce, condiment.<BR>--नी A fireplace.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0546-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तेव्
तेव् {c1c} A. (तेवते)<BR>1 To play, sport.<BR>--2 To weep, lament.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0546-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तेवनं|तेवन
तेवनं<BR>1 Play, pastime.<BR>--2 A<BR>pleasure-garden, play-ground.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0546-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तैक्ष्ण्यं|तैक्ष्ण्य
तैक्ष्ण्यं<BR>1 Sharpness(of a knife),<BR>acuteness.<BR>--2 Pungency.<BR>--3<BR>Fierceness, severity, cruelty.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0546-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तैजस|तैजसं|तैजसः
तैजस a. (सी f.) [तेजसो विकारः अण्]<BR>1 Bright, splendid, luminous;<BR>U. 2. 12.<BR>--2 Made up or consisting of<BR>light; तैजसस्य धनुषः प्रवृत्तये<BR>R. 11. 43.<BR>--3 Metallic.<BR>--4 Passionate.<BR>--5<BR>Vigorous, energetic.<BR>--6 Powerful,<BR>intense.<BR>--सः The highly refined or<BR>subtle essence (Vedānta phil.).<BR>--सं<BR>1 Any metal.<BR>--2 Ghee.<BR>--3<BR>Intensity, severity.<BR>--4 Vigour, energy,<BR>might.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--आवर्तनी a<BR>crucible.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0546-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तैतिक्ष
तैतिक्ष a. (क्षी f.) Patient,<BR>enduring.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0546-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तैतिरः|तैतिर
तैतिरः A partridge.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0546-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तैतिलः|तैतिल|तैतिलं
तैतिलः<BR>1 A rhinoceros.<BR>--2 A<BR>god.<BR>--लं N. of the fourth<BR>astronomical period or करण.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0546-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तैत्तिरः|तैत्तिर|तैत्तिरं
तैत्तिरः<BR>1 A partridge.<BR>--2 A<BR>rhinoceros.<BR>--रं A flock of partridges.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0546-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तैत्तिरिकः|तैत्तिरिक
