तैलिनी
तैलिनी The wick of a lamp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0546-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तैलीनं|तैलीन
तैलीनं A field of sesamum.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0546-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तैलंगः|तैलङ्ग|तैलंग|तैलङ्गः
तैलंगः N. of a country, the<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0547-a" target="_blank">Page0547-a+ 55</a>]<BR>modern Telangaṇa or Carnatic.<BR>--गाः<BR>(pl.) The people of this country.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0546-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तैषः|तैष
तैषः N. of the lunar month<BR>Pauṣa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0547-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तोकं|तोक
तोकं An offspring, a child;<BR>व्याकरणे शकटस्य च तोकं Nir.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0547-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

