दरोदर|दरोदरं|दरोदरः
दरोदर<BR>1 A gamester.<BR>--2 A<BR>stake at play.<BR>--रं<BR>1 Gambling.<BR>--2 A die, dice; see दुरोदर.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0558-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दर्दर|दर्दरः|दर्द्दरः
