दर्भः|दर्भ
दर्भः [दृभ्-घञ् अच् वा] A kind of<BR>sacred grass (Kuśa grass) used at<BR>sacrificial ceremonies &c.; Ś. 1. 7;<BR>R. 11. 31; Ms. 2. 43, 3. 208, 4. 36.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--अंकुरः a pointed blade of<BR>darbha grass; Ś. 2. 12.<BR>--अनूपः a<BR>watery place full of darbha grass.<BR>--आह्वयः the Munja grass.<BR>--पत्रं a<BR>kind of grass (काश).<BR>--संस्तरः a bed<BR>of Kuśa grass.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0558-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दर्भटं|दर्भट
दर्भटं A private apartment, a<BR>retired room.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0558-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दर्म|दर्म्म
