दर्वः|दर्व|दर्व्वः
दर्वः [दॄ-व]<BR>1 A mischievous or<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0559-a" target="_blank">Page0559-a+ 55</a>]<BR>harmful person (हिंस्र).<BR>--2 A<BR>demon, goblin.<BR>--3 A ladle.<BR>--4<BR>Injury, hurt.<BR>--5 The hood of a snake.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0558-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दर्वटः|दर्वट|दर्व्वट|दर्व्वटः
