दांड|दाण्ड
दांड a. (डी f.) Relating to a stick<BR>or punishment.<BR>--डा A kind of game<BR>with sticks.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0562-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दांडाजिनिक|दाण्डाजिनिक|दाण्डाजिनिकः
दांडाजिनिक a. (की f.) Carrying<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0563-a" target="_blank">Page0563-a+ 54</a>]<BR>a staff and hide (as mere outward<BR>signs of religious devotion).<BR>--कः<BR>A cheat, hypocrite, impostor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0562-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दांडिकः|दाण्डिक|दांडिक|दाण्डिकः
