दानु|दानुः
दाक, दाति, दातृ, दानं, दानु, &c. See<BR>under दा.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0563-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दात्यूहः|दात्यूह
दात्यूहः<BR>1 The gallinule;<BR>दात्यूहैस्तिनिशस्य कोटरवति स्कंधे निलीय स्थितं<BR>Māl. 9. 7.<BR>--2 The Cātaka bird.<BR>--3<BR>A cloud.<BR>--4 A water-crow. (Written<BR>also दात्यौह).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0563-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दादः|दाद
दादः [दद्-घञ्] A gift, donation.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--दः a donor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0563-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दाधिक|दाधिकं
दाधिक a. (की f.)<BR>1 Made of or<BR>from, or mixed or sprinkled with,<BR>coagulated milk.<BR>--2 Carrying about<BR>or selling coagulated milk.<BR>--3<BR>Eating anything with coagulated milk.<BR>--कं A kind of broth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0563-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दान्
दान् {c1c} U. (दानति-ते) To cut,<BR>divide. --Desid. (दीदांसति-ते) To make<BR>straight; (desid. in form, but not in<BR>sense).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0563-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दानवः|दानव
दानवः [दनोरपत्यं अण्] A demon,<BR>Rākṣasa; त्रिदिवमुद्धृतदानवकंटकं<BR>Ś. 7. 3.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--अरिः {1} a god.<BR>{2} an epithet of Viṣṇu.<BR>--गुरुः<BR>an epithet of Śukra.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0563-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दानवेयः|दानवेय
दानवेयः = दानव q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0563-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दांत|दान्त|दान्तः
