दार्वटं|दार्वट|दार्व्वट|दार्व्वटं
दार्वटं A council-house, court; (a<BR>word derived from the Persian).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0564-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दार्शनिकः|दार्शनिक
दार्शनिकः One familiar with<BR>the Darśanas or systems of<BR>philosophy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0564-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दार्षद|दार्षदः
