दाह, दाहक, दाहन, दाह्य, &c. See<BR>under दह्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0564-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दिक्कः|दिक्क
दिक्कः A young elephant (करभ)<BR>twenty years old.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0564-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

