धर्णसि
धर्णस, --सि, धर्णि a. Ved.<BR>1<BR>Supporting.<BR>--2 Strong, able.<BR>--3 Durable,<BR>firm.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0592-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

धर्णि
धर्णस, --सि, धर्णि a. Ved.<BR>1<BR>Supporting.<BR>--2 Strong, able.<BR>--3 Durable,<BR>firm.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0592-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

धर्तृ|धर्त्तृ
