धानाकाः
धानाकाः f. pl.<BR>1 Grain, corn.<BR>--2<BR>Fried barley or parched rice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0595-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

