निंदनं|निन्दन|निंदन|निन्दनं
निंदनं, निंदा [निंद्-भावे-ल्युट् अ वा]<BR>1<BR>Blame, censure, reproof, reproach,<BR>abuse, reviling, defamation;<BR>व्याजस्तुतिर्मुखे निंदा K. P. 10; पर˚, वेद˚.<BR>--2<BR>Injury, wickedness.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--स्तुतिः<BR>f. {1} ironical praise, irony. {2}<BR>overt praise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0622-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

