निपीतिः|निपीति
निपीतिः f. Drinking.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0623-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निपाकः|निपाक
निपाकः Maturing, ripening.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0623-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निपादः|निपाद
निपादः Ved.<BR>1 Low ground.<BR>--2<BR>High and low ground.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0623-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निपीड्
निपीड् {c10c} U.<BR>1 To harass, pain,<BR>molest, injure, punish, trouble;<BR>Ms. 7. 23.<BR>--2 To press together, squeeze.<BR>--3 To seize, grasp, hold fast,<BR>embrace; गुरोः सदारस्य निपीड्य पादौ<BR>R. 2. 23, 5. 65.<BR>--4 To impress.<BR>--5 To<BR>eclipse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0623-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निपीडनं|निपीडन
निपीडनं<BR>1 Squeezing, pressing;<BR>Śi. 1. 74, 13. 11.<BR>--2 Hurting,<BR>injuring.<BR>--ना Oppression, hurt, injury.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0623-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निपीडित
