निर्झरः --रं A spring, waterfall,<BR>cataract, cascade, mountain-torrent;<BR>शीतं निर्झरवारि पानं Nāg. 4; R. 2. 13;<BR>Śānti. 2. 17, 21; 4. 6.<BR>--रः<BR>1<BR>Burning chaff.<BR>--2 An elephant.<BR>--3 A<BR>horse of the sun.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0632-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्झरिन्
