निर्झरिणी, निर्झरी A river,<BR>mountaintorrent; स्खलनमुखरभूरिस्रोतसो<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0632-c" target="_blank">Page0632-c+ 56</a>]<BR>निर्झरिण्यः U. 2. 20; Mv. 5. 40.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0632-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्झरी
निर्झरिणी, निर्झरी A river,<BR>mountaintorrent; स्खलनमुखरभूरिस्रोतसो<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0632-c" target="_blank">Page0632-c+ 56</a>]<BR>निर्झरिण्यः U. 2. 20; Mv. 5. 40.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0632-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

