परिकांक्षितः A religious<BR>mendicant or ascetic, a devotee.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0671-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिकूटं|परिकूट
परिकूटं A barrier, a trench<BR>before the gate of a town.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0671-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिकृश
परिकृश a. Very thin, emaciated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0671-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिकृष्
परिकृष् {c1c} P.<BR>1 To draw, pull,<BR>drag.<BR>--2 To lead (as an army).<BR>--3 To ponder, reflect constantly<BR>upon. --Caus. To torment, trouble.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0671-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

