परिपीड्
परिपीड् {c10c} U.<BR>1 To pain,<BR>trouble, molest.<BR>--2 To press, squeeze.<BR>--3 To hug, embrace.<BR>--4 (In<BR>augury) To cover, cover up.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0677-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिपीडनं|परिपीडन
