परिपीडा
परिपीडनं, परिपीडा<BR>1 Squeezing,<BR>peeling out.<BR>--2 Injuring, hurting,<BR>doing harm.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0677-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिपुटनं|परिपुटन
परिपुटनं<BR>1 Removing the bark,<BR>peeling off.<BR>--2 Losing the bark<BR>or skin.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0677-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिपू
परिपू {c9c} U.<BR>1 To purify<BR>completely.<BR>--2 To lustrate.<BR>--3 To become<BR>purified.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0677-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिपूत|परिपूतं
परिपूत p. p.<BR>1 Purified, quite<BR>pure; उत्पत्तिपरिपूतायाः किमस्याः<BR>पावनांतरैः U. 1. 13; Śi. 2. 16.<BR>--2<BR>Completely winnowed or threshed, freed<BR>from chaff.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0677-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिपूजनं|परिपूजन
परिपूजनं, परिपूजा Honouring'<BR>worshipping, adoring.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0677-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिपूजा
परिपूजनं, परिपूजा Honouring'<BR>worshipping, adoring.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0677-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिपूरणं|परिपूरण
परिपूरणं<BR>1 Filling; Śi. 4. 61.<BR>--2<BR>Perfecting, making complete.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0677-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिपूर्ण
परिपूर्ण p. p.<BR>1 Quite full; ˚इंदुः<BR>the full moon; entire, complete,<BR>completely filled.<BR>--2 Self-satisfied,<BR>content.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0677-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिपूर्तिः|परिपूर्ति
