परिपेलव|परिपेलवं
परिपेलव a. Very delicate or<BR>fine, excessively tender.<BR>--वं A kind<BR>of fragrant grass.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0677-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिपोटः|परिपोट
परिपोटः, --पोटकः A particular<BR>disease of the ear (in medicine) (by<BR>which the ear loses its skin).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0677-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिपोटकः|परिपोटक
परिपोटः, --पोटकः A particular<BR>disease of the ear (in medicine) (by<BR>which the ear loses its skin).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0677-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिपोषणं|परिपोषण
परिपोषणं<BR>1 Feeding,<BR>nourishing.<BR>--2 Furthering, promoting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0677-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिप्रच्छ्|परिप्रछ्
