परिपृच्छा
परिपृच्छा^1 Question.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20170110. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/CORRECTIONS/issues/332,. note: परिपृच्छ is impossible without any termination.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0677-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

