परिप्लु
परिप्लु {c1c} A.<BR>1 To swim, float.<BR>--2<BR>Tobathe, plunge into.<BR>--3 To jump,<BR>spring.<BR>--4 To deluge, inundate,<BR>flood.<BR>--5 To cover with.<BR>--6 To<BR>overwhelm.<BR>--7 To fly or hover<BR>about.<BR>--8 To revolve, move in<BR>a circle.<BR>--9 To go astray.<BR>--10 To<BR>hasten forward. --Caus.<BR>1 To<BR>bathe, water.<BR>--2 To flood, deluge.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0677-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिप्लव|परिप्लवं|परिप्लवः
परिप्लव a.<BR>1 Floating.<BR>--2 Shaking,<BR>trembling, oscillating, undulating,<BR>tremulous.<BR>--3 Unsteady, restless;<BR>Śi. 14. 68.<BR>--वः<BR>1 Inundation.<BR>--2<BR>Immersing, wetting.<BR>--3 A boat.<BR>--4<BR>Oppression, tyranny.<BR>--5 Floating,<BR>swimming.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0677-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिप्लुत|परिप्लुतः
