परिप्लुष्ट
परिप्लुष्ट p. p. Burnt, scorched,<BR>singed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0677-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिबंध्|परिबन्ध्
परिबंध् {c9c} A.<BR>1 To tie, bind.<BR>--2<BR>To put on.<BR>--3 To encircle, fasten<BR>round.<BR>--4 To arrest, stop.<BR>--5 To<BR>hinder, interrupt. --Caus. To tie<BR>round.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0677-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिबंधनं|परिबन्धन
परिबंधनं Tying round.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0677-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिबाध्
परिबाध् {c1c} A.<BR>1 To trouble,<BR>afflict; Ś. 7. 25.<BR>--2 Ved. To hinder,<BR>obstruct.<BR>--3 Ved. To protect from<BR>or defend against.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0677-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिबाधा
