परिलघु a.<BR>1 Very light (lit.) (as<BR>clothes &c.).<BR>--2 Very light or easy<BR>to digest; क्षीणः क्षीणः परिलघु पयः<BR>स्रोतसां चोपभुज्य Me. 13.<BR>--3 Very<BR>small; U. 4. 21.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0679-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

