परिलुप् {c6c} U.<BR>1 To interrupt<BR>disturb.<BR>--2 To suspend; diminish.<BR>--3 To dispel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0679-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिलुप्त
परिलुप्त p. p.<BR>1 Interrupted,<BR>disturbed, diminished.<BR>--2 Lost,<BR>disappeared.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--संज्ञ a. senseless,<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0679-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिलोपः|परिलोप
परिलोपः<BR>1 Injury.<BR>--2 Neglect,<BR>omission.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0679-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिलेखः|परिलेख
परिलेखः<BR>1 An outline, a<BR>delineation, sketch.<BR>--2 A picture.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0679-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिलेखनं|परिलेखन
परिलेखनं Drawing lines on the<BR>altar.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0679-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवत्सरः|परिवत्सर
परिवत्सरः A year, a full year,<BR>the revolution of one year; देव्याः<BR>शून्यस्य जगतो द्वादशःपरिवत्सरः U. 3. 33.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0679-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवद्
परिवद् {c1c} P. To abuse, censure,<BR>revile.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0679-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवदनं|परिवदन
परिवदनं<BR>1 Reviling.<BR>--2<BR>Clamouring.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0679-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवादः|परिवाद
परि(री)वादः<BR>1 Blame,<BR>censure, detraction, abuse; अयमेव मयि<BR>प्रथमं परिवादरतः M. 1; Y. 1. 133.<BR>--2 Scandal, stain, stigma; ill-repute;<BR>मा भूत्परीवादनवावतारः R. 5. 24,<BR>14. 86; Mv. 5. 28.<BR>--3 Charge,<BR>accusation; Mk. 3. 30.<BR>--4 An instrument<BR>with which the lute is played.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0679-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परीवादः|परीवाद
परि(री)वादः<BR>1 Blame,<BR>censure, detraction, abuse; अयमेव मयि<BR>प्रथमं परिवादरतः M. 1; Y. 1. 133.<BR>--2 Scandal, stain, stigma; ill-repute;<BR>मा भूत्परीवादनवावतारः R. 5. 24,<BR>14. 86; Mv. 5. 28.<BR>--3 Charge,<BR>accusation; Mk. 3. 30.<BR>--4 An instrument<BR>with which the lute is played.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0679-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवादकः|परिवादक
परिवादकः<BR>1 A plaintiff,<BR>complainant, accuser.<BR>--2 One who plays on<BR>the lute.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0679-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवादिन्
परिवादिन् a.<BR>1 Reviling, censuring,<BR>abusing, slandering.<BR>--2 Accusing.<BR>--3<BR>Screaming, crying aloud.<BR>--4<BR>Censured, slandered. --m. An accuser,<BR>a plaintiff, complainant.<BR>--नी A lute<BR>(वीणा) of seven strings; Śi. 6. 9;<BR>R. 8. 35.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0679-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवर्गः|परिवर्ग
परिवर्गः Ved. Avoiding, removing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0679-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवर्जनं|परिवर्जन|परिवर्ज्जनं
परिवर्जनं<BR>1 Leaving, quitting,<BR>abandoning.<BR>--2 Giving up,<BR>resigning.<BR>--3 Killing, slaughter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0679-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवर्जित|परिवर्ज्जित
परिवर्जित a.<BR>1 Abandoned.<BR>--2<BR>Deprived of.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0680-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवर्मन्
परिवर्मन् a. Clad in mail; armed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0680-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवसथः|परिवसथ
परिवसथः A village.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0680-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवह्
परिवह् {c1c} U.<BR>1 To overflow.<BR>--2<BR>To carry about or round.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0680-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवहः|परिवह
परिवहः<BR>1 N. of one of the seven<BR>courses of wind; it is the sixth<BR>course, and bears along the<BR>Saptarshis and the celestial Ganges;<BR>सप्तर्षिचक्रं स्वर्गंगां षष्ठः परिवहस्तथा; (for<BR>the other courses of wind see under<BR>वायु; cf. the description of परिवह<BR>given by Kālidāsa:<BR>--त्रिस्रोतसं वहति<BR>यो गगनप्रतिष्ठां ज्योतींषि वर्तयति च<BR>प्रविभक्तरश्मिः । तस्य द्वितीयहरिविक्रमनिस्तमस्कं<BR>वायोरिमं परिवहस्य बदंति मार्गं Ś. 7. 6.).<BR>--2 One of the seven tongues of fire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0680-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवाहः|परिवाह
परि(री)वाहः<BR>1 Overflowing<BR>(of a tank &c.), inundation,<BR>overflow, natural or artificial; प्रथमं (<BR>कौतूहलं) सपरिवाहमासीत् Ś. 2.<BR>--2 A<BR>water-course, drain or channel to<BR>carry off excess of water; पूरोत्पीडे<BR>तडागस्य परीवाहः प्रतिक्रिया U. 3. 29;<BR>Pt. 2. 150; Śi. 16. 51; R. 8. 74.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0680-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परीवाहः|परीवाह
परि(री)वाहः<BR>1 Overflowing<BR>(of a tank &c.), inundation,<BR>overflow, natural or artificial; प्रथमं (<BR>कौतूहलं) सपरिवाहमासीत् Ś. 2.<BR>--2 A<BR>water-course, drain or channel to<BR>carry off excess of water; पूरोत्पीडे<BR>तडागस्य परीवाहः प्रतिक्रिया U. 3. 29;<BR>Pt. 2. 150; Śi. 16. 51; R. 8. 74.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0680-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवाहिन्
परिवाहिन् a. Overflowing; as in<BR>आनंदपरिवाहिणा चक्षुषा Ś. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0680-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवापः|परिवाप
परि(री)वापः<BR>1 Shaving,<BR>shearing.<BR>--2 Sowing.<BR>--3 A reservoir, pool,<BR>pond, a piece of water.<BR>--4<BR>Furniture.<BR>--5 Train, retinue.<BR>--6 Fried<BR>grains of rice.<BR>--7 Coagulated milk.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0680-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परीवापः|परीवाप
परि(री)वापः<BR>1 Shaving,<BR>shearing.<BR>--2 Sowing.<BR>--3 A reservoir, pool,<BR>pond, a piece of water.<BR>--4<BR>Furniture.<BR>--5 Train, retinue.<BR>--6 Fried<BR>grains of rice.<BR>--7 Coagulated milk.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0680-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवापणं|परिवापण
परिवापणं Shaving.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0680-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवापित|परिवापितं
परिवापित a. Shaven, shorn.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0680-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवासः|परिवास
परिवासः<BR>1 Residence, stay,<BR>sojourn.<BR>--2 Fragrant odour;<BR>Māl. 9. 42.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0680-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिविण्णः|परिविण्ण
परिविण्णः (न्नः), परिवित्तः,<BR>परिवितिः An unmarried elder brother<BR>whose younger brother is married;<BR>see Ms. 3. 171; and परिवेत्तृ also.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0680-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिविद्धः|परिविद्ध
