परिविंदकः, परिविंदत् m. A<BR>younger brother married before the<BR>elder.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0680-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिविंदत्|परिविन्दत्
परिविंदकः, परिविंदत् m. A<BR>younger brother married before the<BR>elder.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0680-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिविविदानः|परिविविदान
परिविविदानः Ved. = परिवित्तः<BR>above.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0680-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिविष्
परिविष् Caus.<BR>1 To surround.<BR>--2 To present or offer food.<BR>--3 To<BR>attend, wait upon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0680-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिविष्टि
परिविष्टि f. Ved. Service, attendance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0680-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवेशः|परिवेश
परि(री)वेशः(षः)<BR>1 Waiting<BR>at meals, distributing food,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0680-b" target="_blank">Page0680-b+ 55</a>]<BR>serving up meals.<BR>--2 A circle,<BR>circlet, halo (of lustre &c.);<BR>R. 5. 74, 6. 13; Śi. 5. 52, 17. 9.<BR>--3<BR>Especially, the halo round the sun or<BR>moon; लक्ष्यते स्म तदनंतरं<BR>रविर्बद्धभीमपरिवेषमंडलः R. 11. 59.<BR>--4 The<BR>circumference of a circle.<BR>--5 The disc<BR>of the sun or moon.<BR>--6 Anything<BR>which surrounds or protects.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0680-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परीवेशः|परीवेश
परि(री)वेशः(षः)<BR>1 Waiting<BR>at meals, distributing food,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0680-b" target="_blank">Page0680-b+ 55</a>]<BR>serving up meals.<BR>--2 A circle,<BR>circlet, halo (of lustre &c.);<BR>R. 5. 74, 6. 13; Śi. 5. 52, 17. 9.<BR>--3<BR>Especially, the halo round the sun or<BR>moon; लक्ष्यते स्म तदनंतरं<BR>रविर्बद्धभीमपरिवेषमंडलः R. 11. 59.<BR>--4 The<BR>circumference of a circle.<BR>--5 The disc<BR>of the sun or moon.<BR>--6 Anything<BR>which surrounds or protects.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0680-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवेषः|परिवेष
परि(री)वेशः(षः)<BR>1 Waiting<BR>at meals, distributing food,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0680-b" target="_blank">Page0680-b+ 55</a>]<BR>serving up meals.<BR>--2 A circle,<BR>circlet, halo (of lustre &c.);<BR>R. 5. 74, 6. 13; Śi. 5. 52, 17. 9.<BR>--3<BR>Especially, the halo round the sun or<BR>moon; लक्ष्यते स्म तदनंतरं<BR>रविर्बद्धभीमपरिवेषमंडलः R. 11. 59.<BR>--4 The<BR>circumference of a circle.<BR>--5 The disc<BR>of the sun or moon.<BR>--6 Anything<BR>which surrounds or protects.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0680-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परीवेषः|परीवेष
परि(री)वेशः(षः)<BR>1 Waiting<BR>at meals, distributing food,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0680-b" target="_blank">Page0680-b+ 55</a>]<BR>serving up meals.<BR>--2 A circle,<BR>circlet, halo (of lustre &c.);<BR>R. 5. 74, 6. 13; Śi. 5. 52, 17. 9.<BR>--3<BR>Especially, the halo round the sun or<BR>moon; लक्ष्यते स्म तदनंतरं<BR>रविर्बद्धभीमपरिवेषमंडलः R. 11. 59.<BR>--4 The<BR>circumference of a circle.<BR>--5 The disc<BR>of the sun or moon.<BR>--6 Anything<BR>which surrounds or protects.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0680-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवेषकः|परिवेषक
परिवेषकः A waiter at meals.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0680-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवेषणं|परिवेषण
परिवेषणं<BR>1 Serving up meals,<BR>waiting, distributing food.<BR>--2 Enclosing,<BR>surrounding.<BR>--3 A halo round the<BR>sun or moon.<BR>--4 Circumference.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0680-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवेष्टृ
परिवेष्टृ m. A waiter at meals, one<BR>who serves up meals; मरुतः परिवेष्टारो<BR>मरुत्तस्यावसन्गृहे Ait. Br.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0680-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिविहारः|परिविहार
परिविहारः Walking about,<BR>strolling, walking for pleasure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0680-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिविह्वल
परिविह्वल a. Extremely<BR>confused, agitated or bewildered.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0680-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवीत
परिवीत p. p.<BR>1 Surrounded,<BR>encompassed.<BR>--2 Pervaded,<BR>overspread; Śi. 3. 34; Ki. 5. 42.<BR>--तं<BR>The bow of Brahman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0680-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवृढ|परिवृढः
परिवृढ a.<BR>1 Firm, thick, dense.<BR>--2 Ample, large.<BR>--ढः A master,<BR>lord, owner, head, chief (used<BR>adjectively also); किं भुवः परिवृढा न<BR>विवोढुं तत्र तामुपनता विवदंते N. 5. 42;<BR>Ku. 12. 58; Mv. 6. 25, 31, 48.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0680-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवृ
परिवृ {c5c} {c9c} {c10c} U. To encircle,<BR>surround; U. 4. 23.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0680-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवारः|परिवार
परि(री)वारः<BR>1 Train, retinue,<BR>attendants or followers<BR>collectively; (यानं) अध्यास्य कन्या<BR>परिवारशोभि R. 6. 10; 12. 16; ग्रहगणपरिवारो<BR>राजमार्गप्रदीपः Mk. 1. 57.<BR>--2 A<BR>cover, covering.<BR>--3 A sheath,<BR>scabbard.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0680-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परीवारः|परीवार
परि(री)वारः<BR>1 Train, retinue,<BR>attendants or followers<BR>collectively; (यानं) अध्यास्य कन्या<BR>परिवारशोभि R. 6. 10; 12. 16; ग्रहगणपरिवारो<BR>राजमार्गप्रदीपः Mk. 1. 57.<BR>--2 A<BR>cover, covering.<BR>--3 A sheath,<BR>scabbard.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0680-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवारण
परिवारण<BR>1 An envelope, a cover.<BR>--2 Train, retinue.<BR>--3 Warding off,<BR>keeping off.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0680-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवारित
परिवारित p. p. Surrounded,<BR>encircled, encompassed, begirt.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0680-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवृत|परिवृतः
परिवृत p. p.<BR>1 Surrounded,<BR>encompassed, encircled, attended.<BR>--2<BR>Hidden, concealed.<BR>--3<BR>Pervaded, overspread.<BR>--4 Known.<BR>--5<BR>Completely gained.<BR>--तं Ved. An<BR>enclosed space for a sacrifice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0680-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवृतिः|परिवृति
परिवृतिः f. Surrounding.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0680-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवृत्
परिवृत् {c1c} A.<BR>1 To turn round,<BR>revolve; Ku. 1. 16.<BR>--2 To roam about,<BR>move hither and thither.<BR>--3 To<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0680-c" target="_blank">Page0680-c+ 57</a>]<BR>change, barter, exchange.<BR>--4 To<BR>turn back; R. 4. 72; V. 1. 17.<BR>--5<BR>To be, fall into; Māl. 9. 8.<BR>--6 To<BR>decay, perish, disappear; Māl. 10. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0680-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवर्तः|परिवर्त|परिवर्त्त|परिवर्त्तः
परि(री)वर्तः<BR>1 Revolving,<BR>revolution (as of a planet).<BR>--2 A period<BR>lapse or expiration of time; युगशत,<BR>परिवर्तान् Ś. 7. 34.<BR>--3 The<BR>expirationof a Yuga; Śi. 17. 12.<BR>--4<BR>Repetition, recurrence.<BR>--5 Change,<BR>alteration; तदीदृशो जीवलोकस्य परिवर्तः<BR>U. 3 ‘changed condition of life’,<BR>‘change in circumstances’; so<BR>जीवलोकपरिवर्तमनुभवामि Māl. 7; स्वरपरिवर्तः<BR>Mk. 1.<BR>--6 Retreat, flight, desertion.<BR>--7 A year.<BR>--8 Repeated birth,<BR>transmigration.<BR>--9 Barter, exchange;<BR>Śi. 5. 39.<BR>--10 Requital, return.<BR>--11 An<BR>abode.<BR>--12 A chapter or section of<BR>a work.<BR>--13 N. of the Kūrma or<BR>second incarnation of Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0680-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परीवर्तः|परीवर्त|परीवर्त्त|परीवर्त्तः
परि(री)वर्तः<BR>1 Revolving,<BR>revolution (as of a planet).<BR>--2 A period<BR>lapse or expiration of time; युगशत,<BR>परिवर्तान् Ś. 7. 34.<BR>--3 The<BR>expirationof a Yuga; Śi. 17. 12.<BR>--4<BR>Repetition, recurrence.<BR>--5 Change,<BR>alteration; तदीदृशो जीवलोकस्य परिवर्तः<BR>U. 3 ‘changed condition of life’,<BR>‘change in circumstances’; so<BR>जीवलोकपरिवर्तमनुभवामि Māl. 7; स्वरपरिवर्तः<BR>Mk. 1.<BR>--6 Retreat, flight, desertion.<BR>--7 A year.<BR>--8 Repeated birth,<BR>transmigration.<BR>--9 Barter, exchange;<BR>Śi. 5. 39.<BR>--10 Requital, return.<BR>--11 An<BR>abode.<BR>--12 A chapter or section of<BR>a work.<BR>--13 N. of the Kūrma or<BR>second incarnation of Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0680-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवर्तक|परिवर्तकं|परिवर्त्तक
परिवर्तक a.<BR>1 Causing to turn<BR>round or revolve.<BR>--2 Requiting,<BR>exchanging.<BR>--3 Turning round.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0680-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवर्तनं|परिवर्तन|परिवर्त्तन|परिवर्त्तनं
परिवर्तनं<BR>1 Moving to and fro,<BR>turning about, rolling about (as on the<BR>lap, bed &c.); Ku. 5. 12; R. 9. 13;<BR>Śi. 4. 47.<BR>--2 Turning round,<BR>revolving, whirling round.<BR>--3<BR>Revolution, end of a period of time.<BR>--4<BR>Change; वेषपरिवर्तनं विधाय Pt. 3.<BR>--5<BR>Exchange, barter.<BR>--6 Inverting.<BR>--7<BR>Requital, return.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0680-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवर्तिका|परिवर्त्तिका
परिवर्तिका Phimosis or contraction<BR>of the prepuce (in medicine).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0680-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवर्तित|परिवर्त्तित
परिवर्तित a.<BR>1 Revolved.<BR>--2<BR>Exchanged.<BR>--3 Inverted.<BR>--4<BR>Returned, retreated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0680-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवर्तिन्|परिवर्त्तिन्
परिवर्तिन् a.<BR>1 Moving or<BR>turning round, revolving.<BR>--2<BR>Ever-recurring. coming round again and again<BR>परिवर्तिनि संसारे मृतः को वा न जायते<BR>Pt. 1. 27.<BR>--3 Changing.<BR>--4 Being;<BR>or remaining near, moving round<BR>about.<BR>--5 Retreating, flying.<BR>--6<BR>Exchanging.<BR>--7 Recompensing,<BR>requiting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0680-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवृत्त
परिवृत्त p. p.<BR>1 Revolved, turned<BR>round; ˚अर्धमुखी V. 1. 17.<BR>--2<BR>Retreated, turned back.<BR>--3 Exchanged,<BR>bartered.<BR>--4 Finished, ended.<BR>--त्तं<BR>An embrace.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0680-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवृत्तिः|परिवृत्ति
परिवृत्तिः f.<BR>1 Revolution;<BR>Śi. 10. 91.<BR>--2 Return; turning back.<BR>--3<BR>Barter, exchange.<BR>--4 End,<BR>termination.<BR>--5 Surrounding.<BR>--6 Staying<BR>or dwelling in a place.<BR>--7<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0681-a" target="_blank">Page0681-a+ 56</a>]<BR>Contraction of the prepuce.<BR>--8 (In Rhet.)<BR>A figure of speech in which there<BR>is an exchange of a thing for what<BR>is equal, less or greater;<BR>परिवृत्तिर्विनिमयो योऽर्थानां स्यत्समासमैः<BR>K. P. 10; e. g. दत्त्वा कटाक्षमेणाक्षी जग्राह<BR>हृदयं मम । मया तु हृदयं दत्त्वा गृहीतो<BR>मदनज्वरः ॥ S. D. 734.<BR>--9<BR>Substitution of one word for another<BR>without affecting the sense; as in<BR>शब्दपरिवृत्तिसहत्वं K. P. 10; e. g. in<BR>वृषध्वज, ध्वज may be substituted by<BR>लांछन or वाहन.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0680-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवृध्
परिवृध् {c1c} A. To grow up,<BR>increase. --Caus.<BR>1 To grow, increase,<BR>prosper.<BR>--2 To bring up, rear.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0681-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवर्धनं|परिवर्धन
परिवर्धनं<BR>1 Increasing, enlarging.<BR>--2 Rearing, breeding.<BR>--3 Growing,<BR>growth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0681-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवर्धित
परिवर्धित a.<BR>1 Increased.<BR>--2 Cut,<BR>excavated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0681-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवृद्धिः|परिवृद्धि
परिवृद्धिः f. Growth, increase.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0681-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवेत्तृ
परिवेत्तृ m., परिवेदकः A younger<BR>brother married before the elder;<BR>R. 12. 16; ज्येष्ठे अनिर्विष्टे कनीयान्<BR>निर्विशन् परिवेत्ता भवति, परिविण्णो ज्येष्ठः,<BR>परिवेदनीया कन्या, परिदयी दाता,<BR>परिकर्ता याजकः, सर्वे ते पतिताः Hārīta.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0681-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवेदनं|परिवेदन
परिवेदनं<BR>1 The marriage of a<BR>younger brother before the elder.<BR>--2 Marriage in general.<BR>--3<BR>Complete or accurate knowledge.<BR>--4<BR>Gain, acquisition.<BR>--5 Maintaining<BR>the household fire (अग्न्याधान);<BR>Ms. 11. 61.<BR>--6 Pervasion on all sides,<BR>universal pervasion or existence.<BR>--7 Discussion.<BR>--8 Misery, pain<BR>--ना<BR>1 Shrewdness, wit.<BR>--2<BR>Prudence, foresight.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0681-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवेदनीया
परिवेदनीया, परिवेदिनी The wife of a<BR>younger brother who is married<BR>before the elder.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0681-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवेदिनी
परिवेदनीया, परिवेदिनी The wife of a<BR>younger brother who is married<BR>before the elder.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0681-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवेदः|परिवेद
परिवेदः Accurate knowledge.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0681-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवेष्ट्
परिवेष्ट् {c1c} A. or Caus.<BR>1 To<BR>surround, encircle.<BR>--2 To embrace,<BR>clasp round; Pt. 1. 35.<BR>--3 To wrap<BR>up, cover.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0681-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवेष्टनं|परिवेष्टन
परिवेष्टनं<BR>1 Surrounding, enclosing.<BR>--2 Circumference.<BR>--3 A cover,<BR>covering.<BR>--4 A bandage.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0681-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिव्ययः|परिव्यय
परिव्ययः<BR>1 Cost.<BR>--2 Condiment,<BR>spices.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0681-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिव्याधः|परिव्याध
परिव्याधः A species of reed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0681-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिव्रज्
परिव्रज् {c1c} P. To wander about<BR>as a religious mendicant, turn out a<BR>recluse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0681-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिव्रज्या
परिव्रज्या<BR>1 Strolling, wandering<BR>from place to place.<BR>--2 Turning a<BR>recluse, leading the life of a<BR>religious mendicant or recluse.<BR>--3<BR>Renunciation of the world, ascetic<BR>devotion, religious austerity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0681-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिव्राज्
परिव्राज् m., परिव्राजः, --जकः A<BR>wandering mendicant, vagrant,<BR>recluse, an ascetic (of the fourth<BR>religious order) who has renounced<BR>the world.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0681-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिशंक्|परिशङ्क्
परिशंक् {c1c} A.<BR>1 To suspect,<BR>believe, fancy (to be); पत्रेऽपि<BR>संचारिणि प्राप्तंत्वां परिशंकते Gīt. 6.<BR>--2 To<BR>doubt, have doubts about.<BR>--3 To<BR>fear, be afraid of; तृणबिंदोः<BR>परिशंकितः पुरा R. 8. 79.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0681-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिशंकिन्|परिशङ्किन्
परिशंकिन् a. Fearing,<BR>apprehensive.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0681-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिशाश्वत
परिशाश्वत a. (ती f.)<BR>Perpetually the same.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0681-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिशिष्
परिशिष् {c7c} P.<BR>1 To leave<BR>remaining (caus. also); भविता<BR>करेणुपंरिशेषिता मही Bv. 1. 53.<BR>--2 To quit<BR>or leave (a place).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0681-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिशिष्ट|परिशिष्टं
परिशिष्ट a.<BR>1 Left, remaining.<BR>--2<BR>Finished.<BR>--ष्टं A supplement, an<BR>appendix; as in गृह्यपरिशिष्ट.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0681-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिशेषः|परिशेष
परि(री)शेषः<BR>1 Remainder,<BR>remnant.<BR>--2 Supplement.<BR>--3<BR>Termination, conclusion, completion. (<BR>परिशेषेण ind.<BR>1 With the residue.<BR>--2<BR>Completely, in full.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0681-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परीशेषः|परीशेष
परि(री)शेषः<BR>1 Remainder,<BR>remnant.<BR>--2 Supplement.<BR>--3<BR>Termination, conclusion, completion. (<BR>परिशेषेण ind.<BR>1 With the residue.<BR>--2<BR>Completely, in full.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0681-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिशेषणं|परिशेषण
परिशेषणं Remainder, residue.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0681-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिशीलनं|परिशीलन
परिशीलनं<BR>1 Touch, contact (lit.).<BR>ललितलवंगलतापरिशीलनकोमलमलयसभीरे<BR>Gīt. 1; so वदनकमलपरिशीलनभिलित<BR>&c. 11.<BR>--2 Constant contact,<BR>intercourse, or correspondence.<BR>--3 Study,<BR>application or attachment (to a<BR>thing), steady or fixed pursuit;<BR>काव्यार्थ˚ S. D.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0681-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिशुध्
परिशुध् Caus.<BR>1 To purify<BR>completely.<BR>--2 To explain, clear up.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0681-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिशुद्ध
परिशुद्ध p. p.<BR>1 Cleaned, purified.<BR>--2 Acquitted, discharged.<BR>--3<BR>Cleared off, paid.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0681-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिशुद्धिः|परिशुद्धि
परिशुद्धिः f.<BR>1 Complete<BR>purification; अग्नि˚ U. 4.<BR>--2 Justification;<BR>acquittal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0681-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिशोधः|परिशोध
परिशोधः, परिशोधनं<BR>1 Purifying,<BR>cleansing.<BR>--2 Rectifying, correcting.<BR>--3 Quittance, discharging or paying<BR>off (a debt or obligation).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0681-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिशोधनं|परिशोधन
