परिशून्य
परिशून्य a.<BR>1 Quite empty;<BR>R. 8. 66.<BR>--2 Quite free from,<BR>completely devoid of; 19. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0681-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

