परिसंख्या {c2c} P.<BR>1 To count or<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0682-b" target="_blank">Page0682-b+ 55</a>]<BR>reckon up, add together.<BR>--2 To<BR>enumerate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0682-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिसंख्या|परिसङ्ख्या
परिसंख्या<BR>1 Enumeration,<BR>computation.<BR>--2 Sum, total, number;<BR>वित्तस्य विद्यापरिसंख्यया मे R. 5. 21.<BR>--3 (In Mīm. phil.) Exclusion,<BR>specification, limitation to that which<BR>is enumerated or expressly<BR>mentioned, so that everything else is<BR>excluded; (परिसंख्या is opposed to<BR>विधि which lays down a rule for the<BR>first time, and to नियम which restricts<BR>the choice to an alternative which<BR>is expressly stated when several<BR>such alternatives are possible);<BR>विधिरत्यंतमप्राप्तौ नियमः पाक्षिके सति ।<BR>तत्र चान्यत्र च प्राप्तौ परिसंख्येति<BR>गीयते ॥ e. g. पंच पंचनखा भक्ष्याः<BR>usually quoted by the Mīmāṃsakas;<BR>अयं नियमविधिर्न तु परिसंख्या Kull.<BR>on Ms. 3. 45.<BR>--4 (In Rhet.)<BR>Special mention or exclusive<BR>specification, i. e. where with or<BR>without a query something is affirmed<BR>for the denial, expressed or<BR>understood, of something else<BR>similar to it; (this figure is<BR>particularly striking when it is based on<BR>a श्लेष or pun); यस्मिन् महीं शासति<BR>चित्रकर्मसु वर्णसंकराश्चापेषु गुणच्छेदाः &c. or<BR>यस्य नूपुरेषु मुखरता विवाहेषु करग्रहणं तुरंगेषु<BR>कशाभिघातः &c. K; for other examples<BR>see S. D. 735.<BR>--5 Recapitueation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0682-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिसंख्यात|परिसङ्ख्यात
परिसंख्यात p. p.<BR>1 Enumerated,<BR>reckoned up.<BR>--2 Specified<BR>exclusively.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0682-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिसंख्यानं|परिसङ्ख्यान|परिसंख्यान
परिसंख्यानं<BR>1 Enumeration, total,<BR>number.<BR>--2 Exclusive specification.<BR>--3 Correct judgment, proper<BR>estimate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0682-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिसंचरः|परिसञ्चर|परिसंचर
परिसंचरः Time of universal<BR>destruction.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0682-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिसभ्यः|परिसभ्य
परिसभ्यः A member of an<BR>assembly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0682-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिसमाप्त
परिसमाप्त p. p.<BR>1 Finished,<BR>completed.<BR>--2 Centred, comprehended;<BR>Ś. 5. 8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0682-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिसमापनं|परिसमापन
परिसमापनं, परिसमाप्तिः f.<BR>Finishing, completing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0682-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिसमाप्तिः|परिसमाप्ति
परिसमापनं, परिसमाप्तिः f.<BR>Finishing, completing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0682-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिसमूहनं|परिसमूहन
परिसमूहनं<BR>1 Heaping up.<BR>--2<BR>Sprinkling water (in a particular<BR>way) round the sacrificial fire (अग्नेः<BR>समंतात् माजंनं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0682-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिसृ
परिसृ {c1c} P.<BR>1 To flow round; एनं<BR>सरस्वती परिससार Ait. Br.; परिसस्रुरापः<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0682-c" target="_blank">Page0682-c+ 55</a>]<BR>Mb.<BR>--2 To move round, whirl<BR>round; प्रदाक्षिणं तं परिमृत्य Bhāg.,<BR>परिसरति (v. l. for परिपतति) शिखी<BR>भ्रांतिमंद्वारियंत्रं M. 2. 13.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0682-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिसरः|परिसर
परिसरः<BR>1 Verge, border,<BR>proximity, vicinity, neighbourhood,<BR>environs (of a river, mountain, town<BR>&c.); गोदावरीपरिसरस्य गिरेरतटानि<BR>U. 3. 8; परिसरविषयेषु लीढमुक्ताः<BR>Ki. 5. 38.<BR>--2 Position, site.<BR>--3 Width,<BR>breadth.<BR>--4 Death.<BR>--5 A rule,<BR>precept.<BR>--6 A god.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0682-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिसरणं|परिसरण
परिसरणं Running about.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0682-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिसर्या|परिसर्य्या
परि(री)सर्या, परि(री)सारः<BR>Wandering or moving about,<BR>perambulation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0682-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परीसर्या
परि(री)सर्या, परि(री)सारः<BR>Wandering or moving about,<BR>perambulation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0682-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिसारः|परिसार
परि(री)सर्या, परि(री)सारः<BR>Wandering or moving about,<BR>perambulation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0682-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परीसारः|परीसार
परि(री)सर्या, परि(री)सारः<BR>Wandering or moving about,<BR>perambulation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0682-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिसृप्
परिसृप् {c1c} P.<BR>1 To move round<BR>about, hover.<BR>--2 To move to and<BR>fro.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0682-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिसर्पः|परिसर्प
परिसर्पः<BR>1 Going or moving about.<BR>--2 Going in search of, following,<BR>pursuing.<BR>--3 Surrounding,<BR>encircling.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0682-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिसर्पणं|परिसर्पण
परिसर्पणं<BR>1 Walking or<BR>creeping about.<BR>--2 Running to and<BR>froflying about, constantly moving;<BR>पतगपतेः परिसर्पणे च तुल्यः Mk. 3. 21.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0682-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिस्तृ
परिस्तृ {c5c} U., परिस्तॄ {c9c} U.<BR>1<BR>To spread, diffuse, extend;<BR>Bk. 14. 11.<BR>--2 To cover (fig. also);<BR>अथ नागयूथमलिनानि जगत्परितस्तमांसि<BR>परितस्तरिरे Śi. 9. 18; अभितस्तं<BR>पृथासूनुः स्नेहेन परितस्तरे Ki. 11. 8.<BR>--3<BR>To place in order.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0682-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिस्तरः|परिस्तर
परिस्तरः Strewing round or<BR>heaping together.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0682-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिस्तरणं|परिस्तरण
परिस्तरणं<BR>1 Strewing or<BR>spreading round, scattering about.<BR>--2 A<BR>covering, cover.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0682-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिस्थानं|परिस्थान
परिस्थानं<BR>1 Abode.<BR>--2<BR>Fixedness, solidity.<BR>--3 Firmness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0682-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिस्फुट
परिस्फुट a.<BR>1 Quite plain,<BR>manifest, distinctly visible.<BR>--2 Fully<BR>developed, blown or grown.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0682-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिस्फुर्
परिस्फुर् {c6c} P. To throb, quiver,<BR>palpitate; तस्याः<BR>परिस्फुरितगर्भभरालसायाः U. 3. 28.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0682-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिस्फुरणं|परिस्फुरण
परिस्फुरणं<BR>1 Quivering, shooting.<BR>--2 Budding.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0682-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिस्यंदः|परिस्यन्द|परिस्यंद|परिस्यन्दः
परिस्यंदः<BR>1 Oozing, trickling,<BR>dropping.<BR>--2 A flow, stream.<BR>--3 A<BR>train &c.; see परिष्यंद.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0682-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिस्रवः|परिस्रव
परिस्रवः<BR>1 Flowing, streaming.<BR>--2 Gliding down.<BR>--3 A river,<BR>torrent.<BR>--4 Birth of a child.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0682-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिस्रावः|परिस्राव
परिस्रावः<BR>1 Effluxion, efflux.<BR>--2 N.<BR>of a morbid disease (overflowing of<BR>the moistures of the body).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0683-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिस्रावणं|परिस्रावण
परिस्रावणं A filtering vessel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0683-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिस्राविन्
परिस्राविन् m. A kind of भगंदर q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0683-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिस्रुत्
परिस्रुत् f.<BR>1 A kind of intoxicating<BR>liquor.<BR>--2 Trickling, dropping,<BR>flowing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0683-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिहत
परिहत a. Loosened.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0683-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिहस्
परिहस् {c1c} P.<BR>1 To jest, joke.<BR>--2<BR>To laugh at, ridicule: (hence) to<BR>surpass, excel; जनानामानंदः<BR>परिहसति निर्वाणपदवीं G. L. 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0683-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिहासः|परिहास
परि(री)हासः<BR>1 Joking, jesting,<BR>jest, mirth: merriment;<BR>त्वराप्रस्तावोयं न खलु परिहासस्य विषयः<BR>Māl. 9. 44; परिहासपूर्वं ‘jokingly or in jest’<BR>R. 6. 82; परिहासविजल्पितं Ś. 2. 18<BR>‘uttered in jest’; परीहासाश्चित्राः<BR>सततमभवन् येन भवतः Ve. 3. 14;<BR>Ku. 7. 19; R. 9. 8; Śi. 10. 12.<BR>--2<BR>Ridiculing, deriding.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--वेदिन् m. a<BR>buffoon, jester, a witty person.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0683-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परीहासः|परीहास
परि(री)हासः<BR>1 Joking, jesting,<BR>jest, mirth: merriment;<BR>त्वराप्रस्तावोयं न खलु परिहासस्य विषयः<BR>Māl. 9. 44; परिहासपूर्वं ‘jokingly or in jest’<BR>R. 6. 82; परिहासविजल्पितं Ś. 2. 18<BR>‘uttered in jest’; परीहासाश्चित्राः<BR>सततमभवन् येन भवतः Ve. 3. 14;<BR>Ku. 7. 19; R. 9. 8; Śi. 10. 12.<BR>--2<BR>Ridiculing, deriding.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--वेदिन् m. a<BR>buffoon, jester, a witty person.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0683-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिहस्तः|परिहस्त
परिहस्तः A ring for the hand.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0683-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिहा
परिहा {c3c} P.<BR>1 To leave, abandon,<BR>quit<BR>--2 To omit, neglect;<BR>यथोक्तान्यपि कर्माणि परिहाय Ms. 12. 92.<BR>--Pass.<BR>1 To be wanting or<BR>deficient in; आर्यस्य सुविहितप्रयोगतया न<BR>किमपि परिहास्यते Ś. 1.<BR>--2 To be<BR>inferior to; ओजस्वितयान परिहीयते शच्याः<BR>V. 3; न प्रतिच्छंदात्परिहीयते मधुरता<BR>M. 2.<BR>--3 To wane, fail, waste away;<BR>अनुदिवसं परिहीयसे अंगैः Ś. 3;<BR>Pt. 1. 78.<BR>--4 To pass away; परिहीयते<BR>गमनवेला Ś. 4.<BR>--5 To be deprived of or<BR>excluded from.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0683-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिहाणं|परिहाण
परिहाणं Ved.<BR>1 Losing, suffering<BR>loss.<BR>--2 Decrease.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0683-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिहाणिः|परिहाणि
परिहाणिः(निः) f.<BR>1 Decrease,<BR>deficiency, loss.<BR>--2 Decay, decline;<BR>R. 19. 50.<BR>--3 Neglect, omission.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0683-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिहानिः|परिहानि
परिहाणिः(निः) f.<BR>1 Decrease,<BR>deficiency, loss.<BR>--2 Decay, decline;<BR>R. 19. 50.<BR>--3 Neglect, omission.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0683-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिहीण
परिहीण p. p.<BR>1 Waned, wasted.<BR>--2 Deprived or destitute of.<BR>--3<BR>Wanting or deficient in.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0683-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिहृ
परिहृ {c1c} P.<BR>1 To avoid, shun:<BR>स्त्रीसंनिकर्षं परिहर्तुमिच्छन्नंतर्दधे भूतपतिः<BR>सभूतः Ku. 3. 74; Ms. 8. 400;<BR>Ku. 3. 43.<BR>--2 To forsake, abandon, leave,<BR>desert; कति न कथितमिदमनुपदमचिरं मा<BR>परिहर हरिमतिशयरुचिरं Gīt. 9.<BR>--3 To<BR>remove, destroy; answer, refute (as<BR>objections, charges &c.); ब्रह्मास्य<BR>जगतो निमित्तं कारणं प्रकृतिश्चेत्यस्य<BR>पक्षस्याक्षेपः स्मृतिनिमित्तः परिहृतः । तर्कनिमित्त<BR>इदानीमाक्षेपः परिह्रियते S. B; Me. 14.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0683-b" target="_blank">Page0683-b+ 57</a>]<BR>--4 To conceal.<BR>--5 To embrace.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0683-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिहरणं|परिहरण
परिहरणं<BR>1 Leaving, quitting,<BR>abandoning.<BR>--2 Avoiding, shunning.<BR>--3 Refuting.<BR>--4 Seizing, taking<BR>away.<BR>--5 Ved. Carrying or placing<BR>round.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0683-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिहारः|परिहार
परि(री)हारः<BR>1 Leaving,<BR>quitting, giving up, abandoning.<BR>--2<BR>Removing, taking away; as in<BR>विरोधपरिहार.<BR>--3 Shunning, avoiding.<BR>--4<BR>Refuting, repelling.<BR>--5 Omitting<BR>to mention, omission, leaving out.<BR>--6 Reserve, concealment.<BR>--7 A tract<BR>of common land round a village or<BR>town; धनुःशतं परीहारो ग्रामस्य<BR>स्यात्समंततः Ms. 8. 237.<BR>--8 A special grant,<BR>immunity, privilege, exemption<BR>from taxes; Ms. 7. 201.<BR>--9<BR>Contempt, disrespect.<BR>--10 An objection.<BR>--11 Seizing, keeping back.<BR>--12<BR>Bounty.<BR>--13 (In gram.) The<BR>repetition of a word before and after इति;<BR>cf. परिग्रह.<BR>--14 Atoning for any<BR>improper action.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0683-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परीहारः|परीहार
परि(री)हारः<BR>1 Leaving,<BR>quitting, giving up, abandoning.<BR>--2<BR>Removing, taking away; as in<BR>विरोधपरिहार.<BR>--3 Shunning, avoiding.<BR>--4<BR>Refuting, repelling.<BR>--5 Omitting<BR>to mention, omission, leaving out.<BR>--6 Reserve, concealment.<BR>--7 A tract<BR>of common land round a village or<BR>town; धनुःशतं परीहारो ग्रामस्य<BR>स्यात्समंततः Ms. 8. 237.<BR>--8 A special grant,<BR>immunity, privilege, exemption<BR>from taxes; Ms. 7. 201.<BR>--9<BR>Contempt, disrespect.<BR>--10 An objection.<BR>--11 Seizing, keeping back.<BR>--12<BR>Bounty.<BR>--13 (In gram.) The<BR>repetition of a word before and after इति;<BR>cf. परिग्रह.<BR>--14 Atoning for any<BR>improper action.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0683-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिहार्य|परिहार्यः|परिहार्य्य|परिहार्य्यः
परिहार्य a. To be shunned or<BR>avoided, to be escaped from, to be<BR>taken off or away.<BR>--र्यः A bracelet.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0683-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिहृत|परिहृतः
परिहृत p. p.<BR>1 Shunned, avoided.<BR>--2 Left, abandoned.<BR>--3 Refuted,<BR>repelled (as a charge, objection<BR>&c.).<BR>--4 Taken, seized.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0683-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिहृतिः|परिहृति
परिहृतिः f. Avoiding, shunning.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0683-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परी
परी (परि-इ) {c2c} P.<BR>1 To go round,<BR>circumambulate; (चरणन्यासं) भक्तिनम्रः<BR>परीयाः Me. 55; Ms. 2. 48.<BR>--2 To<BR>surround, encompass; हुतवहपरीतं<BR>गृहमिव Ś. 5. 10; विषवल्लीभिः<BR>परीताभिर्महौषधिः R. 12. 61; so कोपपरीतमानसं<BR>Ki. 2. 25.<BR>--3 To go to, think of<BR>(objects &c.).<BR>--4 To be changed or<BR>transformed.<BR>--5 To reach to.<BR>--6<BR>To run against.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0683-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परीत|परीतं
परीत p. p.<BR>1 Surrounded,<BR>encompassed by.<BR>--2 Expired,<BR>elapsed.<BR>--3 Departed, gone forth.<BR>--4<BR>Seized, taken possession of, filled<BR>with; Mu. 3. 30. See परी.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0683-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परीक्ष्
परीक्ष् {c1c} A.<BR>1 To examine, look<BR>at or scrutinize carefully; अतः<BR>परीक्ष्य कर्तव्यं विशेषात्संगतं रहः Ś. 5. 24;<BR>संतः परीक्ष्यान्यतरद्भजंते M. 1. 2;<BR>Ms. 9. 14.<BR>--2 To test, try, put to the<BR>test; मायां मयोद्भाव्य परीक्षितोऽसि<BR>R. 2. 65; यत्नात्परीक्षितः पुंस्त्वे Y. 1. 55<BR>‘carefully tested as to potency’.<BR>--3<BR>To observe, perceive.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0683-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परीक्षकः|परीक्षक
परीक्षकः An examiner,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0683-c" target="_blank">Page0683-c+ 54</a>]<BR>investigator, a judge.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0683-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परीक्षणं|परीक्षण
परीक्षणं Putting to test, testing,<BR>examining; Ms. 1. 117; Y. 2. 177.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0683-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परीक्षा
परीक्षा<BR>1 Examination, test, trial;<BR>पत्तने विद्यमानेपि ग्रामे रत्नपरीक्षा M. 1;<BR>Ms. 9. 19.<BR>--2 Trial by various<BR>kinds of ordeals (in law).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0683-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परीक्षित|परीक्षितः
परीक्षित p. p. Examined, tried,<BR>tested; परीक्षितं काव्यसुवर्णमेतत्<BR>Vikr. 1. 24.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0683-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परीक्षित्
परीक्षित् m. N. of a king, son of<BR>Abhimanyu and grandson of Arjuna.<BR>He succeeded to the throne of<BR>Hastināpura after Yudhiṣṭhira. He<BR>died of a snake-bite. The Kali age<BR>is said to have commenced with<BR>his reign.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0683-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परीणाहः|परीणाह
परीणाहः<BR>1 = परिणाह.<BR>--2 A piece<BR>of common land encircling a<BR>village.<BR>--3 An epithet of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0683-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परीताप
परीताप, परीपाक, परीवार-ह, परीहास<BR>&c. See परिताप &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0683-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परीपाक|परीपाकः
परीताप, परीपाक, परीवार-ह, परीहास<BR>&c. See परिताप &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0683-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परीवार|परीवारः
परीताप, परीपाक, परीवार-ह, परीहास<BR>&c. See परिताप &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0683-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परीवाह|परीवाहः
परीताप, परीपाक, परीवार-ह, परीहास<BR>&c. See परिताप &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0683-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परीहास|परीहासः
परीताप, परीपाक, परीवार-ह, परीहास<BR>&c. See परिताप &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0683-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परीप्सा
परीप्सा<BR>1 Desire of obtaining.<BR>--2 Haste, hurry.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0683-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परीरं|परीर
परीरं A fruit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0683-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परीरणं|परीरण
परीरणं<BR>1 A tortoise.<BR>--2 A stick.<BR>--3 A garment (पट्टशाटक).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0683-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परीष्टिः|परीष्टि
परीष्टिः f.<BR>1 Research, inquiry,<BR>investigation.<BR>--2 Service,<BR>attendance.<BR>--3 Respect, worship, homage.<BR>--4 Willingness, readiness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0683-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परुः|परु
परुः<BR>1 A joint, knot.<BR>--2 A limb,<BR>member.<BR>--3 The ocean.<BR>--4 Heaven,<BR>paradise.<BR>--5 A mountain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0683-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परुत्
परुत् ind. Last year.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0683-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परुद्वारः|परुद्वार
परुद्वारः A horse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0683-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परुष|परुषं
परुष a. [पॄ-उषन्]<BR>1 Hard,<BR>rough, rugged, stiff (opp. मृदु or<BR>श्लक्ष्ण); परुषं चर्म, परुषा माला &c.<BR>--2<BR>Harsh, abusive, severe, unkind,<BR>cruel, stern (as words); (वाक्)<BR>अपरुषा परुषाक्षरमीरिता R. 9. 8;<BR>Pt. 1. 50; said also of a person; स्निग्धे<BR>यत्परुषासि Gīt. 9; Y. 1. 310.<BR>--3<BR>Harsh or disagreeable to the ear (as<BR>a sound &c.); तेन वज्रपरुषस्वनं धनुः<BR>R. 11. 46; Me. 61.<BR>--4 Rough,<BR>coarse, rough to the touch, shaggy<BR>(as hair); शुद्धस्नानात्परुषमलकं<BR>Me. 91.<BR>--5 Sharp, violent, strong, keen,<BR>piercing (wind &c.);<BR>परुषपवनवेगोत्क्षिप्तसंशुष्कपर्णः Rs. 1. 22; 2. 28.<BR>--6 Gross.<BR>--7 Dirty.<BR>--8 Spotted,<BR>variegated.<BR>--9 Ved. Knotted.<BR>--षं<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0684-a" target="_blank">Page0684-a+ 56</a>]<BR>A harsh or abusive speech, abuse.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--अक्षर a. using harsh or<BR>abusive language; Pt. 1. 50<BR>--इतर<BR>a. other than rough, soft, mild;<BR>R. 5. 68.<BR>--उक्ति, f. वचनं abusive or<BR>harsh language.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0683-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परुषित
परुषित a. Treated roughly or<BR>harshly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0684-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परुषिमन्
परुषिमन् m. Ved. A shaggy<BR>appearance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0684-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परुस्
परुस् n.<BR>1 A joint, knot.<BR>--2 A<BR>limb or member of the body.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0684-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परे
परे (पर-इ) {c2c} P.<BR>1 To go or run<BR>away, flee, retreat; यः परैति स<BR>जीवांत Pt. 5. 88 ‘he who runs away<BR>saves his life’; cf. ‘to run for one's<BR>life.’<BR>--2 To reach, attain to;<BR>Ki. 1. 39.<BR>--3 To depart from this world<BR>die.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0684-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परेत|परेतः
परेत p. p. Deceased, departed,<BR>dead.<BR>--तः A spirit, a ghost.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--भर्तृ, --राज् m. the god of death,<BR>Yama; Śi. 1. 57.<BR>--भूमिः f.,<BR>--वासः a<BR>cemetery; Ku. 5. 68.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0684-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परेतिः|परेति
परेतिः f. Ved. Departure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0684-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परेद्यवि
परेद्यवि, परेद्युस् ind. The other<BR>day.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0684-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परेद्युस्
परेद्यवि, परेद्युस् ind. The other<BR>day.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0684-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परेष्टः
परेष्टः f., परेष्टुका A cow that has<BR>often calved.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0684-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परोक्ष|परोक्षं|परोक्षः
परोक्ष a.<BR>1 Out of or beyond<BR>the range of sight, invisible,<BR>escaping observation.<BR>--2 Absent; स्थाने<BR>वृता भूपतिभिः परोक्षैः R. 7. 13.<BR>--3<BR>Secret, unknown, stranger;<BR>परोक्षमन्मथो जनः Ś. 2. 18 ‘a stranger to<BR>the influence of love’; H. Pr. 10.<BR>--क्षः An ascetic.<BR>--क्षं<BR>1 Absence,<BR>invisibility.<BR>--2 (In gram.) Past<BR>time or tense (not witnessed by<BR>the speaker); परोक्षे लिट्<BR>P. III. 2. 115. Note. The acc. and loc.<BR>singulars of परोक्ष (i. e. परोक्षं, परोक्षे)<BR>are used adverbially in the sense<BR>of ‘in one's absence’, ‘out of sight’,<BR>‘behind one's back’, with or<BR>without a gen.; परोक्षे खलीकर्तुं शक्यते न<BR>ममाग्रतः Mk. 2; परोक्षे कार्यहतारं प्रत्यक्षे<BR>प्रियवादिनं Chāṇ. 18; नोदाहरेदस्य नाम<BR>परोक्षमपि केवलं Ms. 2. 119.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--अर्थ a. having a secret meaning.<BR>--कृता a hymn in which a deity is<BR>spoken of in the third person.<BR>--भोगः enjoyment of anything in<BR>the absence of the owner.<BR>--वृत्ति a.<BR>living out of sight. (--त्तिः f.) an<BR>unseen or obscure life.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0684-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परोमात्र
परोमात्र a. Ved. Immense, vast.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0684-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परोजरस्
परोजरस् a. Untouched by<BR>passions, pure; U. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0684-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परोवरम्
परोवरम् ind. Ved.<BR>1 From top to<BR>bottom.<BR>--2 From hand to hand<BR>--3 In succession.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0684-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परोवरीण|परोवरीणः
परोवरीण a. Having both superior<BR>and inferior.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0684-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परोवरीयस्
परोवरीयस् a. Ved.<BR>1 Broader on<BR>the outside.<BR>--2 Most excellent of<BR>all. --m.<BR>1 The Supreme being.<BR>--2<BR>The highest happiness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0684-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परोष्टिः|परोष्टि
परोष्टिः f. परोष्णी A cock-roach.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0684-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परोष्णी
परोष्टिः f. परोष्णी A cock-roach.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0684-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्कटः|पर्कट
पर्कटः A heron.<BR>--टं Regret,<BR>anxiety.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0684-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्कटिः|पर्कटि|पर्क्कटि
पर्कटिः --टी f., पर्कटिन् m.<BR>1 The<BR>wave-leaved fig-tree (प्लक्ष).<BR>--2 A<BR>fresh betel-nut.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0684-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्कटी
पर्कटिः --टी f., पर्कटिन् m.<BR>1 The<BR>wave-leaved fig-tree (प्लक्ष).<BR>--2 A<BR>fresh betel-nut.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0684-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्जन्यः|पर्जन्य|पर्ज्जन्य|पर्ज्जन्यः
पर्जन्यः<BR>1 A rain-cloud,<BR>thundering cloud, a cloud in general; प्रवृद्ध<BR>इव पर्जन्यः सारंगैरभिनंदितः R. 17. 15;<BR>Mk. 10. 60.<BR>--2 Rain; अन्नाद्भवंति भूतानि<BR>पर्जन्यादन्नसंभवः Bg. 3. 14.<BR>--3 The<BR>god of rain, i. e. Indra.<BR>--4 The<BR>muttering or roaring of clouds.<BR>--5 N.<BR>of Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0684-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्ण्
पर्ण् {c10c} U. (पर्णयति-ते) To make<BR>green or verdant; वसंतः पर्णयति चंपकं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0684-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्णं|पर्ण|पर्णः
पर्णं<BR>1 A pinion, wing; as in सुपर्ण.<BR>--2 The feather of an arrow.<BR>--3 A<BR>leaf.<BR>--4 The betel-leaf.<BR>--र्णः The<BR>Palāśa tree.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--अशनं<BR>feeding on leaves.<BR>--(नः) a cloud.<BR>--असिः a kind of basil.<BR>--आहार a.<BR>feeding upon leaves.<BR>--उटजं a hut of<BR>leaves, a hermit's hut, a hermitage.<BR>--कारः a vendor of betel-leaves.<BR>--कुटिका, --कुटी a hut made of<BR>leaves.<BR>--कृच्छ्रः a kind of expiatory<BR>penance which consists in living<BR>upon an infusion of leaves and<BR>Kuśa grass only for five days; see<BR>Y. 3. 317 and Mit. thereon.<BR>--खंडः<BR>a tree without apparent blossoms.<BR>--(डं) a collection of leaves.<BR>--चीरपटः an epithet of Śiva.<BR>--चोरकः a<BR>kind of perfume.<BR>--नरः the figure<BR>of a man made of leaves and burnt<BR>in place of a lost corpse.<BR>--भेदिनी<BR>the Priyaṅgu creeper.<BR>--भोजनः a<BR>goat.<BR>--मुच् m. the winter season<BR>(शिशिर).<BR>--मृगः any wild animal<BR>living in the boughs of trees<BR>&c.<BR>--रुह् m. the spring season<BR>(वसंत).<BR>--लता the betel-plant.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0684-c" target="_blank">Page0684-c+ 54</a>]<BR>--बाटिका pieces of areca-nut mixed with<BR>other spices and rolled up in<BR>betelleaves.<BR>--शय्या a bed or couch of<BR>leaves.<BR>--शाला a hut made of leaves,<BR>a hermitage; निर्दिष्टां कुलपतिना स<BR>पर्णशालामध्यास्य R. 1. 95; 12. 40.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0684-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्णल
पर्णल a. Full of or abounding in<BR>leaves, leafy; Bk. 6. 143.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0684-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्णासः|पर्णास
पर्णासः [Uṇ. 4. 107]<BR>1 A house<BR>standing in the midst of water, a<BR>summer-house.<BR>--2 A lotus.<BR>--3 A<BR>vegetable.<BR>--4 Decoration, toilet,<BR>adorning.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0684-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्णिन्
पर्णिन् m. A tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0684-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्णिल
पर्णिल a. See पर्णल.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0684-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्तृ
पर्तृ m. Ved.<BR>1 A protector.<BR>--2<BR>Means of defence.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0684-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्द्
पर्द् {c1c} A. (पर्दते) To break wind.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0684-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्दः|पर्द|पर्द्द|पर्द्दः
पर्दः<BR>1 A quantity of hair, thick<BR>hair.<BR>--2 A fart, breaking wind (<BR>पर्दनं also in this sense).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0684-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्प्
पर्प् {c1c} P. (पर्पति) To go, move.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0684-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्पः|पर्प|पर्पं
पर्पः<BR>1 Young grass.<BR>--2 A seat<BR>for cripples (पंगुपीठं),<BR>wheel-carriage in which cripples are moved<BR>about; येन पीठेन पंगवश्चरंति सं पर्पः<BR>Sk. on P. IV. 4. 10.<BR>--3 A house.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0684-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्पटः|पर्पट
पर्पटः A kind of medicinal<BR>plant.<BR>--टी<BR>1 A kind of fragrant<BR>earth.<BR>--2 A kind of perfume.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0684-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्परी
पर्परी A braid of hair.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0684-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्परीकः|पर्परीक
पर्परीकः<BR>1 The sun.<BR>--2 Fire.<BR>--3<BR>A reservoir, tank.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0684-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्पिकः|पर्पिक|पर्प्पिक
पर्पिकः --की A cripple who moves<BR>about in a chair.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0684-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्पिकी
पर्पिकः --की A cripple who moves<BR>about in a chair.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0684-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्ब्
पर्ब् {c1c} P. (पर्बति) To go, move.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0684-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यक्
पर्यक् ind. Round about, in every<BR>direction.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0684-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यग्निः|पर्यग्नि
पर्यग्निः Ved.<BR>1 Circumambient<BR>fire.<BR>--2 A torch carried round the<BR>sacrificial animal; or the ceremony<BR>of carrying round such fire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0684-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यंकः|पर्यङ्क|पर्यंक|पर्यङ्कः|पर्य्यङ्क|पर्य्यङ्कः
पर्यंकः<BR>1 A bed, couch, sofa.<BR>--2<BR>A palanquin.<BR>--3 A cloth girt round<BR>the back, loins, and kness (by a<BR>person) when sitting on his hams;<BR>cf. अवसक्थिका.<BR>--4 A particular kind<BR>of posture practised by ascetics in<BR>meditation, sitting on the hams;<BR>it is the same as वीरासन which is<BR>thus defined by Vasiṣṭha:<BR>--एकं<BR>पादमथैकस्मिन् विन्यस्योरौ तु संस्थितं ।<BR>इतरस्मिंस्वथैवोरुं वीरासनमुद हृतं ॥; पर्यंकग्रंथिबंध<BR>&c. Mk. 1. 1.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--बंधः sitting<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0685-a" target="_blank">Page0685-a+ 55</a>]<BR>on the hams, the posture called<BR>पर्यंकः पर्यंकबंधस्थिरपूर्वकायं Ku. 3. 45,<BR>59.<BR>--भोगिन् m. a kind of serpent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0684-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यटनं|पर्यटन|पर्य्यटन|पर्य्यटनं
पर्यटनं, पर्यटितं Wandering or<BR>roaming about, travelling over.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0685-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यटितं|पर्यटित
पर्यटनं, पर्यटितं Wandering or<BR>roaming about, travelling over.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0685-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यनुयोगः|पर्यनुयोग|पर्य्यनुयोग|पर्य्यनुयोगः
पर्यनुयोगः<BR>1 An inquiry with<BR>the object of contradicting or<BR>refuting a statement (दूषणार्थं जिज्ञासा<BR>Halāy.); एतेनास्यापि<BR>पर्यनुयोगस्यानवकाशः Dāy. B.<BR>--2 Asking, inquiring.<BR>--3 Censure, reproach.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0685-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यंत|पर्यन्त|पर्यन्तः|पर्य्यन्त|पर्य्यन्तः
पर्यंत a. Bounded by, extending<BR>as far as; सपुदपर्यंता पृथ्वी ‘the<BR>oceanbounded earth’.<BR>--तः<BR>1 Circuit.<BR>circumference.<BR>--2 Skirt, edge, border.<BR>extremity, boundary;<BR>उटजपर्यंतचारिणी Ś. 4: पर्यतवनं R. 13. 38;<BR>Rs. 3. 3.<BR>--3 Side, flank; Ratn. 2. 3:<BR>R. 18. 43.<BR>--4 End, conclusion,<BR>termination; Pt. 1. 125.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--देशः, --भूः, --भूमिः f. an adjoining district<BR>or region.<BR>--पर्वतः an adjoining hill.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0685-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यंतिका|पर्यन्तिका|पर्य्यन्तिका
पर्यंतिका Loss of good qualities,<BR>depravity, moral turpitude.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0685-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यन्य|पर्य्यन्य|पर्य्यन्यः
पर्यन्य = पर्जन्य q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0685-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्ययः|पर्यय|पर्य्यय|पर्य्ययः
पर्ययः<BR>1 Revolution, lapse,<BR>expiration; कालपर्ययात् Y. 3. 217;<BR>Ms. 1. 30.; 11. 27.<BR>--2 Waste or<BR>loss (of time).<BR>--3 Change,<BR>alteration.<BR>--4 Inversion; confusion,<BR>irregularity.<BR>--5 Deviation from<BR>customary observances, neglect of<BR>duty.<BR>--6 Opposition.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0685-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्ययणं|पर्ययण|पर्य्ययण|पर्य्ययणं
पर्ययणं<BR>1 Walking round,<BR>circumambulation.<BR>--2 A horse's<BR>saddle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0685-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यवदात|पर्य्यवदात
पर्यवदात a. Perfectly pure or<BR>clean.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0685-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यवरोधः|पर्यवरोध
पर्यवरोधः Obstruction,<BR>hinderance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0685-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यवशेषः|पर्यवशेष
पर्यवशेषः End, termination.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0685-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यवष्टंभ्|पर्यवष्टम्भ्
पर्यवष्टंभ् {c5c} {c9c} P. To besiege,<BR>surround; पर्यवष्टभ्यतामेतत्करालायतंन<BR>Māl. 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0685-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यवष्टंभनं|पर्यवष्टम्भन|पर्य्यवष्टम्भन
पर्यवष्टंभनं Surrounding, investing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0685-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यवसो
पर्यवसो {c4c} P.<BR>1 To complete,<BR>finish.<BR>--2 To determine, resolve.<BR>--3<BR>To result in, be reduced to, end in;<BR>एष एव समुच्चयः सद्योगंऽसद्योगे<BR>सदसद्योगे च पर्यवस्यतीति न पृथक् लक्ष्यते<BR>K. P. 10.<BR>--4 To perish, be lost,<BR>decline.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0685-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यवसानं|पर्यवसान|पर्य्यवसान
पर्यवसानं<BR>1 End, termination,<BR>conclusion.<BR>--2 Determination,<BR>ascertainment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0685-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यवसित|पर्य्यवसित
पर्यवसित p. p.<BR>1 Finished, ended,<BR>completed.<BR>--2 Perished, lost.<BR>--3<BR>Determined.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0685-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यवस्था|पर्य्यवस्था
पर्यवस्था {c1c} P.<BR>1 To set out.<BR>--2<BR>To be or exist everywhere.<BR>--3 To<BR>rely upon. --Caus. To compose or<BR>collect oneself; न पर्यवस्थापयत्यात्मानं<BR>V. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0685-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यवस्था|पर्य्यवस्था
पर्यवस्था, पर्यवस्थानं<BR>1 Opposition,<BR>resistance, obstruction.<BR>--2<BR>Contradiction.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0685-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यवस्थानं|पर्यवस्थान|पर्य्यवस्थान|पर्य्यवस्थानं
पर्यवस्था, पर्यवस्थानं<BR>1 Opposition,<BR>resistance, obstruction.<BR>--2<BR>Contradiction.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0685-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यवस्थातृ|पर्य्यवस्थातृ
पर्यवस्थातृ m. An adversary,<BR>antagonist.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0685-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यश्रु|पर्य्यश्रु
पर्यश्रु a. Bathed in or suffused<BR>with tears, shedding tears, tearful:<BR>पर्यश्रुणी मंगलभंगभीरुर्न लोचने मीलयितुं<BR>विषेहे Ki. 3. 36; पर्यश्रुरस्वजत मूर्धनि<BR>चं पजघ्रौ R. 13. 70.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0685-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यस्
पर्यस् {c4c} P.<BR>1 To throw or cast<BR>round, spread round, diffuse.<BR>--2 To<BR>spread over, surround; ताम्रौष्ठपर्य<BR>स्तरुचः स्मितस्य Ku. 1. 44.<BR>--3 To turn<BR>round; पर्यस्तविलोचनेन Ku. 3. 68<BR>--4 To shed, throw down (as tears);<BR>R. 10. 75; Ms. 11. 184.<BR>--5 To<BR>overturn, upset.<BR>--6 To throw about;<BR>R. 18. 13; 5. 49.<BR>--7 To entrap, ensnare.<BR>--8 To enclose.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0685-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यसनं|पर्यसन|पर्य्यसन
पर्यसनं<BR>1 Casting, throwing about<BR>--2 Sending forth, throwing.<BR>--3<BR>Sending away.<BR>--4 Putting off or<BR>away.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0685-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यस्त|पर्य्यस्त|पर्य्यस्तः
पर्यस्त p. p.<BR>1 Thrown round,<BR>scattered over or about; पर्यस्तो<BR>धनंजयस्योपरि शिलीमुखासारः Ve. 4:<BR>Śi. 10. 91.<BR>--2 Surrounded,<BR>encompassed.<BR>--3 Upset, overturned.<BR>--4 Dismissed, laid aside.<BR>--5 Struck,<BR>hurt; killed.<BR>--6 Bound.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0685-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यस्तिः|पर्यस्ति|पर्य्यस्ति
पर्यस्तिः f., पर्यस्तिका Sitting upon<BR>the hams; see पर्यंक {3}<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0685-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यासः|पर्यास|पर्य्यास|पर्य्यासः
पर्यासः<BR>1 End, conclusion,<BR>termination.<BR>--2 Rotation, revolution.<BR>--3 Inverted order or position.<BR>--4<BR>Killing.<BR>--5 Falling down.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0685-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यासनं|पर्यासन
पर्यासनं Revolution.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0685-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्याकुल|पर्य्याकुल
पर्याकुल a.<BR>1 Turbid, foul (as<BR>water).<BR>--2 Confused, confounded,<BR>frightened; Ś. 1.<BR>--3 Disordered,<BR>dishevelled; Ś. 1. 30.<BR>--4 Excited,<BR>agitated, bewildered; पर्याकुलोस्मि<BR>Ś. 6; Rs. 6. 22.<BR>--5 Full of, filled with:<BR>स्नेह˚, क्रोध˚ &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0685-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्याकुलता
पर्याकुलता --त्वं Confusion;<BR>Ku. 2. 25.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0685-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्याकुलत्वं|पर्याकुलत्व
पर्याकुलता --त्वं Confusion;<BR>Ku. 2. 25.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0685-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यागम्
पर्यागम् {c1c} P.<BR>1 To approach.<BR>--2<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0685-c" target="_blank">Page0685-c+ 56</a>]<BR>To be completed or finished.<BR>--3 To<BR>conquer, subdue.<BR>--4 To surround,<BR>encircle.<BR>--5 To elapse.<BR>--6 To last, live.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0685-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यागत
पर्यागत a. One who has finished<BR>his worldly career.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0685-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्याणं|पर्याण|पर्य्याण|पर्य्याणं
पर्याणं A saddle; दत्तपर्याणं<BR>K. 126 ‘saddled’.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0685-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्याप्
पर्याप् {c5c} P. (used generally in<BR>p. p.)<BR>1 To be competent; पर्याप्तं<BR>त्विदमेतेषां बलं भीष्माभिरक्षितं Bg. 1. 10;<BR>Ms. 11. 7.<BR>--2 To be able.<BR>--3 To be<BR>full: as in पर्यप्तकलः, पर्याप्तदक्षिणः.<BR>--4 To save, defend, preserve; इमां<BR>परीप्सुर्दुर्जातेः M. 5. 11.<BR>--5 To finish.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0685-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्याप्त|पर्याप्तं|पर्य्याप्त|पर्य्याप्तं
पर्याप्त p. p.<BR>1 Obtained, got<BR>gained; U. 5. 34.<BR>--2 Finished,<BR>completed.<BR>--3 Full, whole, entire, complete,<BR>all; पर्याप्तचंद्रेव शरित्त्रयामा<BR>Ku. 7. 26; R. 6. 44.<BR>--4 Able,<BR>competent, adequate; R. 10. 25.<BR>--5<BR>Enough, sufficient; R. 15. 11,<BR>17. 17; Ms. 11. 7.<BR>--6 Large, extensive,<BR>spacious.<BR>--7 Abundant, copious,<BR>many; Ku. 3. 39.<BR>--त्पं ind.<BR>1<BR>Willingly, readily.<BR>--2 To one's<BR>satisfaction. enough, sufficiently;<BR>पर्याप्तमाचामति U. 4. 1 ‘drinks his fill.’<BR>--3<BR>Fully, adequately, ably,<BR>competently.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0685-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्याप्ति|पर्याप्तिः|पर्य्याप्ति|पर्य्याप्तिः
पर्याप्ति f.<BR>1 Obtaining, acquisition.<BR>--2 End, conclusion, close.<BR>--3 Enough,<BR>fulness, sufficiency.<BR>--4 Satiety,<BR>satisfaction.<BR>--5 Preserving, guarding,<BR>warding off a blow.<BR>--6 Fitness,<BR>competency.<BR>--7 Willingness,<BR>readiness<BR>--8 Distinction of objects<BR>according to their natural properties.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0685-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्याप्लावः|पर्याप्लाव|पर्य्याप्लाव
पर्याप्लावः<BR>1 Revolution.<BR>--2<BR>Encircling.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0685-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यायः|पर्याय|पर्य्याय|पर्य्यायः
पर्यायः<BR>1 Going or winding round,<BR>revolution.<BR>--2 Lapse, course,<BR>expiration (of time).<BR>--3 Regular<BR>recurrence or repetition.<BR>--4 Turn,<BR>succession, due or regular order;<BR>पर्यायसवामुत्सृज्य Ku. 2. 36;<BR>Māl. 9. 32; Ms. 4. 87; Mu. 3. 27.<BR>--5<BR>Method, arrangement.<BR>--6 Manner,<BR>way, method of proceeding.<BR>--7 A<BR>synonym, convertible term; पर्यायो<BR>निधनस्यायं निर्धनत्वं शरीरिणां Pt. 2. 99;<BR>पर्वतस्य पर्याया इमे &c.<BR>--8 An<BR>opportunity, occasion.<BR>--9 Creation,<BR>formation, preparation, manufacture<BR>--10 Comprehensiveness.<BR>--11 A<BR>strophe of a hymn.<BR>--12 Property,<BR>quality.<BR>--13 (In Rhet.) A figure of<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0686-a" target="_blank">Page0686-a+ 55</a>]<BR>speech; see K. P. 10;<BR>Chandr. 5. 108, 109; S. D. 733. (Note. पर्यायेण<BR>is often used adverbially in the<BR>sense of:<BR>1 in turn or succession, by<BR>regular gradation;<BR>--2 occasionally,<BR>now and then; पर्यायेण हि दृश्यंते स्वप्ताः<BR>कामं शुभाशुभाः Ve. 2. 13).<BR>--Comp.<BR>--अन्नं food intended for another.<BR>--उक्तं a figure of speech in Rhetoric;<BR>it is a circumlocutory or periphrastic<BR>way of speaking, when the fact to<BR>be intimated is expressed by a turn<BR>of speech or periphrasis; e. g. see<BR>Chandr. 5. 66 or S. D. 733.<BR>--च्युत a.<BR>supplanted, superseded.<BR>--वचनं --शब्दः<BR>a synonym.<BR>--शयनं alternate<BR>sleeping and watching.<BR>--सेवा service<BR>by rotation; Ku. 2. 36.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0685-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यारिणी|पर्य्यारिणी
पर्यारिणी A cow afflicted with<BR>diseases.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0686-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्याली|पर्य्याली
पर्याली ind. A particle<BR>expressing ‘harm or injury’, (हिंसन) used<BR>with कृ, भू or अस्; पर्यालीकृत्य =<BR>हिंसित्वा.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0686-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यालोच्
पर्यालोच् {c10c} U. To reflect,<BR>consider, think about.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0686-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यालोचनं|पर्यालोचन|पर्य्यालोचन
पर्यालोचनं --ना<BR>1<BR>Circumspection, attentive observation,<BR>deliberation, mature reflection.<BR>--2<BR>Knowing, recognition.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0686-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यालोचना
पर्यालोचनं --ना<BR>1<BR>Circumspection, attentive observation,<BR>deliberation, mature reflection.<BR>--2<BR>Knowing, recognition.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0686-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यावर्तः|पर्यावर्त
पर्यावर्तः^1, पर्यावर्तनं Coming back,<BR>return.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20170110. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/CORRECTIONS/issues/332,. note: lost repha.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0686-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यावर्तनं|पर्यावर्तन|पर्य्यावर्त्तन
पर्यावर्तः^1, पर्यावर्तनं Coming back,<BR>return.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20170110. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/CORRECTIONS/issues/332,. note: lost repha.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0686-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्याविल|पर्य्याविल
पर्याविल a. Very muddy or<BR>turbid, much soiled; R. 7. 40.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0686-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्याहारः|पर्याहार|पर्य्याहार
पर्याहारः<BR>1 A yoke worn across<BR>the shoulders in carrying a load.<BR>--2<BR>Conveying.<BR>--3 A load or burden.<BR>--4<BR>A pitcher.<BR>--5 Storing grain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0686-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्युक्षणं|पर्युक्षण|पर्य्युक्षण
पर्युक्षणं Sprinkling round water<BR>silently and without uttering any<BR>ritual formulæ or Mantras.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0686-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्युत्थानं|पर्युत्थान|पर्य्युत्थान
पर्युत्थानं Standing up.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0686-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्युत्सुक|पर्य्युत्सुक
पर्युत्सुक a.<BR>1 Sorrowful, sorry,<BR>regretting, sad; ˚त्वं sorrow;<BR>R. 5. 67; पर्युत्सुकीभवति यत्सुखितोऽपि जंतुः<BR>Ś. 5. 2.<BR>--2 Eagerly desirous, anxious,<BR>anxiously longing for; स्मर पर्युसुत्क<BR>एष माधवः Ku. 4. 28; V. 2. 16.<BR>--3<BR>Agitated, excited; मुहूर्तं पर्युत्मुकमना<BR>आसीत् Ś. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0686-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्युदंचनं|पर्युदञ्चन|पर्युदंचन|पर्य्युदञ्चन|पर्य्युदञ्चनं
पर्युदंचनं^1<BR>1 Debt.<BR>--2 Raising<BR>up, drawing out (उद्धार).<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20160521. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/CORRECTIONS/issues/259. note: anusvAra missing in print; same as paryudaYcanam in AP.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0686-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्युदस्
पर्युदस् {c4c} P.<BR>1 To reject,<BR>exclude.<BR>--2 To prohibit, object to<BR>--3 To heap together.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0686-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्युदस्त|पर्य्युदस्त|पर्य्युदस्तः
पर्युदस्त p. p.<BR>1 Excluded,<BR>excepted.<BR>--2 Prohibited, objected to (as<BR>a ceremony).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0686-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्युदासः|पर्युदास|पर्य्युदास|पर्य्युदासः
पर्युदासः An exception, a<BR>prohibitive rule or precept.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0686-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्युपस्थानं|पर्युपस्थान
पर्युपस्थानं Serving, waiting<BR>upon, attendance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0686-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्युपास्
पर्युपास्^1 {c2c} A.<BR>1 To attend<BR>upon, worship, attend<BR>respectfully; पर्युपास्यंत लक्ष्या R. 10. 62;<BR>Ku. 2. 38; Ms. 7. 37.<BR>--2 To go to (for<BR>protection), resort to, seek shelter<BR>or patronage with; अशक्ता एव सर्वत्र<BR>नरेद्रं पर्युपासते Pt. 1. 241.<BR>--3 To<BR>enclose, surround.<BR>--4 To share in<BR>partake of.<BR>--5 To sit on.<BR>--6 To<BR>live round.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20170110. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/CORRECTIONS/issues/332,. note: wrong placed repha.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0686-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्युपासक
पर्युपासक, --सिन् --सितृ m. A<BR>worshipper.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0686-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्युपासिन्
पर्युपासक, --सिन् --सितृ m. A<BR>worshipper.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0686-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्युपासितृ
पर्युपासक, --सिन् --सितृ m. A<BR>worshipper.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0686-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्युपासनं|पर्युपासन|पर्य्युपासन
पर्युपासनं<BR>1 Worship, honour,<BR>service.<BR>--2 Friendliness, courtesy.<BR>--3<BR>Sitting round.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0686-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्युप्तिः|पर्युप्ति
पर्युप्तिः f. Sowing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0686-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्युषणं|पर्युषण
पर्युषणं Worship, adoration,<BR>service.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0686-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्युषित|पर्य्युषित|पर्य्युषितं
पर्युषित a.<BR>1 Stale, not fresh; cf.<BR>अपर्युषित.<BR>--2 Insipid.<BR>--3 Stupid.<BR>--4<BR>Vain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0686-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्येषणं|पर्येषण
पर्येषणं --णा<BR>1 Investigation by<BR>reasoning.<BR>--2 Search, inquiry in<BR>general.<BR>--3 Homage, worship.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0686-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्येषणा|पर्य्येषणा
पर्येषणं --णा<BR>1 Investigation by<BR>reasoning.<BR>--2 Search, inquiry in<BR>general.<BR>--3 Homage, worship.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0686-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्येष्टिः|पर्येष्टि|पर्य्येष्टि
