पर्व्
पर्व् {c1c} P. (पर्वति) To fill.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0686-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

