पललः|पलल|पललं
पललः A demon, goblin, an evil<BR>spirit.<BR>--लं<BR>1 Flesh.<BR>--2 Mire,<BR>mud.<BR>--3 A sweetmeat made of<BR>ground sesamum and sugar.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--आशयः swelled neck.<BR>--ज्वरः gall,<BR>bile.<BR>--प्रियः {1} a raven. {2} a<BR>demon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0687-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पलक्ष
पलक्ष a. Ved. White.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0687-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पलवः|पलव
पलवः A kind of net or basket<BR>for catching fish.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0687-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

