पलापः|पलाप
पलापः<BR>1 The temples of an<BR>elephant.<BR>--2 A halter, rope.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0687-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पलाय्
पलाय् {c1c} A.<BR>1 To flee, run away,<BR>retreat, fly away.<BR>--2 To escape.<BR>--3<BR>To die away.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0687-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पलायक
पलायक a.<BR>1 Flying.<BR>--2 A<BR>fugitive.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0687-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पलायनं|पलायन
पलायनं<BR>1 Running away, retreat,<BR>flight, escape; Bg. 18. 43,<BR>R. 19. 31.<BR>--2 A saddle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0687-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पलायित|पलायितः
पलायित p. p. Fled, retreated, run<BR>away, escaped.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0687-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पलायिन्
पलायिन् a. Fleeing, running away,<BR>a fugitive.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0687-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पलालिः|पलालि
पलालिः A heap of flesh.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0687-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पलालः|पलाल|पलालं
पलालः, --लं Straw, husk;<BR>N. 8. 2.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--दोहदः the mango tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0687-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पलालं|पलाल|पलालः
पलालः, --लं Straw, husk;<BR>N. 8. 2.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--दोहदः the mango tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0687-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पलाश|पलाशं|पलाशः
पलाश a.<BR>1 Green.<BR>--2 Unkind,<BR>cruel.<BR>--शः<BR>1 A demon.<BR>--2 N. of the<BR>Magadha country.<BR>--3 N. of a tree,<BR>Butea Frondosa (also called किंशुक);<BR>नवपलाशपलाशवनं पुरः Śi. 6. 2.<BR>--शं<BR>1 The flower or blossom of this tree;<BR>बालेंदुवक्राण्यविकाशभावाद्बंभुः<BR>पलाशान्यतिलोहितानि Ku. 3. 29.<BR>--2 A leaf or<BR>petal in general;<BR>चलत्पलाशांतरगोचरास्तरोः Śi. 1. 21, 6. 2.<BR>--3 The green<BR>colour.<BR>--शी Lac.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0687-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पलाशकः|पलाशक
पलाशकः The tree Palāśa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0687-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पलाशिन्
पलाशिन् a. Leafy. --m. A tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0687-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पलिक्नी
पलिक्नी<BR>1 An old, grey-haired<BR>woman.<BR>--2 A cow for the first time<BR>with calf (बालगर्भिणी).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0687-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पलिघः|पलिघ
पलिघः<BR>1 A glass-vessel, pitcher.<BR>--2 A wall or rampart.<BR>--3 An iron<BR>club; cf. परिघ.<BR>--4 A cow-pen (गोगृह).<BR>--5 The gateway of a building.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0687-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पलित|पलितं|पलितः
पलित a. Grey, hoary,<BR>grey-haired, old, aged; तातस्य मे<BR>पलितमौलिनिरस्तकाशे (शिरसि) Ve. 3. 19.<BR>--तं<BR>1<BR>Grey hair, or the greyness of hair<BR>brought on by old age;<BR>कैकेयीशंकयेवाह पलितच्छद्मना जरा R. 12. 2;<BR>Ms. 6. 2.<BR>--2 Much or ornamented hair.<BR>--3 A tuft of hair (केशपाश).<BR>--4<BR>Mud, mire.<BR>--5 Heat.<BR>--6 Benzoin.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0687-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पलितंकरण
