पलितंभविष्णु
पलितंभविष्णु a. Becoming grey.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0687-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पलितिन्
