पांचशब्दिकं|पाञ्चशब्दिक|पांचशब्दिक|पाञ्चशब्दिकं
पांचशब्दिकं<BR>1 Music of five<BR>kinds.<BR>--2 Musical instruments in<BR>general.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0690-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पांचार्थिकः|पाञ्चार्थिक|पाञ्चार्थिकः
