पादिक
पादिक a. (की f.) Amounting to<BR>a quarter or fourth; पादिकं शतं 25 per<BR>cent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0694-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पादिन्
पादिन् a.<BR>1 Footed, having feet.<BR>--2 Having four parts, as a stanza.<BR>--3 Receiving or entitled to a fourth<BR>part. --m.<BR>1 An amphibious animal.<BR>--2 A heir to a fourth part of an<BR>estate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0694-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पादिनः|पादिन
