पारसिकः|पारसिक
पारसिकः<BR>1 Persia.<BR>--2 = पारसीक {2}<BR>q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0696-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पारसी
पारसी The Persian language.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0696-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पारसीकः|पारसीक
पारसीकः<BR>1 Persia.<BR>--2 A Persian<BR>horse.<BR>--काः (m. pl.) The Persians.<BR>पारसीकांस्ततो जेतुं प्रतस्थे स्थालवर्त्मना<BR>R. 4. 60.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0696-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पारस्करः|पारस्कर
