पारस्यकुलीन
पारस्यकुलीन a. Born in the<BR>family of another (as an adopted son).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0696-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पारहंस्य
