पारायणिकः|पारायणिक
पारायणिकः<BR>1 A lecturer, reader<BR>of the Purāṇas or mythological<BR>works.<BR>--2 A pupil, scholar.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0696-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पारावतः|पारावत
पारावतः<BR>1 A pigeon, turtle-dove,<BR>dove; पारावतः खरशिलाकणमात्रभोजी<BR>कामी भवत्यनुदिनं वद कोत्र हेतुः<BR>Bh. 3. 154; Me. 38.<BR>--2 A monkey.<BR>--3 A<BR>mountain.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--अंघ्रिपिच्छः a<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0696-c" target="_blank">Page0696-c+ 53</a>]<BR>kind of pigeon.<BR>--घ्नी N. of the river<BR>Sarasvatī.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0696-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पारावारीण|पारावारीणः
पारावारीण a.<BR>1 One who goes to<BR>both sides.<BR>--2 Completely<BR>conversant with.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0696-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पाराशरः|पाराशर|पाराशरं
