पाराशरिः|पाराशरि
पाराशरिः<BR>1 An epithet of Śuka.<BR>--2<BR>N. of Vyāsa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0696-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पाराशरिन्
पाराशरिन् m.<BR>1 A religious<BR>mendicant.<BR>--2 Particularly, such religious<BR>mendicants or ascetics as study the<BR>Śārīra Sūtras of Vyāsa (pl.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0696-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

