पिच्छल
पिच्छल a. Slimy, slippery.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0700-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पिच्छका
पिच्छका The feathers of a<BR>peacock's tail tied in a bunch, a<BR>feather-brush (used by conjurors &c.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0700-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पिच्छिल|पिच्छिलं|पिच्छिलः
पिच्छिल a. [पिच्छ्-बा˚ इल]<BR>1<BR>Slimy, lubricious, slippery, smeary;<BR>तरुणं सर्षपशाकं नवौदनं पिच्छिलानि च<BR>दधीनि Cand. M. 1.<BR>--2 Having a<BR>tail.<BR>--लः --ला, --लं<BR>1 The scum of<BR>boiled rice (भक्तमंड).<BR>--2 Sauce<BR>mixed with rice-gruel.<BR>--3 Curds with<BR>cream on the surface.<BR>--4 Broth,<BR>soup.<BR>--5 Moist split pulse.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--त्वच् m. the orange tree or its<BR>peel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0700-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पिंच्छं
