पिंज्|पिञ्ज्
पिंज् {vI.v} {c2c} A. (पिंक्ते)<BR>1 To tinge<BR>dye.<BR>--2 To touch.<BR>--3 To adore.<BR>--4<BR>To sound.<BR>--5 To join. {vII.v} {c10c} U.<BR>(पिंजयति-ते)<BR>1 To give.<BR>--2 To take.<BR>--3 To shine.<BR>--4 To be strong or<BR>powerful.<BR>--5 To live, dwell.<BR>--6 To<BR>hurt, injure, kill.<BR>--7 To speak.<BR>--8<BR>To send forth a sound.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0700-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पिंज|पिञ्ज|पिञ्जं|पिञ्जः
पिंज a. Confused, disturbed in<BR>mind.<BR>--जः<BR>1 The moon.<BR>--2 A<BR>species of camphor.<BR>--3 Killing, slaughter.<BR>--4 A heap, collection.<BR>--जं Strength,<BR>power.<BR>--जा<BR>1 Injury, hurting<BR>--2<BR>Turmeric.<BR>--3 Cotton.<BR>--4 A switch.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0700-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

