पिंजर|पिञ्जर|पिञ्जरं|पिञ्जरः
पिंजर a. [पिंज्-अरच्]<BR>Reddishyellow, tawny, gold-coloured;<BR>शिखा प्रदीपस्य सुवर्णपिंजरा Mk. 3. 17;<BR>R. 18. 40.<BR>--रः<BR>1 The<BR>reddish-yellow or tawny-brown colour.<BR>--2 The<BR>yellow colour.<BR>--रं<BR>1 Gold.<BR>--2<BR>Yellow orpiment.<BR>--3 A skeleton.<BR>--4 A<BR>cage (for पंजर).<BR>--5 The ribs or the<BR>cavity formed by them, the thorax.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0700-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पिंजरकं|पिञ्जरक|पिंजरक|पिञ्जरकं
