पिप्पलः|पिप्पल|पिप्पलं
पिप्पलः<BR>1 The holy fig-tree;<BR>Y. 1. 302.<BR>--2 A nipple.<BR>--3 The sleeve<BR>of a jacket or coat.<BR>--4 A bird kept<BR>free (not confined in a cage).<BR>--लं<BR>1<BR>A berry in general.<BR>--2 A berry of<BR>the holy fig-tree.<BR>--3 Sensual<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0703-c" target="_blank">Page0703-c+ 55</a>]<BR>enjoyment.<BR>--4 Water.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0703-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

