पिप्पिका^1 The tartar of the teeth.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20170209. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/CORRECTIONS/issues/336. note: lost diacritics.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0703-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

