पीतिः|पीति
पीतिः A horse. --f.<BR>1 Draught,<BR>drinking.<BR>--2 A tavern.<BR>--3 The<BR>proboscis of an elephant.<BR>--4 Going.<BR>--5 Protection (Ved.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0705-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पीतिन्
