पीलकः|पीलक
पीलकः The large black ant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0705-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पीलुः|पीलु
पीलुः [पील्-उ]<BR>1 An arrow.<BR>--2<BR>An atom.<BR>--3 An insect.<BR>--4 An<BR>elephant.<BR>--5 The stem of the palm.<BR>--6<BR>A flower.<BR>--7 A group of palm trees.<BR>--8 A kind of tree.<BR>--9 A heap of<BR>bones.<BR>--10 The central part of the<BR>hand.<BR>--लु n. The fruit of the Pīlu<BR>tree<BR>--Comp.<BR>--पत्रः the Mūrvā plant.<BR>--पर्णी {1} a kind of drug. {2} N. of<BR>two plants.<BR>--पाकवादिन् m. a<BR>Vaiśeshika (one who maintains the<BR>doctrine that heat acts only on the<BR>atoms of matter, as of a jar, and not<BR>on the whole body).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0705-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पीलुकः|पीलुक
पीलुकः An ant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0705-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पीव्
पीव् {c1c} P. (पीवति) To be fat or<BR>corpulent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0705-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पीव
पीव, पीवर, पीवस a. Fat, corpulent<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0705-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पीवर|पीवरः
पीव, पीवर, पीवस a. Fat, corpulent<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0705-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पीवस
पीव, पीवर, पीवस a. Fat, corpulent<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0705-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पीवन्
पीवन् a. (पीवरी f.) [प्यै-क्वनिप् संप्र˚<BR>दीर्घः]<BR>1 Full, fat, large.<BR>--2 Stout,<BR>strong. --m. Wind.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0705-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पीवर|पीवरः
पीवर a. (रा or री f.) [प्यै-ष्वरच्<BR>संप्र˚ दीर्घः]<BR>1 Fat, large, stout, fleshy,<BR>corpulent; R. 3. 8; 5. 65; 19. 32.<BR>--2 Plump, thick.<BR>--रः A tortoise.<BR>--री<BR>1 A young woman.<BR>--2 A cow<BR>--Comp.<BR>--स्तनी {1} a woman with fat<BR>or large breasts. {2} a cow with a<BR>large udder.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0705-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

