पुंगं|पुङ्ग|पुंग|पुंगः|पुङ्गः
पुंगः, --गं A heap, collection,<BR>mul itude.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0706-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुंगलः|पुङ्गल|पुंगल|पुङ्गलः
