पुच्छः|पुच्छ|पुच्छं
पुच्छः --च्छं<BR>1 A tail in general;<BR>पश्चात्पच्छं वहति विपुलं U. 4. 27.<BR>--2<BR>A hairy tail.<BR>--3 A peacock's tail<BR>--4 The hinder part.<BR>--5 The end of<BR>anything.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--अग्रं, --मूलं the<BR>tip of the tail.<BR>--कंटकः a<BR>scorpion.<BR>--जाहं the root of the tail.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0706-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुच्छं|पुच्छ|पुच्छः
पुच्छः --च्छं<BR>1 A tail in general;<BR>पश्चात्पच्छं वहति विपुलं U. 4. 27.<BR>--2<BR>A hairy tail.<BR>--3 A peacock's tail<BR>--4 The hinder part.<BR>--5 The end of<BR>anything.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--अग्रं, --मूलं the<BR>tip of the tail.<BR>--कंटकः a<BR>scorpion.<BR>--जाहं the root of the tail.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0706-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुच्छिन्
पुच्छिन् a. Having a tail. --m.<BR>1<BR>A cock.<BR>--2 The Arka plant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0706-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुच्छटिः|पुच्छटि
