पुंजिः|पुञ्जि|पुंजि|पुञ्जिः
पुंजिः f. A heap, quantity, mass.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--ष्ठ a. heaped.<BR>--(ष्ठः) Ved.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0706-c" target="_blank">Page0706-c+ 56</a>]<BR>{1} a fisherman. {2} a bird-catcher.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0706-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

