पृच्छा
पृच्छा<BR>1 Questioning, asking,<BR>inquiring.<BR>--2 An inquiry into the future.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0718-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

