पृण्
पृड्, पृण् {c6c} P. (पृड-ण-ति) To<BR>delight, please.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0718-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पृत्
