पैठर|पैठरं
पैठर a. (री f.) Boiled in a पिठर,<BR>q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0720-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पैठीनसिः|पैठीनसि
पैठीनसिः N. of an ancient sage,<BR>author of a system of laws.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0720-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पैंडिक्यं|पैण्डिक्य|पैंडिक्य
