पोटकः A servant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0721-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पोटा
पोटा<BR>1 A masculine woman, a<BR>woman with a beard or such other<BR>masculine features.<BR>--2 A<BR>hermaphrodite.<BR>--3 A female servant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0721-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पोटिकः|पोटिक
पोटिकः A boil.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0721-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पोटी
पोटी<BR>1 A large alligator.<BR>--2 The<BR>rectum.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0721-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पोट्टलिका
पोट्टलिका, पोट्टली A bundle,<BR>packet, parcel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0721-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पोट्टली
पोट्टलिका, पोट्टली A bundle,<BR>packet, parcel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0721-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पोडुः|पोडु
पोडुः The bone forming the<BR>upper part of the skull.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0721-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पोतः|पोत
पोतः [पू-तन्; Uṇ. 3. 86]<BR>1 The<BR>young of any animal, cub, colt, foal<BR>&c.; पिब स्तन्यं पोत Bv. 1. 60;<BR>मृगपोतः, शार्दूल˚ Mu. 2. 8; करिपोतः &c.;<BR>वीरपोतः a young warrior; U. 5. 3.<BR>--2 An elephant ten years old.<BR>--3 A<BR>ship, raft, boat; पोतो<BR>दुस्तरवारिराशितरणे H. 2. 165.<BR>--4 A garment,<BR>cloth.<BR>--5 The young shoot of a<BR>plant.<BR>--6 The site or foundation of a<BR>house.<BR>--7 A fœtus having no<BR>enveloping membrane.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--आच्छादनं a tent.<BR>--आधानं a shoal of<BR>small fish.<BR>--धारिन् m. the master of<BR>a vessel.<BR>--प्लवः a mariner, seaman.<BR>--भंगः a ship-wreck.<BR>--रक्षः the<BR>rudder of a boat or ship.<BR>--वणिज् m.<BR>a sea-faring merchant.<BR>--वाहः a<BR>rower, steersman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0721-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पोतकः|पोतक
पोतकः<BR>1 The young of an animal.<BR>--2 A young plant.<BR>--3 The site of a<BR>house.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0721-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पोतन
पोतन a.<BR>1 Sacred, holy.<BR>--2<BR>Purifying.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0721-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पोतासः|पोतास
पोतासः A kind of camphor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0721-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पोतृ
पोतृ m.<BR>1 One of the sixteen<BR>officiating priests at a sacrifice<BR>(assistant of the priest called ब्रह्मन्).<BR>--2 An epithet of Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0721-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पोत्या
पोत्या A multitude of boats.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0721-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पोत्रं|पोत्र
पोत्रं [पू-त्र]<BR>1 The snout of a hog.<BR>--2 A boat, ship.<BR>--3 A plough<BR>share.<BR>--4 The thunderbolt.<BR>--5 A<BR>garment.<BR>--6 The office of the Potṛ.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--आयुधः a hog, boar.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0721-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पोत्रिन्
पोत्रिन् m. A hog, boar.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0721-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पोथकी
पोथकी Red pimples on the<BR>eyelids.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0721-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पोलः|पोल
