पोषिन्
पोषिन्, पोष्टृ a. [पुष्-णिनि तृच् च]<BR>One who feeds, nourishes &c. --m.<BR>A feeder, nourisher, protector.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0721-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पोष्टृ
पोषिन्, पोष्टृ a. [पुष्-णिनि तृच् च]<BR>One who feeds, nourishes &c. --m.<BR>A feeder, nourisher, protector.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0721-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पोष्य|पोष्यः
पोष्य a. [पुष्-कर्मणि ण्यत्]<BR>1 To be<BR>fed, nourished or supported.<BR>--2<BR>Well-fed, thriving.<BR>--3 Causing<BR>prosperity.<BR>--4 Abundant, copious.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--पुत्रः, --सुतः an adopted<BR>son.<BR>--वर्गः a class of relatives, who<BR>must be nourished and protected.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0721-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

