पौगंड|पौगण्ड|पौगण्डं
पौगंड a. (डी f.) Boyish.<BR>--डं,<BR>--पौगडकं Boyhood (from the 5th to<BR>the 16th years).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0721-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पौंडरीक|पौण्डरीक|पौण्डरीकं|पौण्डरीकः
