पौंडर्यं|पौण्डर्य|पौण्डर्य्य|पौण्डर्य्यं
पौंडर्यं A kind of drug used as a<BR>remedy for diseased eyes.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0721-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पौंड्रः|पौण्ड्र|पौंड्र|पौण्ड्रः
पौंड्रः<BR>1 N. of a country.<BR>--2 A<BR>king or inhabitant of that country.<BR>--3 A kind of sugarcane.<BR>--4 A<BR>sectarial mark.<BR>--5 N. of the<BR>conchshell of Bhīma; पौंड्रं दध्मौ महाशंखं<BR>भीमकर्मा वृकोदरः Bg. 1. 15.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0721-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पौंड्रकः|पौण्ड्रक|पौंड्रक|पौण्ड्रकः
पौंड्रकः<BR>1 A kind of sugarcane,<BR>--2 A mixed caste (of sugar-boilers);<BR>cf. Ms. 10. 44.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0721-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

