पौण्य
पौण्य a. Virtuous, holy, upright,<BR>righteous.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0722-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

