प्रतिच्छद्
प्रतिच्छद् {c10c} U.<BR>1 To cover,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0737-a" target="_blank">Page0737-a+ 56</a>]<BR>envelop, clothe.<BR>--2 To hide, conceal.<BR>--3 To endow, furnish or provide<BR>with.<BR>--4 To obscure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0736-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिच्छदनं|प्रतिच्छदन|प्रतिछदन
प्रतिच्छदनं A cover, a piece of<BR>cloth for a covering.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0737-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिच्छंदः|प्रतिच्छन्द|प्रतिच्छंद|प्रतिच्छन्दः|प्रतिछन्द
प्रतिच्छंदः, प्रतिच्छंदकः<BR>1 A likeness,<BR>picture, statue, an image.<BR>--2 A<BR>substitute; Śi. 12. 29.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0737-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिच्छंदकः|प्रतिच्छन्दक|प्रतिच्छंदक|प्रतिच्छन्दकः
प्रतिच्छंदः, प्रतिच्छंदकः<BR>1 A likeness,<BR>picture, statue, an image.<BR>--2 A<BR>substitute; Śi. 12. 29.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0737-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिछन्न|प्रतिच्छन्न
प्रतिछन्न p. p.<BR>1 Covered, covered<BR>over, enveloped; Pt. 1. 394<BR>--2<BR>Hidden, concealed.<BR>--3 Furnished or<BR>provided with.<BR>--4 Beset, hemmed<BR>in.<BR>--5 Clothed or dressed, clad;<BR>Pt. 4. 45.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0737-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिच्छेदः|प्रतिच्छेद|प्रतिछेद
प्रतिच्छेदः Resistance, opposition.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0737-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिजन्य
प्रतिजन्य a. Ved. Hostile, adverse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0737-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिजल्पः|प्रतिजल्प
प्रतिजल्पः An answer, reply.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0737-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिजल्पकः|प्रतिजल्पक
प्रतिजल्पकः A respectful<BR>concurrence.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0737-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिजागरः|प्रतिजागर
