प्रोद्यत
प्रोद्यत p. p.<BR>1 Lifted up.<BR>--2<BR>Active, industrious.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0781-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

