प्रोन्नत
प्रोन्नत p. p.<BR>1 Very high or<BR>lofty.<BR>--2 Projecting.<BR>--3 Superior<BR>to.<BR>--4 Powerful, strong;<BR>Pt. 1. 238, 340.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0781-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रोन्मील्
प्रोन्मील् {c1c} P.<BR>1 To bloom,<BR>blossom.<BR>--2 To come to light, appear.<BR>--Caus.<BR>1 To open the eyes.<BR>--2 To<BR>reveal, disclose, bring to light,<BR>discover.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0781-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

