प्रोल्लाघित a.<BR>1 Recovered from<BR>kness, convalescent.<BR>--2 Robust.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0781-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

