प्रोषित|प्रोषितः
प्रोषित p. p. Gone abroad, on a<BR>journey, living abroad, away from<BR>home, absent, living in a foreign<BR>country.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--भर्तृका a<BR>woman whose husband is gone<BR>abroad; one of the eight Nāyikās in<BR>erotic poetry. She is thus defined in<BR>S. D.: --नानाकार्यवशाद्यस्या दूरदशें गतः पतिः ।<BR>सा मनोभवदुःखार्ता भवेत् प्रोषितभर्तृका ॥ 119.<BR>--मरणं dying in a foreign country.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0781-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रोष्ठः|प्रोष्ठ
प्रो(प्रौ)ष्ठः<BR>1 A bull, an ox.<BR>--2<BR>A bench, stool.<BR>--3 A kind of flish<BR>(ष्ठी also).<BR>--Comp.<BR>--पदः the<BR>month भाद्रपद.<BR>--(दा) the 25th and<BR>26th lunar mansions; पूर्वाभाद्रपदा<BR>and उत्तराभाद्रपदा.<BR>--पाद a. born<BR>under the above Nakṣatra.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0781-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रौष्ठः|प्रौष्ठ
प्रो(प्रौ)ष्ठः<BR>1 A bull, an ox.<BR>--2<BR>A bench, stool.<BR>--3 A kind of flish<BR>(ष्ठी also).<BR>--Comp.<BR>--पदः the<BR>month भाद्रपद.<BR>--(दा) the 25th and<BR>26th lunar mansions; पूर्वाभाद्रपदा<BR>and उत्तराभाद्रपदा.<BR>--पाद a. born<BR>under the above Nakṣatra.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0781-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

