फुः|फु
फुः<BR>1 A magical formula.<BR>--2 An<BR>idle talk.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0785-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फुकः|फुक
फुकः A bird.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0785-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फुटः|फुट
फुटः The expanded hood of a<BR>snake.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0785-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फुत्
फु(फू)त् ind. An<BR>onomatopoetic word generally used in<BR>composition with कृ. and imitative of<BR>the sound made by blowing into<BR>liquids^1 &c.; sometimes it expresses<BR>disregard or contempt; (फु फू) त्कृ<BR>1<BR>to blow into (a liquid); बालः<BR>पायसदग्धो दध्यपि फूत्कृत्य भक्षयति<BR>H. 4. 103.<BR>--2 To scream aloud, cry, shriek.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--करः fire.<BR>--कारः, --कृतं,<BR>--कृतिः f. {1} blowing into. {2}<BR>hissing, whizzing. {3} the hiss of a<BR>serpent. {4} sobbing. {5} screaming,<BR>a loud shriek, yell.<BR>--कृत a. {1} blown<BR>into &c. {2} blown up (as a<BR>bubble.) {3} screamed aloud.<BR>--(तं) {1} the<BR>sound of a wind-instrument. {2}<BR>a loud cry, shriek, scream.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by Jim Funderburk on 20220427. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-orig/issues/846.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0785-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फूत्
फु(फू)त् ind. An<BR>onomatopoetic word generally used in<BR>composition with कृ. and imitative of<BR>the sound made by blowing into<BR>liquids^1 &c.; sometimes it expresses<BR>disregard or contempt; (फु फू) त्कृ<BR>1<BR>to blow into (a liquid); बालः<BR>पायसदग्धो दध्यपि फूत्कृत्य भक्षयति<BR>H. 4. 103.<BR>--2 To scream aloud, cry, shriek.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--करः fire.<BR>--कारः, --कृतं,<BR>--कृतिः f. {1} blowing into. {2}<BR>hissing, whizzing. {3} the hiss of a<BR>serpent. {4} sobbing. {5} screaming,<BR>a loud shriek, yell.<BR>--कृत a. {1} blown<BR>into &c. {2} blown up (as a<BR>bubble.) {3} screamed aloud.<BR>--(तं) {1} the<BR>sound of a wind-instrument. {2}<BR>a loud cry, shriek, scream.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by Jim Funderburk on 20220427. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-orig/issues/846.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0785-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फुप्फु
फुप्फु ind. An onomatopoetic<BR>word.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--कारक a. panting,<BR>gasping.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0785-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फुप्फुसः|फुप्फुस
फुप्फुसः<BR>--सं The lungs.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0785-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फुंफुआ|फुम्फुआ
फुंफुआ ind. Imitation of the<BR>sound made by the crackling of fire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0785-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फुल्ल्
फुल्ल् {c1c} P. (फुल्लति, फुल्लित)<BR>1 To<BR>bloom, expand, blow, open (as a<BR>flower).<BR>--2 To swell, expand;<BR>Māl. 5. 23.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0785-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फुल्ल|फुल्लः
फुल्ल p. p. (of फल्)<BR>1 Expanded,<BR>opened, blown; पुष्पं च फुल्लं<BR>नवमल्लिकायाः प्रयाति कांतिं प्रमदाजतानां Rs. 6. 6;<BR>फुल्लारविंदवदनां Ch. P. 1.<BR>--2<BR>Flowering, blossomed; R. 9. 63.<BR>--3<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0785-c" target="_blank">Page0785-c+ 37</a>]<BR>Expanded, dilated, wide opened (as<BR>eyes).<BR>--4 Smiling, gay.<BR>--ल्ल A<BR>fullblown flower.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--तुवरी alum.<BR>--नयन, --नेत्र --लोचन a. having eyes<BR>dilated (with joy); Pt. 1. 136.<BR>--(नः) a kind of deer.<BR>--(नं) a large,<BR>full eye.<BR>--फालः the wind raised in<BR>winnowing corn.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0785-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फुल्लनं|फुल्लन
फुल्लनं Inflating, filling with wind.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0785-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फुल्लिः|फुल्लि
