फुल्लरीकः|फुल्लरीक
फुल्लरीकः<BR>1 A district, place.<BR>--2<BR>A snake.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0785-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फेट्कारः|फेट्कार
फेट्कारः A shriek, howl.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0785-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फेणः|फेण
फेणः, --नः<BR>1 Foam, froth;<BR>गौरीवक्त्रंभ्रुकुटिरचनां या विहस्येव फेनैः<BR>Me. 50; R. 13. 11; Ms. 2. 61.<BR>--2 Foam<BR>of the mouth.<BR>--3 Saliva.<BR>--4 White<BR>cuttle-fish bone.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--अग्रं a<BR>bubble.<BR>--अशनिः N. of Indra; cf.<BR>नमुचि.<BR>--आहार a. living on foam.<BR>--गिरिः N. of a mountain<BR>near the mouth of the Indus.<BR>--पिंडः {1} a mere bubble. {2} an<BR>empty idea, non-entity.<BR>--वाहिन् m.<BR>a filtering cloth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0785-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फेनः|फेन
फेणः, --नः<BR>1 Foam, froth;<BR>गौरीवक्त्रंभ्रुकुटिरचनां या विहस्येव फेनैः<BR>Me. 50; R. 13. 11; Ms. 2. 61.<BR>--2 Foam<BR>of the mouth.<BR>--3 Saliva.<BR>--4 White<BR>cuttle-fish bone.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--अग्रं a<BR>bubble.<BR>--अशनिः N. of Indra; cf.<BR>नमुचि.<BR>--आहार a. living on foam.<BR>--गिरिः N. of a mountain<BR>near the mouth of the Indus.<BR>--पिंडः {1} a mere bubble. {2} an<BR>empty idea, non-entity.<BR>--वाहिन् m.<BR>a filtering cloth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0785-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

