बर्बटी|बर्ब्बटी
बर्बटी<BR>1 A kind of grain (<BR>राजमाष).<BR>--2 A harlot, prostitute.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0789-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

