बर्ह्
बर्ह् {vI.v} {c1c} A. (बर्हते)<BR>1 To speak.<BR>--2 To give.<BR>--3 To cover.<BR>--4<BR>To hurt, kill, destroy.<BR>--5 To<BR>spread.<BR>--6 To be pre-eminent or<BR>excellent. {vII.v} {c10c} U. (बर्हयति-ते) To hurt,<BR>injure. --WITH नि to kill, destroy;<BR>Śi. 1. 29.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0789-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बर्हः|बर्ह|बर्हं
बर्हः --र्हं [बर्ह्-अच्]<BR>1 A peacock's<BR>tail; दवोल्काहतशेषबर्हाः R. 16. 14;<BR>(केशपाशे) सति कुसुमसनाथे कं हरेदेष<BR>बर्हः V. 4. 10 v. l.<BR>--2 The tail of a<BR>bird.<BR>--3 A tail-feather (especially<BR>of a peacock); Me. 44; Ku. 1. 15;<BR>Śi. 8. 11.<BR>--4 A leaf; आपांडुरं<BR>केतकबर्हमन्यः R. 6. 17.<BR>--5 A train, retinue.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--भारः {1} a peacock's tail.<BR>{2} a tuft of peacock's feathers on<BR>the handle of a club &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0789-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बर्हं|बर्ह|बर्हः
बर्हः --र्हं [बर्ह्-अच्]<BR>1 A peacock's<BR>tail; दवोल्काहतशेषबर्हाः R. 16. 14;<BR>(केशपाशे) सति कुसुमसनाथे कं हरेदेष<BR>बर्हः V. 4. 10 v. l.<BR>--2 The tail of a<BR>bird.<BR>--3 A tail-feather (especially<BR>of a peacock); Me. 44; Ku. 1. 15;<BR>Śi. 8. 11.<BR>--4 A leaf; आपांडुरं<BR>केतकबर्हमन्यः R. 6. 17.<BR>--5 A train, retinue.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--भारः {1} a peacock's tail.<BR>{2} a tuft of peacock's feathers on<BR>the handle of a club &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0789-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बर्हण|बर्हणं
