बर्हस्
बर्हण, बर्हस् a. Ved. Strong,<BR>powerful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0789-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

