बलिन, बलिभ See वलिन-भ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0791-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बलिभ|बलिभः
