बलिंदमः|बलिन्दम|बलिंदम
बलिंदमः A epithet of Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0791-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बलिमत्|बलिमन्त्
बलिमत् a.<BR>1 Having materials of<BR>worship or oblation ready;<BR>R. 14. 15.<BR>--2 Receiving taxes.<BR>--3<BR>Wrinkled.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0791-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बलिमन्
बलिमन् m. Strength, might, power.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0791-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बलिष्ठ|बलिष्ठः
बलिष्ठ a. Most powerful,<BR>strongest, very powerful (superl. of<BR>बलवत् or बलिन् q. v.)<BR>--ष्ठः A camel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0791-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बलिष्णु|बलिष्णुः
बलिष्णु a. Dishonoured, degraded,<BR>despised (अपमानित).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0791-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बलीयस्
बलीयस् a. (सी f.)<BR>1 Stronger,<BR>more powerful.<BR>--2 More effective.<BR>--3 More important (compar. of<BR>बलवत् or बलिन् q. v.). --adv.<BR>Powerfully, very much; बलीयः खलु<BR>भीतोस्मि Ś. 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0791-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बलूल|बलूलः
बलूल a. Strong, powerful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0791-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बल्य|बल्यं|बल्यः
बल्य a. [बलाय हितं यत्]<BR>1 Strong,<BR>powerful.<BR>--2 Giving strength.<BR>--ल्यः<BR>A Buddhist mendicant.<BR>--ल्यं<BR>Semen virile.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0791-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

