बली(री)वर्दः A bull, an ox;<BR>गोरप यं पुमान् बलीवर्दः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0791-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बल्लवः|बल्लव
बल्लवः<BR>1 A cowherd;<BR>कुंजेष्वाक्रांतवीरुन्निचयपरिचया बल्लवाः संचरंतु<BR>Ve. 6. 2; Śi. 11. 8.<BR>--2 A cook.<BR>--3 The<BR>name assumed by Bhīma when<BR>serving as a cook at the court<BR>of Virāṭa.<BR>--वी A cowherdess;<BR>Ki. 4. 17.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--युवतिः --ती f. a<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0791-b" target="_blank">Page0791-b+ 55</a>]<BR>young cowherdess (गोपी);<BR>हरिविरहाकुलबल्लवयुवतिसखीवचनं पठनीयं Gīt. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0791-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बल्वजः|बल्वज
बल्वजः --जा A kind of coarse<BR>grass; Ms. 2. 43.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0791-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बल्वजा
बल्वजः --जा A kind of coarse<BR>grass; Ms. 2. 43.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0791-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बह्लिकाः
बह्लिकाः, बल्हीकाः (pl.) N. of<BR>a country and its inhabitants.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0791-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बल्हीकाः
बह्लिकाः, बल्हीकाः (pl.) N. of<BR>a country and its inhabitants.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0791-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

