बालिनी
बालिनी The constellation Aśvini.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0795-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बालिमन्
बालिमन् m. Childhood, boyhood,<BR>youth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0795-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बालिश|बालिशं|बालिशः
बालिश a.<BR>1 Childish, puerile,<BR>silly.<BR>--2 Young.<BR>--3 Foolish,<BR>ignorant; Ms. 3. 176.<BR>--4 Careless.<BR>--शः<BR>1 A fool, blockhead.<BR>--2 A child, boy.<BR>--शं A pillow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0795-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बालिश्यं|बालिश्य
बालिश्यं<BR>1 Youth, boyhood.<BR>--2<BR>Childishness, silliness, folly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0795-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बाली
