बाल्हिः|बाल्हि
बाल्हिः N. of a country (Balkh).<BR>--Comp.<BR>--ज a. bred in the Balkh<BR>country, of the Balkh breed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0795-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बाष्पः|बाष्प|बाष्पं
बाष्पः --ष्पं [बाध्-पृषो सत्वं˚ षत्वं वा]<BR>1<BR>A tear, tears; कंठः<BR>स्तंभितबाष्पवृत्तिकलुषः Ś. 4. 5.<BR>--2 Vapour, steam, mist.<BR>--3 Iron.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--अंबु n. tears.<BR>--आकुल --आप्लुत a. dimmed or<BR>interrupted by tears.<BR>--उद्भवः the<BR>starting of tears.<BR>--कंठ a. having tears<BR>in the throat, choked with tears.<BR>--कल a. inarticulate or indistinct<BR>through tears.<BR>--दुर्दिनं a flood of tears.<BR>--पूरः a gush or flood of tears;<BR>वारंवारं तिरयति दृशोरुद्गमं बाष्पपूरः<BR>Māl. 1. 35.<BR>--प्रकरः a flow or gush of tears;<BR>पुनर्दृष्टिं बाष्पप्रकरकलुषामर्पितवती Ś. 6. 8.<BR>--मोक्षः --मोचनं shedding tears.<BR>--बिंदुः<BR>a tear-drop.<BR>--संदिग्ध a. indistinct<BR>through suppressed tears.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0795-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बाष्पं|बाष्प|बाष्पः
बाष्पः --ष्पं [बाध्-पृषो सत्वं˚ षत्वं वा]<BR>1<BR>A tear, tears; कंठः<BR>स्तंभितबाष्पवृत्तिकलुषः Ś. 4. 5.<BR>--2 Vapour, steam, mist.<BR>--3 Iron.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--अंबु n. tears.<BR>--आकुल --आप्लुत a. dimmed or<BR>interrupted by tears.<BR>--उद्भवः the<BR>starting of tears.<BR>--कंठ a. having tears<BR>in the throat, choked with tears.<BR>--कल a. inarticulate or indistinct<BR>through tears.<BR>--दुर्दिनं a flood of tears.<BR>--पूरः a gush or flood of tears;<BR>वारंवारं तिरयति दृशोरुद्गमं बाष्पपूरः<BR>Māl. 1. 35.<BR>--प्रकरः a flow or gush of tears;<BR>पुनर्दृष्टिं बाष्पप्रकरकलुषामर्पितवती Ś. 6. 8.<BR>--मोक्षः --मोचनं shedding tears.<BR>--बिंदुः<BR>a tear-drop.<BR>--संदिग्ध a. indistinct<BR>through suppressed tears.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0795-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बाष्पायते
बाष्पायते Den. A.<BR>1 To shed tears,<BR>weep; तत्किमिति बाष्पायितं भगवत्या<BR>Māl. 6; V. 5. 9.<BR>--2 To emit vapour<BR>or steam.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0795-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बास्त
बास्त a. (स्ती f.) Coming or<BR>derived from a goat; Ms. 2. 41.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0795-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बाहः|बाह
बाहः<BR>1 The arm.<BR>--2 A horse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0795-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बाहा
बाहा The arm; मां<BR>प्रत्यालिंगेतोगताभिः शाखाबाहाभिः Ś. 4.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--बाहवि ind. hand to hand, arm<BR>against arm; cf. बाहूबाहवि.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0795-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बाहीक|बाहीकः
बाहीक a. (वी f.) External, out<BR>er.<BR>--काः (pl.) The people of the<BR>Punjab.<BR>--कः<BR>1 An inhabitant of<BR>the Punjab.<BR>--2 An ox.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0795-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बाहुः|बाहु
बाहुः [बाध् कु धस्य हः Tv.]<BR>1 The<BR>arm; शांतमिदमाश्रमपदं स्फुरति च बाहुः<BR>कुतः फलमिहास्य Ś. 1. 16; so महाबाहुः<BR>&c.<BR>--2 The fore-arm.<BR>--3 The<BR>forefoot of an animal.<BR>--4 A door-post.<BR>--5 The base of a right-angled<BR>triangle (in geom.).<BR>--6 (In medic.)<BR>The whole upper extremity of the<BR>body (opp. सक्थि).<BR>--7 The bar of a<BR>chariot-pole.<BR>--8 The shadow of the<BR>gnomon on a sun-dial.<BR>--हू (du.)<BR>The lunar mansion Ārdrā.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--उत्क्षेपं ind. having raised or tossed<BR>up the arms; बाहूत्क्षेपं क्रंदितुं च प्रवृत्ता<BR>Ś. 5. 30.<BR>--कुंठ, --कुब्ज a. crippled<BR>in the arms.<BR>--कुंथः a wing (of a<BR>bird).<BR>--चापः the distance<BR>measured by the extended arms.<BR>--जः {1} a<BR>man of the Kṣatriya caste; cf.<BR>बाहू राजन्यः कृतः Rv. 10. 90. 12; also<BR>Ms. 1. 31. {2} a parrot. {3} sesamum<BR>growing spontaneously.<BR>--ज्या a sine<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0796-a" target="_blank">Page0796-a+ 56</a>]<BR>(in math.).<BR>--त्रः, --त्रं, --त्राण<BR>vantbrass (armour for the arms).<BR>--दंडः<BR>{1} a staff-like arm. {2} punishment<BR>with the arm or fist.<BR>--पाशः {1}<BR>a particular attitude in fighting.<BR>{2} the arm thrown round, as<BR>in the act of embracing.<BR>--प्रतिबाहौ<BR>the opposite sides of a figure.<BR>--प्रसारः --प्रसारणं stretching the arms (for<BR>embracing &c.).<BR>--प्रहरणः a boxer.<BR>--(णं) boxing.<BR>--फलं (in geom.)<BR>the result for the base sine.<BR>--बलं<BR>strength of arm, muscular<BR>strength.<BR>--भूषणं, --भूषा an<BR>ornament worn on the arm, an armlet.<BR>--भेदिन् m. an epithet of Viṣṇu.<BR>--मूलं<BR>{1} the armpit. {2} the<BR>shoulderblade.<BR>--युद्धं a hand-to-hand or<BR>close fight, personal or pugilistic<BR>encounter, boxing.<BR>--याधेः, --योधिन्<BR>m. a pugilist, boxer.<BR>--लता an<BR>armlike creeper. ˚अंतरं the breast,<BR>bosom.<BR>--विक्षेपः {1} the act of<BR>throwing about the arms, moving the<BR>arms. {2} swimming.<BR>--वीर्यं strength<BR>of arm.<BR>--व्यायामः athletic exercise.<BR>--शालिन् m. {1} an epithet of Śiva.<BR>{2} of Bhīma.<BR>--शिखरं the upper part<BR>of the arm, the shoulder.<BR>--संभबः a<BR>man of the Kṣatriya caste.<BR>--सहस्रभृत् m. an epithet of king<BR>Kārtavīrya (also called सहस्रार्जुन).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0795-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बाहुक|बाहुकः
बाहुक a.<BR>1 Swimming with the<BR>arms.<BR>--2 Servile. dependent.<BR>--3<BR>Dwarfish.<BR>--कः<BR>1 A monkey.<BR>--2<BR>A name assumed by Nala after his<BR>transformation into a dwarf by<BR>Karkoṭaka.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0796-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बाहुमत्|बाहुमन्त्
बाहुमत् m. An epithet of Indra.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0796-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बाहुगुण्यं|बाहुगुण्य
बाहुगुण्यं<BR>1 Possession of many<BR>virtues or excellences.<BR>--2 Excess,<BR>plenty.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0796-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बाहुदंतकं|बाहुदन्तक|बाहुदंतक
बाहुदंतकं A treatise on moral<BR>duties said to be composed or a<BR>bridged by Indra.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0796-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बाहुदंतिन्|बाहुदन्तिन्
बाहुदंतिन् m. बाहुदंतेयः An<BR>epithet of Indra.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0796-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बाहुदा
बाहुदा N. of a river.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0796-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बाहुभाष्यं|बाहुभाष्य
बाहुभाष्यं Garrulity,<BR>loquaciousness, talkativeness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0796-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बाहुरूप्यं|बाहुरूप्य
बाहुरूप्यं Manifoldness, variety.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0796-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बाहुल|बाहुलं|बाहुलः
बाहुल a. Manifold.<BR>--लः<BR>1 Fire.<BR>--2 The month Kārtika.<BR>--लं<BR>1<BR>Manifoldness.<BR>--2 An armour for the<BR>arms, vantbrass.<BR>--ली The day of full<BR>moon in the month of Kārtika.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0796-b" target="_blank">Page0796-b+ 55</a>]<BR>--Comp.<BR>--ग्रीवः a peacock.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0796-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बाहुलकं|बाहुलक
बाहुलकं<BR>1 Manifoldness.<BR>--2 The<BR>diverse or interminable<BR>applicability of a rule, of meanings or of<BR>forms; a term frequently used in<BR>grammar; बाहुलकाच्छंदसि.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0796-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बाहुलेयः|बाहुलेय
बाहुलेयः An epithet of<BR>Kārtikeya.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0796-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बाहुल्यं|बाहुल्य
बाहुल्यं<BR>1 Abundance, plenty,<BR>copiousness.<BR>--2 Manifoldness,<BR>multiplicity, variety.<BR>--3 The usual course<BR>or common order of things. (<BR>बाहुल्यात् --ल्यंन {1} usually, commonly.<BR>{2} in all probability).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0796-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बाहुश्रुत्यं|बाहुश्रुत्य
बाहुश्रुत्यं Erudition, great<BR>learning.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0796-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बाहूबाहवि
बाहूबाहवि ind. Arm to arm,<BR>hand-to hand, in close encounter;<BR>(वाहुभिर्बाहुभिः प्रहृत्येदं युद्धं प्रवृत्तं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0796-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बाह्य|बाह्यः
बाह्य a. [बहिर्भवः ष्यञ् टिलोपः]<BR>1<BR>Outer, outward, external, exterior,<BR>being or situated without; विरहः<BR>किमिवानुतापयेद्वद बाह्यैर्विषयैर्विपश्चितं<BR>R. 8. 89; बाह्योद्यान Me. 7; Ku. 6. 46;<BR>बाह्यनामन् ‘the outer name’, i. e.<BR>the address or superscription<BR>written on the back of a letter;<BR>अदत्तबाह्यतामानं लेखं लेखयित्वा Mu. 1.<BR>--2<BR>Foreign, strange; Pt. 1.<BR>--3<BR>Excluded from, out of the pale of;<BR>जातास्तदूर्वोरुपमानबाह्याः Ku. 1. 36.<BR>--4<BR>Expelled from society, outcast.<BR>--ह्यः<BR>1 A stranger, foreigner; Pt. 1. 259;<BR>5. 26.<BR>--2 One who is<BR>excommunicated, an outcast.<BR>--ह्यं, बाह्येन, बाह्ये<BR>ind. Outside, on the outside,<BR>externally.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0796-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बाह्वृच्यं|बाह्वृच्य
बाह्वृच्यं Traditional teaching of<BR>the Ṛgveda.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0796-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बिट्
बिट् {c1c} P. (बेटति)<BR>1 To swear.<BR>To curse.<BR>--2 To shout, exclaim.<BR>--3<BR>To address harshly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0796-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

