बिटकः --कं, बिटका A boil.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0796-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बिटका
बिटकः --कं, बिटका A boil.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0796-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बिठं|बिठ
बिठं Ved. The sky or atmosphere.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0796-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बिडं|बिड
बिडं A kind of salt.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0796-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बिडालः|बिडाल
बिडालः<BR>1 A cat.<BR>--2 The<BR>eycball.<BR>--ली A female cat.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--पदः, --पदकं a measure of weight<BR>equal to sixteen Māṣas.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0796-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बिडालकः|बिडालक|बिडालकं
बिडालकः<BR>1 A cat.<BR>--2 Application<BR>of ointment to the exterior part of<BR>the eye.<BR>--कं Yellow orpiment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0796-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बिडौजस्
बिडौजस् m. An epithet of<BR>Indra; Ś. 7. 34.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0796-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

