भिषज्यं|भिषज्य
भिषज्यं<BR>1 Healing, curing.<BR>--2 A<BR>remedy, cure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0818-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

