भृत्यीभू
भृत्यीभू {c1c} P. To become a servant,<BR>accept service.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0824-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भृत्रिम
भृत्रिम a. Supported, nourished.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0824-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भृकुंशः|भृकुंश
भृकुंशः(सः) A male actor in<BR>female attire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0824-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भृकुंसः|भृकुंस
भृकुंशः(सः) A male actor in<BR>female attire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0824-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भृकुटिः|भृकुटि
