भ्रुकुंशः|भ्रुकुंश
भ्रु(भ्रू)कुंशः(सः) A male actor<BR>in female attire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0829-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भ्रूकुंशः|भ्रूकुंश
भ्रु(भ्रू)कुंशः(सः) A male actor<BR>in female attire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0829-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भ्रुकुंसः|भ्रुकुंस
भ्रु(भ्रू)कुंशः(सः) A male actor<BR>in female attire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0829-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भ्रूकुंसः|भ्रूकुंस
भ्रु(भ्रू)कुंशः(सः) A male actor<BR>in female attire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0829-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

