मरोलिकः|मरोलिक
मरोलिः --लिकः The sea-monster<BR>Makara.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0846-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मर्क|मर्कः
मर्क a. Ved.<BR>1 Cleaning,<BR>purifying.<BR>--2 Perishing, dying away.<BR>--र्कः<BR>1 The vital breath, life-wind.<BR>--2 An<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0846-c" target="_blank">Page0846-c+ 56</a>]<BR>ape, a monkey.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0846-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मर्ककः|मर्कक
