मशः|मश
मशः<BR>1 A mosquito.<BR>--2 Hum,<BR>humming.<BR>--3 Anger.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--हरी<BR>a mosquito-curtain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0849-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मशकः|मशक
