मसिः|मसि
मसिः m. f.<BR>1 Ink.<BR>--2<BR>Lampblack, soot.<BR>--3 A black powder<BR>used to paint the eyes.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--आधारः, --कूपी, --धानं, --धानी, --मणिः an<BR>ink-bottle, an ink-stand.<BR>--जलं ink.<BR>--पण्य a writer, scribe.<BR>--पथः a<BR>pen.<BR>--प्रसूः f. {1} a pen. {2} an<BR>inkbottle.<BR>--वर्ण a. black as ink, inky.<BR>--वर्धनं myrrh.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0849-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

