मसृण|मसृणं
मसृण a.<BR>1 Unctuous, oily;<BR>मसृणचंदनचर्चितांगीं Ch. P. 7; or<BR>सरसमसृणमपि मलयजपंकं Gīt. 4.<BR>--2 Soft,<BR>tender, smooth; U. 1. 38.<BR>--3<BR>Bland, mild, sweet; मसृणवाणि<BR>Gīt. 10.<BR>--4 Lovely, charming;<BR>विनयमसृणो वाचि नियमः U. 2. 2; 4. 21.<BR>--5<BR>Beaming, glistening; मसृणमुकुलिता<BR>नां प्रांतविस्तारभाजां (आलोकितानां)<BR>Māl. 1. 27; 4. 2.<BR>--णा Linseed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0849-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

