मस्ज्
मस्ज् {c6c} P. (मज्जति, मग्न; caus.<BR>मज्जयति; desid. मिमंक्षति)<BR>1 To bathe,<BR>plunge, dip or throw oneself into<BR>water; R. 15. 101; Bv. 2. 95.<BR>--2 To<BR>sink, sink into or down, sink under,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0849-c" target="_blank">Page0849-c+ 56</a>]<BR>plunge (with loc. or acc.); सीदन्नंधे<BR>तमसि विधुरो मज्जतीवांतरात्मा U. 3. 38;<BR>Māl. 9. 20; सोऽसंवृतं नाम तमः सह<BR>तेनैव मज्जति Ms. 4. 81; R. 16. 72.<BR>--3 To be drowned, perish, (in<BR>water).<BR>--4 To sink into misfortune.<BR>--5 To despond, be discouraged or<BR>disheartened. --Caus. (मज्जयति)<BR>1<BR>To cause to sink, immerse, dip,<BR>drown.<BR>--2 To deluge, inundate,<BR>overwhelm.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0849-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मस्तं|मस्त
