माड्डुकिकः|माड्डुकिक
माड्डुकः --किकः A drummer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0857-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

माढिः|माढि
माढिः f.<BR>1 The young leaf before<BR>it opens.<BR>--2 Honouring.<BR>--3<BR>Sadness, dejection.<BR>--4 Poverty.<BR>--5<BR>Anger, passion.<BR>--6 The border or<BR>hem of a garment.<BR>--7 A double<BR>tooth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0857-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

माणवः|माणव
माणवः [मनोरपत्यं अण् अल्पार्थे णत्वम्]<BR>1 A lad, boy, youth, youngster.<BR>--2<BR>A little man, manikin (used<BR>contemptuously).<BR>--3 A pearl-necklace<BR>of sixteen (or twenty) strings.<BR>--4 A<BR>young Brāhmaṇa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0857-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

माणवकः|माणवक
माणवकः<BR>1 A youth, boy, lad,<BR>youngster (oft. used<BR>contemptuously).<BR>--2 A little man, dwarf;<BR>manikin; मायामाणवकं हरिं Bhāg.<BR>--3 A silly fellow.<BR>--4 A scholar,<BR>religious student.<BR>--5 A pearl-necklace<BR>of sixteen (or twenty) strings.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0857-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

माणविका
माणविका A young girl, damsel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0857-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

माणवीन|माणवीनं
