मुस्
मुस् {c4c} P. (मुस्यति) To cleave,<BR>divide, break into pieces.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0872-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुसलः|मुसल|मुसलं
मुसलः --लं<BR>1 A mace, club.<BR>--2<BR>A pestle (used for cleaning rice);<BR>मुमलमिदमियं च पातकाले पुहरनुयाति<BR>कलेन हुकृतेन Mu. 1. 4; Ms. 6. 56.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0872-c" target="_blank">Page0872-c+ 56</a>]<BR>--3 A kind of surgical instrument.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--आयुधः an epithet of<BR>Balarāma.<BR>--उलूखलं a pestle and<BR>mortar.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0872-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुसलं|मुसल|मुसलः
