मुसलीका A common lizard.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0872-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुसलिन
