मृगी
मृगी<BR>1 A female deer, doe.<BR>--2<BR>Epilepsy.<BR>--3 N. of a particular<BR>class of women.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--दृश् f.<BR>--लोचना &c. a woman with eyes<BR>like those of a doe or fawn.<BR>--पतिः<BR>an epithet of Kṛṣṇa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0876-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मृग्य|मृग्यः
