वडवा
वडवा<BR>1 A mare.<BR>--2 The nymph<BR>Aśvinī who in the form of a mare<BR>bore to the sun two sons, the<BR>Aśvins; see संज्ञा.<BR>--3 A female slave.<BR>--4 A harlot, prostitute.<BR>--5 A<BR>woman of the Brāhmaṇa caste (<BR>द्विजयोषित्).<BR>--Comp.<BR>--अग्निः, --अनलः the<BR>submarine fire.<BR>--मुखः {1} the<BR>submarine fire. {2} N. of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0940-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वडा
