वणः|वण
वणः Sound, noise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0940-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वणिज्
वणिज् m. [Uṇ. 2. 70]<BR>1 A<BR>merchant, trader; यस्यागमः<BR>केवलजीविकायै तं ज्ञानपण्यं वणिजं वदंति<BR>M. 1. 17.<BR>--2 The sign Libra of the<BR>zodiac. --f. Merchandise, trade.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--कर्मन् n.,<BR>--क्रिया traffic,<BR>trade.<BR>--जनः {1} merchants<BR>(collectively). {2} a trader, merchant.<BR>--पथः<BR>{1} trade, traffic. {2} a merchant. {3}<BR>a merchants's shop, a stall. {4} the<BR>sign Libra of the zodiac.<BR>--वृत्तिः f.<BR>trade, traffic; Bh. 3. 81.<BR>--सार्थः a<BR>caravan.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0940-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वणिजः|वणिज
वणिजः<BR>1 A merchant, trader.<BR>--2<BR>The sign Libra of the zodiac.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0940-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वणिजकः|वणिजक
वणिजकः A merchant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0940-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वणिज्यं|वणिज्य
वणिज्यं, वणिज्या Trade, traffic.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0940-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वणिज्या
वणिज्यं, वणिज्या Trade, traffic.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0940-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वंट्|वण्ट्
वंट् {c1c} P., {c10c} U. (वंटति, वंटयति-ते)<BR>To divide, apportion, partition,<BR>share.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0940-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वंट|वण्ट|वण्टः
वंट a. Unmarried.<BR>--टः<BR>1 A part,<BR>portion, share.<BR>--2 The handle of a<BR>sickle.<BR>--3 An unmarried man, a<BR>bachelor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0940-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वंटकः|वण्टक|वंटक|वण्टकः
वंटकः [वंट्-घञ् स्वार्थे क]<BR>1<BR>Dividing, distributing.<BR>--2 A distributer.<BR>--3 A part, portion, share.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0940-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वंटनं|वण्टन|वंटन
