वरालः, --वरालकः Cloves.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0946-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वरालकः|वरालक
वरालः, --वरालकः Cloves.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0946-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वराशिः|वराशि
वराशिः --सिः A coarse cloth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0946-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वरासिः|वरासि
वराशिः --सिः A coarse cloth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0946-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वराहः|वराह
वराहः [वराय अभीष्टाय मुस्तादिलाभाय<BR>आहंति भूमिं आ-हन्-ड Tv.]<BR>1 A boar,<BR>hog; विस्रब्धं क्रियतां<BR>वराहततिभिर्मुस्ताक्षतिः पल्वले Ś. 2. 6.<BR>--2 A ram.<BR>--3 A<BR>bull.<BR>--4 A cloud.<BR>--5 A crocodile.<BR>--6 An array of troops in the form<BR>of a boar.<BR>--7 N. of Viṣṇu in the<BR>third or boar-incarnation; cf. वसति<BR>दशनशिखरे धरणी तव लग्ना शशिनि<BR>कलंककलेव निमग्ना । केशव धृतशूकररूप जय<BR>जगदीश हरे Gīt. 1.<BR>--8 A particular<BR>measure.<BR>--9 N. of Varāhamihira.<BR>--10 N. of one of the 18 Purāṇas.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--अवतारः the boar or third<BR>incarnation of Viṣṇu.<BR>--कंदः a<BR>kind of esculent root.<BR>--कर्णः a kind<BR>of arrow.<BR>--कर्णिका a kind of<BR>missile.<BR>--कल्पः the period of the<BR>boarincarnation, the period during<BR>which Viṣṇu assumed the form of<BR>a boar.<BR>--क्रांता the sensitive plant.<BR>--द्वादशी a festival held on the<BR>12th day in the bright half of<BR>Māgha in honor of Viṣṇu.<BR>--नामन्<BR>n. an esculent root.<BR>--मिहिरः N. of<BR>a celebrated astronomer, author of<BR>बृहत्सहिता (supposed to be one of<BR>the ‘nine gems’ at the court of<BR>king Vikrama).<BR>--शृंगः N. of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0946-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वराहुः|वराहु
वराहुः Ved. A boar, hog.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0946-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वरिमन्
वरिमन् m.<BR>1 Excellence,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0946-c" target="_blank">Page0946-c+ 54</a>]<BR>superiority, pre-eminence.<BR>--2 Ved.<BR>Circuit, compass.<BR>--3 Breadth, extent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0946-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वरिवस्
वरिवस् n. Ved.<BR>1 Worshipping,<BR>honouring.<BR>--2 Wealth.<BR>--3 Room,<BR>space.<BR>--4 Pleasure, happiness.<BR>--5<BR>Ease.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0946-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वरिवसित|वरिवसितः
वरिवसि(स्यि)त a. Worshipped,<BR>honoured, adored, revered.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0946-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वरिवस्यित|वरिवस्यितः
वरिवसि(स्यि)त a. Worshipped,<BR>honoured, adored, revered.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0946-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वरिवस्या
वरिवस्या<BR>1 Worship, honour,<BR>adoration, devotion.<BR>--2 Service,<BR>attendance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0946-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वरिशी
वरिशी A fish-hook.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0946-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वरिष्ठ|वरिष्ठं|वरिष्ठः
वरिष्ठ a.<BR>1 Best, most excellent,<BR>most distinguished or pre-eminent.<BR>--2 Largest, greatest.<BR>--3 Widest.<BR>--4<BR>Heaviest.<BR>--5 Worst, most wicked;<BR>(superl. of उरु q. v.)<BR>--ष्ठः<BR>1 The<BR>francoline partridge.<BR>--2 The orange<BR>tree.<BR>--ष्ठं<BR>1 Copper.<BR>--2 Pepper.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0946-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वरी
वरी<BR>1 N. of Chāyā, wife of<BR>the sun.<BR>--2 The plant called<BR>शतावरी.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0946-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वरीमन्
वरीमन्^1 m. Excellence &c.; see<BR>वरिमन्.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20170110. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/CORRECTIONS/issues/332,. note: badly placed diacritics.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0946-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वरीयस्
वरीयस् a.<BR>1 Better, more<BR>excellent, preferable.<BR>--2 Most<BR>excellent, very good; Māl. 1. 16.<BR>--3<BR>Larger, wider, more extensive<BR>(compar. of उरु q. v.).<BR>--4<BR>Extremely tender or younger. --n. Ved.<BR>Rest, repose.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0946-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वरीवर्दः|वरीवर्द|वरीवर्द्द|वरीवर्द्दः
वरी(ली)वर्दः An ox, a bull,<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0946-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वलीवर्दः|वलीवर्द|वलीवर्द्द|वलीवर्द्दः
वरी(ली)वर्दः An ox, a bull,<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0946-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वरीषुः|वरीषु
वरीषुः N. of Cupid, the god of<BR>love.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0946-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वरुटः|वरुट
वरुटः N. of a class of<BR>Mlecchas.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0946-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वरुडः|वरुड
वरुडः N. of a low caste.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0946-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वरुणः|वरुण
वरुणः [वृ-उनन् Uṇ. 3. 53]<BR>1 N.<BR>of an Āditya (usually associated<BR>with Mitra).<BR>--2 (In later<BR>mythology) The regent of the ocean and<BR>of the western quarter<BR>(represented with a noose in hand); यासां<BR>राजा वरुणो याति मध्ये सत्यानृते<BR>अवपश्यञ्जनानाम्; वरुणो यादसामहं<BR>Bg. 10. 29; त्वं विश्वेषां वरुणासि राजा ये च देवा<BR>ये च मर्ताः Rv. 2. 27. 10; प्रतीचीं वरुणः<BR>पाति Mb.; अतिसक्तिमेत्य वरुणस्य दिशा<BR>भृशमन्वरज्यदतुषारकरः Śi. 9. 7.<BR>--3<BR>The ocean.<BR>--4 Firmament.<BR>--5 The<BR>Sun.<BR>--6 The Varuṇa tree.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--अंगरुहः an epithet of Agastya.<BR>--आत्मजा spirituous liquor (so<BR>called being produced from the<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0947-a" target="_blank">Page0947-a+ 55</a>]<BR>sea).<BR>--आलयः, --आवासः the ocean.<BR>--देवं,--दैवतं the Nakṣatra<BR>Śatabhishaj.<BR>--पाशः {1} a shark. {2} the<BR>noose of Varuṇa.<BR>--लोकः {1} the<BR>world of Varuṇa. {2} water.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0946-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वरुणानी
वरुणानी Varuṇa's wife.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0947-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वरुणाविः|वरुणावि
वरुणाविः f. N. of Lakṣmī.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0947-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वरुत्रं|वरुत्र
वरुत्रं A cloak, mantle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0947-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वरूतृ
वरूतृ m. Ved.<BR>1 A protector,<BR>defender.<BR>--2 A god, deity.<BR>--त्री A<BR>guardian deity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0947-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वरूथं|वरूथ|वरूथः
वरूथं [वृ ऊथन् Uṇ. 2. 6]<BR>1 A<BR>sort of wooden fence or fender with<BR>which a chariot is provided as a<BR>defence against collision (m. also in<BR>this sense); वरूथो रथगुप्तिर्या तिरोधत्ते<BR>रथस्थितिम्.<BR>--2 An armour, a coat of<BR>mail.<BR>--3 A shield.<BR>--4 A group,<BR>multitude, an assemblage.<BR>--5<BR>Protection.<BR>--6 A family.<BR>--7 A house,<BR>residence (Ved. in the last {3}<BR>senses).<BR>--थः<BR>1 The cuckoo.<BR>--2<BR>Time.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0947-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वरूथिन्
वरूथिन् a.<BR>1 Wearing an armour,<BR>mailed.<BR>--2 Furnished with a fender<BR>or protecting plank; अवतिमेकरथेन<BR>वरूथिना जितवतः किल तस्य धनुर्भृतः<BR>R. 9. 11.<BR>--3 Protecting, sheltering.<BR>--4<BR>Surrounded by a troop.<BR>--5 Being<BR>or seated in a carriage. --m.<BR>1 A<BR>chariot.<BR>--2 A guard, defender.<BR>--नी<BR>An army; स्खलितसलिलामुल्लंध्यैनां<BR>जगाम वरुथिनी Śi. 12. 77; R. 12. 50.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0947-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वरेण्य|वरेण्यं|वरेण्यः
वरेण्य a. [वृ-एन्य]<BR>1 To be<BR>wished for, desirable, eligible;<BR>अनेन चेदिच्छसि गृह्यमाणं पाणिं वरेण्येन<BR>R. 6. 24.<BR>--2 (Hence) Best, most<BR>excellent, pre-eminent, most worthy<BR>or distinguished, chief; वेधा विधाय<BR>पुनरुक्तमिवेंदुबिंबं दुरीकरोति न कथं विदूषां<BR>वरेण्यः Bv. 2. 158; तत्सवितुर्वरेण्यं भर्गो<BR>देवस्य धीमही Rv. 3. 62. 10;<BR>R. 6. 84, Bk. 1. 4; Ku. 7. 90.<BR>--ण्यं<BR>Saffron.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0947-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वरोटः|वरोट|वरोटं
वरोटः The Marubaka plant.<BR>--टं Its flower.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0947-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वरोलः|वरोल
वरोलः A kind of wasp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0947-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्करः|वर्कर
वर्करः [वृक्-अरन्]<BR>1 A lamb,<BR>kid.<BR>--2 A goat.<BR>--3 Any young<BR>domestic animal.<BR>--4 Mirth, sport,<BR>pastime.<BR>--5 Jest, joke.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--कर्करः a strap or rope of leather (कर्करः)<BR>to bind a lamb or goat with.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0947-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्कराटः|वर्कराट
वर्कराटः<BR>1 A side-glance, leer.<BR>--2 The marks of a lover's<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0947-b" target="_blank">Page0947-b+ 56</a>]<BR>fingernails on the bosom of a woman.<BR>--3<BR>The rays of the ascending sun.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0947-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्कुटः|वर्कुट
वर्कुटः A pin, bolt.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0947-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्गः|वर्ग|वर्ग्ग
वर्गः [वृज्-घञ्]<BR>1 A class,<BR>division, group; company, society, tribe,<BR>collection (of similar things);<BR>न्यषेधि शेषोऽप्यनुयायिवर्गः R. 2. 4,<BR>11. 7; so पौरवर्गः, नक्षत्रवर्गः &c.<BR>--2 A<BR>party, side; Ku. 7. 53.<BR>--3 A<BR>category.<BR>--4 A class of words grouped<BR>together; as मनुष्यवर्गः, वनस्पतिवर्गः &c.<BR>--5 A class of consonants in the<BR>alphabet.<BR>--6 A section, chapter,<BR>division of a book.<BR>--7 Particularly, a<BR>subdivision of an Adhyāya in<BR>Ṛgveda.<BR>--8 The square power.<BR>--9<BR>Strength.<BR>--10 Sphere, province.<BR>--11<BR>The whole class of objects of<BR>worldly existence (धर्म, अर्थ, and काम).<BR>--Comp.<BR>--अंत्यं, --उत्तमं the last letter<BR>of each of the first five classes of<BR>consonants; i. e. a nasal.<BR>--घनः the<BR>cube of a square. ˚घातः the fifth<BR>power.<BR>--पदं, --मूलं the square root.<BR>--प्रकृतिः f. an affected square.<BR>--वर्गः the square of a square.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0947-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्गणा
वर्गणा Multiplication.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0947-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्गयति
वर्गयति Den. P. To multiply.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0947-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्गशस्
वर्गशस् ind. In groups, according<BR>to classes.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0947-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्गिन्
वर्गिन् a. Belonging to a class or<BR>party.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0947-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्गीण
वर्गीण a. Belonging to a class or<BR>category.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0947-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्गीय|वर्गीयः
वर्गीय a. Belonging to a class or<BR>category.<BR>--यः A class-fellow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0947-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्ग्य|वर्ग्यः
वर्ग्य a. Belonging to the same<BR>class.<BR>--र्ग्यः One belonging to the<BR>same class or company, colleague,<BR>class-fellow, fellow-student (in<BR>learning); या यस्य युज्यते भूमिका तां खलु<BR>भावेन तथैव सर्वे वर्ग्याः पाठिताः Māl. 1;<BR>उद्बाहुना जुहुविरे मुहुरात्मवर्ग्याः Śi. 5. 15.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0947-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्च्|वर्च्च्
वर्च् {c1c} A. (वर्चते) To shine, be<BR>bright or splendid.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0947-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्चटी|वर्च्चटी
वर्चटी<BR>1 A kind of rice.<BR>--2 A<BR>harlot.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0947-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्चस्|वर्च्चस्
वर्चस् n. [वर्च्-असुन्]<BR>1 Vigour,<BR>energy, power.<BR>--2 Light, lustre,<BR>brilliance, splendour.<BR>--3 Form,<BR>figure, shape.<BR>--4 Ordure, feces.<BR>--5<BR>Semen virile.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--ग्रहः<BR>constipation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0947-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्चस्कः|वर्चस्क|वर्च्चस्क|वर्च्चस्कः
वर्चस्कः<BR>1 Brightness, lustre.<BR>--2<BR>Vigour.<BR>--3 Feces.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0947-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्चस्विन्|वर्च्चस्विन्
वर्चस्विन् a.<BR>1 Vigorous, energetic,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0947-c" target="_blank">Page0947-c+ 56</a>]<BR>active.<BR>--2 Bright, brilliant, radiant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0947-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्जः|वर्ज|वर्जं|वर्ज्ज
वर्जः Leaving, abandoning.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0947-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्जक|वर्ज्जक
वर्जक a. (At the end of comp.)<BR>1<BR>Exclusive of, excluding.<BR>--2 Leaving,<BR>avoiding, abandoning.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0947-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्जनं|वर्जन|वर्ज्जन|वर्ज्जनं
वर्जनं [वृज्-ल्युट्]<BR>1 Leaving,<BR>giving up, abandoning.<BR>--2 Renouncing.<BR>--3 Exception, exclusion.<BR>--4 Hurt,<BR>injury, killing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0947-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्जं|वर्ज|वर्जः|वर्ज्ज
वर्जं ind. To the exclusion of,<BR>excluding, except (at the end of<BR>comp.); गौतमीवर्जमितरा निष्क्रांताः<BR>Ś. 4; Ku. 7. 72.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0947-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्जित|वर्ज्जित|वर्ज्जितः
वर्जित p. p.<BR>1 Left out, excepted.<BR>--2 Abandoned, relinquished.<BR>--3<BR>Excluded.<BR>--4 Deprived of, destitute<BR>of, without; as in गुणवर्जित.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0947-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्ज्य|वर्ज्ज्यः
वर्ज्य a.<BR>1 To be avoided or<BR>shunned.<BR>--2 To be excluded or left out.<BR>--3 With the exception of.<BR>--र्ज्यं A<BR>point in each lunar mansion during<BR>which no business should be<BR>undertaken.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0947-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्ण्
वर्ण् {c10c} U. (वर्णयति-ते, वर्णित)<BR>1<BR>To colour, paint, dye; यथा हि भरता<BR>वर्णैर्वर्णयंत्यात्मनस्तनुं Subhāṣ.<BR>--2<BR>To describe, relate, explain,<BR>write, depict delineate,<BR>illustrate; वर्णितं जयदेवेन हरोरिदं प्रणतेन<BR>Gīt. 3; Ki. 5. 18.<BR>--3 To praise; extol.<BR>--4<BR>To spread, extend.<BR>--5 To illuminate.<BR>--6 To exert oneself.<BR>--7 To send,<BR>cast.<BR>--8 To pound, grind.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0947-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्णः|वर्ण|वर्णं|वर्ण्ण
वर्णः [वर्ण्-अच्]<BR>1 A colour, hue;<BR>अंतःशुद्धस्त्वमपि भविता वर्णमात्रेण कृष्णः<BR>Me. 49.<BR>--2 A paint, dye,<BR>paintcolour; see वर्ण् (1).<BR>--3 Colour,<BR>complexion, beauty; त्वय्यादातुं<BR>जलमवनते शार्ङ्गिणो वर्णचौरे Me. 46;<BR>R. 8. 42.<BR>--4 A class of men, tribe, caste<BR>(especially applied to the four<BR>principal castes, ब्राह्मण, क्षत्रिय, वैश्य, and<BR>शूद्र); वर्णानामानुपूर्व्येण Vārt; न<BR>कश्चिद्वर्णानामपथमपकृष्टोऽपि भजते Ś. 5. 10;<BR>R. 5. 19.<BR>--5 A class, race, tribe,<BR>kind, species; as in सवर्णं अक्षरं.<BR>--6<BR>(a) A letter, character, sound; न मे<BR>वर्णविचारक्षमा दृष्टिः V. 5. (b) A word,<BR>syllable; S. D. 9.<BR>--7 Fame, glory,<BR>celebrity, renown; राजा<BR>प्रजारंजनलब्धवर्णः R. 6. 21.<BR>--8 A good quality,<BR>merit, virtue.<BR>--9 Praise.<BR>--10 Dress,<BR>decoration.<BR>--11 Outward appearance.<BR>form, figure.<BR>--12 A cloak, mantle.<BR>--13 A covering, lid.<BR>--14 The order<BR>or arrangement of a subject in a<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0948-a" target="_blank">Page0948-a+ 56</a>]<BR>song (गीतक्रम); उपात्तवर्णे चरिते<BR>पिनाकिनः Ku. 5. 56 ‘celebrated in song,<BR>made the subject of a song.’<BR>--15<BR>The housings of an elephant.<BR>--16 A<BR>quality, property.<BR>--17 A religious<BR>observance.<BR>--18 An unknown<BR>quantity.<BR>--19 The number ‘one.’<BR>--20<BR>Application of perfumed unguents<BR>to the body.<BR>--21 Gold.<BR>--22 A<BR>musical mode.<BR>--र्णं<BR>1 Saffron.<BR>--2 A<BR>coloured unguent or perfume.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--अंका a pen.<BR>--अधिपः a<BR>planet presiding over a caste or<BR>class.<BR>--अपसदः an outcast.<BR>--अपेत<BR>a. devoid of any caste, outcast,<BR>degraded.<BR>--अर्हः a kind of bean.<BR>--आगमः the addition of a letter;<BR>भवेद्वर्णागमाद्धंसः Sk.<BR>--आत्मन् m. a<BR>word.<BR>--आश्रमाः the (four) castes<BR>and stages of life; R. 5. 19.<BR>--उदकं<BR>coloured water; R. 16. 70.<BR>--कूपिका an ink-stand.<BR>--क्रमः {1}<BR>the order of castes or colours. {2}<BR>alphabetical order or arrangement.<BR>--गत a. {1} coloured. {2}<BR>algebraical.<BR>--चारकः a painter.<BR>--ज्येष्ठः a<BR>Brāhmaṇa.<BR>--तूलिः, --तूलिका, --तूली f.<BR>a pencil, paint-brush.<BR>--द a.<BR>colouring.<BR>--(दं) a kind of fragrant yellow<BR>wood.<BR>--दात्री turmeric.<BR>--दूतः a<BR>letter.<BR>--दूषक a. violating the<BR>distinctions of castes.<BR>--धर्मः the<BR>peculiar duties of a caste.<BR>--पातः<BR>the omission of a letter.<BR>--पात्रं a<BR>paint-box.<BR>--पुष्पं the flower of<BR>the globe-amaranth.<BR>--पुष्पकः the<BR>globe-amaranth.<BR>--प्रकर्षः excellence<BR>of colour.<BR>--प्रसादनं aloe-wood.<BR>--मातृ f. a pen, pencil.<BR>--मातृका<BR>N. of Sarasvatī.<BR>--माला, --राशिः<BR>the alphabet.<BR>--रे (ले) खा chalk.<BR>--वर्तिः, --वर्तिका f. a paint-brush,<BR>pencil.<BR>--वादिन् m. a panegyrist.<BR>--विपर्ययः the substitution or<BR>change of letters; (भवेत्) सिंहो<BR>वर्णविपर्ययात् Sk.<BR>--विलासिनी turmeric.<BR>--विलोडकः {1} a house-breaker. {2}<BR>a plagiarist (lit. word-stealer).<BR>--वृत्तं a metre regulated by the<BR>number of syllables it contains<BR>(opp. मात्रावृत्त).<BR>--व्यवस्थितिः f. the<BR>institution of caste.<BR>--शिक्षा<BR>instruction in letters.<BR>--श्रेष्ठः a<BR>Brāhmaṇa.<BR>--संयोगः marriage<BR>between persons of the same caste.<BR>--संसर्गः confusion of castes.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0948-b" target="_blank">Page0948-b+ 57</a>]<BR>--संकरः {1} confusion of castes through<BR>intermarriage. {2} mixture or<BR>blending of colours; चित्रेषु वर्णसंकरः<BR>K. (where both senses are<BR>intended); Śi. 14. 37.<BR>--संघातः, --समाम्नायः<BR>the alphabet.<BR>--स्थानं an organ of<BR>utterance.<BR>--हीन a. outcast.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0947-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्णकः|वर्णक|वर्णकं|वर्ण्णक
वर्णकः [वर्णयति, वर्ण् --ण्वुल्]<BR>1 A<BR>mask, the dress of an actor.<BR>--2<BR>A paint, colour for painting;<BR>Śi. 16. 62.<BR>--3 A paint, or anything<BR>used as an unguent or pigment;<BR>एतैः पिष्टतमालवर्णकनिभैरालिप्तमंभोधरैः<BR>Mk. 5. 46; Bk. 19. 11.<BR>--4 A bard,<BR>panegyrist.<BR>--5 Vermilion.<BR>--6<BR>Sandal (the tree).<BR>--7 A letter, syllable.<BR>--का<BR>1 A mask.<BR>--2 A paint, colour<BR>for painting.<BR>--3 Fine gold.<BR>--4<BR>Vermilion.<BR>--5 A cloak, mantle.<BR>--कं<BR>1 A paint, colour, pigment; Ś. 6. 15.<BR>--2 Sandal.<BR>--3 A chapter, division.<BR>--4 A circle, orb.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0948-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्णनं|वर्णन
वर्णनं --ना [वर्ण्-ल्युट्]<BR>1 Painting.<BR>--2 Description, delineation,<BR>representation; स्वभावोक्तिस्तु डिंभादेः<BR>स्वक्रियारूपवर्णनं K. P. 10.<BR>--3 Writing.<BR>--4 A statement, an assertion.<BR>--5<BR>Praise, commendation (--ना only in<BR>this sense).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0948-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्णना
वर्णनं --ना [वर्ण्-ल्युट्]<BR>1 Painting.<BR>--2 Description, delineation,<BR>representation; स्वभावोक्तिस्तु डिंभादेः<BR>स्वक्रियारूपवर्णनं K. P. 10.<BR>--3 Writing.<BR>--4 A statement, an assertion.<BR>--5<BR>Praise, commendation (--ना only in<BR>this sense).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0948-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्णवती
वर्णवती Turmeric.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0948-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्णसिः|वर्णसि
वर्णसिः Water.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0948-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्णाटः|वर्णाट
वर्णाटः<BR>1 A painter.<BR>--2 A singer.<BR>--3 One who maintains himself by<BR>his wife (स्त्रीकृताजीव).<BR>--4 A lover.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0948-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्णिका
वर्णिका [वर्णा अक्षराणि लेख्यत्वेन<BR>संत्यस्याः ठन्]<BR>1 The mask or dress of an<BR>actor.<BR>--2 A colour, paint.<BR>--3 Ink.<BR>--4 A pen, pencil.<BR>--5 Chalk.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--परिग्रहः the assumption of a<BR>character or mask; ततः<BR>प्रकरणनायकस्य मालतीवल्लभस्य माधवस्य<BR>वर्णिकापरिग्रहः कथं Māl. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0948-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्णित|वर्णितः
वर्णित p. p. [वर्ण्-क्त]<BR>1 Painted.<BR>--2 Described, represented.<BR>--3<BR>Extolled, praised.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0948-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्णिन्
वर्णिन् a. [वर्णोऽस्त्यस्य इनि] (At the<BR>end of comp.)<BR>1 Having the colour<BR>or appearance of.<BR>--2 Belonging to<BR>the caste of. --m.<BR>1 A painter.<BR>--2<BR>A scribe, writer.<BR>--3 A religious<BR>student, a Brahmacārin q. v.;<BR>अथाह वर्णी Ku. 5. 65, 52; वर्णाश्रमाणां<BR>गुरवे स वर्णी विचक्षणः प्रस्तुतमाचचक्षे<BR>R. 5. 19.<BR>--4 A person of any one of<BR>the four principal castes.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--लिंगिन् a. disguised as, or<BR>wearing the marks of, a religious<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0948-c" target="_blank">Page0948-c+ 56</a>]<BR>student; स वर्णिलिंगी विदितः समाययौ<BR>युधिष्ठिरं द्वैतवने वनेचरः Ki. 1. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0948-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्णिनी
वर्णिनी<BR>1 A woman(in general).<BR>--2 A woman belonging to any one<BR>of the four principal castes.<BR>--3<BR>Turmeric.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0948-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्णुः|वर्णु
वर्णुः The sun.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0948-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्ण्य
वर्ण्य a. To be described; (often<BR>used in rhetorical works like प्रकृत<BR>or प्रस्तुत q. v.).<BR>--र्ण्यं Saffron.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0948-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्तः|वर्त|वर्त्त
वर्तः (Usually at the end of<BR>comp.) Living, livelihood; as in<BR>कल्यवर्त q. v.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--जन्मन् m. a<BR>cloud.<BR>--लोहं bell-metal, a kind of<BR>brass.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0948-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्तक|वर्तकः|वर्त्तक|वर्त्तकं|वर्त्तकः
वर्तक a. [वृत्-ण्वुल्]<BR>1 Living,<BR>being, existing.<BR>--2 Devoted to.<BR>--कः<BR>1 A quail.<BR>--2 A horse's hoof.<BR>--कं A sort of brass or<BR>bellmetal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0948-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्तका|वर्त्तका
वर्तका A kind of quail.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0948-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्तकी
वर्तकी A kind of quail.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0948-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्तन|वर्तनः|वर्त्तन|वर्त्तनं|वर्त्तनः
वर्तन a. [वृत्-ल्यु ल्युट वा]<BR>1<BR>Abiding, living, staying, being &c.<BR>--2<BR>Stationary.<BR>--नः A dwarf.<BR>--नी<BR>1<BR>A road, way.<BR>--2 Living, life.<BR>--3<BR>Pounding, grinding.<BR>--4 Sending off,<BR>despatching.<BR>--5 A spindle.<BR>--नं<BR>1<BR>Living, being.<BR>--2 Staying, abiding,<BR>residing.<BR>--3 Action, movement,<BR>mode or manner of living; स्मरसि<BR>च तदुपांतेष्वावयोर्वर्तनानि U. 1. 26;<BR>(the word may here mean ‘abode<BR>or residence’, also).<BR>--4 Living<BR>on, subsisting (at the end of<BR>comp.)<BR>--5 Livelihood,<BR>maintenance, subsistence.<BR>--6 Turning<BR>round, revolving.<BR>--7 Rolling on,<BR>moving about.<BR>--8 Appointing.<BR>--9<BR>A means of subsistence, profession,<BR>occupation.<BR>--10 Conduct, behaviour,<BR>proceeding.<BR>--11 Wages, salary,<BR>hire.<BR>--12 Commerce, traffic.<BR>--13 A<BR>spindle.<BR>--14 A globe, ball.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0948-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्तनिः|वर्तनि|वर्त्तनि|वर्त्तनिः
वर्तनिः<BR>1 The eastern part of<BR>India, the eastern country.<BR>--2 A<BR>hymn, praise, eulogium (स्तोत्र).<BR>--निः f.<BR>1 A way, road.<BR>--2 The<BR>eyelashes.<BR>--3 Ved. A wheel.<BR>--4<BR>The track of a wheel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0948-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्तमान|वर्तमानः|वर्त्तमान|वर्त्तमानः
वर्तमान a. [वृत्-शानच्]<BR>1 Being,<BR>existing.<BR>--2 Living, being alive,<BR>contemporary; प्रथितयशसां<BR>भासकविसौमिल्लकविमिश्रादीनां प्रबंधानतिक्रम्य<BR>वर्तमानकवेः कालिदासस्य क्रियायां कथं<BR>परिषदो बहुमानः M. 1.<BR>--3 Turning or<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0949-a" target="_blank">Page0949-a+ 56</a>]<BR>moving round, revolving.<BR>--4<BR>Dwelling in.<BR>--नः The present tense<BR>(in gram.); वर्तमानसामीप्ये<BR>वर्तमानवद्वा P. III. 3. 131.<BR>--नं Presence.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0948-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्तरूकः|वर्तरूक|वर्त्तरूक|वर्त्तरूकः
वर्तरूकः<BR>1 A pool, puddle.<BR>--2<BR>An eddy, a whirlpool.<BR>--3 A crow's<BR>nest.<BR>--4 A doorkeeper.<BR>--5 N. of a<BR>river.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0949-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्तस्
वर्तस् n. Ved. The eyelashes.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0949-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्तिः|वर्ति|वर्त्ति|वर्त्तिः
वर्तिः --र्ती f. [वृत्-इन् वा ङीप्]<BR>1<BR>Anything wrapped round, a pad,<BR>roll.<BR>--2 An unguent, ointment,<BR>eye-salve, collyrium or any<BR>cosmetic (in the form of a ball or pill);<BR>सा पुनर्मम प्रथमदर्शनात्प्रभृत्यमृतवर्तिरिव<BR>चक्षुषोरानंदमुत्पादयंती Māl. 1;<BR>इयममृतवर्तिर्नयनयोः U. 1. 38; कर्पूरवर्तिरिव<BR>लोचनतापहंत्री Bv. 3. 16; Vb. 1.<BR>--3<BR>The wick of a lamp; Māl. 10. 4.<BR>--4 The projecting threads or<BR>unwoven ends (of a cloth), the fringe.<BR>--5 A magical lamp.<BR>--6 The<BR>protuberance round a vessel.<BR>--7 A<BR>surgical instrument (such as a<BR>bougie).<BR>--8 A streak, line.<BR>--9<BR>Swelling in the throat.<BR>--10 A<BR>swelling formed by internal<BR>rupture.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0949-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्ती|वर्त्ती
वर्तिः --र्ती f. [वृत्-इन् वा ङीप्]<BR>1<BR>Anything wrapped round, a pad,<BR>roll.<BR>--2 An unguent, ointment,<BR>eye-salve, collyrium or any<BR>cosmetic (in the form of a ball or pill);<BR>सा पुनर्मम प्रथमदर्शनात्प्रभृत्यमृतवर्तिरिव<BR>चक्षुषोरानंदमुत्पादयंती Māl. 1;<BR>इयममृतवर्तिर्नयनयोः U. 1. 38; कर्पूरवर्तिरिव<BR>लोचनतापहंत्री Bv. 3. 16; Vb. 1.<BR>--3<BR>The wick of a lamp; Māl. 10. 4.<BR>--4 The projecting threads or<BR>unwoven ends (of a cloth), the fringe.<BR>--5 A magical lamp.<BR>--6 The<BR>protuberance round a vessel.<BR>--7 A<BR>surgical instrument (such as a<BR>bougie).<BR>--8 A streak, line.<BR>--9<BR>Swelling in the throat.<BR>--10 A<BR>swelling formed by internal<BR>rupture.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0949-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्तिकः|वर्तिक|वर्त्तिक|वर्त्तिकः
वर्तिकः A kind of quail.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0949-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्तिका|वर्त्तिका
वर्तिका<BR>1 A paint-brush; तदुपनय<BR>चित्रफलकं चित्रवर्तिकाश्च Māl. 1;<BR>अंगुलिक्षरणसन्नवर्तिकः R. 19. 19.<BR>--2<BR>The wick of a lamp.<BR>--3 Colour,<BR>paint.<BR>--4 A quail; Māl. 8. 8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0949-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्तिन्|वर्त्तिन्
वर्तिन् a. (नी f.) [वृत्-र्णिनि]<BR>(Usually at the end of comp.)<BR>1<BR>Abiding, being, resting, staying,<BR>situated.<BR>--2 Going, moving,<BR>turning.<BR>--3 Acting, behaving.<BR>--4<BR>Performing, practising.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0949-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्तिष्णु|वर्त्तिष्णु|वर्त्तिष्णुः
वर्तिष्णु a.<BR>1 Revolving.<BR>--2 Being,<BR>abiding.<BR>--3 Circular.<BR>--4 Stationary,<BR>fixed.<BR>--5 Firm in battle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0949-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्तिस्
वर्तिस् n. Ved.<BR>1 Circuit, orbit.<BR>--2 A way, path.<BR>--3 Abode,<BR>residence.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0949-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्तीरः|वर्तीर
वर्ती(र्ति)रः A kind of quail.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0949-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्तिरः|वर्तिर
वर्ती(र्ति)रः A kind of quail.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0949-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्तुल|वर्तुलः|वर्त्तुल|वर्त्तुलं|वर्त्तुलः
वर्तुल a. [वृत्-उलच्] Round,<BR>circular, globular.<BR>--लः<BR>1 A kind of<BR>pulse, a pea.<BR>--2 A ball.<BR>--लं A<BR>circle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0949-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्त्मन्
वर्त्मन् n. [वृत्-मनिन्]<BR>1 A way,<BR>road, path, passage, track; वर्त्म<BR>भानोस्त्वजाशु Me. 39; पारसीकांस्ततो<BR>जेतुं प्रतस्थे स्थलवर्त्मना ‘by land’;<BR>आकाशवर्त्मना ‘through the air’.<BR>--2<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0949-b" target="_blank">Page0949-b+ 56</a>]<BR>(Fig.) A way, course, an<BR>established or prescribed usage, the usual<BR>manner or course of conduct; मम<BR>वर्त्मानुगच्छंति मनुष्याः पार्थ सर्वशः<BR>Bg. 3. 23; रेखामात्रमपि क्षुण्णादामनोर्वर्त्मनः<BR>परम् । न व्यतीयुः प्रजास्तस्य<BR>नियंतुर्नोमिवृत्तयः R. 1. 17 (where the literal<BR>sense is also intended); अहमेत्य<BR>पतंगवर्त्मना पुनरंकाश्रयिणी भवामि ते<BR>Ku. 4. 20 ‘after the manner of a<BR>moth.’<BR>--3 Room, scope for<BR>action; न वर्त्म कस्मैचिदपि प्रदीयतां<BR>Ki. 14. 14.<BR>--4 An eye-lid.<BR>--5 An edge,<BR>a border.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--कर्मन् n.<BR>‘roadwork’, engineering.<BR>--पातः<BR>deviation from the road.<BR>--बंधः, --बंधकः<BR>an affection of the eye-lids.<BR>--रोगः<BR>a disease of the eyelids.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0949-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्त्मनिः|वर्त्मनि
वर्त्मनिः --नी f. A road, way.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0949-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्त्मनी
वर्त्मनिः --नी f. A road, way.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0949-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्त्र
वर्त्र a. Ved. Protecting.<BR>--र्त्रं A<BR>dam, dike.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0949-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्ध्
वर्ध् {c10c} U. (वर्धयति-से, also वर्धापयति)<BR>1 To cut, divide, shear.<BR>--2 To fill.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0949-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्धः|वर्ध|वर्द्धं|वर्द्धः
वर्धः<BR>1 Cutting, dividing.<BR>--2<BR>Increasing, causing increase or<BR>prosperity.<BR>--3 Increase, augmentation.<BR>--र्धं<BR>1 Lead.<BR>--2 Red lead.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0949-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्धक|वर्द्धकः|वर्धकः
वर्धक a. [वृध्-णिच् ण्वुल्]<BR>1<BR>Increasing.<BR>--2 Cutting, dividing.<BR>--3<BR>Filling.<BR>--कः A carpenter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0949-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्धकिः|वर्धकि|वर्द्धकिः
वर्धकिः, वर्धकिन् m. A carpenter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0949-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्धकिन्
वर्धकिः, वर्धकिन् m. A carpenter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0949-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्धन|वर्द्धनं|वर्द्धनः|वर्धनः
वर्धन a. [वृध्-णिच् ल्यु ल्युद् वा]<BR>1<BR>Increasing, growing.<BR>--2 Causing to<BR>increase, enlarging, magnifying.<BR>--नः<BR>1 A bestower of prosperity.<BR>--2 A tooth growing over another<BR>tooth.<BR>--3 N. of Śiva.<BR>--नी<BR>1 A<BR>broom.<BR>--2 A bier.<BR>--3 A water-jar<BR>of a particular shape.<BR>--नं<BR>1<BR>Growing, thriving.<BR>--2 Growth, increase,<BR>prosperity, magnifying,<BR>enlargement.<BR>--3 Elevation.<BR>--4<BR>Exhilaration (of spirits), animation.<BR>--5<BR>Educating, rearing.<BR>--6 Cutting,<BR>dividing; as in नाभिर्वधनं<BR>--7 A means<BR>of strengthening, restorative.<BR>--8<BR>Filling.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0949-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्धनिका
वर्धनिका A small vessel in which<BR>sacred water is kept.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0949-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्धमान|वर्द्धमानः|वर्धमानः
वर्धमान a. [वृध् --शानच्] Growing,<BR>increasing.<BR>--नः<BR>1 The castor-oil<BR>plant.<BR>--2 A kind of riddle.<BR>--3 N.<BR>of Viṣṇu.<BR>--4 N. of a district (said<BR>to be the same as the modern<BR>Bardvāna).<BR>--5 Sweet citron.<BR>--नः, --नं<BR>1<BR>A pot or dish of a particular shape,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0949-c" target="_blank">Page0949-c+ 55</a>]<BR>lid.<BR>--2 A kind of mystical diagram.<BR>--3 A palace or temple built in the<BR>form of the above diagram.<BR>--4 A<BR>house having no door on the south<BR>side.<BR>--ना N. of a district (the<BR>modern Bardvāna).<BR>--Comp.<BR>--पुरं the<BR>city of Bardvāna.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0949-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्धमानकः|वर्धमानक|वर्द्धमानकः
वर्धमानकः A kind of dish or pot,<BR>lid or cover.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0949-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्धापनं|वर्धापन|वर्द्धापनं
वर्धापनं [वर्धं छेदं करोति, वृध् णिच्-आप्<BR>च ततो भावे ल्युट्]<BR>1 Cutting, dividing.<BR>--2 Cutting the umbilical cord, or<BR>the ceremony connected with this<BR>act.<BR>--3 A festival on a birth-day.<BR>--4<BR>Any festival in general when wishes<BR>for prosperity and other<BR>congratulatory expressions are offered; cf.<BR>पूर्णपात्र.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0949-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्धित|वर्द्धितं
वर्धित p. p.<BR>1 Grown, increased.<BR>--2 Enlarged, magnified.<BR>--3 Cut.<BR>--4<BR>Filled, full.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0949-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्धिष्णु|वर्द्धिष्णुः
वर्धिष्णु a. Growing, increasing,<BR>thriving.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0949-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्ध्रं|वर्ध्र|वर्द्ध्रं
वर्ध्रं<BR>1 A leather strap or thong.<BR>--2 Leather.<BR>--3 Lead.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0949-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्ध्रिका
वर्ध्रिका, वर्ध्री A leather strap or<BR>thong.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0949-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्ध्री
वर्ध्रिका, वर्ध्री A leather strap or<BR>thong.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0949-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्पन्
वर्पन् n. Ved.<BR>1 Form, figure.<BR>--2<BR>Praise.<BR>--3 A plot, trick, artifice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0949-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्फ्
वर्फ् {c1c} P. (वर्फति)<BR>1 To go, move.<BR>--2 To kill.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0949-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्मन्|वर्म्मन्
वर्मन् n. [वृ-मनिन्]<BR>1 An armour,<BR>a coat of mail; स्वहृदयमर्माणि वर्म करोति<BR>सजलनलिनीदलजालं Gīt. 4;<BR>R. 4. 56; Mu. 2. 8.<BR>--2 (Hence) Shelter,<BR>protection.<BR>--3 Bark, rind. --m. An<BR>affix added to the names of<BR>Kṣatriyas; as चंडवर्मन्, प्रहारवर्मन्; cf. दास.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--हर a. {1} wearing armour<BR>{2} old enough to wear armour (i. e.<BR>to take part in battle);<BR>सम्यग्विनीतमथ वर्महरं कुमारं R. 8. 94.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0949-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्मिक
वर्मिक, वर्मिन् a. Mailed, furnished<BR>with armour.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0949-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्मिन्
वर्मिक, वर्मिन् a. Mailed, furnished<BR>with armour.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0949-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्मणः|वर्मण
वर्मणः The orange tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0949-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्मिः|वर्मि|वर्म्मि|वर्म्मिः
वर्मिः A kind of fish.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0949-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्य|वर्यः|वर्य्य|वर्य्यं|वर्य्यः
वर्य a. [वृ-यत्]<BR>1 To be chosen<BR>or selected, eligible.<BR>--2 Best, most<BR>excellent, chief, principal (mostly<BR>at the end of comp.); अन्वीतः स<BR>कतिपयैः किरातवर्यैः Ki. 12. 54.<BR>--र्यः<BR>The god of love.<BR>--र्या<BR>1 A girl<BR>choosing her own husband.<BR>--2 A<BR>girl in general.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0949-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्वट|वर्व्वट
वर्वट See बर्बट.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0949-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्वणा|वर्व्वणा
वर्वणा See बर्बणा.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0950-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्वर|वर्वरः|वर्व्वर|वर्व्वरं|वर्व्वरः
वर्वर a. [वृ-अरच् वुट् च]<BR>1<BR>Stammering.<BR>--2 Curled.<BR>--रः<BR>1 A<BR>barbarian.<BR>--2 A blockhead, babbling<BR>fool.<BR>--3 An outcast.<BR>--4 Curly hair.<BR>--5 The clash of weapons.<BR>--6 A<BR>mode of dancing.<BR>--रा, --री<BR>1 A kind<BR>of fly.<BR>--2 A kind of basil.<BR>--रं<BR>1<BR>Yellow sandal-wood.<BR>--2 Vermilion.<BR>--3<BR>Gum-myrrh.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--उत्थं white<BR>sandal-wood.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0950-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्वरकं|वर्वरक|वर्व्वरकं
वर्वरकं A variety of sandal-wood.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0950-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्वरीकः|वर्वरीक|वर्व्वरीक|वर्व्वरीकः
वर्वरीकः<BR>1 Curly hair.<BR>--2 A kind<BR>of basil.<BR>--3 A kind of shrub.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0950-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्वूरः|वर्वूर|वर्व्वूरः
वर्वू(र्वु)रः A kind of tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0950-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्वुरः|वर्वुर
वर्वू(र्वु)रः A kind of tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0950-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्षः|वर्ष|वर्षं
वर्षः, --र्षं [वृष् भावे घञ् कर्तरि<BR>अच् वा]<BR>1 Raining, rain, a<BR>shower of rain; विद्युत्स्तनितवर्षेषु<BR>Ms. 4. 103; Me. 35.<BR>--2 Sprinkling,<BR>effusion, throwing down, a shower of<BR>anything; सुरभि सुरविमुक्तं पुष्पवर्षं<BR>पपात R. 12. 102; so शरवर्षः, शिलावर्षः;<BR>लाजवर्षः &c.<BR>--3 Seminal effusion.<BR>--4<BR>A year (usually only n.); इयंति<BR>वर्षाणि तया सहोग्रमभ्यस्यतीव<BR>व्रतमासिधारं R. 13. 67; न ववर्ष वर्षाणि द्बादश<BR>दक्षशताक्षः Dk.; वर्षभोग्येण शापेन<BR>Me. 1.<BR>--5 A division of the world, a<BR>continent; (nine such divisions are<BR>usually enumerated:<BR>1 कुरु; {2}<BR>हिरण्मय; {3} रम्यक; {4} इलावृत; {5} हरि; {6}<BR>केतुमाला; {7} भद्राश्व, {8} किंनर; and {9} भारत);<BR>एतदूढगुरुभार भारतं वर्षमद्य मम वर्तते<BR>वशे Śi. 14. 5.<BR>--6 India (= भारतवर्ष).<BR>--7 A cloud (only m. according to<BR>Hemacandra).<BR>--Comp.<BR>--अंशः,<BR>--अंशकः, --अंगः a month.<BR>--अंबु n.<BR>rain-water.<BR>--अयुतं ten thousand<BR>years.<BR>--अर्चिस् m. the planet Mars.<BR>--अवसानं the autumn or Śarat<BR>season.<BR>--आघोषः a frog.<BR>--आमदः a<BR>peacock.<BR>--उपलः hail.<BR>--करः a cloud.<BR>--(री) a cricket.<BR>--कोशः, --षः {1} a<BR>month. {2} an astrologer.<BR>--गिरिः,<BR>--पर्वतः ‘a Varṣa mountain’, i. e.<BR>one of the mountain-ranges<BR>supposed to separate the different divisions<BR>of the world from one another; (they<BR>are seven: --हिमवान् हेमक्टश्च निषधो<BR>मेरुरेव च । चैत्रः कर्णी च शृंगी च सप्तैते<BR>वर्षपर्वताः).<BR>--ज a. (वर्षेज also)<BR>produced in the rainy season.<BR>--धरः {1} a<BR>cloud. {2} a eunuch, an attendant<BR>on the women's apartments; M. 4;<BR>(वर्षधर्ष in the same sense).<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0950-b" target="_blank">Page0950-b+ 55</a>]<BR>--पाकिन् m. the hog-plum.<BR>--पूगः a series<BR>or collection of years.<BR>--प्रतिबंधः a<BR>drought.<BR>--प्रियः the Cātaka bird.<BR>--वरः a eunuch, an attendant on the<BR>women's apartments.<BR>--वृद्धिः f.<BR>birth-day.<BR>--शतं a century, one<BR>hundred years.<BR>--सहस्रं a thousand<BR>years.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0950-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्षं|वर्ष|वर्षः
वर्षः, --र्षं [वृष् भावे घञ् कर्तरि<BR>अच् वा]<BR>1 Raining, rain, a<BR>shower of rain; विद्युत्स्तनितवर्षेषु<BR>Ms. 4. 103; Me. 35.<BR>--2 Sprinkling,<BR>effusion, throwing down, a shower of<BR>anything; सुरभि सुरविमुक्तं पुष्पवर्षं<BR>पपात R. 12. 102; so शरवर्षः, शिलावर्षः;<BR>लाजवर्षः &c.<BR>--3 Seminal effusion.<BR>--4<BR>A year (usually only n.); इयंति<BR>वर्षाणि तया सहोग्रमभ्यस्यतीव<BR>व्रतमासिधारं R. 13. 67; न ववर्ष वर्षाणि द्बादश<BR>दक्षशताक्षः Dk.; वर्षभोग्येण शापेन<BR>Me. 1.<BR>--5 A division of the world, a<BR>continent; (nine such divisions are<BR>usually enumerated:<BR>1 कुरु; {2}<BR>हिरण्मय; {3} रम्यक; {4} इलावृत; {5} हरि; {6}<BR>केतुमाला; {7} भद्राश्व, {8} किंनर; and {9} भारत);<BR>एतदूढगुरुभार भारतं वर्षमद्य मम वर्तते<BR>वशे Śi. 14. 5.<BR>--6 India (= भारतवर्ष).<BR>--7 A cloud (only m. according to<BR>Hemacandra).<BR>--Comp.<BR>--अंशः,<BR>--अंशकः, --अंगः a month.<BR>--अंबु n.<BR>rain-water.<BR>--अयुतं ten thousand<BR>years.<BR>--अर्चिस् m. the planet Mars.<BR>--अवसानं the autumn or Śarat<BR>season.<BR>--आघोषः a frog.<BR>--आमदः a<BR>peacock.<BR>--उपलः hail.<BR>--करः a cloud.<BR>--(री) a cricket.<BR>--कोशः, --षः {1} a<BR>month. {2} an astrologer.<BR>--गिरिः,<BR>--पर्वतः ‘a Varṣa mountain’, i. e.<BR>one of the mountain-ranges<BR>supposed to separate the different divisions<BR>of the world from one another; (they<BR>are seven: --हिमवान् हेमक्टश्च निषधो<BR>मेरुरेव च । चैत्रः कर्णी च शृंगी च सप्तैते<BR>वर्षपर्वताः).<BR>--ज a. (वर्षेज also)<BR>produced in the rainy season.<BR>--धरः {1} a<BR>cloud. {2} a eunuch, an attendant<BR>on the women's apartments; M. 4;<BR>(वर्षधर्ष in the same sense).<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0950-b" target="_blank">Page0950-b+ 55</a>]<BR>--पाकिन् m. the hog-plum.<BR>--पूगः a series<BR>or collection of years.<BR>--प्रतिबंधः a<BR>drought.<BR>--प्रियः the Cātaka bird.<BR>--वरः a eunuch, an attendant on the<BR>women's apartments.<BR>--वृद्धिः f.<BR>birth-day.<BR>--शतं a century, one<BR>hundred years.<BR>--सहस्रं a thousand<BR>years.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0950-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्षक
वर्षक a. Raining.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0950-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्षणं|वर्षण
वर्षणं [वृष्-ल्युट्]<BR>1 Raining, rain.<BR>--2 Sprinkling, showering down (fig.<BR>also); द्रव्यवर्षणं ‘showering or<BR>bestowing wealth’.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0950-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्षणिः|वर्षणि
वर्षणिः f. [वृस्-अनिः]<BR>1 Raining.<BR>--2<BR>A sacrifice, sacrificial rite.<BR>--3 An<BR>act, action.<BR>--4 Staying, living,<BR>abiding (वर्तन).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0950-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्षा
वर्षा (Usually f. pl.)<BR>1 The rainy<BR>season, the rains, the monsoon;<BR>ग्रीष्मे पंचाग्निमध्यस्थो वर्षासु स्थंडिलेशयः<BR>Y. 3. 52; Bk. 7. 1.<BR>--2 Rain (sing.<BR>in this sense).<BR>--Comp.<BR>--कालः<BR>the rains, the rainy season; so<BR>वर्षासमयः.<BR>--कालीन a. belonging to or<BR>produced in the rainy season.<BR>--प्रभंजनः a high wind.<BR>--भू m. {1} a<BR>frog. {2} a kind of insect (इंद्रगोप).<BR>--भूः, --भ्वी f. {1} a female frog or a<BR>little frog. {2} hogweed. {3} an<BR>earth-worm.<BR>--रात्रः {1} a night in<BR>the rainy season. {2} the rainy<BR>season.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0950-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्षिक
वर्षिक a. Raining, showering.<BR>--कं Aloe-wood.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0950-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्षितं|वर्षित
वर्षितं Rain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0950-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्षुक|वर्षुकः
वर्षुक a. (की f.) [वृष्-उकञ्]<BR>Raining, watery, pouring down<BR>water; वर्षुकस्य किमपः<BR>कृतान्नेतरेंबुदस्य परिहार्यमूषरं Śi. 14. 46;<BR>Bk. 2. 37.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--अब्दः, --अंबुदः a<BR>rain-cloud.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0950-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्षिष्ठ|वर्षिष्ठः
वर्षिष्ठ a.<BR>1 Oldest, very old.<BR>--2<BR>Strongest.<BR>--3 Largest (superl. of<BR>वृद्ध q. v.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0950-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्षीयस्
वर्षीयस् a. (सी f.)<BR>1 Older; very<BR>old.<BR>--2 Stronger (compar. of<BR>वृद्ध q. v.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0950-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्ष्मं|वर्ष्म
वर्ष्मं The body; see below.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0950-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्ष्मन्
वर्ष्मन् n. [वृष्-मनिन्]<BR>1 Body,<BR>form.<BR>--2 A measure, height; वर्ष्म<BR>द्विपानां विरुवंत<BR>उच्चकैर्वनेचरेभ्याश्चिरमाचचक्षिरे Śi. 12. 64; गजवर्ष्म किरातेभ्यः<BR>शशंसुर्देवदारवः R. 4. 76.<BR>--3 A<BR>handsome or lovely form.<BR>--4 Surface<BR>(as of a mountain); Māl. 9. 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0950-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्ह्
वर्ह् See बर्ह्, बर्ह, बर्हण,<BR>बर्हिण, बर्हिन्, बर्हिस्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0950-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्ह|वर्हं
वर्ह See बर्ह्, बर्ह, बर्हण,<BR>बर्हिण, बर्हिन्, बर्हिस्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0950-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्हण|वर्हणं
वर्हण See बर्ह्, बर्ह, बर्हण,<BR>बर्हिण, बर्हिन्, बर्हिस्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0950-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्हिण|वर्हिणः
वर्हिण See बर्ह्, बर्ह, बर्हण,<BR>बर्हिण, बर्हिन्, बर्हिस्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0950-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्हिन्
वर्हिन् See बर्ह्, बर्ह, बर्हण,<BR>बर्हिण, बर्हिन्, बर्हिस्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0950-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्हिस्
वर्हिस् See बर्ह्, बर्ह, बर्हण,<BR>बर्हिण, बर्हिन्, बर्हिस्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0950-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वल्
वल् {c1c} A. (वलते; but sometimes<BR>वलति also; वलित)<BR>1 To go, approach,<BR>hasten; अन्योन्यं शरवृष्टिरेव वलते<BR>Mv. 6. 41; प्रणयिनं परिरब्धुमथांगना<BR>ववलिरे वलिरेचितमध्यमाः Śi. 6. 38,<BR>6. 11, 19. 42; त्वदभिसरणरभसेन वलंती<BR>पतति पदानि कियंति चलंती Gīt. 6.<BR>--2<BR>To move, turn, move or turn round;<BR>वलितकंधर Māl. 1. 29; दृष्टिरन्यतो न<BR>वलति K.<BR>--3 To turn to, be<BR>drawn or attracted towards, be<BR>attached to; हृदयमदये तस्पिन्नेवं<BR>पुनर्वलते बलात् Gīt. 7; Nalod. 3. 5.<BR>--4 To increase; वलन्नूपुरनिस्वना<BR>S. D. 116; अमंदं कंदर्पज्वरजनिताचिंताकुलतया<BR>वलद्वाधां राधां सरसामिदमूचे सहचरी<BR>Gīt. 1.<BR>--5 To cover, enclose.<BR>--6 To be<BR>covered, enclosed or surrounded.<BR>--WITH वि to move to and fro, roll<BR>about; स्विद्यति कूणति वेल्लति विवलति<BR>निमिष ते विलाकेयति तिर्यक् K. P. 10.<BR>--सं {1} to mix, blend. {2} to<BR>connect, unite with (mostly in p. p.;<BR>see संवलित).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0950-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वलनं|वलन
वलनं [वल्-भावे ल्युट्]<BR>1 Moving,<BR>turning towards.<BR>--2 Moving round<BR>in a circle.<BR>--3 (In astr.)<BR>Deflection.<BR>--4 Agitation, excitement.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0950-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वलित|वलितः
वलित p. p.<BR>1 Moving.<BR>--2 Moved,<BR>turned round, bent round.<BR>--3<BR>Surrounded, enclosed.<BR>--4 Wrinkled;<BR>Ki. 11. 4.<BR>--5 Cast, darted;<BR>Māl. 8. 11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0950-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वल|वलं|वलः
वल See बल.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0950-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वलक्ष|वलक्षः
वलक्ष See बलक्ष.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0950-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वलग्नः|वलग्न|वलग्नं
वलग्नः, --ग्नं The waist.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0950-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वलग्नं|वलग्न|वलग्नः
वलग्नः, --ग्नं The waist.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0950-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वलभिः|वलभि
वलभिः --भी f. [वल्यते आच्छाद्यते<BR>वल्-अभि वा ङीप्] (Also frequently<BR>written बडभिः-भी)<BR>1 The sloping roof,<BR>the wooden frame of a thatch;<BR>धूपैर्जालविनिःसृतैर्वलभयः संदिग्धपारावताः<BR>V. 3. 2;<BR>सौधान्यत्यर्थतापाद्वलाभिपरिचयद्वोषेपारावतानि M. 2. 13.<BR>--2 The topmost part<BR>(of a house); दृष्ट्वा दृष्ट्वा<BR>भवनवलभीतुंगवातायनस्था Māl. 1. 15; Me. 38;<BR>Śi. 3. 53.<BR>--3 N. of a town in<BR>Saurāṣṭra; अस्ति सौराष्ट्रेषु वलभी नाम नगरी<BR>Dk., Bk. 22. 35.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0950-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वलभी
