वलयः|वलय|वलयं
वलयः --यं [वल्-अयन्]<BR>1 A<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0951-a" target="_blank">Page0951-a+ 55</a>]<BR>bracelet, armlet;<BR>विहितविशदबिसकिसलयवलया जीवति परमिह तव रतिकलया<BR>Gīt. 6; Bk. 3. 22; Me. 2, 60;<BR>R. 13. 21, 43.<BR>--2 A ring, coil; Ś. 1. 33,<BR>7. 11.<BR>--3 The zone or girdle of a<BR>married woman.<BR>--4 A circle,<BR>circumference (oft. at the end of comp.);<BR>भ्रांतभूवलयः Dk.; वेलावप्रवलयां (उर्वी)<BR>R. 1. 30; दिग्वलय Śi. 9. 8.<BR>--5 An<BR>enclosure, a bower; as in लतावलयमंडप.<BR>--यः<BR>1 A fence, hedge.<BR>--2 A branch.<BR>--3 A sore throat. (वलयीकृ ‘to form<BR>into a bracelet;’ Ku. 5. 66; वलयीभू<BR>‘to serve as a bracelet or girdle’).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0950-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

