वल्कलः|वल्कल|वल्कलं
वल्कलः --लं [वल्-कलन् कस्य नेत्वं]<BR>1 The bark of a tree.<BR>--2 A garment<BR>made of bark, bark-garment;<BR>इयमधिकमनोज्ञा वल्कलेनापि तन्वी Ś. 1. 20,<BR>19. R. 12. 8; Ku. 5. 8; हैमवल्कलाः<BR>6. 6 ‘wearing golden bark-dresses’;<BR>(cf. चीरपरिग्रहाः in Ku. 6. 93).<BR>--Comp.<BR>--संवीत a. clad in bark.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0951-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वल्कलं|वल्कल|वल्कलः
