वल्ग्
वल्ग् {c1c} U. (वल्गति-ते, वल्गित)<BR>1<BR>To go, move, shake; Śi. 12. 20.<BR>--2<BR>To leap, bounce, bound, go by<BR>leaps, gallop (fig. also); वल्गु<BR>वल्गंति सूक्तयः Pt. 1. 62.<BR>--3 To dance,<BR>prance; द्वारे हेमविभूषणाश्च तुरगा वल्गंति<BR>यद्दर्पिताः Bh. 3. 148, 2. 125;<BR>Śi. 18. 53.<BR>--4 To be pleased;<BR>Bk. 13. 28.<BR>--5 To eat;<BR>निर्जिताखिलमहार्णवौषधिस्यंदसारममृतं बवल्गिरे Śi. 14. 29.<BR>--6 To swagger, vaunt;<BR>विद्यासद्मविनिर्गलत्कणमुषो वल्गंति चेत्पामराः Bv. 1. 72.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0951-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वल्गनं|वल्गन
वल्गनं Leaping, jumping,<BR>galloping; R. 9. 51.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0951-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वल्गा
वल्गा A bridle, rein; आलाने गृह्यते<BR>हस्ती वाजी वल्गासु गृह्यते Mk. 1. 50.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0951-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वल्गित|वल्गितं
वल्गित p. p.<BR>1 Jumped,<BR>bounded, leaped &c.<BR>--2 Moved, made to<BR>dance; Kāv. 2. 73.<BR>--तं<BR>1 A gallop,<BR>one of the paces of a horse.<BR>--2<BR>Swaggering, boasting, vaunt;<BR>निमित्तादपराद्धेषोर्धानुष्कस्येव वल्गितं Śi. 2. 27.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0951-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वल्गु|वल्गुः
वल्गु a. [वल् संवरणे उ गुक् च Tv.]<BR>1<BR>Lovely, beautiful, handsome,<BR>attractive; R. 5. 68, Śi. 5. 29;<BR>Ki. 18. 11.<BR>--2 Sweet; Bv. 2. 136.<BR>--3<BR>Precious. --adv. Beautifully,<BR>splendidly; Pt. 1. 62.<BR>--ल्गुः A goat.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--पत्रः a kind of wild pulse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0951-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वल्गुक|वल्गुकं
वल्गुक a. Handsome, lovely,<BR>beautiful.<BR>--कं<BR>1 Sandal.<BR>--2 Price.<BR>--3<BR>A wood.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0951-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वल्गुलः|वल्गुल
वल्गुलः The flying fox.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0951-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वल्गुलिका
वल्गुलिका<BR>1 A cock roach.<BR>--2<BR>A chest.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0951-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वल्गूयति
वल्गूयति Den. P.<BR>1 To be<BR>handsome.<BR>--2 To be mild or gentle.<BR>--3<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0951-c" target="_blank">Page0951-c+ 55</a>]<BR>Ved. To praise, honour.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0951-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

