वास्तव्य|वास्तव्यः
वास्तव्य a.<BR>1 Dwelling,<BR>inhabiting, resident; पुरेऽस्य<BR>वास्तव्यकुटुबितां ययुः Śi. 1. 66.<BR>--2 Fit to be<BR>inhabited, habitable.<BR>--व्यः A<BR>dweller, resident, an inhabitant;<BR>नानादिगंतवास्तव्यो महाजनसमाजः<BR>Māl. 1.<BR>--व्यं<BR>1 A habitable place,<BR>house.<BR>--2 Habitation, residence<BR>(वसति).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0964-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वास्तिकं|वास्तिक
वास्तिकं A collection of goats.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0964-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वास्तु
वास्तु m., n. [वस्-तुण् Uṇ. 1. 77]<BR>1 The site of a house,<BR>buildingground, site.<BR>--2 A house, an abode,<BR>a dwelling-place; रवेरविषये वास्तु किं<BR>न दीपः प्रकाशयेत् Subhāṣ.;<BR>Ms. 3. 18.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--यागः a sacrifice<BR>performed on the occasion of laying<BR>the foundation of a house.<BR>--संशमनं,<BR>--शांतिः f. a religious rite performed<BR>on the occasion of laying the<BR>foundation of a new house,<BR>particularly on the occasion of entering<BR>it.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0964-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वास्तोष्पतिः|वास्तोष्पति
