वाह्
वाह् {c1c} A. (वाह्ते) To try, exert<BR>oneself, endeavour.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0964-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वाह|वाहः
वाह a. [वह्-घञ्] Bearing,<BR>carrying &c. (at the end of comp.); as<BR>in अंबुवाह, तोयवाह &c.<BR>--हः<BR>1<BR>Carrying, bearing.<BR>--2 A porter.<BR>--3 A<BR>draught-animal, a beast of burden.<BR>--4 A horse; R. 4. 56, 5. 73,<BR>14. 52.<BR>--5 A bull; Ku. 7. 49.<BR>--6 A<BR>buffalo.<BR>--7 A carriage, conveyance<BR>in general.<BR>--8 The arm.<BR>--9 Air,<BR>wind.<BR>--10 A measure equal to ten<BR>Kumbhas or four Bhāras; वाहो<BR>भारचतुष्टयं.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--द्विषत् m. a buffalo.<BR>--श्रेष्ठः a horse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0964-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वाहकः|वाहक
वाहकः [वह्-ण्वुल्]<BR>1 A porter.<BR>--2 A<BR>coach-driver.<BR>--3 A horseman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0964-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वाहनं|वाहन
वाहनं [वाहयति वह्-णिच् ल्यु ल्युट् वा]<BR>1 Bearing, carrying, conveying.<BR>--2<BR>Driving (as a horse).<BR>--3 A<BR>vehicle, conveyance of any kind;<BR>Ms. 7. 75; N. 22. 45.<BR>--4 An animal used<BR>in riding or draught, as a horse;<BR>स दुष्प्रापयशाः प्रापदाश्रमं श्रांतवाहनः<BR>R. 1. 48, 9. 25, 60.<BR>--5 An elephant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0964-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वाहस्
वाहस् m. Ved.<BR>1 Agni.<BR>--2 A<BR>hymn.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0964-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वाहिन्
वाहिन् a. [वह्-णिनि] Bearing<BR>carrying. --m. A chariot.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0964-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वाहिनी
वाहिनी [वाहो अस्त्यस्याः इनि ङीप्]<BR>1<BR>An army; आशिषं प्रयुयुजे न वाहिनीं<BR>R. 11. 6, 13. 66.<BR>--2 A division of<BR>an army consisting of 81 elephants,<BR>as many chariots, 243 horse, and<BR>405 foot.<BR>--3 A river.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--निवेशः the camp of an army.<BR>--पतिः {1} a general, a commanding<BR>officer. {2} the ocean (lord of rivers).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0964-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वाहसः|वाहस
वाहसः<BR>1 A water-course.<BR>--2 A<BR>large serpent, the boa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0964-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वाहिकः|वाहिक
वाहिकः<BR>1 A large drum.<BR>--2 A<BR>car drawn by oxen.<BR>--3 A carrier of<BR>loads.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0964-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वाहितं|वाहित
वाहितं A heavy burden.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0964-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वाहित्त्थं|वाहित्त्थ
वाहित्त्थं The part of an<BR>elephant's forehead below the frontal<BR>globes.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0964-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वाहीक|वाहीकः
वाहीक See बाहीक.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0964-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वाहुक
वाहुक See बाहुक.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0964-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वाह्य|वाह्यं|वाह्यः
वाह्य See वाह्य.<BR>--ह्यः A beast of<BR>burden, an ox &c.<BR>--ह्यं A carriage.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0964-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वाह्लिः|वाह्लि
वाह्लिः N. of a country (the<BR>modern Balkh).<BR>--Comp.<BR>--जः a<BR>Balkh bred horse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0964-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वाह्लिकः|वाह्लिक|वाह्लिकं
वाह्लि(ह्ली)कः<BR>1 N. of a country<BR>(the modern Balkh).<BR>--2 A horse<BR>from this country, a Balkh-bred<BR>horse.<BR>--3 N. of one of the<BR>principal Gandharvas.<BR>--कं<BR>1 Saffron.<BR>--2<BR>Asa Fœtida.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0964-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वाह्लीकः|वाह्लीक|वाह्लीकं
वाह्लि(ह्ली)कः<BR>1 N. of a country<BR>(the modern Balkh).<BR>--2 A horse<BR>from this country, a Balkh-bred<BR>horse.<BR>--3 N. of one of the<BR>principal Gandharvas.<BR>--कं<BR>1 Saffron.<BR>--2<BR>Asa Fœtida.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0964-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वि|विः
वि ind.<BR>1 As a prefix to verbs<BR>and nouns it expresses:--(a)<BR>separation, disjunction (apart,<BR>asunder, away, off &c.), as वियुज्, विहृ,<BR>विचल् &c.; (b) the reverse of an<BR>action; as क्री ‘to buy’; विक्री, ‘to<BR>sell’; स्मृ ‘to remember’; विस्मृ ‘to<BR>forget’; (c) division; as विभज्,<BR>विभाग; (d) distinction; as<BR>विशिष्, विशेष, विविच्, विवेक; (e)<BR>discrimination; व्यवच्छेद; (f)<BR>order, arrangement; as विधा, विरच्;<BR>(g) opposition; as विरुध्, विरोध;<BR>privation; as विती, विनयत; (i)<BR>deliberation, as विचर, विचार; (j)<BR>intensity; विध्वंस^1.<BR>--2 As a prefix<BR>to nouns or adjectives not<BR>immediately connected with roots वि<BR>expresses (a) negation or privation,<BR>in which case it is used much in the<BR>same way as अ or निर्, i. e. it forms<BR>Bah. comp., विधवा, व्यसुः &c.; (b)<BR>intensity, greatness; as विकराल; (c)<BR>variety, as विचित्र; (d) difference;<BR>as विलक्षण; (e) manifoldness, as<BR>विविध; (f) contrariety, opposition,<BR>as विलोम; (g) change, as विकार;<BR>(h) impropriety, as विजन्मन्.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by Dr. Sampada Savardekar and Jim Funderburk on 20210104. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-corrections/issues/20.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0964-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विः|वि
विः m., f.<BR>1 A bird.<BR>--2 A horse.<BR>--3 A goer.<BR>--4 A rein.<BR>--5 An epithet<BR>of the Soma.<BR>--6 A sacrificer (mostly<BR>Ved. in the last four senses).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0964-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विंश|विंशः
विंश a. (शी f.) Twentieth.<BR>--शः<BR>A twentieth part.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0964-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विंशक|विंशकः
विंशक a. (की f.) Twenty.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0964-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विंशतिः|विंशति
