विंशतिक|विंशतिकः
विंशतिक a. Worth twenty.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0964-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विंशतितम|विंशतितमः
विंशतितम a. (मी f.) Twentieth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0964-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विंशिन्
विंशिन् m.<BR>1 Twenty, a score.<BR>--2<BR>A lord or ruler of twenty villages.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0964-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विकं|विक
विकं The milk of a cow that has<BR>recently calved.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0964-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विकंकटः|विकङ्कट|विकंकट|विकङ्कटः
