विकच|विकचः
विकच a. [विकच्-अच्]<BR>1 Blown,<BR>expanded, opened (as a lotus-flower<BR>&c.); विकचकिंशुकसंहतिरुच्चकैः<BR>Śi. 6. 21; R. 9. 37.<BR>--2 Spread about,<BR>scattered over; Bv. 1. 3.<BR>--3<BR>Destitute of hair.<BR>--4 Manifested,<BR>distinctly apparent; U. 5. 26;<BR>विकचनक्षत्रकुमुदैः Mu. 3. 7.<BR>--चः<BR>1 A Buddhist<BR>mendicant.<BR>--2 N. of Ketu.<BR>--3 A flag,<BR>banner.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0965-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

