विकस्
विकस् {c1c} P.<BR>1 To open, expand<BR>(fig. also); विकसति हि पतंगस्योदये<BR>पुंडरीकं Māl. 1. 28; Śi. 9. 47, 82;<BR>Ku. 7. 55; निजहृदि विकसंतः<BR>Bh. 2. 78.<BR>--2 To burst, become divided.<BR>--Caus. To open, cause to expand;<BR>चंद्रो विकासयति कैरवचक्रवालं<BR>Bh. 2. 73; Śi. 15. 12; Amaru. 84.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0965-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

