विष्किरः|विष्किर
विष्किरः<BR>1 Scattering about,<BR>tearing up.<BR>--2 A cock.<BR>--3 A bird,<BR>gallinaceous bird;<BR>छायापस्किरमाणविष्किरमुखव्याकृष्टकीटत्वचः U. 2. 9.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0999-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विष्टप्
विष्टप् f.<BR>1 A place, region, world.<BR>--2 Heaven.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0999-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विष्टपः|विष्टप|विष्टपं
विष्टपः --पं<BR>1 A world; Ku. 3. 20;<BR>cf. त्रिविष्टप.<BR>--2 A vessel, cup (Ved.).<BR>--Comp.<BR>--हारिन् a. one who pleases<BR>the world; Bh. 2. 25.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0999-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विष्टपं|विष्टप|विष्टपः
विष्टपः --पं<BR>1 A world; Ku. 3. 20;<BR>cf. त्रिविष्टप.<BR>--2 A vessel, cup (Ved.).<BR>--Comp.<BR>--हारिन् a. one who pleases<BR>the world; Bh. 2. 25.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=0999-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विष्टंभ्|विष्टम्भ्
विष्टंभ् {c5c} {c9c} P.<BR>1 To stop,<BR>obstruct; Ś. 5. 9.<BR>--2 To fix, plant,<BR>rest on; अत्युच्छ्रिते मंत्रिणि पार्थिवे च<BR>विष्टभ्य पादावुपतिष्ठते श्रीः Mu. 4. 13.<BR>--Caus.<BR>1 To obstruct.<BR>--2 To<BR>paralyse, benumb.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1000-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विष्टब्ध
विष्टब्ध p. p.<BR>1 Fixed firmly; well<BR>supported.<BR>--2 Propped up,<BR>supported.<BR>--3 Obstructed, hindered.<BR>--4<BR>Paralysed, made motionless.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1000-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विष्टंभः|विष्टम्भ|विष्टंभ|विष्टम्भः
विष्टंभः<BR>1 Fixing firmly.<BR>--2<BR>Obstruction, hindrance, an<BR>impediment.<BR>--3 Obstruction of the urine<BR>or ordure, constipation.<BR>--4<BR>Paralysis.<BR>--5 Stopping, staying.<BR>--6<BR>Stepping, placing the feet.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1000-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विष्टंभिन्|विष्टम्भिन्
विष्टंभिन् a.<BR>1 Stopping,<BR>obstructing, impeding.<BR>--2 Making<BR>motionless, benumbing, chilling.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1000-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विष्टरः|विष्टर
विष्टरः<BR>1 A seat (a stool, chair<BR>&c.); R. 8. 18.<BR>--2 A layer, bed<BR>(as of Kuśa grass.).<BR>--3 A handful of<BR>Kuśa grass.<BR>--4 The seat of the<BR>presiding priest (or Brahman) at<BR>a sacrifice.<BR>--5 A tree.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--भाज् a. seated on or occupying a<BR>seat; Ku. 7. 72.<BR>--श्रवस् m. an<BR>epithet of Viṣṇu or Kṛṣṇa;<BR>Śi. 14. 12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1000-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विष्टा
विष्टा Excrement, feces, ordure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1000-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विष्टिः|विष्टि
विष्टिः f. [विष्-क्तिन् क्तिच् वा]<BR>1<BR>Pervading.<BR>--2 An act, occupation.<BR>--3 Hire, wages.<BR>--4 Unpaid labour.<BR>--5 Sending.<BR>--6 Residence in hell<BR>to which one is condemned.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1000-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विष्ठलं|विष्ठल
विष्ठलं A remote place, one<BR>situated at a distance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1000-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विष्ठा
विष्ठा<BR>1 Feces, ordure, excrement;<BR>Ms. 3. 180, 10. 91.<BR>--2 The belly.<BR>--3 Ved. Interval.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1000-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विष्णुः|विष्णु
विष्णुः [विष् व्यापने नुक् Uṇ. 3. 39]<BR>1 The second deity of the sacred<BR>Triad, entrusted with the<BR>preservation of the world, which duty he<BR>is represented to have duly<BR>discharged by his various incarnations;<BR>(for their descriptions see the<BR>several avatāras s. v. and also under<BR>अवतार); the word is thus popularly<BR>derived: --यस्माद्विश्वमिदं सर्वं तस्य शक्त्या<BR>महात्मनः । तस्मादेवोच्यते विष्णुर्वीशधातोः<BR>प्रवेशनात् ॥.<BR>--2 N. of Agni.<BR>--3 A pious man.<BR>--4 N. of a law-giver, author of a<BR>Smṛti called विष्णुस्मृति.<BR>--5 N. of one<BR>of the Vasus.<BR>--6 The lunar mansion<BR>called Śravaṇa (presided over by<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1000-b" target="_blank">Page1000-b+ 55</a>]<BR>Viṣṇu).<BR>--Comp.<BR>--कांची N. of a<BR>town.<BR>--क्रमः the step or stride of<BR>Viṣṇu.<BR>--गुप्तः N. of Cāṇakya.<BR>--तैलं<BR>a kind of medicinal oil.<BR>--दैवत्या N.<BR>of the eleventh and twelfth days<BR>of each fortnight (of a lunar<BR>month).<BR>--पदं {1} the sky,<BR>atmosphere. {2} the sea of milk. {3} the<BR>foot of Viṣṇu (worshipped at<BR>Gayā). {4} a lotus.<BR>--पदी an<BR>epithet of the Ganges.<BR>--पुराणं N. of<BR>one of the most celebrated of the<BR>eighteen Purāṇas.<BR>--प्रीतिः f. land<BR>granted rent-free to Brāhmaṇas to<BR>maintain Viṣṇu's worship.<BR>--माया<BR>N. of Durgā.<BR>--रथः an epithet of<BR>Garuḍa.<BR>--रातः N. of king<BR>Parīkṣit.<BR>--लिंगी a quail.<BR>--लोकः<BR>Viṣṇu's world.<BR>--वल्लभा {1} an<BR>epithet of Lakṣmī. {2} the holy basil.<BR>--वाहनः, --वाह्यः epithets of Garuḍa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1000-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विष्पंद्|विष्पन्द्
विष्पंद् {c1c} A.<BR>1 To A move about.<BR>--2 To throb, beat, palpitate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1000-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विष्पंदः|विष्पन्द|विष्पंद|विष्पन्दः
विष्पंदः Throbbing, palpitation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1000-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विष्फारः|विष्फार
विष्फारः<BR>1 The twang of a bow.<BR>--2 Vibration.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1000-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विष्य|विष्यः
विष्य a. Deserving death by<BR>poison.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1000-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विष्यंद्|विष्यन्द्
विष्यंद् {c1c} A. To flow; Bk. 9. 74.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1000-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विष्यंदः|विष्यन्द|विष्यन्दः
विष्यंदः Flowing, trickling.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1000-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विष्व|विष्वः
विष्व a. Hurtful, injurious,<BR>mischievous.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1000-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विष्वच्
विष्वच्, विष्वंच् a. (Nom. sing.<BR>m. विष्वङ्; f. विषूची, n. विष्वक्)<BR>1<BR>Going or being everywhere,<BR>all-pervading; विष्वङ्मोहः स्थगयति कथं<BR>मंदभाग्यः करोमि U. 3. 38, Māl. 9. 20.<BR>--2 Separating into parts.<BR>--3<BR>Different.<BR>--4 Alternately. (विष्वक् is<BR>used adverbially in the sense of<BR>‘everywhere, on all sides, all<BR>around’; Ki. 14. 59; Pt. 2. 2;<BR>Māl. 5. 4, 9. 25).<BR>--Comp.<BR>--सेनः (<BR>विष्वक्सेनः or विष्वक्षेणः) an epithet of Viṣṇu;<BR>साम्यमाप<BR>कमलासखविष्वक्सेनसेवितयुगांतपयोधेः Śi. 10. 55; विष्वक्सेनः<BR>स्वतनुमविशत्सर्वलोकप्रतिष्ठां R. 15. 103. ˚प्रिया<BR>N. of Lakṣmī.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1000-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विष्वंच्|विष्वञ्च्
विष्वच्, विष्वंच् a. (Nom. sing.<BR>m. विष्वङ्; f. विषूची, n. विष्वक्)<BR>1<BR>Going or being everywhere,<BR>all-pervading; विष्वङ्मोहः स्थगयति कथं<BR>मंदभाग्यः करोमि U. 3. 38, Māl. 9. 20.<BR>--2 Separating into parts.<BR>--3<BR>Different.<BR>--4 Alternately. (विष्वक् is<BR>used adverbially in the sense of<BR>‘everywhere, on all sides, all<BR>around’; Ki. 14. 59; Pt. 2. 2;<BR>Māl. 5. 4, 9. 25).<BR>--Comp.<BR>--सेनः (<BR>विष्वक्सेनः or विष्वक्षेणः) an epithet of Viṣṇu;<BR>साम्यमाप<BR>कमलासखविष्वक्सेनसेवितयुगांतपयोधेः Śi. 10. 55; विष्वक्सेनः<BR>स्वतनुमविशत्सर्वलोकप्रतिष्ठां R. 15. 103. ˚प्रिया<BR>N. of Lakṣmī.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1000-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विष्वद्र्यच्
विष्वद्र्य(द्र्यं)च् a. (विष्वद्रीची f.)<BR>Going everywhere, all-pervading;<BR>विष्वद्रीचीर्विक्षिपन् सैन्यवीचीः Śi. 18. 25;<BR>विष्वद्रीच्या भुवनमभितो भासते यस्य भासा<BR>Bv. 4. 18.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1000-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विष्वद्र्यंच्|विष्वद्र्यञ्च्
विष्वद्र्य(द्र्यं)च् a. (विष्वद्रीची f.)<BR>Going everywhere, all-pervading;<BR>विष्वद्रीचीर्विक्षिपन् सैन्यवीचीः Śi. 18. 25;<BR>विष्वद्रीच्या भुवनमभितो भासते यस्य भासा<BR>Bv. 4. 18.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1000-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विष्वद्र्यंच्|विष्वद्र्यञ्च्
विष्वद्र्य(द्र्यं)च् a. (विष्वद्रीची f.)<BR>Going everywhere, all-pervading;<BR>विष्वद्रीचीर्विक्षिपन् सैन्यवीचीः Śi. 18. 25;<BR>विष्वद्रीच्या भुवनमभितो भासते यस्य भासा<BR>Bv. 4. 18.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1000-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विष्वणनं|विष्वणन
विष्वणनं, विष्वाणः Eating.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1000-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विष्वाणः|विष्वाण
विष्वणनं, विष्वाणः Eating.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1000-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विस्
विस् {vI.v} {c4c} P. (विस्यति) To cast,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1000-c" target="_blank">Page1000-c+ 54</a>]<BR>throw, send. {vII.v} {c1c} P. (वेसति) To<BR>go, move.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1000-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विस|विसं
विस See बिस.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1000-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विसंयुक्त
विसंयुक्त p. p. Disjoined,<BR>separated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1000-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विसंयोगः|विसंयोग
विसंयोगः Disjunction, separation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1000-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विसंवद्
विसंवद् {c1c} P.<BR>1 To be<BR>inconsistent, be at variance; कमलानां<BR>मनोहराणामपि रूपाद्विसंवदति शीलं Mu. 1. 19;<BR>शकटदासस्तु मित्रमिति विसंवदंत्यक्षराणि<BR>Mu. 5.<BR>--2 To break one's word or<BR>promise.<BR>--3 To disappoint, deceive.<BR>--4 To fail.<BR>--5 To assert falsely.<BR>--6<BR>To contradict. --Caus.<BR>1 To make<BR>inconsistent.<BR>--2 To disappoint, to<BR>cause to fail; रमणीयोऽवधिर्विधिना<BR>विसंवादितः Ś. 6.<BR>--3 To fail to prove.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1000-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विसंवादः|विसंवाद
विसंवादः<BR>1 Deception, breaking<BR>one's promise, disappointment.<BR>--2<BR>Inconsistency, incongruity,<BR>disagreement.<BR>--3 Contradiction.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1000-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विसंवादिन्
विसंवादिन् a.<BR>1 Disappointing,<BR>deceiving.<BR>--2 Inconsistent,<BR>contradictory<BR>--3 Differing, disagreeing;<BR>R. 15. 67.<BR>--4 Disputing, contesting.<BR>--5 False, untrue.<BR>--6 Fraudulent,<BR>crafty.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1000-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विसंष्ठुल
विसंष्ठुल a.<BR>1 Unsteady,<BR>agitated; Māl. 7.<BR>--2 Uneven.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1000-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विसंकट|विसङ्कट|विसंकटः|विसङ्कटः
विसंकट a. Frightful; dreadful,<BR>Māl. 5. 13; cf. विशंकट.<BR>--टः<BR>1 A<BR>lion.<BR>--2 The Iṅgudī tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1000-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विसंगत|विसङ्गत
विसंगत a. Ill-fitted,<BR>incongruous, unharmonious.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1000-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विसंज्ञ|विसञ्ज्ञ
विसंज्ञ a. Insensible,<BR>unconscious.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1000-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विसंधिः|विसन्धि
विसंधिः Bad or disagreeable<BR>Saṃdhi (euphony) or absence of<BR>Saṃdhi, regarded as a fault in<BR>composition; see K. P. 7. ad loc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1000-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विसल|विसलं
विसल See बिसल.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1000-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विसिनी
विसिनी See बिसिनी.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1000-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विसिल
विसिल See बिसिल.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1000-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विसूचिका
विसूचिका Cholera.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1000-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विसूरणं|विसूरण
विसूरणं --णा Distress, sorrow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1000-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विसूरणा
विसूरणं --णा Distress, sorrow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1000-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विसूरितं|विसूरित
विसूरितं Repentance, distress.<BR>--ता<BR>Fever.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1000-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विसृ
विसृ {c1c} P.<BR>1 To spread, be<BR>extended or diffused;<BR>चंक्रीवदंगरुहधूम्ररुचो विसस्रः Śi. 5. 8; 9. 19, 37;<BR>Ki. 10. 53.<BR>--2 To return. --Caus.<BR>1 To spread, stretch.<BR>--2 To cause<BR>to prevail or spread.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1000-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विसरः|विसर
विसरः<BR>1 Going forth.<BR>--2<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1001-a" target="_blank">Page1001-a+ 56</a>]<BR>Spreading, extending.<BR>--3 Crowd,<BR>multitude, herd, flock.<BR>--4 A large<BR>quantity, heap; Māl. 1. 37.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1000-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विसारः|विसार
विसारः<BR>1 Spreading out,<BR>expansion, diffusion.<BR>--2 Creeping,<BR>gliding.<BR>--3 A fish.<BR>--रं<BR>1 wood.<BR>--2<BR>Timber.<BR>--री The region of the winds.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1001-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विसारिन्
विसारिन् a. (णी f.)<BR>1 Spreading,<BR>diffusing.<BR>--2 Creeping, gliding.<BR>--m. A fish.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1001-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विसृत|विसृतं
विसृत p. p.<BR>1 Spread out,<BR>extended, diffused.<BR>--2 Extended,<BR>stretched.<BR>--3 Uttered, spoken.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1001-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विसृत्वर|विसृत्वरः
विसृत्वर a. (री f.)<BR>1 Spreading<BR>about, being diffused; विसृत्वरैरबुरुहां<BR>रजोभिः Śi. 3. 11.<BR>--2 Creeping,<BR>gliding.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1001-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विसृमर|विसृमरः
विसृमर a. Creeping along,<BR>gliding, moving gently;<BR>विसृमरथेषितहयः Ve. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1001-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विसृज्
विसृज् {c6c} P.<BR>1 To abandon,<BR>leave, give up; विसृज सुंदरि<BR>संगमसाध्वसं M. 4. 13; पूर्वार्धाविसृष्टतल्पः<BR>R. 16. 6; Bv. 1. 78.<BR>--2 To let go,<BR>let loose.<BR>--3 To shed, pour down;<BR>तद्विप्रयोगाश्रु समं विसृष्टं R. 13. 26.<BR>--4<BR>To send, despatch; भोजेन दूतो रघवे<BR>विसृष्टः R. 5. 39.<BR>--5 To dismiss,<BR>allow to go, send away; प्रतिगृह्य वचो<BR>विससर्ज मुनिं R. 8. 91; 14. 19.<BR>--6<BR>To give; R. 13. 67; 18. 7.<BR>--7 To<BR>send or cast forth, emit, dart;<BR>विसृजति हिमगर्मैरग्निमिंदुमर्यूखैः Ś. 3. 2.<BR>--8<BR>To drop, let fall, strike; विसृज<BR>शूद्रमुनौ कृपाणं U. 2. 10.<BR>--9 To utter;<BR>Śi. 15. 62.<BR>--10 To cast off, repudiate.<BR>--11 To create, produce.<BR>--12 To<BR>deliver, hand over to. --Caus.<BR>1 To<BR>emit, pour forth, shed.<BR>--2 To send<BR>away, dismiss.<BR>--3 To spare.<BR>--4 To<BR>cast off, repel, repudiate.<BR>--5 To lose.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1001-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विसर्गः|विसर्ग
विसर्गः<BR>1 Sending forth, emission.<BR>--2 Shedding, pouring down,<BR>dropping; R. 16. 38.<BR>--3 Casting,<BR>discharge.<BR>--4 Giving away, a gift,<BR>donation; आदानं हि विसर्गाय सतां<BR>वारिमुचामिव R. 4. 86 (where the<BR>word means ‘pouring down’ also).<BR>--5 Sending away, dismissal.<BR>--6 Creation, creating.<BR>--7<BR>Ahandonment, relinquishment.<BR>--8<BR>Voiding, evacuation; as in पुरीषविसग<BR>--9 Departure, separation.<BR>--10 Final<BR>beatitude.<BR>--11 Light, splendour.<BR>--12 A symbol in writing,<BR>representing a distinct hard aspiration and<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1001-b" target="_blank">Page1001-b+ 56</a>]<BR>marked by two perpendicular dots<BR>(H).<BR>--13 The southern course of the<BR>sun.<BR>--14 The penis.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1001-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विसर्जनं|विसर्जन|विसर्ज्जनं
विसर्जनं<BR>1 Emitting, sending forth,<BR>pouring down; समतया<BR>वसुवृष्टिविसर्जनैः R. 9. 6.<BR>--2 Giving away, a gift,<BR>donation; R. 9. 6.<BR>--3 Voiding;<BR>Ms. 4. 48.<BR>--4 Casting off, quitting,<BR>abandoning; श्रुतदेहविसर्जनः पितुः<BR>R. 8. 25.<BR>--5 Sending away, dismissal.<BR>--6 Allowing (the deity invoked)<BR>to go (opp. आवाहन).<BR>--7 Setting a<BR>bull at liberty on certain occasions.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1001-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विसर्जनीय|विसर्जनीयः|विसर्ज्जनीय
विसर्जनीय a. To be abandoned<BR>&c.<BR>--यः = विसर्ग (12) q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1001-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विसर्जित|विसर्ज्जित
विसर्जित p. p.<BR>1 Emitted, sent<BR>forth.<BR>--2 Given away.<BR>--3 Left,<BR>quitted, abandoned.<BR>--4 Sent,<BR>despatched.<BR>--5 Dismissed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1001-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विसृष्ट|विसृष्टः
विसृष्ट p. p.<BR>1 Emitted, sent forth.<BR>--2 Created, emanated.<BR>--3 Shed,<BR>cast.<BR>--4 Sent, despatched;<BR>R. 5. 39.<BR>--5 Dismissed, let go,<BR>discharged; R. 2. 9.<BR>--6 Discharged,<BR>hurled.<BR>--7 Given, bestowed,<BR>granted; ग्रामेष्वात्मविसृष्टेषु R. 1. 44.<BR>--8 Abandoned, quitted, removed.<BR>--9 Cast out, expelled.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1001-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विसृष्टिः|विसृष्टि
विसृष्टिः f.<BR>1 Emitting, sending<BR>forth.<BR>--2 Abandoning.<BR>--3 Giving.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1001-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विसृप्
विसृप् {c1c} P.<BR>1 To move, march,<BR>proceed; यः सुबाहुरिति राक्षसोऽपरस्तत्र<BR>तत्र विससर्प मायया R. 11. 29; 4. 53.<BR>--2 To fly or roam about.<BR>--3 To<BR>spread; मनोरागस्तीव्रं विषमिव<BR>विसर्पत्यविरतं Māl. 2. 1.<BR>--4 To flow along,<BR>fall down; (बाष्पौघः) विसर्पन्<BR>धाराभिर्लुठति धरणीं जर्जरकणः U. 1. 29.<BR>--5<BR>To escape, run away.<BR>--6 To hover<BR>about.<BR>--7 To wind, meander.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1001-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विसर्पः|विसर्प
विसर्पः<BR>1 Creeping about, gliding.<BR>--2 Moving to and fro.<BR>--3 Spread,<BR>circulation; U. 1. 36.<BR>--4 An<BR>unexpected or unwished-for<BR>consequence of an act.<BR>--5 A sort of<BR>disease, dry spreading itch.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--घ्नं wax.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1001-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विसर्पणं|विसर्पण
विसर्पणं<BR>1 Creeping along,<BR>gliding, going gently.<BR>--2 Diffusion,<BR>spreading, extending.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1001-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विसर्पिः|विसर्पि
विसर्पिः, विसर्पिका See विसर्प (5)<BR>above.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1001-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विसर्पिका
विसर्पिः, विसर्पिका See विसर्प (5)<BR>above.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1001-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विस्तृ
विस्तृ {c5c} U., विस्तॄ {c9c} U.<BR>1 To<BR>spread, diffuse.<BR>--2 To cover, fill.<BR>--3<BR>To extend, expand.<BR>--4 To strew<BR>or scatter about. --Caus.<BR>1 To<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1001-c" target="_blank">Page1001-c+ 57</a>]<BR>cause to spread or expand; as in<BR>पयोधरविस्तारयितृकं यौवनं Ś. 1.<BR>--2 To<BR>increase; R. 7. 39.<BR>--3 To stretch,<BR>extend.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1001-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विस्तरः|विस्तर
विस्तरः<BR>1 Extension, expansion.<BR>--2 Minute details, detailed<BR>description, minute particulars;<BR>संक्षिप्तस्याप्यतोऽस्यैव वाक्यस्यार्थगरीयसः ।<BR>सुविस्तरतरा वाचो भाष्यभूता भवंतु मे<BR>Śi. 4. 24; (विस्तरणे, विस्तरतः, विस्तरशः ‘in<BR>detail, at length, fully, with minute<BR>details, with full particulars’;<BR>अंगुलिमुद्रधिगमं विस्तरेण श्रोतुमिच्छामि<BR>Mu. 1; Bg. 10. 18).<BR>--3 Prolixity,<BR>diffuseness; अलं विस्तरेण.<BR>--4<BR>Abundance, quantity, multitude,<BR>number.<BR>--5 A bed, layer.<BR>--6 A seat,<BR>stool.<BR>--7 Affectionate solicitation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1001-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विस्तारः|विस्तार
विस्तारः<BR>1 Spreading, extension,<BR>expansion; प्रांतविस्तारभाजां<BR>Māl. 1. 27.<BR>--2 Amplitude, breadth;<BR>विलोकयंत्यो वपुरापुरक्ष्णां<BR>प्रकामविस्तारफलं हरिण्यः R. 2. 11;<BR>Bg. 13. 30.<BR>--3 Expanse, vastness,<BR>magnitude; मध्यः श्यामः स्तन इव भुवः<BR>शेषविस्तारपांडुः Me. 18.<BR>--4 Details, full<BR>particulars; कण्वोऽपि तावच्छ्रुतविस्तारः<BR>क्रियतां Ś. 7.<BR>--5 The diameter of a<BR>circle.<BR>--6 A shrub.<BR>--7 The branch of<BR>a tre with new shoots.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1001-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विस्तीर्ण|विस्तीर्णः
विस्तीर्ण p. p.<BR>1 Spread out,<BR>expanded, extended.<BR>--2 Wide, broad.<BR>--3 Large, great, extensive.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--पर्णं a kind of root (मानक).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1001-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विस्तृत|विस्तृतः
विस्तृत p. p.<BR>1 Diffused, spread,<BR>extended.<BR>--2 Broad, expanded.<BR>--3<BR>Ample.<BR>--4 Diffuse, prolix.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1001-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विस्तृतिः|विस्तृति
विस्तृतिः f.<BR>1 Extension, expansion,<BR>--2 Breadth, width, magnitude.<BR>--3<BR>The diameter of a circle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1001-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विस्था
विस्था {c1c} A.<BR>1 To stand apart.<BR>--2 To remain, stay, dwell, remain<BR>fixed or stationary; पदैर्भुवं व्याप्य<BR>वितिष्ठमानं Śi. 4. 4.<BR>--3 To spread, be<BR>diffused.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1001-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विस्पष्ट|विस्पष्टः
विस्पष्ट a.<BR>1 Plain, clear,<BR>intelligible.<BR>--2 Manifest, evident, obvious,<BR>open, apparent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1001-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विस्फुर्
विस्फुर् {c6c} P.<BR>1 To quiver,<BR>palpitate, tremble.<BR>--2 To move about,<BR>struggle.<BR>--3 To shine, gleam; किं नाम<BR>विस्फुरति शस्त्राणि U. 4.<BR>--4 To draw or<BR>twang (as a bow, used in caus. in<BR>the same sense); एकोऽपि<BR>विस्फुरितमंडलचापचक्रं कः सिंधुराजमभिषेणयितुं<BR>समर्थः Ve. 2. 25.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1001-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विस्फारः|विस्फार
विस्फारः<BR>1 Vibration, trembling.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1002-a" target="_blank">Page1002-a+ 56</a>]<BR>throbbing.<BR>--2 The twang of a bow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1001-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विस्फारित|विस्फारितः
विस्फारित p. p.<BR>1 Made to vibrate.<BR>--2 Trembling, tremulous.<BR>--3<BR>Twanged; विकृष्टविस्फारितचापमंडलः<BR>Ki. 14. 31.<BR>--4 Dilated, expanded.<BR>--5<BR>Manifested, displayed.<BR>--6 Evident,<BR>apparent, manifest.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1002-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विस्फुरित|विस्फुरितः
विस्फुरित p. p.<BR>1 Tremulous,<BR>quivering.<BR>--2 Swollen, enlarged^1.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by Dr. Sampada Savardekar and Jim Funderburk on 20210104. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-corrections/issues/20.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1002-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विस्फुर्ज्
विस्फुर्ज् {c1c} P.<BR>1 To roar, thunder.<BR>--2 To resound.<BR>--3 To increase.<BR>--4<BR>To shine, appear; अस्त्येवं जडधामता<BR>तु भवतो यद् व्योम्नि विस्फूर्जसे<BR>K. P. 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1002-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विस्फूर्जथुः|विस्फूर्जथु
विस्फूर्जथुः<BR>1 Roaring, thundering,<BR>rumbling.<BR>--2 A clap or peal of<BR>thunder.<BR>--3 (Hence) A thunderlike<BR>manifestation or rise, any sudden<BR>appearance or stroke; ममैव<BR>जन्मांतरपातकानां विपाकविस्फूर्जथुरप्रसह्यः<BR>R. 14. 62.<BR>--4 Rolling (as of waves);<BR>swell, surging appearance;<BR>महोर्मिविस्फूर्जथुनिर्विशेषाः R. 13. 12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1002-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विस्फूर्जितं|विस्फूर्जित
विस्फूर्जितं<BR>1 Roar, shout.<BR>--2<BR>Rolling.<BR>--3 Fruit, result; तत्सर्वं<BR>सुरलोकदेवसदृशं धर्मस्य विस्फूर्जितं Bh. 2. 125,<BR>3. 143.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1002-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विस्फुलिंगः|विस्फुलिङ्ग|विस्फुलिंग|विस्फुलिङ्गः
विस्फुलिंगः<BR>1 A spark of fire;<BR>अग्नेर्ज्वलतो विस्फुलिंगा विप्रतिष्ठेरन् Ś. B.<BR>--2 A kind of poison.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1002-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विस्फोटः|विस्फोट
विस्फोटः --टा<BR>1 A boil, pimple,<BR>tumour.<BR>--2 Small-pox.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1002-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विस्फोटा
विस्फोटः --टा<BR>1 A boil, pimple,<BR>tumour.<BR>--2 Small-pox.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1002-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विस्मि
विस्मि {c1c} A.<BR>1 To wonder or be<BR>surprised at; उभयोर्न तथा लोकः<BR>प्रावीण्येन विसिष्मिये R. 15. 68; उद्वीक्ष्य को<BR>भुवि न विस्मयते नगेशं Śi. 4. 19,<BR>Bk. 5. 51.<BR>--2 To admire.<BR>--3 To be<BR>proud or conceited; न विस्मयेत तपसा<BR>Ms. 4. 236. --Caus. To cause to<BR>smile, cause to be surprised, fill<BR>with wonder or astonishment;<BR>विस्मापयन् विस्मितमात्मवृत्तौ R. 2. 33;<BR>Bk. 5. 58; 8. 42.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1002-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विस्मयः|विस्मय
विस्मयः<BR>1 Wonder, surprise,<BR>astonishment, amazement; पुरुषः<BR>प्रबभूवाग्नेर्विस्मयेन सहर्त्विजां R. 10. 50.<BR>--2<BR>Astonishment or wonder, being the<BR>feeling which produces the<BR>adbhuta sentiment; S. D. thus defines<BR>it: --विविधेषु पदार्थेषु लोकसीमातिवतिंषु ।<BR>विस्फारश्चेतसो यस्तु स विस्मय उदाहृतः ॥ 207.<BR>--3 Pride, arrogance; तपः क्षरति<BR>विस्मयात् Ms. 4. 237.<BR>--4 Uncertainty,<BR>doubt.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--आकुल, --आविष्ट a.<BR>astonished, struck with wonder.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1002-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विस्मयंगम
विस्मयंगम a. Astonishing,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1002-b" target="_blank">Page1002-b+ 56</a>]<BR>producing wonder.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1002-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विस्मापन|विस्मापनः
विस्मापन a. (नी f.) Astonishing.<BR>--नः<BR>1 The god of love.<BR>--2 Trick,<BR>deceit, illusion.<BR>--नं<BR>1 Causing<BR>wonder.<BR>--2 Anything causing<BR>wonder.<BR>--3 A city of the Gandharvas<BR>(said to be m. also).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1002-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विस्मित|विस्मितः
विस्मित p. p.<BR>1 Astonished,<BR>surprised, amazed, wonder-struck.<BR>--2<BR>Disconcerted.<BR>--3 Proud.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1002-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विस्मितिः|विस्मिति
विस्मितिः f. Astonishment, wonder,<BR>surprise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1002-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विस्मेर
विस्मेर a. Surprised, struck with<BR>wonder, astonished.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1002-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विस्मृ
विस्मृ {c1c} P. To forget; मधुकर<BR>विस्मृतोस्येनां कथं Ś. 5. 1; यदा तु<BR>अन्यसंगात्पूर्ववृत्तं विस्मृतो भवान् Ś. 6.<BR>--Caus. To cause to forget.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1002-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विस्मरणं|विस्मरण
विस्मरणं Forgetting, forgetfulness,<BR>oblivion; Ś. 5. 23.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1002-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विस्मृत|विस्मृतः
विस्मृत p. p. Forgotten.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1002-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विस्मृतिः|विस्मृति
विस्मृतिः f. Forgetfulness,<BR>oblivion, loss of memory.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1002-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विस्रं|विस्र
विस्रं A smell like that of<BR>raw meat.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--गंधिः yellow<BR>orpiment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1002-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विस्रंस्
विस्रंस् {c1c} A.<BR>1 To slip down,<BR>become loosened.<BR>--2 To fall down,<BR>drop, slip. --Caus.<BR>1 To cause to<BR>fall down, let fall; विस्रंसयंती<BR>नवकर्णिकारं Ku. 3. 62.<BR>--2 To loosen,<BR>relax, slacken.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1002-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विस्रंसः|विस्रंस
विस्रंसः --सा<BR>1 Falling down.<BR>--2<BR>Decay, laxness, weakness, debility.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1002-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विस्रंसा
विस्रंसः --सा<BR>1 Falling down.<BR>--2<BR>Decay, laxness, weakness, debility.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1002-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विस्रंसन
विस्रंसन a.<BR>1 Causing to fall or<BR>drop drown;<BR>अंतर्मोहनमौलिघूर्णनचलन्मंदारवि स्रंसनः Gīt. 3.<BR>--2 Untying,<BR>loosening; नीविविस्रंसनः करः<BR>K. P. 7.<BR>--नं<BR>1 Falling down.<BR>--2 Flowing,<BR>dropping.<BR>--3 Untying, loosening.<BR>--4 A laxative, purgative.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1002-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विस्रस्त
विस्रस्त p. p.<BR>1 Loosened.<BR>--2 Weak,<BR>infirm.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1002-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विस्रसा
विस्रसा Decay, debility,<BR>decrepitnde.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1002-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विस्रब्ध|विस्रब्धः
विस्रब्ध, विस्रंभ See विश्रब्ध, विश्रंभ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1002-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विस्रंभ|विस्रम्भ|विस्रम्भः
विस्रब्ध, विस्रंभ See विश्रब्ध, विश्रंभ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1002-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विस्रु
विस्रु {c1c} P. To flow forth, trickle,<BR>ooze.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1002-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विस्रवः|विस्रव
विस्रवः, विस्रावः Flowing, dropping,<BR>trickling.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1002-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विस्रावः|विस्राव
विस्रवः, विस्रावः Flowing, dropping,<BR>trickling.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1002-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विस्रावणं|विस्रावण
विस्रावणं<BR>1 Bleeding.<BR>--2 Distilling.<BR>--3 A kind of spirit distilled from<BR>molasses.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1002-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विस्रुतिः|विस्रुति
विस्रुतिः f. Flowing forth, trickling,<BR>oozing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1002-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विस्वर|विस्वरः
विस्वर a. Discordant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1002-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विहगः|विहग
विहगः [विहायसा गच्छति गम्-ड नि˚]<BR>1 A bird; Me. 28; Rs. 1. 28.<BR>--2 A<BR>cloud.<BR>--3 An arrow.<BR>--4 The sun.<BR>--5<BR>The moon.<BR>--6 A planet in general.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1002-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विहंगः|विहङ्ग|विहंग|विहङ्गः
विहंगः<BR>1 A bird; R. 1. 51;<BR>Ms. 9. 55.<BR>--2 A cloud.<BR>--3 An arrow.<BR>--4<BR>The sun.<BR>--5 The moon.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--इंद्रः, --ईश्वरः, --राजः epithets of<BR>Garuḍa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1002-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विहंगमः|विहङ्गम|विहंगम|विहङ्गमः
विहंगमः<BR>1 A bird; (गृहदीर्घिकाः)<BR>मदकलोदकलोलविहंगमाः R. 9. 37;<BR>Ms. 1. 39, H. 1. 37.<BR>--2 The sun.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1002-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विहंगमा
विहंगमा, विहंगिका A pole for<BR>carrying burdens.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1002-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विहंगिका|विहङ्गिका
विहंगमा, विहंगिका A pole for<BR>carrying burdens.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1002-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विहन्
विहन् {c2c} P.<BR>1 To kill, slay,<BR>destroy, destroy completely,<BR>annihilate; (अलं) सहसा संहतिमंहसां विहंतुं<BR>Ki. 5. 17, 14. 23.<BR>--2 To strike,<BR>beat violently.<BR>--3 To obstruct,<BR>impede, oppose, resist; विघ्नांति रक्षांसि<BR>वने क्रतूंश्च Bk. 1. 19; Śi. 14. 8,<BR>R. 5. 27.<BR>--4 To reject, refuse, decline;<BR>तद्भूतनाथानुग नार्हसि त्वं संबंधिनो मे<BR>प्रणयं विहंतुं R. 2. 58; न व्यहन्यत<BR>कदाचिदर्थिता 11. 2.<BR>--5 To disappoint, foil,<BR>frustrate.<BR>--6 To separate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1002-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विहत|विहतः
विहत p. p.<BR>1 Struck completely,<BR>killed.<BR>--2 Hurt.<BR>--3 Opposed,<BR>impeded, resisted.<BR>--तः A Jaina temple.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1002-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विहतिः|विहति
विहतिः A friend, companion. --f.<BR>1 Killing, striking.<BR>--2 Failure.<BR>--3<BR>Defeat, rout.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1002-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विहननं|विहनन
विहननं<BR>1 Killing, striking.<BR>--2<BR>Hurt, injury.<BR>--3 Obstruction,<BR>obstacle, impediment.<BR>--4 A bow for<BR>cleaning cotton.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1002-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विहर्षः|विहर्ष
विहर्षः Great joy, rapture.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1002-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विहस्
विहस् {c1c} P.<BR>1 To smile, laugh<BR>gently; किंचिद्विहस्यार्थपतिं बभाषे<BR>R. 2. 46.<BR>--2 To laugh at, deride,<BR>ridicule; किमिति विषीदसि रोदीषि विकला<BR>विहसति युवतिसभा तव विकला Gīt. 9;<BR>गौरीवक्त्रभ्रुकुटिरचनां या विहस्येव फेनैः<BR>Me. 50.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1002-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विहसनं|विहसन
विहसनं, विहसितं, विहासः A gentle<BR>laugh, smile.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1002-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विहसितं|विहसित
विहसनं, विहसितं, विहासः A gentle<BR>laugh, smile.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1002-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विहासः|विहास
विहसनं, विहसितं, विहासः A gentle<BR>laugh, smile.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1002-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विहस्त|विहस्तः
विहस्त a.<BR>1 Handless.<BR>--2<BR>Confounded, bewildered<BR>overpowered, made powerless;<BR>मालतीमुखावलोकनविहस्ततया Māl. 1,<BR>R. 5. 49.<BR>--3 Disabled, incapacitated<BR>(for doing the proper work);<BR>रुजाविहस्तचरणं M. 4.<BR>--4 Learned,<BR>wise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1002-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विहा
विहा ind. Heaven, paradise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1002-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विहा
विहा {c2c} P. To leave, abandon,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1003-a" target="_blank">Page1003-a+ 57</a>]<BR>forsake, give up; विहाय<BR>लक्ष्मीपतिलक्ष्म कार्मुकं जटाधरः सन् जुहुधीह पावकं<BR>Ki. 1. 44; Me. 41; R. 2. 40; 5.<BR>67, 73; 6. 7; 12. 102; 14. 48, 69;<BR>Ku. 3. 1. --Caus.<BR>1 To give away.<BR>--2 To abandon, give up.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1002-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विहापित|विहापितं
विहापित p. p.<BR>1 Caused to<BR>abandon.<BR>--2 Extorted, caused to be<BR>given up.<BR>--तं A gift, donation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1003-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विहीन|विहीनः
विहीन p. p.<BR>1 Left,<BR>abandoned, forsaken.<BR>--2 Devoid of,<BR>destitute or deprived of, without<BR>(usually in comp.); विद्याविहीनः<BR>पशुः Bh. 2. 20.<BR>--3 Base, low,<BR>inferior.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--जाति, --योनि a.<BR>base-born, low-born.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1003-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विहायस्
विहायस् m., n. Sky, atmosphere;<BR>Ki. 16. 43. --m. A bird; N. 3. 99.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1003-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विहायस|विहायसं|विहायसः
विहायस See विहायस्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1003-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विहित|विहितः
विहित p. p.<BR>1 Done,<BR>performed, made, acted.<BR>--2 Arranged,<BR>fixed, settled, appointed,<BR>determined.<BR>--3 Ordered, prescribed,<BR>decreed; Pt. 1. 201.<BR>--4 Framed,<BR>constructed.<BR>--5 Placed, deposited<BR>--6 Furnished with, possessed of.<BR>--7 Fit to be done.<BR>--8 Distributed,<BR>apportioned. (See धा with वि).<BR>--तं An order, a command, decree;<BR>परतो दवैविहितायत्तं Pt. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1003-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विहितिः|विहिति
विहितिः f.<BR>1 Performance, doing,<BR>action.<BR>--2 Arrangement.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1003-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विहृ
विहृ {c1c} P.<BR>1 To take away, seize<BR>away.<BR>--2 To remove, destroy.<BR>--3 To<BR>let fall, shed (as tears); as in<BR>बाष्पं विहरति.<BR>--4 To pass (as time).<BR>--5 To amuse, or divert oneself.<BR>sport, play; विहरति हरिरिह सरसवसंते<BR>Gīt. 1; गंधमादनवनं विहर्तुं गता V. 4;<BR>U. 3. 6.<BR>--6 To go in various<BR>directions.<BR>--7 To live.<BR>--8 To change,<BR>alternate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1003-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विहरः|विहर
विहरः<BR>1 Taking away, removing.<BR>--2 Separation, disunion.<BR>--3<BR>Changing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1003-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विहरणं|विहरण
विहरणं<BR>1 Removing, taking away.<BR>--2 Taking a walk, airing, going<BR>about or rambling for pleasure.<BR>--3<BR>Pleasure, pastime.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1003-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विहर्तृ|विहर्त्तृ
विहर्तृ m.<BR>1 A roamer.<BR>--2 A<BR>robber.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1003-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विहारः|विहार
विहारः<BR>1 Removing, taking away.<BR>--2 Roaming or walking for pleasure,<BR>airing, a stroll, taking a walk.<BR>--3 Sport, play, pastime, recreation,<BR>diversion, pleasure; विहारशैलानुगतेव<BR>नागैः R. 16. 26, 67; 5. 41; 9. 68,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1003-b" target="_blank">Page1003-b+ 57</a>]<BR>13. 38, 19. 37.<BR>--4 Tread,<BR>stepping, movement (of hands, feet<BR>&c.); विकर्षणैः पाणिविहारहारिमिः<BR>Ki. 4. 15; दरमंथरचरणविहारं Gīt. 11.<BR>--5 A park, garden; especially a<BR>pleasure-garden.<BR>--6 The shoulder.<BR>--7 A jaina or Buddhist temple,<BR>convent, monastery.<BR>--8 A temple<BR>in general.<BR>--9 Great expansion of<BR>the organs of speech.<BR>--10 Opening,<BR>expansion.<BR>--11 The palace or<BR>banner of Indra.<BR>--12 A palace in<BR>general.<BR>--13 A kind of bird.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--गृहं a pleasure-house.<BR>--दासी a<BR>nun.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1003-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विहारिका
विहारिका A convent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1003-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विहारिन्
विहारिन् a. Diverting or<BR>amusing oneself by; मृगयाविहारिणः Ś.<BR>1 Pt. 2. 20.<BR>--2 Expanding.<BR>--3<BR>Beautiful, lovely.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1003-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विहृत|विहृतं
विहृत p. p.<BR>1 Sported, played.<BR>--2<BR>Expanded.<BR>--तं<BR>1 One of the ten<BR>modes of indicating love used by<BR>women; see S. D. 125, 146;<BR>(written विकृत also in this sense).<BR>--2<BR>Sport, play.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1003-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विहृतिः|विहृति
विहृतिः f.<BR>1 Removal, taking<BR>away.<BR>--2 Sport, pastime, pleasure.<BR>--3 Expansion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1003-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विहेठः|विहेठ
विहेठः<BR>1 Hurt, injury.<BR>--2<BR>Afflicting, harassing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1003-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विहेठकः|विहेठक
विहेठकः<BR>1 An injurer.<BR>--2 A<BR>reviler, calumniator.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1003-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विहेठनं|विहेठन
विहेठनं<BR>1 Injuring, hurting.<BR>--2<BR>Rubbing, grinding.<BR>--3 Afflicting.<BR>--4 Pain, sorrow, torment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1003-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विह्वल्
विह्वल् {c1c} P. To stagger, tremble,<BR>shake about; अंतर्भिन्नं भ्रमति हृदयं<BR>विह्वलत्यंगमंगं Māl. 5. 20.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1003-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विह्वल|विह्वलः
विह्वल a.<BR>1 Agitated, disquieted,<BR>perturbed, confused; R. 8. 37.<BR>--2<BR>Overcome with fear, alarmed.<BR>--3<BR>Delirious, beside oneself.<BR>--4<BR>Afflicted, distressed; Bh. 3. 59;<BR>Ku. 4. 4.<BR>--5 Desponding.<BR>--6 Fused, liquid.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1003-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वी
वी {vI.v} {c2c} P. (वेति, rarely used in<BR>classical literature)<BR>1 To go, move.<BR>--2 To approach.<BR>--3 To pervade.<BR>--4<BR>To bring, convey.<BR>--5 To throw,<BR>cast.<BR>--6 To eat, consume.<BR>--7 To<BR>obtain.<BR>--8 To conceive, bring forth.<BR>--9 To be born or produced.<BR>--10<BR>To shine, be beautiful.<BR>--11 To<BR>desire, wish.<BR>--12 To shine. {vII.v} (वि +<BR>इ) {c2c} P.<BR>1 To go away, depart;<BR>तस्यामहं त्वयि च सप्रांति वीतचिंतः<BR>Ś. 4. 12; so वीतभय, वीतक्रोध.<BR>--2 To<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1003-c" target="_blank">Page1003-c+ 68</a>]<BR>undergo a change; सदृशं त्रिषु लिंगेषु<BR>यन्न व्योति तदव्ययं Sk.<BR>--3 To spend.<BR>--4 To be diffused, to spread.<BR>--5 To<BR>vanish, disappear.<BR>--6 To cross over,<BR>traverse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1003-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वीकः|वीक
वीकः<BR>1 Wind.<BR>--2 A bird.<BR>--3<BR>The mind.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1003-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वीकाश|वीकाशः
वीकाश See वीकाश.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1003-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वीक्ष्
वीक्ष् {c1c} A.<BR>1 To see, behold; तं<BR>वीक्ष्य वेपथुमती Ku. 5. 85; सुभगं तथैव<BR>खलु सापि वीक्षते V. 4. 3.<BR>--2 To<BR>regard or consider as.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1003-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वीक्षं|वीक्ष|वीक्षः
वीक्षं<BR>1 A visible object.<BR>--2<BR>Surprise, astonishment.<BR>--क्षः -क्षा<BR>Seeing, gazing at.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1003-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वीक्षणं|वीक्षण
वीक्षणं --णा Seeing, looking at,<BR>sight.<BR>--णं An eye.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1003-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वीक्षणा
वीक्षणं --णा Seeing, looking at,<BR>sight.<BR>--णं An eye.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1003-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वीक्षितं|वीक्षित|वीक्षितः
वीक्षितं A look, glance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1003-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वीक्ष्य|वीक्ष्यं|वीक्ष्यः
वीक्ष्य a.<BR>1 To be looked at.<BR>--2<BR>Visible, perceptible.<BR>--क्ष्यः<BR>1 A<BR>dancer, an actor.<BR>--2 A horse.<BR>--क्ष्यं<BR>1 Anything to be looked at, a<BR>visible object.<BR>--2 Wonder, surprise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1003-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वींखा|वीङ्खा
वींखा<BR>1 Going, moving,<BR>progress.<BR>--2 One of the paces of a<BR>horse.<BR>--3 Dancing.<BR>--4 Junction,<BR>union.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1003-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वीचिः|वीचि
वीचिः m. f., वीची [Uṇ. 4. 72]<BR>1<BR>A wave; समुद्रवीचीव चलस्वभावाः<BR>Pt. 1. 194; U. 3. 2; R. 6. 56. 12. 100,<BR>Me. 28.<BR>--2 Inconstancy,<BR>thoughtlessness.<BR>--3 Pleasure, delight.<BR>--4<BR>Rest, leisure.<BR>--5 A ray of light.<BR>--6<BR>Little.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--मालिन् m. the<BR>ocean.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1003-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वीज्
वीज् {vI.v} {c1c} A. (वीजते) To go. {vII.v}<BR>{c10c} U. (वीजयति-ते) To fan, cool by<BR>fanning; खं वीज्यते मणिमयैरिव<BR>तालवंतैः Mk. 5. 13; Ku. 2. 42. --WITH<BR>पभि, उप, परि to fan; Rs. 3. 4;<BR>Ś. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1003-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वीजनः|वीजन|वीजनं
वीजनः<BR>1 The ruddy goose.<BR>--2 A<BR>sort of pheasant.<BR>--नं<BR>1 Fanning;<BR>Ku. 4. 36.<BR>--2 A fan.<BR>--3 A thing,<BR>substance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1003-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वीज|वीजं
वीज See बीज, बीजक,<BR>बीजल, बीजिक, बीजिन्,<BR>and बीज्य.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1003-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वीजक|वीजकः
