वैजयंतिका
वैजयंतिका<BR>1 A banner, flag (fig.<BR>also); संचारिणीव देवस्य<BR>मकरकेतोर्जगद्विजयवैजयंतिका काप्यागतवती<BR>Māl. 1.<BR>--2 A kind of necklace of pearls.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1013-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैजयंती
वैजयंती<BR>1 A banner, flag;<BR>स्तनपरिणाहविलासवैजयंती Māl. 3. 15.<BR>--2<BR>An ensign.<BR>--3 A garland, necklace.<BR>--4 The necklace of Viṣṇu.<BR>--5 N.<BR>of a lexicon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1013-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैजात्यं|वैजात्य
वैजात्यं [विजात-ष्यञ्]<BR>1 Difference<BR>of kind or species.<BR>--2 Difference<BR>of caste.<BR>--3 Strangeness.<BR>--4<BR>Exclusion from caste.<BR>--5 Looseness,<BR>wantonness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1013-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

