वैतरणी
वैतरणिः --णी f.<BR>1 N. of the river<BR>of hell.<BR>--2 N. of a river in the<BR>country of the Kaliṅgas.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1013-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैतस|वैतसः
वैतस a. (सी f.)<BR>1 Pertaining<BR>to a cane.<BR>--2 Reed-like, i. e.<BR>yielding to a superior foe, bowing down<BR>to a stronger enemy; आत्मा संरक्षितः<BR>सुह्नैर्वृत्तिमाश्रित्य वैतसीं R. 4. 35;<BR>Pt. 3. 19.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1013-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैतान
