वैतालिकः|वैतालिक
वैतालिकः [विविधस्तालस्तेन<BR>व्यवहरति ठक्]<BR>1 A bard, minstrel.<BR>--2 A<BR>magician, conjurer; especially, one<BR>who is a votary of Vetāla q. v.<BR>--3<BR>The servant of a Vetāla.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1013-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैत्रक|वैत्रकः
वैत्रक a. (की f.), वैत्रकीय a.<BR>Cany, reedy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1013-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैदः|वैद
वैदः A wise man, learned man.<BR>--दी The wife of a wise man.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1013-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैदग्धं|वैदग्ध
