वैदग्धी
वैदग्धं, वैदग्धी, वैदग्ध्यं<BR>1 Skill,<BR>dexterity, proficiency, cleverness;<BR>अहो वैदग्ध्यं Māl. 1;<BR>प्रबंधविन्यासवैदग्ध्यनिधिः Vās.; Śi. 4. 16.<BR>--2<BR>Skill in arrangement, beauty;<BR>वैदग्ध्यं जहति कपोलकुंकुमानि Māl. 1. 37.<BR>--3 Shrewdness, smartness,<BR>cunningness; Ratn. 2.<BR>--4 Wit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1013-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैदग्ध्यं|वैदग्ध्य
वैदग्धं, वैदग्धी, वैदग्ध्यं<BR>1 Skill,<BR>dexterity, proficiency, cleverness;<BR>अहो वैदग्ध्यं Māl. 1;<BR>प्रबंधविन्यासवैदग्ध्यनिधिः Vās.; Śi. 4. 16.<BR>--2<BR>Skill in arrangement, beauty;<BR>वैदग्ध्यं जहति कपोलकुंकुमानि Māl. 1. 37.<BR>--3 Shrewdness, smartness,<BR>cunningness; Ratn. 2.<BR>--4 Wit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1013-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैदर्भः|वैदर्भ|वैदर्भं
वैदर्भः [विदर्भ-अण्]<BR>1 A king of<BR>Vidarbha.<BR>--2 A gum-boil.<BR>--र्भं Crafty<BR>speech.<BR>--र्भीं<BR>1 N. of Dams yantī.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1013-c" target="_blank">Page1013-c+ 56</a>]<BR>--2 Of Rukmiṇī.<BR>--3 A particular<BR>style of composition; thus defined<BR>in S. D.: --माधुर्यव्यंजकैर्वर्णै रचना<BR>ललितात्मिका । अवृत्तिरल्पवृत्तिर्वा वैदर्भी<BR>रीतिरिष्यते ॥ 626. Daṇḍin very minutely<BR>distinguishes this style from the<BR>Gauḍīya; see Kāv. 1. 41-53.<BR>--4<BR>N. of the wife of Agastya.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1013-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैदल|वैदलं|वैदलः
वैदल (ली f.) [विदलस्य विकारः<BR>अण्] Made of wicker or cane.<BR>--लः<BR>1<BR>A kind of cake.<BR>--2 Any<BR>leguminous vegetable or grain.<BR>--लं<BR>1 A<BR>shallow cup of a religious mendicant.<BR>--2 Any seat or vessel of<BR>wickerwork.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1013-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैदिक|वैदिकः
वैदिक a. (की f.) [वेदं-वे त्त्यधीते<BR>वा ठञ् वेदेषु विहितः ठक् वा]<BR>1 Derived<BR>from or conformable to the Vedas,<BR>Vedic.<BR>--2 Sacred, scriptural, holy;<BR>Ku. 5. 73.<BR>--कः A Brāhmaṇa<BR>wellversed in the Vedas.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--पाशः a smatterer in Veda, one<BR>possessing an imperfect knowledge of<BR>the Vedas.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1013-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

