वैदूर्य|वैदूर्य्य|वैदूर्य्यं
वैदूर्य a. (री or र्यी f.) Brought<BR>from, or produced in, Vidūra.<BR>--र्यं<BR>[विदूरे गिरौ भवं ष्यञ्] Lapis lazuli;<BR>Ku. 7. 10; Śi. 3. 45.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1013-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैदेशिक|वैदेशिकः
वैदेशिक a. (की f.) [विदेश-ठञ्]<BR>Belonging to another country,<BR>foreign, exotic.<BR>--कः A stranger,<BR>foreigner; वैदेशिकोस्मीति पृच्छामि कः<BR>पुनरसौ जामाता U. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1013-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैदेश्यं|वैदेश्य
