वैदेहः|वैदेह
वैदेहः [विदेह अण्]<BR>1 A king of<BR>Videha.<BR>--2 An inhabitant of Videha.<BR>--3 A trader by caste.<BR>--4 The son<BR>of a Vaiśya by a Brāhmaṇa woman;<BR>Ms. 10. 11.<BR>--5 An attendant on the<BR>women's apartments.<BR>--हाः (m. pl.)<BR>The people of Videha.<BR>--ही<BR>1 N. of<BR>Sītā; वैदेहिबंर्धोहृदयं विदद्रे R. 14. 13<BR>(the final vowel in वैदेही being<BR>shortened.)<BR>--2 The wife of a<BR>merchant.<BR>--3 A sort of pigment (रोचना).<BR>--4 Turmeric.<BR>--5 A cow.<BR>--6 Long<BR>pepper.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1013-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैदेहकः|वैदेहक
वैदेहकः<BR>1 A trader.<BR>--2 = वैदेह (4)<BR>q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1013-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैदेहिकः|वैदेहिक
वैदेहिकः A merchant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1013-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैद्य|वैद्यः
वैद्य a. (द्यी f.)<BR>1 Relating to<BR>the Vedas, spiritual.<BR>--2 Relating<BR>to medicine, medical.<BR>--द्यः [विद्या<BR>अस्त्यस्य अण्]<BR>1 A learned man,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1014-a" target="_blank">Page1014-a+ 56</a>]<BR>scholar, doctor.<BR>--2 A medical man,<BR>physician. वैद्ययत्नपरिभाविनं गदं न प्रदाप<BR>इव वायुमत्यगात् R. 19. 53;<BR>वैद्यानामातुरः श्रेयान् Subhāṣ.<BR>--3 A man of<BR>the medical caste, supposed to be<BR>one of the mixed classes; (the<BR>offspring of a Brāhmaṇa by a Vaiśya<BR>woman).<BR>--4 A man of a lower<BR>mixed tribe (the offspring of a Śūdra<BR>father by Vaiśya mother).<BR>--Comp.<BR>--क्रिया a doctor's profession,<BR>practice of medicine.<BR>--नाथः {1} N. of<BR>Dhanvantari. {2} of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1013-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैद्यकः|वैद्यक|वैद्यकं
वैद्यकः A doctor, physician.<BR>--कं<BR>The science of medicine.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1014-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैद्युत
वैद्युत a. (ती f.) [विद्युत इदं अण्]<BR>Belonging to or proceeding from<BR>lightning, electric; वृक्षस्य वैद्युत<BR>इवाग्निरुपस्थितोऽयं V. 5. 16, U. 5. 13.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--अग्निः, --अनलः, --वह्निः the<BR>fire of lightning.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1014-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैध|वैधः
