शर्या|शर्य्या
शर्या<BR>1 Night.<BR>--2 A finger.<BR>--3<BR>An arrow (Ved.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1036-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शर्व्|शर्व्व्
