शर्वली
शर्वला --ली An iron crow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1036-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

