शल्
शल् {vI.v} {c1c} A. (शलते)<BR>1 To shake,<BR>stir, agitate.<BR>--2 To tremble.<BR>--3 To<BR>cover. {vII.v} {c1c} P. (शलति)<BR>1 To go.<BR>--2 To run fast. {vIII.v} {c10c} A.<BR>शालयते To praise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1036-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

