शाकपूर्णिः|शाकपूर्णि
शाकपूणिः --र्णिः N. of an ancient<BR>expounder of the Vedas.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1038-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

