शाकंभरी|शाकम्भरी
शाकंभरी<BR>1 An epithet of<BR>Durgā.<BR>--2 N. of a city.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1038-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शाकल|शाकलः
शाकल a. (ली f.) [शकल-अण्]<BR>Relating to a piece (शकल).<BR>--लः A<BR>school of the Ṛgveda or the<BR>followers of this school (pl.)<BR>--Comp.<BR>--प्रातिशाखयं N. of the Ṛgveda<BR>Prātiśākhya.<BR>--शाखा the recension<BR>or traditional text of the Ṛgveda<BR>as represented by the Sākalas.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1038-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शाकलिक|शाकलिकः
