शाकुण|शाकुणः
शाकुण a. (णी f.)<BR>1 Repentant.<BR>--2 Afflicting others (परतापक).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1038-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शाकल्यः|शाकल्य
