शाकारी
शाकारी One of the lowest<BR>forms of Prākṛta, the dialect<BR>spoken by the Sakāra, as in the<BR>Mṛcchakaṭika.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1038-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शाकिनं|शाकिन
