शाकिनी
शाकिनी [शाकमस्त्यस्या इनि]<BR>1 A<BR>field of vegetables.<BR>--2 A kind of<BR>female being attendant on Durgā<BR>(supposed to be a demon or fairy).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1038-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

