शाकुंतलः, शाकुंतलेयः A<BR>metronymic of Bharata (son of Śakuntalā).<BR>--लं The drama called अभिज्ञानशकुंतला<BR>of Kālidāsa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1038-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शाकुंतलेयः|शाकुन्तलेय|शाकुन्तलेयः
