शाकुलिकः|शाकुलिक
शाकुलिकः A fisherman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1038-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शाक्करः|शाक्कर
शाक्करः An ox.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1038-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शाक्त|शाक्तः
शाक्त a. क्ती f. [शक्तिर्देवताऽस्य<BR>अण्.]<BR>1 Relating to power.<BR>--2<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1039-a" target="_blank">Page1039-a+ 56</a>]<BR>Relating to Śakti or the female<BR>personification of divine energy<BR>--क्तः A<BR>worshipper of Śakti; (the Śāktas<BR>are generally worshippers of Durgā<BR>representing the female<BR>personification of divine energy, and the ritual<BR>enjoined to them is of two kinds,<BR>the pure or right-hand ritual<BR>दक्षिणाचार, and impure or left-hand ritual<BR>वामाचार q.q. v.v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1038-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शाक्तिकः|शाक्तिक
शाक्तिकः<BR>1 A worshipper of Śakti.<BR>--2 A spearman, lancer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1039-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शाक्तीकः|शाक्तीक
शाक्तीकः A spearman, lancer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1039-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शाक्तेयः|शाक्तेय
शाक्तेयः, शाक्त्यः<BR>1 A worshipper<BR>of Śakti.<BR>--2 N. of Parāśara.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1039-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शाक्त्यः|शाक्त्य
शाक्तेयः, शाक्त्यः<BR>1 A worshipper<BR>of Śakti.<BR>--2 N. of Parāśara.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1039-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शाक्यः|शाक्य
शाक्यः [शक्-घञ् तत्र साधुः यत]<BR>1 N.<BR>of the family of Buddha.<BR>--2 N. of<BR>Buddha.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--भिक्षुकः a<BR>Buddhist religious mendicant.<BR>--मुनिः,<BR>सिंहः epithets of Buddha.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1039-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शाक्री
शाक्री<BR>1 N. of Sacī, wife of<BR>Indra.<BR>--2 Of Durgā.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1039-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शाक्वरः|शाक्वर
शाक्वरः An ox; cf. शाक्कर<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1039-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शाख्
शाख् {c1c} P. (शाखति) To pervade,<BR>fill completely.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1039-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शाखः|शाख
शाखः N. of Kārtikeya.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1039-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शाखा
शाखा<BR>1 A branch (as of a tree);<BR>आवज्र्य शाखाः R. 16. 19.<BR>--2 An<BR>arm.<BR>--3 A party, section, faction.<BR>--4 A part of subdivision of a work.<BR>--5 A school, branch, sect.<BR>--6 A<BR>part or division of an animal.<BR>--7 A<BR>school or traditional recension of<BR>the Veda, the traditional text<BR>followed by a school; as in<BR>शाकलशाखा, आश्वलायनशाखा, बाष्कलशाखा &c.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--चंक्रमणं leaping from<BR>branch to branch’, irregular study.<BR>--चंद्रन्यायः see under न्याय.<BR>--नगरं, --पुरं<BR>a suburb.<BR>--पित्तः inflammation of the<BR>extremities of the body, e. g. hands,<BR>shoulders &c.<BR>--भृत् m. a tree.<BR>--भेदः difference of (Vedic) school.<BR>--मृगः {1} a monkey, an ape. {2} a<BR>squirrel.<BR>--रंडः ‘a traitor to his<BR>Śākhā’, a Brāhmaṇa who has<BR>changed his own school of the Vedas.<BR>--रथ्या a branch-road.<BR>--विलीन a.<BR>sitting on branches (as a bird).<BR>--शिफा a root growing from a<BR>branch (as of the fig-tree).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1039-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शाखालः|शाखाल
शाखालः A sort of cane (वानीर).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1039-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शाखिन्
शाखिन् a. [शाखा अस्त्यस्य इति]<BR>1<BR>Having branches (fig. also).<BR>--2<BR>Branching, ramifying.<BR>--3 Belonging to any<BR>branch or school (as of the Veda).<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1039-b" target="_blank">Page1039-b+ 55</a>]<BR>--m.<BR>1 A tree; कुल्यांभोभिः पवनचपलैः<BR>शाखिनो धौतूलाः Ś. 1. 15.<BR>--2 A<BR>Veda.<BR>--3 A follower of any Vedic<BR>school or recension.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1039-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शाखोटः|शाखोट
शाखोटः, शाखोटकः N. of a<BR>tree; कस्त्वं भोः कथयामि दैवहतकं मां<BR>विद्धि शाखोटकं K. P. 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1039-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शाखोटकः|शाखोटक
शाखोटः, शाखोटकः N. of a<BR>tree; कस्त्वं भोः कथयामि दैवहतकं मां<BR>विद्धि शाखोटकं K. P. 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1039-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शांकरः|शाङ्कर|शांकर|शाङ्करं|शाङ्करः
शांकरः A bull.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1039-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शांकरिः|शाङ्करि|शांकरि|शाङ्करिः
शांकरिः<BR>1 N. of Kārtikeya.<BR>--2 Of<BR>Gaṇeśa.<BR>--3 Fire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1039-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शांखं|शाङ्ख|शाङ्खः
शांखं The sound of a conch-shell.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1039-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शांखिकः|शाङ्खिक|शांखिक|शाङ्खिकः
शांखिकः [शंख-ठञ्]<BR>1 A shell-cutter,<BR>worker in shells.<BR>--2 N. of a mixed<BR>tribe.<BR>--3 A shell-blower; Śi. 15. 72.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1039-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शाचि
शाचि a.<BR>1 Distinguished,<BR>renowned.<BR>--2 Strong, powerful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1039-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शाटः|शाट
शाटः, शाटी<BR>1 A garment, cloth.<BR>--2 A petticoat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1039-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शाटी
शाटः, शाटी<BR>1 A garment, cloth.<BR>--2 A petticoat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1039-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शाटकः|शाटक|शाटकं
