शैखरेयः|शैखरेय
शैखरिकः --रेयः The Apāmārga<BR>tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1054-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शैख्य
शैख्य a. Pointed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1054-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शैघ्र्यं|शैघ्र्य
शैघ्र्यं [शीघ्र-ष्यञ्] Quickness,<BR>rapidity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1054-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शैत्यं|शैत्य
शैत्यं [शीत-ष्यञ्] Cold, coldness,<BR>frigidity; शैत्यं हि यत्सा प्रकृतिर्जलस्य<BR>R. 5. 54, Ku. 1. 36.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1055-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शैथिल्यं|शैथिल्य
शैथिल्यं [शिथिलस्य भावः ष्यञ्]<BR>1<BR>Looseness, laxity, relaxation of rule<BR>&c.<BR>--2 Slackness.<BR>--3 Dilatoriness,<BR>inattention.<BR>--4 Weakness;<BR>cowardice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1055-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शैनेयः|शैनेय
