श्वादंतः A dog's tooth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1063-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्वानः|श्वान
श्वानः [श्वैव-अण् न टिलोपः] A<BR>dog.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--निद्रा ‘a dog's sleep’,<BR>a very light sleep.<BR>--वैखरी angry<BR>or currish snarling.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1063-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्वापद|श्वापदः
