सचेतन
सचेतन a.<BR>1 Sentient, animate,<BR>rational.<BR>--2 Conscious, sensible.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1080-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सचेतस्
सचेतस् a.<BR>1 Intelligent.<BR>--2<BR>Possessed of feeling; सचेतपः कस्य<BR>मनो न दूयते Ku. 5. 48.<BR>--3<BR>Unanimous.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1080-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सचेल
