सच्छिद्र
सच्छिद्र a.<BR>1 Having holes.<BR>--2<BR>Defective, faulty.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1080-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सजन|सजनः
सजन a. Having men or living<BR>beings.<BR>--नः A man of the same<BR>family, a kinsman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1080-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सजंबाल|सजम्बाल|सजम्बालः
