सजल
सजल a. Watery, wet, humid.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1080-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सजात|सजातः
सजात a. Born together.<BR>--तः<BR>A brother (Ved.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1080-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सजाति|सजातिः
सजाति, सजातीय a.<BR>1 Of the<BR>same kind, tribe, class, or species.<BR>--2 Like, similar. --m. A son of a<BR>man and woman of the same caste.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1080-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सजातीय|सजातीयः
सजाति, सजातीय a.<BR>1 Of the<BR>same kind, tribe, class, or species.<BR>--2 Like, similar. --m. A son of a<BR>man and woman of the same caste.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1080-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सजात्यं|सजात्य
सजात्यं Brotherhood, relationship.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1080-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सजुष्
सजुष्(स्) a.<BR>1 Loving,<BR>attached to<BR>--2 Associated together. --m.<BR>(Nom. सजूः, सजुत्रौ, सजुषः; instr. dual<BR>सजूर्भ्याम्) A friend, companion. --ind.<BR>With, together with.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1080-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सजुस्
सजुष्(स्) a.<BR>1 Loving,<BR>attached to<BR>--2 Associated together. --m.<BR>(Nom. सजूः, सजुत्रौ, सजुषः; instr. dual<BR>सजूर्भ्याम्) A friend, companion. --ind.<BR>With, together with.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1080-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सज्ज|सज्जः
