सज्जा
सज्जा<BR>1 Dress, decoration.<BR>--2<BR>Equipment, apparatus.<BR>--3 Military<BR>accoutrement, armour, mail.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1080-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सज्जित|सज्जितः
सज्जित a.<BR>1 Dressed.<BR>--2<BR>Decorated.<BR>--3 Made ready, equipped;<BR>Pt. 1. 157.<BR>--4 Accoutred, armed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1080-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सज्जीकृ
