सज्य
सज्य a.<BR>1 Furnished with a<BR>bow-string.<BR>--2 Strung (as a bow);<BR>Ki. 1. 21.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1080-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सज्योत्स्ना
सज्योत्स्ना A moonlight night.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1080-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संचः|सञ्च|संच|सञ्चः
