संचत्|सञ्चत्
संचत् m.<BR>1 A cheat, rogue,<BR>juggler.<BR>--2 Cheating, deceit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1080-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संचर्|सञ्चर्
संचर् {c1c} P. (but Atm. when<BR>used with the instrumental of a<BR>conveyance)<BR>1 To move, walk, go,<BR>pass, walk about; यानैः समचरंतान्ये<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1081-a" target="_blank">Page1081-a+ 56</a>]<BR>Bk. 8. 32; क्वचित्पथा संचरते सुराणां<BR>R. 13. 19; N. 6. 57.<BR>--2 To practise,<BR>perform.<BR>--3 To pass over, be<BR>transferred to.<BR>--4 To act, behave;<BR>Māl. 6. 2.<BR>--5 To join, meet.<BR>--6 To pass<BR>or roam through, travel over.<BR>--7<BR>To arrive at, reach, attain. --Caus.<BR>1 To cause to go about, lead,<BR>conduct; यूथानि संचार्य Ś. 5. 5.<BR>--2<BR>To cause to spread, circulate.<BR>--3<BR>To transmit, communicate, pass<BR>over, deliver over to (as a disease<BR>&c.).<BR>--4 To turn out (as cattle<BR>&c.) to graze.<BR>--5 To impel,<BR>instigate, incite.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1080-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संचरः|सञ्चर|संचर|सञ्चरः
संचरः<BR>1 Passage, transit from one<BR>zodiacal sign to another.<BR>--2 A way,<BR>path; यत्रौषधिप्र काशेन नक्तं<BR>दर्शितसंचराः Ku. 6. 43; R. 16. 12<BR>--3 A<BR>narrow road, defile, difficult passage.<BR>--4 Entrance, gate.<BR>--5 The body.<BR>--6<BR>Killing.<BR>--7 Development.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1081-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संचरणं|सञ्चरण
संचरणं Going, motion, travelling.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1081-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संचारः|सञ्चार|संचार|सञ्चारः
संचारः<BR>1 Going, movement,<BR>travelling or roaming through; स पुनः<BR>पार्थसंचारं संचरत्यवनीपतिः K. P. 10;<BR>सुलभपुरुषसंचारेऽस्मिन्प्रदेशे Mk. 7;<BR>R. 2. 15.<BR>--2 Passing through, passage,<BR>transit.<BR>--3 A course, way, road,<BR>pass.<BR>--4 A difficult progress or<BR>journey.<BR>--5 Difficulty, distress.<BR>--6<BR>Inciting.<BR>--7 Leading, guiding.<BR>--8<BR>Transmission, contagion.<BR>--9 A gem<BR>said to be found in the hood of<BR>serpents.<BR>--10 The entrance of the sun<BR>into a new sign.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1081-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संचारक|सञ्चारक|संचारकः
संचारक a. Conveying,<BR>transmitting.<BR>--कः<BR>1 A leader, guide.<BR>--2 An<BR>instigator.<BR>--3 An orator.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1081-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संचारणं|सञ्चारण|संचारण
संचारणं Moving, impelling,<BR>conveying, leading &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1081-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संचारिका|सञ्चारिका
संचारिका<BR>1 A female messenger,<BR>go-between.<BR>--2 A bawd, procuress.<BR>--3 A pair, couple.<BR>--4 Smell, odour.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1081-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संचारित|सञ्चारित
संचारित p. p.<BR>1 Moved, set in<BR>motion.<BR>--2 Impelled, driven<BR>onward, incited.<BR>--3 Conveyed; see संचर्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1081-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संचारिन्|सञ्चारिन्
संचारिन् a. (णी f.)<BR>1 Moving,<BR>moveable; संचारिणी नगरदेवतेव<BR>Māl. 1; Ku. 3. 54; संचारिणी दीपाशिखेव रात्रौ<BR>R. 6. 67.<BR>--2 Roaming, wandering.<BR>--3 Changing, unsteady, fickle.<BR>--4<BR>Difficult to be passed, inaccessible,<BR>--5 Evanescent, as a Bhāva; see<BR>below.<BR>--6 Influencing.<BR>--7 Hereditary,<BR>successively communicated (as a<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1081-b" target="_blank">Page1081-b+ 55</a>]<BR>disease).<BR>--8 Contagious.<BR>--9<BR>Impelling. --m.<BR>1 Wind, air.<BR>--2 Incense.<BR>--3 A transient or evanescent<BR>feeling which serves to strengthen the<BR>prevailing sentiment; see व्यभिचारिन्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1081-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संचल्|सञ्चल्
संचल् {c1c} P.<BR>1 To move about,<BR>move to and fro, waver, oscillate.<BR>--2 To quiver, tremble.<BR>--3 To start<BR>or jump up<BR>--4 To depart, go away.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1081-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संचल|सञ्चल
संचल a. Trembling, quivering.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1081-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संचलनं|सञ्चलन|संचलन|सञ्चलनं
संचलनं Agitation, trembling,<BR>shaking; अचलसंचलनाहरणोरणः Ki. 18. 8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1081-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संचाली|सञ्चाली
संचाली The Guñjā shrub.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1081-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संचाय्यः|सञ्चाय्य|संचाय्य|सञ्चाय्यः
संचाय्यः N. of a particular<BR>sacrifice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1081-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संचि|सञ्चि
संचि {c5c} U.<BR>1 To gather, collect,<BR>hoard; रक्षायोगादयमपि तपः प्रत्यहं<BR>संचिनोति Ś. 2. 14; R. 19. 2;<BR>Ms. 6. 15.<BR>--2 To arrange, put in order,<BR>put or place; Bk. 3. 35.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1081-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संचयः|सञ्चय|संचय|सञ्चयः
संचयः<BR>1 Heaping up, gathering.<BR>--2 Hoard, heap, accumulation, stock,<BR>store; कर्तव्यः संचयो नित्यं कर्तव्यो<BR>नातिसंचयः Subhāṣ.<BR>--3 A large<BR>quantity, collection.<BR>--4 Joint;<BR>Māl. 8. 9.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1081-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संचयनं|सञ्चयन|संचयन|सञ्चयनं
संचयनं<BR>1 Gathering, collecting.<BR>--2 Collecting the ashes and bones<BR>of a body after it has been burnt.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1081-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संचयिन्|सञ्चयिन्
संचयिन् a. Collecting,<BR>gathering, hoarding &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1081-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संचित|सञ्चित
संचित p. p.<BR>1 Heaped up,<BR>accumulated, hoarded, collected.<BR>--2<BR>Laid by, stored.<BR>--3 Enumerated,<BR>reckoned.<BR>--4 Full of, furnished or<BR>provided with.<BR>--5 Impeded,<BR>obstructed.<BR>--6 Dense, thick (as a wood).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1081-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संचितिः|सञ्चिति|संचिति
संचितिः f. A collection.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1081-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संचिंत्|सञ्चिन्त्|संचिन्त्
संचिंत् {c10c} U.<BR>1 To think,<BR>consider, reflect, think over; Y. 1. 360;<BR>Ch. P. 32.<BR>--2 To weigh (in the<BR>mind), discriminate.<BR>--3 To design,<BR>intend.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1081-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संचिंतनं|सञ्चिन्तन|संचिन्तन
संचिंतनं Consideration, reflection.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1081-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संचिंतित|सञ्चिन्तित|संचिन्तित
संचिंतित a.<BR>1 Considered, thought<BR>about.<BR>--2 Designed, intended.<BR>--3<BR>Settled.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1081-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संचूर्ण्
संचूर्ण् {c10c} U.<BR>1 To pulverize.<BR>--2 To bruise, crush; संचूर्णयामि गदया<BR>न सुयोधनोरु Ve. 1. 15.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1081-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संचूर्णनं|सञ्चूर्णन|संचूर्णन
संचूर्णनं Crushing to pieces.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1081-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संछद्|सञ्छद्
संछद् {c10c} U.<BR>1 To hide, conceal.<BR>--2 To envelope, cover, wrap up.<BR>--3<BR>To put on (as clothes).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1081-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संछन्न|सञ्छन्न
संछन्न p. p.<BR>1 Enveloped,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1081-c" target="_blank">Page1081-c+ 55</a>]<BR>concealed, hidden.<BR>--2 Clothed.<BR>--3<BR>Surrounded.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1081-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संछादनं|सञ्छादन|संछादन
संछादनं Obscuring, hiding.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1081-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संछिद्|सञ्छिद्
संछिद् {c7c} U.<BR>1 To cut, cut off,<BR>divide.<BR>--2 To penetrate, pierce.<BR>--3<BR>To remove, clear, solve, (as a<BR>doubt &c.).<BR>--4 To settle, decide (a<BR>question).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1081-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संच्छेदः
संच्छेदः<BR>1 Cutting, dividing.<BR>--2<BR>Removal, solution.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1081-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संज्|सञ्ज्
संज् {c1c} P. (सजति, सक्त; the स् of<BR>the root being changed to ष् after a<BR>preposition ending in इ or उ)<BR>1 To<BR>stick or adhere to, cling to;<BR>तुल्यगंधिषु मत्तेभकटेषु फलरेणवः (ससंजुः);<BR>R. 4. 47.<BR>--2 To go, move.<BR>--3 To<BR>fasten. --Pass. (सज्यते) To be<BR>attached to, cling or adhere to.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1081-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संजन्|सञ्जन्
संजन् {c4c} A.<BR>1 To be born or<BR>produced.<BR>--2 To grow, arise, spring.<BR>--3 To be or become.<BR>--4 To elapse,<BR>pass (time). --Caus. To beget,<BR>produce, generate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1081-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संजः|सञ्ज|संज|सञ्जः
संजः<BR>1 N. of Brahman.<BR>--2 N. of<BR>Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1081-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संजात|सञ्जात
संजात p. p.<BR>1 Born, produced,<BR>grown, arisen (oft. in comp. in the<BR>sense of ‘growing, becoming,<BR>possessing’; संजातकोप ‘being angry’;<BR>so संजातपक्ष ‘winged,’ &c.).<BR>--2<BR>Passed (as time).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1081-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संजयः|सञ्जय|संजय
संजयः N. of the charioteer of<BR>king Dhṛtarāṣṭra. He tried to<BR>bring about a peaceful settlement<BR>of the dispute between the<BR>Kauravas and Pāṇḍavas, but failed.<BR>It was he who narrated the events<BR>of the great Bhāratī war to the<BR>blind king Dhṛtarāṣṭra; cf.<BR>Bg. 1. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1081-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संजल्प्|सञ्जल्प्
संजल्प् {c1c} P. To talk, converse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1081-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संजल्पः|सञ्जल्प|संजल्प
संजल्पः<BR>1 Conversation.<BR>--2<BR>Confused talk, chattering, confusion.<BR>--3 An uproar.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1081-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संजवनं|सञ्जवन|संजवन|सञ्जवनं
संजवनं A quadrangle; a group<BR>of four houses forming a court.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1081-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संजा
संजा A she-goat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1081-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संजीव्|सञ्जीव्
संजीव् {c1c} P.<BR>1 To live together.<BR>--2 To live, exist (by any profession).<BR>--3 To be restored to life. --Caus.<BR>1 To revive, restore or bring to life,<BR>reanimate.<BR>--2 To maintain, nourish.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1081-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संजीवनं|सञ्जीवन|संजीवन|सञ्जीवनं
संजीवनं<BR>1 Living together.<BR>--2<BR>Bringing to life, life-restoring,<BR>reanimation, resuscitation.<BR>--3 N. of<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1082-a" target="_blank">Page1082-a+ 57</a>]<BR>one of the 21 hells; see<BR>Ms. 4. 89.<BR>--4 A group of four houses,<BR>quadrangle.<BR>--नी<BR>1 A kind of elixir<BR>(said to restore the dead to life).<BR>--2<BR>Making alive, restoring life.<BR>--3<BR>Food.<BR>--4 N. of Mallinātha's<BR>commentaries on Ku., R., and Me.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--ओषधि f. a reviving or<BR>life-restoring plant; संजीवनौषधिरसो<BR>नु हृदि प्रसिक्तः U. 3. 11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1081-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संज्ञा
संज्ञा {c9c} A.<BR>1 To know,<BR>understand, be aware of.<BR>--2 To recognize.<BR>--3 To live in harmony, agree<BR>together (with acc or instr.); पित्रा<BR>पितरं वा संजानीते Sk.<BR>--4 To watch,<BR>be on the alert; Bk. 8. 27.<BR>--5 To<BR>accede or agree to.<BR>--6 To<BR>remember, think of (Paras.); मातुः मातरं<BR>वा संजानाति Sk.<BR>--7 To direct,<BR>appoint. --Caus.<BR>1 To inform.<BR>--2 To<BR>appease, gratify, console.<BR>--3 (a) To<BR>quiet, pacify (a sacrificial animal).<BR>(b) To kill.<BR>--4 To command,<BR>enjoin.<BR>--5 To animate.<BR>--6 To make<BR>intelligible, cause to be understood,<BR>inform.<BR>--7 To make a sign to (any<BR>one), communicate by signs.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1082-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संज्ञ
संज्ञ a.<BR>1 Knock-kneed.<BR>--2<BR>Being conscious.<BR>--3 Named,<BR>called; see संज्ञा below.<BR>--ज्ञं A yellow<BR>fragrant wood.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1082-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संज्ञपनं|सञ्ज्ञपन|संज्ञपन|सञ्ज्ञपनं
संज्ञपनं Killing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1082-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संज्ञप्तिः|सञ्ज्ञप्ति|सञ्ज्ञप्तिः
संज्ञप्तिः f.<BR>1 Apprising, informing.<BR>--2 Killing, sacrificing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1082-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संज्ञा
संज्ञा<BR>1 Consciousness; संज्ञां लभ्,<BR>आपद् or प्रतिपद् ‘to regain or recover<BR>one's, consciousness, come to one's<BR>senses.<BR>--2 Knowledge,<BR>understanding.<BR>--3 Intellect, mind.<BR>--4 A hint,<BR>sign, token, gesture;<BR>मुखार्पितैकांगुलिसंज्ञयैव मा चापलायेति गणान् व्यतैषीत्<BR>Ku. 3. 41.<BR>--5 A name, designation,<BR>an appellation; oft. at the end of<BR>comp. in this sense; द्वंद्वैर्विमुक्ताः<BR>सुखदुःखसंज्ञैः Bg. 15. 5.<BR>--6 (In gram.)<BR>Any name or noun having a special<BR>meaning, a proper name.<BR>--7 The<BR>technical name for an affix.<BR>--8 The<BR>Gāyatrī Mantra; see गायत्री.<BR>--9 N.<BR>of the daughter of Viśvakarman and<BR>wife of the sun, and mother of<BR>Yama, Yamī, and the two Aśvins.<BR>[A legend relates that संज्ञा on<BR>one occasion wished to go to her<BR>father's house and asked her husband's<BR>permission, which was not granted.<BR>Resolved to carry out her purpose, she<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1082-b" target="_blank">Page1082-b+ 59</a>]<BR>created, by means of her superhuman<BR>power, a woman exactly like<BR>herselfwho was, as it were, her own shadow<BR>(and was therefore called Chāyā),<BR>-and putting her in her own place, went<BR>away without the knowledge of the<BR>sun. Chāyā bore to the sun three<BR>children (see छाया), and lived quite<BR>happily with him, so that when Saṃjñā<BR>returned, he would not admit her.<BR>Thus repudiated and disappointed, she<BR>assumed the form of a mare and<BR>roamed over the earth. The sun, however,<BR>in course of time, came to know the<BR>real state of things, and discovered<BR>that his wife had assumed the form<BR>of a mare. He accordingly assumed<BR>the form of a horse, and was united with<BR>his wife, who bore to him two<BR>sonsthe Aśvinīkumāras or Aśvins q. v.].<BR>--Comp.<BR>--अधिकारः a leading<BR>rule which gives a particular name<BR>to the rules falling under it, and<BR>which exercises influence over them.<BR>--विपर्ययः loss of consciousness;<BR>Ku. 6. 44.<BR>--विषयः an epithet, an<BR>attribute.<BR>--सुतः an epithet of Saturn.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1082-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संज्ञानं|सञ्ज्ञान|संज्ञान
संज्ञानं Knowledge, understanding.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1082-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संज्ञापनं|सञ्ज्ञापन
