संज्ञावत्
संज्ञावत् a.<BR>1 Having consciousness,<BR>become sensible, revived.<BR>--2<BR>Having a name.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1082-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संज्ञिन्|सञ्ज्ञिन्
