संज्वरः|सञ्ज्वर|संज्वर|सञ्ज्वरः
संज्वरः<BR>1 Great heat, fever;<BR>Māl. 9. 36.<BR>--2 Heat.<BR>--3 Indignation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1082-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सट्
सट् {vI.v} {c1c} P. (सटति) To form a<BR>part. {vII.v} {c10c} U. (साटयति-ते) To<BR>show, display, manifest.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1082-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सटं|सट
सटं, सटा<BR>1 An ascetic's matted<BR>hair.<BR>--2 The mane (of a lion);<BR>Mu. 7. 6; Śi. 1. 47.<BR>--3 Bristles of a<BR>boar; विध्यंतमुद्धृतसटाः प्रतिहंतुमीषुः<BR>R. 9. 60.<BR>--4 A braid of hair.<BR>--5 A<BR>crest.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--अंकः a lion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1082-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सटा
सटं, सटा<BR>1 An ascetic's matted<BR>hair.<BR>--2 The mane (of a lion);<BR>Mu. 7. 6; Śi. 1. 47.<BR>--3 Bristles of a<BR>boar; विध्यंतमुद्धृतसटाः प्रतिहंतुमीषुः<BR>R. 9. 60.<BR>--4 A braid of hair.<BR>--5 A<BR>crest.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--अंकः a lion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1082-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

