सट्ट्
सट्ट् {c10c} U. (सट्टयति-ते)<BR>1 To<BR>injure, kill,<BR>--2 To be strong.<BR>--3 To<BR>give.<BR>--4 To take.<BR>--5 To dwell.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1082-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सट्टकं|सट्टक
सट्टकं A kind of minor drama in<BR>Prākṛta; e. g. कर्पूरमंजरी; see<BR>S. D. 542.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1082-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सट्वा
सट्वा<BR>1 A kind of bird.<BR>--2 A<BR>musical instrument.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1082-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सठ्
