सठि f. The plant zedoary.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1082-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सणसूत्रं|सणसूत्र
सणसूत्रं A hempen cord or<BR>thread.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1082-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संड|सण्ड|सण्डः
संड See षंढ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1082-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संडिशः|सण्डिश|संडिश|सण्डिशः
