समीक्षा
समीक्षा<BR>1 Investigation, search.<BR>--2<BR>Consideration.<BR>--3 Close or thorough<BR>inspection.<BR>--4 Understanding,<BR>intellect.<BR>--5 Essential nature of truth.<BR>--6 An essential principle.<BR>--7 The<BR>Mīmāṃsā system of philosophy.<BR>--8<BR>Fffort.<BR>--9 The Sāṃkhya system of<BR>philosophy; Śi. 2. 59.<BR>--10<BR>Complete or thorough investigation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1099-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

