समुज्जृंभ्|समुज्जृम्भ्
समुज्जृंभ् {c1c} A.<BR>1 To yawn, gape.<BR>--2 To extend, spread out.<BR>--3 To<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1100-a" target="_blank">Page1100-a+ 56</a>]<BR>appear, rise, become visible.<BR>--4 To<BR>attempt, strive, endeavour; व्यालं<BR>बालमृणालतंतुभिरसौ रोद्धुं समुज्जृंभते<BR>Bh. 2. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1099-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुज्जृंभणं|समुज्जृम्भण
