समुद्ग|समुद्गः
समुद्ग a.<BR>1 Rising, ascending.<BR>--2<BR>Completely pervading.<BR>--3 Having<BR>a covering or lid.<BR>--4 Having beans.<BR>--द्गः<BR>1 A covered box or casket.<BR>--2<BR>A kind of artificial stanza; see<BR>समुद्गक below.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--यमकं (in<BR>Rhet.) making an artificial<BR>arrangement of words in such a manner<BR>as to make different parts of a<BR>stanza correspond in sound though<BR>they differ in meaning; see यमक.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1100-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुद्गकः|समुद्गक
समुद्गकः<BR>1 A covered box or<BR>casket; Ś. 4.<BR>--2 A kind of artificial<BR>stanza, the two halves of which<BR>exactly correspond in sound, though<BR>different in meaning; e. g.<BR>Ki. 15. 16.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1100-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुद्गमः|समुद्गम
