समुद्धत|समुद्धतः
समुद्धत p. p.<BR>1 Upraised,<BR>uplifted, elevated.<BR>--2 Excited,<BR>drawnup.<BR>--3 Puffed up with pride, proud,<BR>arrogant.<BR>--4 Ill-mannered,<BR>ill-behaved.<BR>--5 Impudent, rude.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1100-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुद्धृ
समुद्धृ {c1c} U.<BR>1 To raise or lift up.<BR>--2 To save, extricate, deliver,<BR>rescue.<BR>--3 To extract, take or draw<BR>out.<BR>--4 To pull up by the roots,<BR>root out, extirpate.<BR>--5 To extol,<BR>praise, honour.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1100-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुद्धरणं|समुद्धरण
समुद्धरणं<BR>1 Upraising, lifting up.<BR>--2 Picking up.<BR>--3 Drawing or lifting<BR>out.<BR>--4 Extrication, deliverance.<BR>--5 Eradication, extirpation.<BR>--6<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1101-a" target="_blank">Page1101-a+ 56</a>]<BR>Taking out from (a share).<BR>--7 Food<BR>thrown up or vomited.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1100-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

