समुद्वाहः|समुद्वाह
समुद्वाहः<BR>1 Bearing up.<BR>--2<BR>Marriage.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1101-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

