समुन्नत|समुन्नतः
समुन्नत p. p.<BR>1 Upraised, lifted<BR>up.<BR>--2 Elevated, high, lofty.<BR>--3<BR>Exalted, sublime.<BR>--4 Proud.<BR>--5<BR>Projecting.<BR>--6 Upright, just.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1101-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुन्नतिः|समुन्नति
समुन्नतिः f.<BR>1 Lifting up, raising.<BR>--2 Height, loftiness, elevation<BR>(mental also); मनसः शिखराणां च सट्टशी ते<BR>समुन्नतिः Ku. 6. 66; R. 3. 10.<BR>--3<BR>Eminence, high position or dignity,<BR>exaltation; उत्तमैः सह संगेन को न<BR>याति समुन्नतिं; स जातो येन जातेव याति<BR>वंशः समुन्नतिं Subhāṣ.<BR>--4 Rise,<BR>prosperity, increase, success;<BR>विनिपातोपि समः समुन्नतेः Ki. 2. 34, or प्रकृतिः<BR>खलु सा महीयसः सहते नान्यसमुन्नतिं<BR>यया 2. 21.<BR>--5 Pride, arrogance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1101-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुन्नह्
समुन्नह् {c4c} P.<BR>1 To bind or tie<BR>up.<BR>--2 To raise or lift up.<BR>--3 To<BR>loosen, unfasten.<BR>--4 To liberate,<BR>release, set free.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1101-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुन्नद्ध|समुन्नद्धः
समुन्नद्ध p. p.<BR>1 Elevated, exalted.<BR>--2 Swollen.<BR>--3 Full.<BR>--4 Proud,<BR>arrogant, overbearing.<BR>--5<BR>Conceited, thinking oneself to be learned.<BR>--6 Unfettered.<BR>--7 Bound up.<BR>--8<BR>Supreme.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1101-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुन्नी
समुन्नी {c1c} U.<BR>1 To raise<BR>completely up, elevate.<BR>--2 To bring<BR>out, deduce.<BR>--3 To discharge, pay<BR>off (as a debt &c.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1101-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुन्नयः|समुन्नय
समुन्नयः<BR>1 Getting, obtaining.<BR>--2<BR>Occurrence, event.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1101-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुन्मूलनं|समुन्मूलन
समुन्मूलनं Uprooting, eradication.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1101-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुपगमः|समुपगम
समुपगमः Approach, contact.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1101-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुपजोषम्
समुपजोषम् ind.<BR>1 Entirely<BR>according to wish.<BR>--2 Happily.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1101-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुपभोगः|समुपभोग
समुपभोगः Sexual union, coition.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1101-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुपविश्
समुपविश् {c6c} P.<BR>1 To sit down.<BR>--2 To lie down upon.<BR>--3 To<BR>encamp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1101-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुपवेशः|समुपवेश
समुपवेशः<BR>1 Sitting down together.<BR>--2 Entertaining.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1101-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुपवेशनं|समुपवेशन
समुपवेशनं<BR>1 A building, habitation,<BR>residence.<BR>--2 Seating down.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1101-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुपस्था
समुपस्था {c1c} U.<BR>1 To come near,<BR>go to, approach.<BR>--2 To attack.<BR>--3<BR>To befall, occur.<BR>--4 To stand in<BR>close contact.<BR>--5 To attain, arrive<BR>at, resort to; Ś. 2. 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1101-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुपस्था
समुपस्था, समुपस्थानं<BR>1 Approach,<BR>approximation.<BR>--2 Proximity,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1101-c" target="_blank">Page1101-c+ 56</a>]<BR>nearness.<BR>--3 Happening, befalling,<BR>occurrence.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1101-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुपस्थानं|समुपस्थान
समुपस्था, समुपस्थानं<BR>1 Approach,<BR>approximation.<BR>--2 Proximity,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1101-c" target="_blank">Page1101-c+ 56</a>]<BR>nearness.<BR>--3 Happening, befalling,<BR>occurrence.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1101-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुपस्थितिः|समुपस्थिति
समुपस्थितिः --समुपस्थानं q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1101-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुपस्थानं|समुपस्थान
समुपस्थितिः --समुपस्थानं q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1101-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुपार्जनं|समुपार्जन
समुपार्जनं Acquiring together,<BR>simultaneous acquisition.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1101-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुपे
समुपे {c2c} P.<BR>1 To get, obtain.<BR>--2<BR>To assemble, meet.<BR>--3 To attack,<BR>assail.<BR>--4 To go to, reach.<BR>--5 To<BR>fall to the lot of.<BR>--6 To undergo,<BR>suffer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1101-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुपेत
समुपेत p. p.<BR>1 Come together,<BR>assembled, collected.<BR>--2 Arrived at.<BR>--3 Furnished or endowed with,<BR>possessed of.<BR>--4 Inhabited by.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1101-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुपोढ
समुपोढ p. p.<BR>1 Gone upwards,<BR>risen; U. 5. 26.<BR>--2 Increased.<BR>--3<BR>Brought near.<BR>--4 Restrained.<BR>--5<BR>Begun.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1101-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुल्लस्
समुल्लस् {c1c} P.<BR>1 To shine forth,<BR>gleam.<BR>--2 To break forth, appear.<BR>--3 To sport, be wanton, dally.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1101-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुल्लासः|समुल्लास
समुल्लासः<BR>1 Excessive brilliance.<BR>--2 Great joy, exhilaration.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1101-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समूढ|समूढः
समूढ p. p.<BR>1 Brought together,<BR>assembled.<BR>--2 Accumulated,<BR>collected.<BR>--3 Enveloped.<BR>--4<BR>Associated with.<BR>--5 Produced quickly.<BR>--6<BR>Calmed, tamed down, tranquillized.<BR>--7 Crooked, bent.<BR>--8 Purified,<BR>cleansed.<BR>--9 Borne along.<BR>--10<BR>Led, conducted.<BR>--11 Married.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1101-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समूरः|समूर
समूरः, समूरुः, समूरकः A kind of<BR>deer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1101-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समूरुः|समूरु
समूरः, समूरुः, समूरकः A kind of<BR>deer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1101-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समूरकः
समूरः, समूरुः, समूरकः A kind of<BR>deer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1101-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समूल|समूलं
समूल a. Along with the roots;<BR>as in समूलघातं ‘having completely<BR>exterminated, tearing up root and<BR>branch’.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1101-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समूह्
समूह् {c1c} U. To gather, assemble,<BR>collect.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1101-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समूहः|समूह
समूहः<BR>1 A multitude, collection,<BR>an assemblage, aggregate, number;<BR>जनसमूहः, विघ्नसमूहः, पदसमूहः &c.<BR>--2<BR>A flock, troop.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1101-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समूहनं|समूहन
समूहनं<BR>1 Bringing together.<BR>--2 A<BR>collection, plenty.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1101-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समूहनी
समूहनी A broom.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1101-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समूह्यः|समूह्य
समूह्यः A kind of sacrificial fire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1101-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समृ
समृ {c1c} P.<BR>1 To meet, be united.<BR>--2 To come into conflict.<BR>--3 To<BR>bring together, construct. --Caus.<BR>(समर्पयति)<BR>1 To hand over, deliver,<BR>commit, consign.<BR>--2 To give,<BR>present.<BR>--3 To place in, put in or on,<BR>--4 To strike, hit.<BR>--5 To restore,<BR>return.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1101-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समृध्
समृध् {c4c} {c5c} P. To thrive, prosper,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1102-a" target="_blank">Page1102-a+ 56</a>]<BR>flourish. --Pass.<BR>1 To be fulfilled<BR>or accomplished, succeed.<BR>--2 To<BR>share in abundantly, be fully<BR>furnished (with instr.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1101-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समृद्ध|समृद्धः
समृद्ध p. p.<BR>1 Prosperous,<BR>flourishing, thriving.<BR>--2 Happy,<BR>fortunate.<BR>--3 Rich, wealthy.<BR>--4 Rich in,<BR>richly endowed with, abounding<BR>in.<BR>--5 Fruitful.<BR>--6 Full-grown,<BR>increased.<BR>--7 Full, complete, entire.<BR>--8 Copious, abundant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1102-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समृद्धिः|समृद्धि
समृद्धिः f.<BR>1 Great growth,<BR>increase, thriving;<BR>मधुसमृद्धिसमेधितमेधवा Śi. 6. 20.<BR>--2 Prosperity,<BR>opulence, affluence; Pt. 1. 169;<BR>Bh. 2. 42.<BR>--3 Wealth, riches.<BR>--4<BR>Exuberance, profusion, abundance; as<BR>in धनधान्यसमृद्धिरस्तु.<BR>--5 Power,<BR>supremacy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1102-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समे
समे {c2c} P.<BR>1 To come together<BR>or meet; समेत्य च व्यपेयातां<BR>H. 4. 69.<BR>--2 To go through, march across.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1102-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समेत|समेतः
समेत p. p.<BR>1 Come or met<BR>together, assembled.<BR>--2 United,<BR>combined.<BR>--3 Come near, approached.<BR>--4 Accompanied by.<BR>--5 Endowed<BR>or furnished with, having,<BR>possessed of; Pt. 1. 24.<BR>--6 Come into<BR>collision, encountered.<BR>--7 Agreed upon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1102-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समेध्
समेध् {c1c} A. To prosper greatly,<BR>thrive, increase. --Caus.<BR>1 To make<BR>happy or fortunate.<BR>--2 To feed,<BR>supply with, strengthen; सूर्यः<BR>समेधयत्बग्निमग्निः सूर्बं च तेजसा V. 5. 20.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1102-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समेधित|समेधितः
समेधित p. p.<BR>1 Greatly increased;<BR>Śi. 6. 20.<BR>--2 Strong.<BR>--3 United.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1102-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संपत्|सम्पत्
संपत् {c1c} P.<BR>1 To fly or meet<BR>together, assemble.<BR>--2 To go or roam<BR>about.<BR>--3 To attack, fall upon,<BR>assail.<BR>--4 To come to pass, occur,<BR>happen.<BR>--5 To fall down, alight, fly<BR>down. --Caus.<BR>1 To bring near.<BR>--2 To collect or assemble together,<BR>bring or call together.<BR>--3 To throw<BR>down, cast, hurl down.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1102-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संपातः|सम्पात|संपात|सम्पातः
संपातः<BR>1 Falling together,<BR>concurrence<BR>--2 Meeting together,<BR>encountering.<BR>--3 Collision, butting<BR>against.<BR>--4 Falling down,<BR>descending; Bg. 1. 20.<BR>--5 Alighting (as<BR>of a bird).<BR>--6 Flight (of an<BR>arrow).<BR>--7 Going, moving.<BR>--8<BR>Being removed, removal; Ms. 6. 56.<BR>--9 A particular mode of the flight<BR>of birds; Pt. 2. 54; cf. डीन.<BR>--10<BR>The residue (of an offering).<BR>--11<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1102-b" target="_blank">Page1102-b+ 56</a>]<BR>N. of the son of Garuḍa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1102-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संपातिः|सम्पाति|संपाति|सम्पातिः
संपातिः N. of a fabulous bird,<BR>son of Garuḍa and elder brother of<BR>Jaṭāyu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1102-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संपातिकः|सम्पातिक|संपातिक|सम्पातिकः
संपातिकः A fabulous bird.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1102-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संपद्|सम्पद्
संपद् {c4c} A.<BR>1 To turn out well,<BR>succeed, prosper, be accomplished or<BR>fulfilled; संपत्स्यते वः कामोऽयं कालः<BR>काश्चित्प्रतीक्ष्यतां Ku. 2. 54;<BR>R. 14. 76; Ms. 3. 254; 6. 69.<BR>--2 To be<BR>completed, to amount to (as a<BR>number); त्र्याहताः पंच पंचदश संपद्यंते.<BR>--3 To turn out to be, become;<BR>संपत्स्यंते नभसि भवतो राजहंसाः सहायाः<BR>Me. 11, 23; संपेदे श्रमसलिलोद्गमो<BR>विभूषा Ki. 7. 5.<BR>--4 To arise, be born<BR>or produced.<BR>--5 To fall or come<BR>together, unite.<BR>--6 To be provided or<BR>furnished with, be possessed of;<BR>अशोक यदि सद्य एव कुसुमैर्न संपत्स्यसे<BR>M. 3. 16; see संपन्न.<BR>--7 To tend<BR>to, bring about, produce (with dat.);<BR>साधोः शिक्षा गुणाय संपद्यते नासाधोः<BR>Pt. 1; Mu. 3. 32.<BR>--8 To obtain,<BR>attain to, acquire, get.<BR>--9 To enter<BR>into, be absorbed in (with loc.).<BR>--Caus.<BR>1 To cause to happen,<BR>bring about, produce, accomplish,<BR>fulfil, effect; इति स्वसुर्भोजकुलप्रदीपः<BR>संपाद्य पाणिग्रहणं स राजा R. 7. 29.<BR>--2 To procure, obtain, make ready,<BR>prepare.<BR>--3 To obtain, acquire,<BR>attain to.<BR>--4 To furnish, provide,<BR>endow with.<BR>--5 To change or<BR>transform into.<BR>--6 To make an<BR>agreement.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1102-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संपादः|सम्पाद|संपाद
संपादः<BR>1 Completion,<BR>accomplishment.<BR>--2 Acquisition.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1102-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संपादनं|सम्पादन|संपादन|सम्पादनं
संपादनं<BR>1 Accomplishing,<BR>effecting, fulfilment.<BR>--2 Gaining,<BR>obtaining, acquiring.<BR>--3 Cleaning,<BR>clearing, preparing (as ground);<BR>Ms. 3. 250.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1102-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संपत्तिः|सम्पत्ति|संपत्ति|सम्पत्तिः
संपत्तिः f.<BR>1 Prosperity, increase<BR>of wealth; संपत्तौ च विपत्तौ च<BR>महतामेकरूपता Subhāṣ.<BR>--2 Success,<BR>fulfilment, accomplishment.<BR>--3<BR>Perfection, excellence; as in रूपसंपत्ति.<BR>--4 Exuberance, plenty, abundance.<BR>--5 A suitable state or condition.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1102-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संपद्|सम्पद्
संपद् f.<BR>1 Wealth, riches;<BR>नीताविवोत्साहगुणेन संपद् Ku. 1. 22;<BR>आपन्नार्तिप्रशमनफलाः संपदो ह्युत्तमानां Me. 53.<BR>--2 Prosperity, affluence,<BR>advancement; (opp. विपद् or आपद्); ते भृत्या<BR>नृपतेः कलत्रमितरे संपत्सु चापत्सु च<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1102-c" target="_blank">Page1102-c+ 56</a>]<BR>Mu. 1. 15.<BR>--3 Good fortune, happiness,<BR>luck.<BR>--4 Success, fulfilment,<BR>accomplishment of desired objects;<BR>Ś. 7. 30.<BR>--5 Perfection, excellence; as<BR>in रूपसंपद्; Śi. 3. 35.<BR>--6 Richness,<BR>plenty, exuberance, abundance,<BR>excess; तुषारवृष्टिक्षतपद्मसंपदां Ku. 5. 27;<BR>R. 10. 59.<BR>--7 Treasure.<BR>--8 An<BR>advantage, a benefit, blessing.<BR>--9<BR>Advancement in good qualities.<BR>--10<BR>Decoration.<BR>--11 Right method.<BR>--12<BR>A necklace of pearls<BR>--Comp.<BR>--वरः<BR>a king.<BR>--वसुः N. of one of the<BR>principal rays of the sun.<BR>--विनिमयः<BR>an interchange or reciprocity of<BR>benefits or services; R. 1. 26.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1102-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संपन्न|सम्पन्न|संपन्नः|सम्पन्नः
संपन्न p. p.<BR>1 Prosperous,<BR>thriving, rich.<BR>--2 Fortunate,<BR>successful, happy.<BR>--3 Effected,<BR>brought about, accomplished.<BR>--4<BR>Finished, completed.<BR>--5 Perfect.<BR>--6 Full-grown, mature.<BR>--7<BR>Procured, obtained.<BR>--8 Right, correct.<BR>--9 Endowed with, possessed of.<BR>--10 Turned out, become; ईदृशः<BR>संपन्नः U. 3.<BR>--11 Perfectly<BR>acquainted or conversant with.<BR>--न्नः An<BR>epithet of Śiva.<BR>--न्नं<BR>1 Riches,<BR>wealth; Pt. 4. 115.<BR>--2 A dainty,<BR>delicacy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1102-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संपरे|सम्परे
संपरे (संपरा + इ) {c2c} A.<BR>1 To come<BR>or meet together, encounter.<BR>--2 To<BR>go away, go beyond (to the next<BR>world).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1102-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संपरायः|सम्पराय|संपराय|सम्परायः
संपरायः<BR>1 Conflict, encounter, war,<BR>battle.<BR>--2 A calamity, misfortune.<BR>--3 Future state, futurity.<BR>--4 A son.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1102-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संपरायकं|सम्परायक|संपरायक|सम्परायकं
संपराय(यि)कं Encounter, war,<BR>battle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1102-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संपरायिकं|सम्परायिक|संपरायिक|सम्परायिकं
संपराय(यि)कं Encounter, war,<BR>battle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1102-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संपा|सम्पा
संपा Lightning.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1102-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संपाक|सम्पाक|संपाकः|सम्पाकः
संपाक a.<BR>1 Reasoning well, a<BR>reasoner.<BR>--2 Cunning, subtle.<BR>--3<BR>Lustful, lewd.<BR>--4 Small, little.<BR>--कः<BR>1 Maturing.<BR>--2 N. of a tree (<BR>आराग्वध).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1102-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संपाटः|सम्पाट|संपाट|सम्पाटः
संपाटः<BR>1 Intersection.<BR>--2 A<BR>spindle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1102-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संपिंडित|सम्पिण्डित|संपिण्डित
संपिंडित p. p.<BR>1 Formed into a<BR>mass.<BR>--2 Contracted.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1102-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संपिष्|सम्पिष्
संपिष् {c7c} P.<BR>1 To pound to pieces,<BR>bruise, crush.<BR>--2 To destroy,<BR>kill.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1102-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संपेषणं|सम्पेषण|संपेषण
संपेषणं Rubbing together,<BR>pounding.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1102-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संपीड्|सम्पीड्
संपीड् {c10c} U.<BR>1 To compress,<BR>press or squeeze together.<BR>--2 To<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1103-a" target="_blank">Page1103-a+ 55</a>]<BR>torture, harass, oppress, pinch, pain;<BR>कंठे जीर्णलताप्रतानवलयेनात्यर्यसंपीडितः<BR>Ś. 7. 11; Ch. P. 3.<BR>--3 To<BR>compute, reckon.<BR>--4 To obscure, eclipse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1102-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संपीडः|सम्पीड|संपीड
संपीडः<BR>1 Squeezing together,<BR>compression.<BR>--2 Pain, torture.<BR>--3<BR>Agitating, disturbing.<BR>--4 Sending,<BR>directing, driving onward,<BR>propelling; संपीडक्षुभितजलेषु तोयदेषु<BR>Ki. 7. 12.<BR>--डा Torment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1103-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संपीडनं|सम्पीडन|संपीडन|सम्पीडनं
संपीडनं<BR>1 Squeezing, pressing<BR>together.<BR>--2 Sending.<BR>--3 Punishment,<BR>castigation.<BR>--4 Stirring up,<BR>agitating.<BR>--5 Paining, torturing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1103-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संपीतिः|सम्पीति|संपीति|सम्पीतिः
संपीतिः f. Drinking together,<BR>compotation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1103-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संपुटः|सम्पुट|संपुट|सम्पुटः
संपुटः<BR>1 A cavity; स्वात्यां<BR>सागरशुक्तिसंपुटगतं (पयः) सन्मौक्तिकं जायते<BR>Bh. 2. 67 v. l.; Kāv. 2. 288;<BR>Rs. 1. 21.<BR>--2 A casket, covered box.<BR>--3 The Kurabaka flower.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1103-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संपुटका
संपुटका, संपुटिका A box, casket;<BR>Pt. 2. 165.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1103-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संपुटिका
संपुटका, संपुटिका A box, casket;<BR>Pt. 2. 165.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1103-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संपूज्|सम्पूज्
संपूज् {c10c} U.<BR>1 To worship,<BR>revere, honour.<BR>--2 To present or<BR>honour with.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1103-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संपूजनं|सम्पूजन|संपूजन
संपूजनं<BR>1 Honouring, reverence.<BR>--2 Presenting with.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1103-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संपूर्ण|सम्पूर्ण|सम्पूर्णं|सम्पूर्णः
संपूर्ण a.<BR>1 Filled &c.<BR>--2 All,<BR>whole; see पूर्ण.<BR>--र्णः A mode of<BR>music in which all the notes of the<BR>gamut are used.<BR>--र्णं Ether.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1103-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संपृच्|सम्पृच्
संपृच् {c7c} P., {c2c} A.<BR>1 To mix, bring<BR>in contact with, join, unite;<BR>Bk. 17. 106.<BR>--2 To be united or mixed<BR>together, be in contact.<BR>--3 To fill<BR>up, complete.<BR>--4 To present with.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1103-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संपर्कः|सम्पर्क|संपर्क|सम्पर्कः
संपर्कः<BR>1 Mixture.<BR>--2 Union,<BR>contact, touch; पादेम नापैक्षत सुंदरीणां<BR>संपर्कमाशिंजितनूपुरेण Ku. 3. 26;<BR>Me. 25; V. 1. 12.<BR>--3 Society,<BR>association, company; न मूर्खजनसंपर्कः<BR>सुरेंद्रभवनेष्वपि Bh. 2. 14.<BR>--4 Sexual<BR>union, copulation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1103-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संपृक्त|सम्पृक्त|सम्पृक्तः
संपृक्त p. p.<BR>1 Blended, mixed.<BR>--2 Connected together, related, in<BR>close relation; वागर्थाविव संपृक्तौ<BR>R. 1. 1.<BR>--3 Touching.<BR>--4 Interspersed,<BR>inlaid.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1103-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संप्रक्षालनं|सम्प्रक्षालन
संप्रक्षालनं<BR>1 Complete ablution.<BR>--2 Bathing.<BR>--3 Inundation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1103-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संप्रणेतृ|सम्प्रणेतृ
