संप्रतिरोधकः|सम्प्रतिरोधक|संप्रतिरोधक|संप्रतिरोधकं|सम्प्रतिरोधकं
संप्रतिरोधकः --कं<BR>1 Complete<BR>obstruction.<BR>--2 Confinement,<BR>imprisonment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1103-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संप्रतिरोधकं|सम्प्रतिरोधक|संप्रतिरोधक|सम्प्रतिरोधकं|संप्रतिरोधकः
संप्रतिरोधकः --कं<BR>1 Complete<BR>obstruction.<BR>--2 Confinement,<BR>imprisonment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1103-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संप्रती|सम्प्रती
संप्रती {c2c} P.<BR>1 To trust in,<BR>believe firmly in.<BR>--2 To decide, settle,<BR>determine; judge; किं तत्कयं<BR>वेत्युपलब्धसंज्ञा विकल्पयंतोऽपि न संप्रतीयुः<BR>Bk. 11. 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1103-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संप्रतीत|सम्प्रतीत
संप्रतीत p. p.<BR>1 Returned.<BR>--2 Fully<BR>convinced.<BR>--3 Proved, admitted.<BR>--4<BR>Renowned.<BR>--5 Respectful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1103-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संप्रतीतिः|सम्प्रतीति|संप्रतीति|सम्प्रतीतिः
संप्रतीतिः f.<BR>1 Full ascertainment.<BR>--2 Compliance.<BR>--3 Fame, celebrity,<BR>notoriety; Ki. 3. 43.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1103-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संप्रत्ययः|सम्प्रत्यय|संप्रत्यय
संप्रत्ययः<BR>1 Firm conviction.<BR>--2<BR>Agreement.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1103-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संप्रतीक्षा|सम्प्रतीक्षा
