संप्रदा|सम्प्रदा
संप्रदा {c3c} U.<BR>1 To give, grant,<BR>bestow or confer on; तं तेऽहं<BR>संप्रदास्यामि.<BR>--2 To hand down by<BR>tradition; see संप्रदाय.<BR>--3 To bequeath.<BR>--4 To give completely up or deliver<BR>over.<BR>--5 To give in marriage.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1103-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संप्रत्तिः|सम्प्रत्ति|संप्रत्ति
