संप्रदानं|सम्प्रदान|संप्रदान|सम्प्रदानं
संप्रदानं<BR>1 Giving or handing over<BR>completely.<BR>--2 Bestowal, gift,<BR>donation.<BR>--3 Giving in marriage.<BR>--4<BR>The sense expressed by the dative<BR>case; कर्मणा यमभिप्रैति स संप्रदानं<BR>P. I. 4. 32.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1103-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संप्रदानीयं|सम्प्रदानीय|संप्रदानीय
संप्रदानीयं A gift, donation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1103-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संप्रदायः|सम्प्रदाय|संप्रदाय|सम्प्रदायः
संप्रदायः<BR>1 Tradition, traditional<BR>doctrine or knowledge, traditional<BR>handing down of instruction; U. 2;<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1103-c" target="_blank">Page1103-c+ 55</a>]<BR>5. 15.<BR>--2 A peculiar system of<BR>religious teaching, a religious doctrine<BR>inculcating the worship of one<BR>peculiar deity.<BR>--3 An established<BR>custom, usage.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1103-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संप्रधानं|सम्प्रधान
संप्रधानं Ascertainment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1103-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संप्रधृ|सम्प्रधृ
संप्रधृ {c10c} U.<BR>1 To know,<BR>determine, ascertain; Śi. 9. 60.<BR>--2 To<BR>reflect, think, consider, ponder over;<BR>Ms. 10. 73; एवं संप्रधार्य Pt. 1.<BR>--3<BR>To fix upon, direct towards.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1103-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संप्रधारणं|सम्प्रधारण|संप्रधारण
संप्रधारणं --णा<BR>1 Deliberation.<BR>--2<BR>Determining the propriety or<BR>otherwise of anything.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1103-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संप्रधारणा|सम्प्रधारणा
संप्रधारणं --णा<BR>1 Deliberation.<BR>--2<BR>Determining the propriety or<BR>otherwise of anything.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1103-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संप्रपद्|सम्प्रपद्
संप्रपद् {c4c} A.<BR>1 To set out (on a<BR>journey).<BR>--2 To come to, arrive at.<BR>--3 To have recourse to, betake<BR>oneself to.<BR>--4 To set about, begin.<BR>--5<BR>To succeed.<BR>--6 To become, turn out<BR>to be.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1103-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संप्रपदः|सम्प्रपद|संप्रपद|सम्प्रपदं
संप्रपदः Roaming about.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1103-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संप्रपन्न|सम्प्रपन्न
संप्रपन्न p. p.<BR>1 Arrived at.<BR>--2<BR>Endowed with, possessed of.<BR>--3<BR>Entered, fallen into.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1103-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संप्रभिन्न|सम्प्रभिन्न
संप्रभिन्न p. p.<BR>1 Split open, cleft.<BR>--2 In rut.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1103-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संप्रमोदः|सम्प्रमोद|संप्रमोद
संप्रमोदः Great joy, jubilee.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1103-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संप्रमोषः|सम्प्रमोष|संप्रमोष
संप्रमोषः Loss, destruction,<BR>abstraction.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1103-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संप्रमोहः|सम्प्रमोह|संप्रमोह
संप्रमोहः Complete<BR>bewilderment, embarrassment, infatuation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1103-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संप्रयाणं|सम्प्रयाण|संप्रयाण
संप्रयाणं Departure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1103-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संप्रयुज्|सम्प्रयुज्
संप्रयुज् {c7c} U.<BR>1 To yoke together,<BR>harness.<BR>--2 To join, connect.<BR>--3 To<BR>apply, employ, make use of.<BR>--4 To<BR>perform, execute.<BR>--5 To instigate,<BR>induce. --Caus.<BR>1 To join together,<BR>unite.<BR>--2 To equip, prepare.<BR>--3 To<BR>employ, use.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1103-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संप्रयुक्त|सम्प्रयुक्त
संप्रयुक्त p. p.<BR>1 Yoked or joined<BR>together.<BR>--2 Sexually united.<BR>--3<BR>Intent upon.<BR>--4 Devoted or addicted<BR>to; see above.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1103-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संप्रयोगः|सम्प्रयोग|संप्रयोग|सम्प्रयोगः
संप्रयोगः<BR>1 Union, connection,<BR>meeting, conjunction, contact;<BR>(जलस्य) उष्णत्वमग्न्यातपसंप्रयोगात्<BR>R. 5. 54; M. 5. 3.<BR>--2 A connecting<BR>link, fastening; एतेन मोचयति<BR>भूषणसंप्रयोगान् Mk. 3. 16.<BR>--3 Relation,<BR>dependence.<BR>--4 Mutual relation or<BR>proportion.<BR>--5 Connected series or<BR>order.<BR>--6 Sexual union, coition.<BR>--7<BR>Application.<BR>--8 Magic.<BR>--9 Mutual<BR>intercourse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1103-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संप्रयोगिन्|सम्प्रयोगिन्
संप्रयोगिन् a.<BR>1 Joining together.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1104-a" target="_blank">Page1104-a+ 54</a>]<BR>--2 Wanton, addicted to sexual<BR>intercourse. --m.<BR>1 A joiner, uniter.<BR>--2<BR>A conjuror.<BR>--3 A libertine.<BR>--4 A<BR>catamite.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1103-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संप्रवद्|सम्प्रवद्
संप्रवद् {c1c} U.<BR>1 To speak loudly<BR>or distinctly (as men); संप्रवदंते<BR>ब्राह्मणाः Sk.<BR>--2 To cry, utter a cry<BR>(Paras.); (वरतनु) संप्रवदंति कुक्कुटाः<BR>Mbh.<BR>--3 To converse together<BR>(Atm.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1104-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संप्रवदनं|सम्प्रवदन
संप्रवदनं Conversation, dialogue.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1104-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संप्रविश्|सम्प्रविश्
संप्रविश् {c6c} P.<BR>1 To enter<BR>together.<BR>--2 To have sexual<BR>intercourse with. --Caus. To lead into,<BR>introduce.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1104-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संप्रवेशः|सम्प्रवेश
संप्रवेशः<BR>1 Complete entrance.<BR>--2<BR>Introduction.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1104-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संप्रवृत्|सम्प्रवृत्
संप्रवृत् {c1c} A.<BR>1 To take place,<BR>happen.<BR>--2 To begin, set about,<BR>commence.<BR>--3 To proceed, go on.<BR>--4 To attack, assail.<BR>--5 To be<BR>present. --Caus.<BR>1 To begin,<BR>undertake.<BR>--2 To set in motion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1104-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संप्रवर्तनं|सम्प्रवर्तन|संप्रवर्तन
संप्रवर्तनं Undertaking, beginning.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1104-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संप्रवृष्टं|सम्प्रवृष्ट|संप्रवृष्ट
संप्रवृष्टं Complete rain-fall.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1104-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संप्रश्नः|सम्प्रश्न|संप्रश्न
संप्रश्नः<BR>1 Full or courteous<BR>inquiry.<BR>--2 An inquiry.<BR>--3 Ved. A<BR>refuge, an asylum.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1104-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संप्रसादः|सम्प्रसाद|संप्रसाद
संप्रसादः<BR>1 Propitiation.<BR>--2<BR>Favour, grace.<BR>--3 Serenity,<BR>sedateness.<BR>--4 Trust, confidence.<BR>--5 The<BR>soul.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1104-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संप्रसाधनं|सम्प्रसाधन|संप्रसाधन
संप्रसाधनं<BR>1 An ornament, a<BR>decoration.<BR>--2 Accomplishing or<BR>performing well.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1104-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संप्रसारणं|सम्प्रसारण|संप्रसारण|सम्प्रसारणं
संप्रसारणं The change of य्, व्, र्,<BR>and ल् to इ, उ, ऋ, and ऌ respectively;<BR>इग्यणः संप्रसारणं P. I. 1. 45.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1104-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संप्रस्था|सम्प्रस्था
संप्रस्था {c1c} A.<BR>1 To set out, depart.<BR>--2 To proceed, advance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1104-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संप्रस्थानं|सम्प्रस्थान|संप्रस्थान
संप्रस्थानं Departure, advance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1104-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संप्रहारः|सम्प्रहार|संप्रहार|सम्प्रहारः
संप्रहारः<BR>1 Mutual striking.<BR>--2<BR>Encounter, war, battle, conflict;<BR>U. 6. 7.<BR>--3 Going, motion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1104-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संप्राप्|सम्प्राप्
संप्राप् {c5c} P.<BR>1 To reach, arrive<BR>at.<BR>--2 To gain, obtain.<BR>--3 To meet<BR>with, encounter, come upon, fall in<BR>with; as in संप्राप्नुवंत्यापदं.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1104-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संप्राप्तिः|सम्प्राप्ति|संप्राप्ति|सम्प्राप्तिः
