सिप्रः|सिप्र|सिप्रं
सिप्रः<BR>1 Perspiration, sweat.<BR>--2<BR>The moon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1124-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सिप्रा
सिप्रा<BR>1 A woman's zone or<BR>girdle.<BR>--2 A female buffalo.<BR>--3 A<BR>river near Ujjayinī; see शिप्रा.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1124-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सिम|सिमः
