सिमिसिमायते
सिमिसिमायते Den. A. To be<BR>convulsed, feel a chilling sensation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1124-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सिंबा|सिम्बा
