सृभ्
सृभ्, सृंभ् {c1c} P. (सर्भति, सृंभति) To<BR>hurt, injure, kill.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1137-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सृंभ्|सृम्भ्
सृभ्, सृंभ् {c1c} P. (सर्भति, सृंभति) To<BR>hurt, injure, kill.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1137-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सृमर|सृमरः
सृमर a. (री f.) Going, moving.<BR>--रः A kind of deer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1137-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सॄ
सॄ {c9c} P. (सृणाति) To hurt,<BR>injure, kill.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1137-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सेक्
सेक् {c1c} A. (सेकते) To go, move.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1137-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सेकः|सेक
सेकः [सिच्-घञ्]<BR>1 Sprinkling,<BR>watering (trees); सेकः सीकरिणा<BR>करेण विहितः कामं U. 3. 16, R. 1. 51,<BR>8. 45, 16. 30, 17. 16.<BR>--2 Emission,<BR>effusion.<BR>--3 Seminal effusion.<BR>--4<BR>A libation, an offering.<BR>--5 Seminal<BR>fluid.<BR>--6 A drop of anything.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--पात्रं {1} a pot for sprinkling water,<BR>a watering-pot. {2} a bucket.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1137-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सेकिमं|सेकिम
सेकिमं A radish.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1137-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सेक्तृ
सेक्तृ a. (क्त्री f.) One who sprinkles<BR>&c. --m.<BR>1 A sprinkler.<BR>--2 A<BR>husband.<BR>--3 A water-bearer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1137-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सेक्त्रं|सेक्त्र
सेक्त्रं A bucket, watering-pot.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1137-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सेचक|सेचकः
सेचक a. (चिका f.) [सिच्-ण्वुल्]<BR>Sprinkling.<BR>--कः A cloud.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1137-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सेचनं|सेचन
सेचनं [सिच्-भावे ल्युट्]<BR>1<BR>Sprinkling, watering; वृक्षसेचने द्वे धारयसि मे<BR>Ś. 1.<BR>--2 Effusion, aspersion.<BR>--3<BR>Oozing, dripping.<BR>--4 A bucket.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--घटः a watering-pot.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1137-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सेचनी
सेचनी A bucket.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1137-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सेटुः|सेटु
सेटुः<BR>1 Water-melon.<BR>--2 A kind<BR>of cucumber.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1137-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सेतिका
सेतिका N. of Ayodhyā.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1137-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सेतुः|सेतु
सेतुः [सि तुन् Uṇ. 1. 69]<BR>1 A<BR>ridge of earth, mound, bank,<BR>causeway, dam; नलिंनीं क्षतसेतुबंधनो<BR>जलसंघात इवासि विद्रुतः Ku. 4. 6,<BR>R. 16. 2.<BR>--2 A bridge in general; वैदेहि<BR>पश्यामलयाद्विभक्तं मत्सेतुना फेनिलमंबुराशिं<BR>R. 13. 2; सैन्यैर्बद्धद्विरदसेतुभिः 4. 38,<BR>12. 70; Ku. 7. 53.<BR>--3 A land-mark;<BR>Ms. 8. 245.<BR>--4 A defile, pass, a<BR>narrow mountain-road.<BR>--5 A<BR>boundary, limit.<BR>--6 A barrier,<BR>limitation, obstruction of any kind;<BR>द्वष्येयुः सर्ववर्णाश्च मिद्येरन् सर्वसेतवः Subhāṣ.<BR>--7 A fixed rule or law, an<BR>established institution.<BR>--8 The sacred<BR>syllable om; मंत्राणां प्रणवः सेतुस्तत्सेतुः<BR>प्रणवः स्मृतः । स्रवत्यनोंकृतं पूर्वं परस्ताच्च<BR>विदीर्यते Kālikā P.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--बंधः {1}<BR>the forming or construction of a<BR>bridge, cause-way &c.; वयोगते किं<BR>वनिताविलासो जले गते किं खलु सेतुबंधः<BR>Subhāṣ.; Ku. 4. 6. {2} the ridge<BR>of rocks extending from the<BR>southern extremity of the Coromandel<BR>coast towards Ceylon (said to have<BR>been built for Rāma's passage to<BR>Laṅkā by Nala and the other<BR>monkeys). {3} any bridge or cause-way.<BR>--भेदिन् a. {1} breaking down<BR>barriers. {2} removing obstructions.<BR>(--m.) N. of a tree (दंती).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1137-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सेतुकः|सेतुक
सेतुकः<BR>1 A bank, cause-way,<BR>bridge.<BR>--2 A pass.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1137-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सेत्रं|सेत्र
सेत्रं A bond, fetter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1137-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सेदिवस्
सेदिवस् a. (सेदुषी f.) Sitting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1137-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सेधः|सेध
सेधः<BR>1 Going, reaching.<BR>--2 A<BR>tail.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1137-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सेन
सेन a. Having a lord,<BR>possessing a master or leader.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1137-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सेना
सेना [सि-न, सह इनेन प्रभुणा वा;<BR>Uṇ. 3. 10]<BR>1 An army; सेना परिच्छदस्तस्य<BR>द्वयमेवार्थसाधनं R. 1. 19.<BR>--2 Army<BR>personified as the wife of<BR>Kārtikeya, the god of war; cf. देवसेना.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--अग्रं the van or front of an army.<BR>˚गः the leader or general of an<BR>army.<BR>--अंगं a component part of an<BR>army; (these are four:<BR>--हस्त्यश्वरथपादातं सेनांगं स्याच्चतुष्टयम्).<BR>--कल्पः an<BR>epithet of Śiva.<BR>--चरः {1} a soldier.<BR>{2} a camp-follower.<BR>--निवेशः the<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1137-c" target="_blank">Page1137-c+ 55</a>]<BR>camp of an army; सेनानिवेशं तुमुलं<BR>चकार R. 5. 49.<BR>--नी m. {1} a leader<BR>of an army, commander, general;<BR>सेनानीनामहं स्कंदः Bg. 10. 24;<BR>Ku. 2. 51. {2} N. of Kārtikeya;<BR>अथैनमद्रेस्तनया शुशोच सेनान्यमालढिमिवासुरास्त्रैः<BR>R. 2. 37.<BR>--पतिः {1} a general. {2}<BR>N. of Śiva. {3} N. of Kārtikeya.<BR>--परिच्छद् a. surrounded by an<BR>army; (in R. 1. 19 सेकपरिच्छदः is<BR>sometimes taken as one word and<BR>is interpreted in this way, but it is<BR>much better to take them as<BR>separate words).<BR>--पृष्ठं the rear of an<BR>army.<BR>--भंगः the breaking of an<BR>army, complete rout, disorderly<BR>flight.<BR>--मुखं {1} a division of an<BR>army. {2} particularly, a division<BR>of an army consisting of three<BR>elephants, as many chariots, nine horse,<BR>and fifteen foot. {3} a mound in<BR>front of a city gate.<BR>--योगः the<BR>equipment of an army.<BR>--रक्षः a<BR>guard, sentinel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1137-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सेफः|सेफ
सेफः The penis; cf. शेफ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1137-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सेमंती|सेमन्ती
सेमंती The Indian white rose.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1137-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सेरः|सेर
सेरः A kind of measure (Mar.<BR>शेर); it is thus defined in Līlāvatī:<BR>--पादोनगद्यानकतुल्यटंकैर्द्विसप्ततुल्यैः कथितोऽत्र<BR>सेरः ॥.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1137-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सेराहः|सेराह
सेराहः A horse of a milk-white<BR>colour.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1137-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सेरु|सेरुः
सेरु a. Binding, fastening.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1137-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सेर्ष्य
सेर्ष्य a. Full of envy or<BR>jealousy, envious, jealous.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1137-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सेल्
सेल् {c1c} P. (सेलति) To go, move.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1137-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सेव्
सेव् {c1c} A. (सेवते, सेवित; caus.<BR>सेवयति-ते; desid. सिसेविषते; the स् of सेव्<BR>is generally changed to ष् after<BR>prepositions ending in इ such as नि,<BR>परि, वि)<BR>1 To serve, wait or<BR>attend upon, honour, worship, obey;<BR>प्रायो भृत्यास्त्यजंति प्रचलितविभवं<BR>स्वामि नं सेवमानाः Mu. 4. 21; आचारपूतं<BR>पवनः सिषेवे R. 2. 13 ‘served or<BR>refreshed’; ऐश्वर्यादनपेतमीश्वरमयं<BR>लोकोर्थतः सेवते 1. 14.<BR>--2 To go after,<BR>pursue, follow.<BR>--3 To use, enjoy;<BR>किं सेव्यते सुमनसां मनसापि गंधः<BR>कस्तूरिकाजननशक्तिभृता मृगेण R. G.<BR>--4 To<BR>enjoy carnally; केतकीं सेवसे हंत<BR>कथं रोलंब निस्त्रपः Bv. 1. 118.<BR>--5 To<BR>attach or devote oneself to, attend<BR>to, cultivate, practise, perform;<BR>Ms. 2. 1; Ku. 5. 38, R. 17. 49.<BR>--6<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1138-a" target="_blank">Page1138-a+ 57</a>]<BR>To resort to, betake oneself to,<BR>dwell in, frequent, inhabit; तप्तं वारि<BR>विहाय तीरनलिनीं कारंडवः सेवते<BR>V. 2. 23, Pt. 1. 9.<BR>--7 To watch over,<BR>guard, protect.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1137-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सेव|सेवं
सेव See सेवन.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1138-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सेवक|सेवकः
सेवक a. [सेव्-ण्वुल्]<BR>1 Serving,<BR>worshipping, honouring.<BR>--2<BR>Practising, following.<BR>--3 Dependent,<BR>servile.<BR>--कः<BR>1 A servant, dependant;<BR>सेवया धनमिच्छद्भिः सेवकैः पश्य किं<BR>कृतम् । स्वातंत्र्यं यच्छरीरस्य मूढैस्तदपि<BR>हारितं H. 2. 20.<BR>--2 A votary,<BR>worshipper.<BR>--3 A sewer.<BR>--4 A sack.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1138-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सेवनं|सेवन
सेवनं [सिव्-सेव्-ल्युट्]<BR>1 The act of<BR>serving, service, attendance upon,<BR>worship; पात्रीकृतात्मा गुरुसेवनेन<BR>R. 18. 30; Pt. 1. 11.<BR>--2 Following,<BR>practising, employing; Ms. 12. 52.<BR>--3 Using, enjoying.<BR>--4 Enjoying<BR>carnally; यत्करोत्येकरात्रेण<BR>वृषलीसेवनाद्द्विजः Ms. 11. 179.<BR>--5 Devotion<BR>to, fondness for.<BR>--6 Frequenting,<BR>dwelling in.<BR>--7 Binding, fastening.<BR>--8 Sewing, stitching.<BR>--9 A sack.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1138-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सेवनी
सेवनी<BR>1 A needle.<BR>--2 A seam.<BR>--3 A<BR>suture or seam-like union of parts<BR>of the body.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1138-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सेवा
सेवा [सेव्-अ]<BR>1 Service, servitude,<BR>dependence; attendance; सेवां<BR>लाघवकारिणीं कृतधियः स्थाने श्ववृत्तिं विदुः<BR>Mu. 3. 14; हनिसेवा न कर्तव्या<BR>H. 3. 11.<BR>--2 Worship, homage,<BR>honouring<BR>--3 Addiction or devotion to,<BR>fondness for.<BR>--4 Use, practice,<BR>employment, exercise.<BR>--5 Frequenting,<BR>resorting to.<BR>--6 Flattery, coaxing<BR>or flattering words; अलं सेवया<BR>मध्यस्थतां गृहीत्वा भण M. 3.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--आकार a. in the form of servitude;<BR>V. 3. 1.<BR>--काकुः change of voice in<BR>service; (this is a variant in<BR>V. 3. 1 for सेवाकारा).<BR>--धर्मः {1} the duty<BR>of service; सेवाधर्मः परमगहनो<BR>योगिनामप्यगम्यः Pt. 1. 285. {2} the<BR>obligations of service.<BR>--व्यवहारः the<BR>practice or law of service.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1138-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सेवि
सेवि n.<BR>1 The jujube.<BR>--2 An apple.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1138-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सेवित|सेवितः
सेवित p. p. [सेव्-क्त]<BR>1 Served,<BR>attended upon, worshipped.<BR>--2 Followed,<BR>practised, pursued.<BR>--3 Frequented<BR>by, resorted to, inhabited by,<BR>haunted by; Pt. 5. 23.<BR>--4 Protected,<BR>preserved.<BR>--5 Enjoyed, used.<BR>--तं<BR>1 An<BR>apple.<BR>--2 The jujube.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1138-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सेवितृ
सेवितृ m. An attendant, a<BR>dependant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1138-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सेविन्
सेविन् a,<BR>1 Serving, worshipping.<BR>--2 Following, practising, using.<BR>--3<BR>Inhabiting, dwelling. --m. A<BR>servant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1138-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सेव्य|सेव्यं|सेव्यः
सेव्य a. [सेव्-ण्यत्]<BR>1 To be served<BR>or waited upon.<BR>--2 To be used or<BR>employed<BR>--3 To be enjoyed.<BR>--4 To<BR>be taken care of or guarded.<BR>--व्यः<BR>1 A master (opp. सेवक); भयं तावत्<BR>सेव्यादभिनिविशते सेवकजनं Mu. 5. 12;<BR>Pt. 1. 48.<BR>--2 The Aśvattha tree.<BR>--व्यं A kind of root.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--सेवकौ<BR>m. dual. master and servant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1138-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सेवधि|सेवधिः
सेवधि ind. See शेवधि under शेव.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1138-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सै
सै {c1c} P. (सायति) To waste away,<BR>decline, perish.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1138-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सैंह|सैंहः
सैंह a. (ही f.) Belonging to a<BR>lion, leonine; द्युतिं सैंहीं किं श्वा<BR>धृतकनकमालोऽपि लभते H. 1. 175.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1138-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सैंहल
सैंहल a. Belonging to, growing<BR>or produced in, Ceylon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1138-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सैंहिकः|सैंहिक
सैंहिकः, सैंहिकेयः A metronymic<BR>of Rāhu, q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1138-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सैंहिकेयः|सैंहिकेय
सैंहिकः, सैंहिकेयः A metronymic<BR>of Rāhu, q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1138-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सैकत|सैकतं|सैकतः
सैकत a. (ती f.) [सिकताः संत्यत्र<BR>अण्]<BR>1 Consisting or made of sand,<BR>sandy, gravelly; तोयस्येवाप्रतिहतरयः<BR>सैकतं सेतुमोघः U. 3. 36.<BR>--2 Having<BR>sandy soil.<BR>--तं<BR>1 A sand-bank;<BR>सुरगज इव गांगं सैकतं सुप्रतीकः R. 5. 75,<BR>5. 8; 10. 62, 13. 17, 62; 14. 76;<BR>16. 21; Ku. 1. 29; Ś. 6. 16.<BR>--2 An<BR>island with sandy shores.<BR>--3 A bank<BR>or shore (in general).<BR>--Comp.<BR>--इष्टं<BR>ginger.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1138-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सैकतिक|सैकतिकं|सैकतिकः
सैकतिक a. (की f.)<BR>1 Belonging<BR>or relating to a sand-bank.<BR>--2<BR>Fluctuating, wavering, living in doubt<BR>and error (संदेह्जीविन्).<BR>--कः<BR>1 A<BR>religious mendicant.<BR>--2 An ascetic.<BR>--कं A thread worn round the<BR>wrist or neck to secure good<BR>fortune.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1138-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सैद्धांतिक|सैद्धान्तिक|सैद्धान्तिकः
सैद्धांतिक a. (की f.) [सिद्धांतं<BR>वेत्ति ठक्]<BR>1 Relating to a dogma or<BR>demonstrated truth.<BR>--2 One who<BR>knows the real truth.<BR>--3 Relating<BR>to an astronomical or any other<BR>scientific work.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1138-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सैनापत्यं|सैनापत्य
सैनापत्यं The command of an<BR>army, generalship; Ku. 2. 61.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1138-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सैनिक|सैनिकः
सैनिक a. (की f.) [सेनायां समवैति<BR>ठक्]<BR>1 Relating to an army.<BR>--2<BR>Martial, military.<BR>--कः<BR>1 A soldier;<BR>पपात भूमौ सह सैनिकाश्रुभिः R. 3. 61.<BR>--2 A guard, sentinel.<BR>--3 The body<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1138-c" target="_blank">Page1138-c+ 55</a>]<BR>of troops drawn up in battle-array<BR>R. 3. 57.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1138-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सैंधव|सैन्धव|सैन्धवं|सैन्धवः
सैंधव a. (वी f.) [सिंधुनदसिमीपे<BR>देशे भवः अण्]<BR>1 Produced or born in<BR>the Sindhu-territory.<BR>--2 Belonging<BR>to the Indus.<BR>--3 River-born.<BR>--4<BR>Belonging to the sea, oceanic, marine.<BR>--वः<BR>1 A horse, especially one<BR>bred in Sindhu; N. 1. 71.<BR>--2 N. of<BR>a sage.<BR>--3 N. of a country.<BR>--वः,<BR>--वं A kind of rock-salt.<BR>--वाः m. pl.<BR>The people inhabiting the Sindhu<BR>territory.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--घनः a lump of<BR>salt.<BR>--शिला a kind of rock or<BR>fossil salt.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1138-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सैंधवक|सैन्धवक|सैन्धवकः
सैंधवक a. (की f.) Relating to the<BR>Saindhavas.<BR>--कः A miserable<BR>inhabitant of Sindhu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1138-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सैंधी|सैन्धी
सैंधी A sort of spirituous liquor<BR>(perhaps from palm-juice).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1138-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सैन्यः|सैन्य|सैन्यं
सैन्यः [सेनायां समवैति ञ्य]<BR>1 A<BR>soldier; Śi. 5. 28.<BR>--2 A guard,<BR>sentinel.<BR>--न्यं An army, a troop; स<BR>प्रतस्थेऽरिनाशाय हरिसैन्यैरनुद्रुतः R. 12. 67.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1138-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सैमंतिकं|सैमन्तिक|सैमंतिक|सैमन्तिकं
सैमंतिकं Red lead.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1138-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सैरंध्रः|सैरन्ध्र|सैरंध्र|सैरन्ध्रः
सैरंध्रः, सैरिंध्रः<BR>1 A menial servant<BR>or attendant.<BR>--2 A mixed tribe,<BR>the offspring of a Dasyu and an<BR>Ayogava female; सैरिंध्रं वागुरावृत्तिं<BR>सूते दस्युरयोगवे Ms. 10. 32.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1138-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सैरिंध्रः|सैरिन्ध्र|सैरिंध्र|सैरिन्ध्रः
सैरंध्रः, सैरिंध्रः<BR>1 A menial servant<BR>or attendant.<BR>--2 A mixed tribe,<BR>the offspring of a Dasyu and an<BR>Ayogava female; सैरिंध्रं वागुरावृत्तिं<BR>सूते दस्युरयोगवे Ms. 10. 32.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1138-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सैरंध्री|सैरन्ध्री
सैरंध्री, सैरिंध्री<BR>1 A maidservant or<BR>female attendant in the women's<BR>apartments (a woman of the mixed<BR>tribe described in सैरंध्र 2).<BR>--2 An<BR>independent female artisan working<BR>in another person's house.<BR>--3 An<BR>epithet of Draupadī (assumed by<BR>her when she acted as servant to<BR>Sudeṣṇā^1, queen of Virāṭa.).<BR>[1] Correction submitted by Scott Rhodes on 20240609. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1138-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सैरिंध्री|सैरिन्ध्री
सैरंध्री, सैरिंध्री<BR>1 A maidservant or<BR>female attendant in the women's<BR>apartments (a woman of the mixed<BR>tribe described in सैरंध्र 2).<BR>--2 An<BR>independent female artisan working<BR>in another person's house.<BR>--3 An<BR>epithet of Draupadī (assumed by<BR>her when she acted as servant to<BR>Sudeṣṇā^1, queen of Virāṭa.).<BR>[1] Correction submitted by Scott Rhodes on 20240609. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1138-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सैरिक|सैरिकः
सैरिक a. (की f.)<BR>1 Relating to<BR>a plough.<BR>--2 Having furrows.<BR>--कः<BR>1 A plough-ox.<BR>--2 A ploughman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1138-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सैरिभः|सैरिभ
सैरिभः<BR>1 A buffalo; अवमानित इव<BR>कुलीनो दीर्घं निःश्वसिति सैरिभः Mk. 4.<BR>--2 Indra's heaven or Svarga.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1138-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

