सो
सो {c4c} P. (स्यति, ससौ, असात्-असासीत्,<BR>सास्यति, सातुं, सित; caus. साययति-ते, desid.<BR>सिषासति; pass. सीयते; the स् of सो is<BR>changed to ष् after prepositions<BR>ending in इ or उ)<BR>1 To kill, destroy.<BR>--2<BR>To finish, complete, bring to an end.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1138-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सोढ|सोढः
