सोढृ
सोढृ a. (ढ्री f.) [सह्-तृच्]<BR>1<BR>Enduring, bearing, patient.<BR>--2<BR>Powerful, able.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1139-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सोत्क
सोत्क, सोत्कंठ a.<BR>1 Ardently<BR>longing, impatiently eager,<BR>anxious; as in सोत्कंठमालिंगनम्.<BR>--2<BR>Regreatful.<BR>--3 Bewailing, sorrowing.<BR>--ठं ind.<BR>1 With ardent or eager<BR>longing, anxiously; प्रोड्डीयेव<BR>बलाकया सरभसं सोत्कंठमालिंगितः<BR>Mk. 5. 23.<BR>--2 Regretfully,<BR>sorrowfully.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1139-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सोत्कंठ|सोत्कण्ठ|सोत्कण्ठः
सोत्क, सोत्कंठ a.<BR>1 Ardently<BR>longing, impatiently eager,<BR>anxious; as in सोत्कंठमालिंगनम्.<BR>--2<BR>Regreatful.<BR>--3 Bewailing, sorrowing.<BR>--ठं ind.<BR>1 With ardent or eager<BR>longing, anxiously; प्रोड्डीयेव<BR>बलाकया सरभसं सोत्कंठमालिंगितः<BR>Mk. 5. 23.<BR>--2 Regretfully,<BR>sorrowfully.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1139-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सोच्छ्वास
सोच्छ्वास a. Glad; Māl. 3. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1139-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सोत्प्रास|सोत्प्रासं|सोत्प्रासः
सोत्प्रास a.<BR>1 Excessive.<BR>--2<BR>Exaggerated.<BR>--3 Ironical, sarcastic.<BR>--सः Violent laughter.<BR>--सः --सं<BR>Ironical exaggeration, sarcasm,<BR>irony; cf. व्याजस्तुति.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1139-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सोत्सव
सोत्सव a. Festive, making<BR>merry, joyous.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1139-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सोत्साह
सोत्साह a. Vigorous, active,<BR>energetic, persevering.<BR>--हं ind.<BR>Actively, energetically, carefully.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1139-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सोत्सुक
सोत्सुक a. Regretful, repining,<BR>anxious, sorrowful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1139-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सोत्सेध
सोत्सेध a. Raised, elevated,<BR>high, lofty; सोत्सेधैः स्कंधदेशैः<BR>Mu. 4. 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1139-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सोदर|सोदरः
सोदर a. [समानमुदरं यस्य समानस्य<BR>सः] Born from the same womb,<BR>uterine.<BR>--रः A uterine brother.<BR>--रा A uterine sister.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1139-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सोदर्यः|सोदर्य|सोदर्य्य|सोदर्य्यः
सोदर्यः A co-uterine brother,<BR>brother of whole blood; (fig. also);<BR>भ्रातुः सोदर्यमात्मानमिंद्रजिद्वधशोभिनः<BR>R. 15. 26; अवज्ञासोदर्यं दारिद्र्यं Dk.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1139-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सोद्योग
सोद्योग a.<BR>1 Making vigorous<BR>exertions, diligent, active,<BR>persevering, industrious.<BR>--2 Violent,<BR>strong.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1139-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सोद्वेग
सोद्वेग a.<BR>1 Anxious,<BR>apprehensive.<BR>--2 Sorrowful.<BR>--गं ind.<BR>Anxiously, eagerly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1139-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सोनहः|सोनह
