सौजन्यं|सौजन्य
सौजन्यं<BR>1 Goodness, kindness of<BR>spirit, gentility; U. 3. 13;<BR>Mk. 8. 38.<BR>--2 Magnanimousness, generosity.<BR>--3 Kindness, compassion, clemency.<BR>--4 Friendship, love.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1140-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

