सौत्र|सौत्रः
सौत्र a. (त्री f.) [सूत्र-अण्]<BR>1<BR>Belonging to or having a thread or<BR>string.<BR>--2 Belonging to, mentioned,<BR>occurring or declared in, a<BR>Sūtra q. v.<BR>--त्रः<BR>1 A Brāhmaṇa.<BR>--2 An artificial root occurring in<BR>grammatical Sūtras which can not be<BR>conjugated like a regular verb,<BR>but is used only to form<BR>derivative words.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1140-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

