सौदामनी, सौदामिनी, सौदाम्नी<BR>1<BR>Lightning; सौदामन्या<BR>कनकनिकषस्निग्धया दर्शर्योवीं Me. 37; सौदामिनीव<BR>जलदोदरसंधिलीना Mk. 1. 35;<BR>Māl. 8. 14.<BR>--2 The female of Indra's<BR>elephant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1140-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सौदाम्नी
सौदामनी, सौदामिनी, सौदाम्नी<BR>1<BR>Lightning; सौदामन्या<BR>कनकनिकषस्निग्धया दर्शर्योवीं Me. 37; सौदामिनीव<BR>जलदोदरसंधिलीना Mk. 1. 35;<BR>Māl. 8. 14.<BR>--2 The female of Indra's<BR>elephant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1140-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सौदायिक|सौदायिकं
सौदायिक a. (की f.)<BR>Whatever is given to a woman at her<BR>marriage by her parents, or a<BR>relative in general, which becomes<BR>her own property.<BR>--कं A nuptial<BR>present so made.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1140-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सौध|सौधः
सौध a. (धी f.) [सुधया निर्मितं<BR>रक्तं वा अण्]<BR>1 Relating to, or<BR>having, nectar.<BR>--2 Having plaster, or<BR>plastered.<BR>--धं<BR>1 A<BR>white-washed mansion, any stuccoed house.<BR>--2 Any great mansion or<BR>palace, large house; सौधवासमुटजेन<BR>विस्मृतः संचिकाय फलनिःस्पृहस्तपः<BR>R. 19. 2, 7. 5, 13. 40.<BR>--3 Silver.<BR>--4 Opal.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--कारः {1} a plasterer. {2} a<BR>builder of a house.<BR>--वासः a palatial<BR>building.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1140-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सौन|सौनः
सौन a. (नी f.) Relating to<BR>butchery or a slaughter-house.<BR>--नं<BR>Butcher's meat.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--धर्म्यं a<BR>state of deadly hostility.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1140-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सौनिकः|सौनिक
सौनिकः A butcher; cf. शौनिक.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1140-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सौनंदं|सौनन्द|सौनंद|सौनन्दं
सौनंदं The club of Balarāma.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1140-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सौनंदिन्|सौनन्दिन्
सौनंदिन् m. An epithet of<BR>Balarāma.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1140-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सौंदर्यं|सौन्दर्य|सौंदर्य|सौन्दर्य्य|सौन्दर्य्यं
सौंदर्यं [सुंदरस्य भावः ष्यञ्]<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1141-a" target="_blank">Page1141-a+ 56</a>]<BR>Beauty, loveliness, gracefulness, elegance;<BR>सौंदर्यसारसमुदायनिकेतनं वा<BR>Māl. 1. 21; Ku. 1. 49, 5. 41.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1140-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सौपर्णं|सौपर्ण
सौपर्णं<BR>1 Dry ginger.<BR>--2<BR>Emerald.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1141-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सौपर्णेयः|सौपर्णेय
सौपर्णेयः An epithet of Garuḍa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1141-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सौप्तिक|सौप्तिकं
सौप्तिक a. (की f.)<BR>1 Connected<BR>with or relating to sleep.<BR>--2<BR>Somniferous.<BR>--कं A night-attack, an<BR>attack on sleeping men.<BR>--Comp.<BR>--पर्वन् n. N. of the tenth parvan or<BR>book of the Mahābhārata which<BR>relates how Aśvatthāman,<BR>Kṛtavarman and Kṛpa-the only<BR>surviving Kuru warriors-attacked by<BR>night the Pāṇḍava camp and<BR>slaughtered thousands of warriors<BR>while asleep.<BR>--वधः the great<BR>nocturnal slaughter of Pāṇḍava camp<BR>(above referred to); मार्गो ह्येष<BR>नरेंद्रसौप्तिकवधे पूर्वं कृतो द्रौणिना Mk. 3. 11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1141-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सौबलः|सौबल
सौबलः N. of Śakuni q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1141-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सौबली
सौबली, सौबलेयी N. of<BR>Gāndhārī, wife of Dhṛtarāṣṭra.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1141-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सौबलेयी
सौबली, सौबलेयी N. of<BR>Gāndhārī, wife of Dhṛtarāṣṭra.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1141-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सौभं|सौभ
सौभं N. of Hariścandra's city<BR>(said to be suspended in air).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1141-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सौभीकः
सौभीकः N. of Drupada.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1141-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सौभगं|सौभग
सौभगं<BR>1 Good luck, happiness.<BR>--2 Prosperity, riches, wealth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1141-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सौभद्रः|सौभद्र
