हलीनः|हलीन
हलीनः The teak tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1167-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हलीषा
हलीषा The handle of a plough.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1167-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हल्य|हल्यं
हल्य a.<BR>1 Arable, to be ploughed.<BR>--2 Ugly, deformed.<BR>--ल्यं<BR>1 A<BR>ploughed field.<BR>--2 Deformity,<BR>ugliness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1167-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हल्या
हल्या A number of ploughs.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1167-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हलाहः|हलाह
हलाहः A spotted or variegated<BR>horse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1167-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हलाहलं|हलाहल|हलाहलः
हलाहलं<BR>1 = हाल(ला) हल.<BR>--2 A<BR>kind of snake.<BR>--3 A sort of lizard.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1167-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हल्लकं|हल्लक
