हिंदोलः|हिन्दोल|हिंदोल|हिन्दोलः
हिंदोलः<BR>1 A swing.<BR>--2 The<BR>swing on which the figures of<BR>Kṛṣṇa are carried about during the<BR>swing-festival in the bright half of<BR>Śrāvaṇa, or the festival itself.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1172-a" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

