हिमानी<BR>1 [महद् हिमं, आनुक्] A mass<BR>or collection of snow, snow-drift;<BR>नगमुपरि हिमानीगौरमासाद्य जिष्णुः<BR>Ki. 4. 38; Bv. 1. 26.<BR>--2 A kind of<BR>sugar.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1172-b" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

