हिरुक्
हिरुक् ind. Ved.<BR>1 Without, except<BR>--2 Amongst, in the midst of.<BR>--3<BR>Near.<BR>--4 Below.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP90&page=1172-c" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap90" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हिल्
